UID:ai1ec-121213@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015804Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Registration is encouraged\, but not required.\nJoin us for our
  Tallest Sunflower Competition! All ages.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nStarting May 1\, co
 me to any MCPL location to get a packet with five sunflower seeds and an i
 nformation sheet about the competition. The team or person with the talles
 t sunflower in August will win! There will also be second and third place 
 prizes. Emailed photos are required. Submissions open August 1 and close A
 ugust 31.
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20240501
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20240502
LOCATION:Information Desk\, Monroe County Public Library\, 303 East Kirkwoo
 d Ave.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Tallest Sunflower Competition
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/tallest-sunflower-competition/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div id='idlw5ZC
 ' class='amh-row row'>\n<div id='idjLXfv' class='amh-block amh-text col-md
 -12' data-block-type='text'>\n<div class='amh-content'>\n<p><strong>Regist
 ration is encouraged\, but not required.</strong></p>\n<p class='custom1'>
 Join us for our Tallest Sunflower Competition! All ages.</p>\n</div>\n</di
 v>\n</div>\n<div id='idQ9R9H' class='amh-row row'>\n<div id='idiga4D' clas
 s='amh-block amh-text col-md-12' data-block-type='text'>\n<div class='amh-
 content'>\n<p>Starting May 1\, come to any MCPL location to get a packet w
 ith five sunflower seeds and an information sheet about the competition. T
 he team or person with the tallest sunflower in August will win! There wil
 l also be second and third place prizes. Emailed photos are required. Subm
 issions open August 1 and close August 31.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</
 BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
