BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-121956@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015804Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Pickin in the Backwoods\,” brought to you by Coyote Radio Show 
 and Podcast alongside Duke’s Indy\, is an event you won’t want to pass up.
  Immerse yourself in the scenic backwoods of Brown County\, Indiana\, for 
 an unforgettable two-day experience! Crafted with the fans in mind\, this 
 event is all about creating a close-knit atmosphere. With tickets highly l
 imited\, attendees are guaranteed an exceptionally intimate live show.\n*3
 0+ Bands*\n*Free Camping*\n*Free Parking*\n*BYOB*\n*Food Trucks*\n*Vendors
 *\n*Campfire Jams*\n*All Ages*
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20240516
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20240518
LOCATION:eXplore Brown County at Valley Branch Retreat\, 2620 Valley Branch
  Rd\, Nashville\, IN
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Pickin’ in the Backwoods Music Festival
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/pickin-in-the-backwoods-music-festival/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Pickin in the
  Backwoods\,” brought to you by Coyote Radio Show and Podcast alongside Du
 ke’s Indy\, is an event you won’t want to pass up. Immerse yourself in the
  scenic backwoods of Brown County\, Indiana\, for an unforgettable two-day
  experience! Crafted with the fans in mind\, this event is all about creat
 ing a close-knit atmosphere. With tickets highly limited\, attendees are g
 uaranteed an exceptionally intimate live show.</p>\n<p>*30+ Bands*</p>\n<p
 >*Free Camping*</p>\n<p>*Free Parking*</p>\n<p>*BYOB*</p>\n<p>*Food Trucks
 *</p>\n<p>*Vendors*</p>\n<p>*Campfire Jams*</p>\n<p>*All Ages*</p>\n</BODY
 ></HTML>
END:VEVENT
