  purchase required and no strings attached. The free comics are brand new 
 and made specifically for this day\, with comics for every age and interes
 t represented. Free Comic Book Day is a celebration of comics\, and everyo
 ne’s invited —  those who already know how great comics are\, and those ab
 out to find out!
