 ok Day is the first Saturday in May each year — the day when comic book sh
 ops across North America and around the world give comic books away absolu
 tely free to anyone who comes into the stores\, no purchase required and n
 o strings attached. The free comics are brand new and made specifically fo
 r this day\, with comics for every age and interest represented. Free Comi
 c Book Day is a celebration of comics\, and everyone’s invited —  those wh
 o already know how great comics are\, and those about to find out!</p>\n</
 BODY></HTML>
