BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-130465@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015804Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Gates open: 10 am both days\nGrand Entry : Noon and 6pm Saturda
 y and Noon on Sunday\nOpen to the Public\, all ages event\nHost Drum – Iro
 n Bear Singers\nPowwow Head Staff :\nMaster of Ceremony : Buffalo Child\nA
 rena Director and Co-MC: Leroy Malaterre\nHead Veteran – Mike Dunn\nHead M
 an – Eric Parrish\nHead Lady – Kichie – Alissa Malaterre\nHead Junior Man 
 – Hunter Parks\nHead Junior Lady – Emyle Hobbs\nFeaturing Buffalo Child\nB
 uffalo Child will be returning again this year to MC and do his Hoop Dance
 ! He has been in over 100 movies\, films & TV shows including: Dances with
  Wolves\, Crazy Horse\, and Call of the Wild. Buffalo Child is 14/16 Plain
 s Cree and part Nakota. He will share the history of smudging and powwows 
 and perform a hoop dance from 4:30 pm to 5:30 pm both days.\nWe will be do
 ing several honor dances\, candy dance for the kids\, and a GLOW DANCE Sat
 urday at dusk.\nConsider bringing your own chairs – Seating may be limited
 !
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250802
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250803
LOCATION:9582 Hi Ridge Trail\, Spencer\, Indiana
RRULE:FREQ=DAILY;UNTIL=20250803T235959Z
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:The Gathering of the People Powwow 2025
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/the-gathering-of-the-people-pow-wow/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Gates
  open: 10 am both days</strong><br />\nGrand Entry : Noon and 6pm Saturday
  and Noon on Sunday<br />\nOpen to the Public\, all ages event<br />\nHost
  Drum – Iron Bear Singers<br />\nPowwow Head Staff :<br />\nMaster of Cere
 mony : Buffalo Child<br />\nArena Director and Co-MC: Leroy Malaterre<br /
 >\nHead Veteran – Mike Dunn<br />\nHead Man – Eric Parrish<br />\nHead Lad
 y – Kichie – Alissa Malaterre<br />\nHead Junior Man – Hunter Parks<br />
 \nHead Junior Lady – Emyle Hobbs<br />\nFeaturing Buffalo Child<br />\nBuf
 falo Child will be returning again this year to MC and do his Hoop Dance! 
 He has been in over 100 movies\, films & TV shows including: Dances with W
 olves\, Crazy Horse\, and Call of the Wild. Buffalo Child is 14/16 Plains 
 Cree and part Nakota. He will share the history of smudging and powwows an
 d perform a hoop dance from 4:30 pm to 5:30 pm both days.<br />\nWe will b
 e doing several honor dances\, candy dance for the kids\, and a GLOW DANCE
  Saturday at dusk.<br />\nConsider bringing your own chairs – Seating may 
 be limited!</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
