CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Once again\, we’ve reserved the perfect natural space for danci
 ng\, live music\, and being a part of the community of musicians and dance
 rs.\nCamp\, choose a bunk in rustic cabins\, or reserve your spot in moder
 n air-conditioned cabins. Update\, Aug 14: All cabins (rustic and modern) 
 are full. Camping\, of course is still available. If you like\, you may em
 ail shweekend@gmail.com to be added to a waitlist for rustic or modern bun
 ks.\nEnjoy workshops\, jamming\, singing\, canoeing\, beach activities\, a
 nd more!\nReconnect with old-time friends\, meet new friends and dance\, d
 ance\, dance!\nGreat meals and snacks all weekend!\nEveryone helps – it ad
 ds to the fun and reduces the cost!\nCheck the website and Facebook for up
 dates and registration information.\n Saturday:\n8:00 – 10:00 am Breakfast
 \, Dining Hall\n9:30 – 11:00 am  Workshops\n10:00 am – 5:30 pm  Beach open
  with lifeguards\, canoes & pontoon boat\n11:30 am – 1:00 pm Workshops\n11
 :30 am – 2:00 pm Lunch\, Dining Hall\n1:30 – 3:00 pm Workshops\n3:00- 3:45
  pm Ice Cream Party at the beach\n3:30 – 5:00 pm Workshops\n5:30pm Lottery
  for Bands & Callers\, Registration area\, David Ernst\n                  
 Please sign up by 5!\n6:00 – 7:30 pm  Dinner\, Dining Hall\n8:00 pm – ??  
 Contra Dance\, Dining Hall
