X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Once again\, 
 we’ve reserved the perfect natural space for dancing\, live music\, and be
 ing a part of the community of musicians and dancers.<br />\nCamp\, choose
  a bunk in rustic cabins\, or reserve your spot in modern air-conditioned 
 cabins. Update\, Aug 14: All cabins (rustic and modern) are full. Camping\
 , of course is still available. If you like\, you may email shweekend@gmai
 l.com to be added to a waitlist for rustic or modern bunks.<br />\nEnjoy w
 orkshops\, jamming\, singing\, canoeing\, beach activities\, and more!<br 
 />\nReconnect with old-time friends\, meet new friends and dance\, dance\,
  dance!<br />\nGreat meals and snacks all weekend!<br />\nEveryone helps –
  it adds to the fun and reduces the cost!<br />\nCheck the website and Fac
 ebook for updates and registration information.<br />\n Saturday:<br />\n8
 :00 – 10:00 am Breakfast\, Dining Hall<br />\n9:30 – 11:00 am  Workshops<b
 r />\n10:00 am – 5:30 pm  Beach open with lifeguards\, canoes & pontoon bo
 at<br />\n11:30 am – 1:00 pm Workshops<br />\n11:30 am – 2:00 pm Lunch\, D
 ining Hall<br />\n1:30 – 3:00 pm Workshops<br />\n3:00- 3:45 pm Ice Cream 
 Party at the beach<br />\n3:30 – 5:00 pm Workshops<br />\n5:30pm Lottery f
 or Bands & Callers\, Registration area\, David Ernst</p>\n<p>             
      Please sign up by 5!</p>\n<p>6:00 – 7:30 pm  Dinner\, Dining Hall<br 
 />\n8:00 pm – ??  Contra Dance\, Dining Hall</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
