END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-107677@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015804Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:A Riveting new Sports Drama! College basketball superstar Khady
  Salama dreams of leading her team to the NCAA Championship. But in her se
 nior year\, March Madness coincides with Ramadan and she’s promised her de
 vout mother that she’ll fast. When her story goes public\, Khady unexpecte
 dly becomes a role model for young Muslim women everywhere\, with just one
  small problem…she’s lying about fasting. As the tournament unfolds\, Khad
 y is forced to grapple with her faith\, family\, and what it means to win 
 at all costs.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230331T193000
LOCATION:Ted Jones Playhouse\, 107 W 9th St\, Bloomington
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20230325T193000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20230329T193000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20230330T193000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20230331T193000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20230401T193000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20230405T193000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20230406T193000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20230407T193000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20230408T193000
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:America Fast\, presented by Constellation Stage and Screen
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/america-fast-presented-by-constellation-stage-an
 d-screen/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><em><strong>A
  Riveting new Sports Drama!</strong></em> College basketball superstar Kha
 dy Salama dreams of leading her team to the NCAA Championship. But in her 
 senior year\, March Madness coincides with Ramadan and she’s promised her 
 devout mother that she’ll fast. When her story goes public\, Khady unexpec
 tedly becomes a role model for young Muslim women everywhere\, with just o
 ne small problem…she’s lying about fasting. As the tournament unfolds\, Kh
 ady is forced to grapple with her faith\, family\, and what it means to wi
 n at all costs.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
