DESCRIPTION:First Thursdays festivals showcase the diversity of arts and hu
 manities at IU Bloomington and offer a welcoming environment for students\
 , faculty\, staff\, and community members to explore new creative outlets.
  Previous festivals have included everything from opera to breakdancing\, 
 stage-fighting to clay-throwing\, and much\, much more. Each festival is a
  unique opportunity to experience the wonderful work of artists\, performe
 rs\, and scholars from all across campus and around town.
