 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>First Thursda
 ys festivals showcase the diversity of arts and humanities at IU Bloomingt
 on and offer a welcoming environment for students\, faculty\, staff\, and 
 community members to explore new creative outlets. Previous festivals have
  included everything from opera to breakdancing\, stage-fighting to clay-t
 hrowing\, and much\, much more. Each festival is a unique opportunity to e
 xperience the wonderful work of artists\, performers\, and scholars from a
 ll across campus and around town.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
