BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-107688@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015804Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:(812) 345-2470\; BCGCglass@gmail.com
DESCRIPTION:The Bloomington Creative Glass Center (BCGC) will host their 7t
 h annual Fused Glass EGGstravaganza on April 8th from 12:00-5:00 p.m. Come
  make a beautiful fused glass keepsake for yourself or a loved one this sp
 ring. This family friendly workshop is an opportunity for anyone ages 5 an
 d above to try glass making “on the spot”. Children under 13 must be accom
 panied by an adult.\nGlass-fusing is a fun creative process that involves 
 collaging smaller bits of glass onto a larger glass surface. Pieces will b
 e fired in a kiln and will be available for pick it up the following week.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230408T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20230408T170000
LOCATION:Bloomington Creative Glass Center \, 229 W. Grimes Lane\, Blooming
 ton\, Indiana
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Fused Glass EGGstravaganza
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/fused-glass-eggstravaganza/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p dir='ltr'>The
  Bloomington Creative Glass Center (BCGC) will host their 7th annual Fused
  Glass EGGstravaganza on April 8th from 12:00-5:00 p.m. Come make a beauti
 ful fused glass keepsake for yourself or a loved one this spring. This fam
 ily friendly workshop is an opportunity for anyone ages 5 and above to try
  glass making “on the spot”. Children under 13 must be accompanied by an a
 dult.</p>\n<p dir='ltr'>Glass-fusing is a fun creative process that involv
 es collaging smaller bits of glass onto a larger glass surface. Pieces wil
 l be fired in a kiln and will be available for pick it up the following we
 ek.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
