 rand Jury Prize at the Cannes Film Festival\, Lukas Dhont’s second film is
  an emotionally transformative and unforgettable portrait of the intersect
 ion of friendship and love\, identity and independence\, and heartbreak an
 d healing. [104 min\; drama\; English\, French\, Flemish\, and Dutch with 
 English subtitles]
