DESCRIPTION:On April 10\, 2023\, KMC Bloomington is celebrating 2 years of 
 being at its new location — 234 N. Morton Street — and 6 years in Blooming
 ton. On this special day\, we will be unveiling a new reception area dedic
 ated to community use following classes\, retreats\, talks and gatherings.
  Everyone is welcome to join any of the scheduled events. If you are joini
 ng us for lunch\, please register in advance.\nRegister for lunch: https:/
 /www.meditationinbloomington.org/apr-10-2-year-anniversary-kmc-bloomington
 \nSCHEDULE of EVENTS\n9:30am – 11am — Offering to the Spiritual Guide Chan
 ted Prayer\n12:15pm-12:45pm — Lunchtime meditation with Gen Kelsang Chokyi
 \n12:45 – 1:30pm — FREE Taco Bar lunch with community — please register\n5
  – 6pm — Heart Jewel Chanted Prayer
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230410T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20230410T180000
LOCATION:Kadampa Meditation Center Bloomington\, 234 North Morton Street\, 
 Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Anniversary Celebration
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/two-year-anniversary-of-the-kadampa-meditation-c
 enter-bloomington/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>On April 10\,
  2023\, KMC Bloomington is celebrating 2 years of being at its new locatio
 n — 234 N. Morton Street — and 6 years in Bloomington. On this special day
 \, we will be unveiling a new reception area dedicated to community use fo
 llowing classes\, retreats\, talks and gatherings. Everyone is welcome to 
 join any of the scheduled events. If you are joining us for lunch\, please
  register in advance.</p>\n<p>Register for lunch: https://www.meditationin
 bloomington.org/apr-10-2-year-anniversary-kmc-bloomington<br />\nSCHEDULE 
 of EVENTS<br />\n9:30am – 11am — Offering to the Spiritual Guide Chanted P
 rayer<br />\n12:15pm-12:45pm — Lunchtime meditation with Gen Kelsang Choky
 i<br />\n12:45 – 1:30pm — FREE Taco Bar lunch with community — please regi
 ster<br />\n5 – 6pm — Heart Jewel Chanted Prayer</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
