DTSTAMP:20260331T015804Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:812-349-3409\; ash.kulak@bloomington.in.gov\; http://safetyforallbl
 oomington.eventbrite.com/
DESCRIPTION: “Safety For All\, At the Expense of None: A Town Hall on Publi
 c Safety in Bloomington” to be held in-person in the Monroe County Public 
 Library Auditorium and online via Zoom on Tuesday\, April 11 at 5-7pm. All
  Bloomington residents are encouraged to register online to help us plan t
 he event. The link to register is: SafetyForAllBloomington.eventbrite.com.
 \nThis town hall event is intended to facilitate a community-led deliberat
 ion on our city’s public safety in a way which will improve the safety of 
 all residents of Bloomington. For more information\, please see visit the 
 event website  SafetyForAllBloomington.eventbrite.com or contact commissio
 n liaison Ash Kulak by email at ash.kulak@bloomington.in.gov or by phone a
 t 812-349-3409.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230411T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20230411T190000
LOCATION:Monroe County Public Library Auditorium\, 303 E Kirkwood Ave\, Blo
 omington\, Indiana 47408
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Safety For All\, At the Expense of None: A Town Hall on Public Safe
 ty in Bloomington
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/safety-for-all-at-the-expense-of-none-a-town-hal
 l-on-public-safety-in-bloomington/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div> “Safety Fo
 r All\, At the Expense of None: A Town Hall on Public Safety in Bloomingto
 n” to be held in-person in the Monroe County Public Library Auditorium and
  online via Zoom on <b>Tuesday\, April 11 at 5-7pm</b>. All Bloomington re
 sidents are encouraged to register online to help us plan the event. The l
 ink to register is: <a href='http://safetyforallbloomington.eventbrite.com
 /' target='_blank' rel='noopener' data-saferedirecturl='https://www.google
 .com/url?q=http://SafetyForAllBloomington.eventbrite.com&source=gmail&ust=
 1680980470185000&usg=AOvVaw1VHoYJEtR7hCmiWsIvw1Xa'>SafetyForAllBloomington
 .<wbr />eventbrite.com</a>.</div>\n<p>This town hall event is intended to 
 facilitate a community-led deliberation on our city’s public safety in a w
 ay which will improve the safety of all residents of Bloomington. For more
  information\, please see visit the event website  <a href='http://safetyf
 orallbloomington.eventbrite.com/' target='_blank' rel='noopener' data-safe
 redirecturl='https://www.google.com/url?q=http://SafetyForAllBloomington.e
 ventbrite.com&source=gmail&ust=1680980470185000&usg=AOvVaw1VHoYJEtR7hCmiWs
 Ivw1Xa'>SafetyForAllBloomington.<wbr />eventbrite.com</a> or contact commi
 ssion liaison Ash Kulak by email at <a href='mailto:ash.kulak@bloomington.
 in.gov' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>ash.kulak@bloomington.in.gov</a> or
  by phone at 812-349-3409.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
