BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-108098@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015804Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Nohe & Sus Santos (Nohe and Her Saints) is a four-piece band re
 plete with musical traditions\, rhythms and sounds of Central and North Am
 erica. Incorporating Alt-Rock en Espanol\, Quirky Cumbia\, Pop Grooves\, a
 nd beyond. Nohe & Sus Santos delivers a Latinx vibe full of soul and passi
 on\, possessing a distinctive style all their own. You’ll hear electric gu
 itar\, supple bass\, fluid percussion – and celebrated Honduran vocalist\,
  Nohelia Sosa!\nReserve your spot to see Nohe & Sus Santos in concert here
 . Payment & donations accepted at the door. Admission is sliding scale: $1
 0 – $15.\nThe Lotus Firebay is within walking distance of downtown parking
 . There is also parking available along 4th Street\, across Rogers Street 
 from the Lotus Firebay.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230411T190000
LOCATION:Lotus Firebay\, 105 South Rogers St.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Nohe & Sus Santos (Nohe and Her Saints)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/nohe-sus-santos-nohe-and-her-saints/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Nohe & Sus Sa
 ntos (Nohe and Her Saints) is a four-piece band replete with musical tradi
 tions\, rhythms and sounds of Central and North America. Incorporating Alt
 -Rock en Espanol\, Quirky Cumbia\, Pop Grooves\, and beyond. Nohe & Sus Sa
 ntos delivers a Latinx vibe full of soul and passion\, possessing a distin
 ctive style all their own. You’ll hear electric guitar\, supple bass\, flu
 id percussion – and celebrated Honduran vocalist\, Nohelia Sosa!</p>\n<p>R
 eserve your spot to see Nohe & Sus Santos in concert here. Payment & donat
 ions accepted at the door. Admission is sliding scale: $10 – $15.</p>\n<p>
 The Lotus Firebay is within walking distance of downtown parking. There is
  also parking available along 4th Street\, across Rogers Street from the L
 otus Firebay.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
