 ti Symphony Orchestra\, and guest artists Alexander Kerr (violin) and Rand
 olph Bowman (flute) perform favorites by Rameau\, Ibert\, and Berlioz\, an
 d introduce some intriguing lesser-known pieces by Amy Beach\, Chevalier d
 e Saint-Georges and Sebastian Currier.
