 in Zander (vocals\, rhythm guitar)\, Rick Nielsen (lead guitar)\, Tom Pete
 rsson (bass guitar)\, and Daxx Nielsen (drums) – are true pioneers with an
  unparalleled streak of certifiably classic tunes\, from “He’s A Whore\,” 
 “California Man” and “Dream Police” to “Surrender” and “I Want You To Want
  Me.”<br />\n2016 saw Cheap Trick’s long-awaited induction into the Rock a
 nd Roll Hall of Fame. The induction honored both the band and the pioneeri
