UID:ai1ec-108336@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015804Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:In Sydney\, business lawyer David Burton (Richard Chamberlain) 
 is given the pro bono assignment of defending five Aborigines accused of t
 he murder of another tribesman. None of Burton’s clients are willing to sp
 eak about what happened\, even in their own defense\, and the medical exam
 iner on the case can’t figure out how the victim died. But what’s most tro
 ubling Burton is the increasingly terrifying apocalyptic visions he’s havi
 ng\, leading him to think Australia may soon be destroyed. [105 min\; myst
 ery\, thriller\; English]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230418T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. Seventh Street Bloomington\,(on the North side
  of the IU Auditorium\, across from Hoagy)
