  is America’s first and finest collegiate Black popular music ensemble sin
 ce 1971.\nDon’t miss these dynamic performances of R&B\, soul\, funk\, and
  contemporary Black popular music delivered by commanding vocalists\, powe
 rful horns\, and tight rhythm section.
