 escription'>\n<p>The IU Soul Revue Spring Concert will be held on Saturday
 \, April 22\, 2023\, 7:30 p.m. at the Buskirk-Chumley Theater in Bloomingt
 on\, IN.</p>\n<p>Directed by IU and Soul Revue alumnus James Strong\, the 
 IU Soul Revue is America’s first and finest collegiate Black popular music
  ensemble since 1971.</p>\n<p>Don’t miss these dynamic performances of R&B
