BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-108476@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015804Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:soulcraftbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Spend the weekend gathering wild edibles and wild medicines fro
 m various ecosystems in beautiful Southern Indiana! We will learn about\, 
 ethically harvest\, process\, cook\, and of course devour lots of wild edi
 bles throughout the weekend. Make lots of plant medicines for you to take 
 home for yourself or friends and family\, and learn various wild cooking t
 echniques\, along with creating some of your own collection and eating con
 tainers. This is an immersive\, jam packed weekend of plant and mushroom t
 astiness\, that will leave you feeling deeply connected to the land. Suste
 nance activities like foraging help to slow down\, try new things\, go on 
 adventures\, and have FUN!!!! No experience necessary.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230423T120000
LOCATION:Soulcraft Bloomington\, 3370 bethel ln\, Bloomington\, IN\, 47408
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Food for the Soul: Wild Foraging Weekend
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/food-for-the-soul-wild-foraging-weekend-2/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Spend the wee
 kend gathering wild edibles and wild medicines from various ecosystems in 
 beautiful Southern Indiana! We will learn about\, ethically harvest\, proc
 ess\, cook\, and of course devour lots of wild edibles throughout the week
 end. Make lots of plant medicines for you to take home for yourself or fri
 ends and family\, and learn various wild cooking techniques\, along with c
 reating some of your own collection and eating containers. This is an imme
 rsive\, jam packed weekend of plant and mushroom tastiness\, that will lea
 ve you feeling deeply connected to the land. Sustenance activities like fo
 raging help to slow down\, try new things\, go on adventures\, and have FU
 N!!!! No experience necessary.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
