 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Union Board\,
  in partnership with the IU LGBTQ+ Culture Center\, presents the first edi
 tion of the brand new “Speaking of Excellence” lecture series featuring le
 gendary actor\, activist\, author\, and speaker George Takei. Best known f
 or his portrayal of Mr. Sulu in the acclaimed television and film series S
 tar Trek\, Takei’s acting career has spanned five decades\, and he has app
 eared in more than 40 feature films and hundreds of TV appearances.</p>\n<
 /BODY></HTML>
