DESCRIPTION:Sleep out so others don’t have to! Join compassionate community
  members and local nonprofit Beacon\, Inc. in support of our annual Solida
 rity Sleepout to raise funds for our region’s only LGBTQ+ affirming emerge
 ncy overnight shelter\, Friend’s Place. The event will be held from Friday
 \, April 28th at 7pm to Saturday\, April 29th at 8 am on the grounds of th
 e First United Methodist Church in downtown Bloomington. Sign up to sleep 
 out at givebutter.com/sleepout2023
