CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:About Montage Film Festival 2023\nThe Fourth Annual Montage Fil
 m Festival is IU’s annual celebration of student-produced films. Submitted
  films are viewed and judged by IU alumni and awarded for several categori
 es including Best in Show\, Best Cinematography\, and Best Acting or Perfo
 rmance.\nMontage is a collaboration between IU Cinema and The Media School
 .\nAny film screened at IU Cinema may contain content that viewers find se
 nsitive or upsetting.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230428T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. Seventh Street Bloomington\,(on the North side
  of the IU Auditorium\, across from Hoagy)
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Films: Montage Film Festival 2023 – New work from IU student filmma
 kers!
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/films-montage-film-festival-2023-new-work-from-i
 u-student-filmmakers/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>About Montage
  Film Festival 2023</p>\n<p>The Fourth Annual Montage Film Festival is IU’
 s annual celebration of student-produced films. Submitted films are viewed
  and judged by IU alumni and awarded for several categories including Best
  in Show\, Best Cinematography\, and Best Acting or Performance.</p>\n<p>M
 ontage is a collaboration between IU Cinema and The Media School.</p>\n<p>
 Any film screened at IU Cinema may contain content that viewers find sensi
 tive or upsetting.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
