BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-108613@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015804Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Solitary Man is a high-energy concert event which pays homage t
 o the music of Neil Diamond. Veteran singer and actor David Jericko brings
  Neil’s music to life\, capturing every stylistic nuance of his sound and 
 personality.\nJericko is supported in this extravaganza by “The Crew” — a 
 six-piece band of A-list players who have backed some of the industry’s bi
 ggest stars. From “Solitary Man” to “Love on the Rocks”\, you’ll hear fait
 hful renditions of all the hits that made Neil Diamond a musical legend. T
 his show is as close as you can get to seeing Neil Diamond live at the pea
 k of his career.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230429T193000
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 South Van Buren St\, Nashville\,
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Solitary Man\, A Neil Diamond Tribute
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/solitary-man-a-neil-diamond-tribute/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Solitary Man 
 is a high-energy concert event which pays homage to the music of Neil Diam
 ond. Veteran singer and actor David Jericko brings Neil’s music to life\, 
 capturing every stylistic nuance of his sound and personality.<br />\nJeri
 cko is supported in this extravaganza by “The Crew” — a six-piece band of 
 A-list players who have backed some of the industry’s biggest stars. From 
 “Solitary Man” to “Love on the Rocks”\, you’ll hear faithful renditions of
  all the hits that made Neil Diamond a musical legend. This show is as clo
 se as you can get to seeing Neil Diamond live at the peak of his career.</
 p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
