CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Showing:\nNational Treasure (2004)  |  Dir. Jon Turteltaub  |  
 PG  |  12pm\nValley Girl (1983)  |  Dir. Martha Coolidge  |  R  |  2:15pm
 \nVampire’s Kiss (1988)  |  Dir. Robert Bierman  |  R  |  4pm\nRaising Ari
 zona (1987)  |  Dir. Joel Coen  |  PG-13  |  5:50pm\nWild at Heart (1990) 
  |  Dir. David Lynch  |  R  |  7:30pm\nMandy (2018)  |  Dir. Panos Cosmato
 s  |  Not rated  |  9:40pm\nFinals got you down? The 9-to-5 stressing you 
 out? Swing by the IU Cinema and take a break from it all! Doors open at 11
 :30am with films screening back-to-back\, starting at 12pm. There will be 
 no intermissions\, but we are scheduling a five-minute bathroom break betw
 een the start of each film. You can stay for as long or as little as you l
 ike!\nAnd\, this is big: we’re breaking our own rules… that’s right\, SNAC
 KS WILL BE ALLOWED! Snacks\, drinks in resealable/enclosed containers (the
 re are no cupholders in the Cinema!)\, and finger foods that do not emit a
  strong odor will be allowed for this event. Alcohol\, cigarettes\, electr
 onic cigarettes\, and illicit drugs are prohibited at IU Cinema.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230430T120000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. Seventh Street Bloomington\,(on the North side
  of the IU Auditorium\, across from Hoagy)
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:ESCAPE THE WEEK MEGA MARATHON – Join us for 12 hours of back-to-bac
 k movies featuring Nicolas Cage
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/escape-the-week-mega-marathon-join-us-for-12-hou
 rs-of-back-to-back-movies-featuring-nick-cage/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Showi
 ng:<br />\nNational Treasure (2004)  |  Dir. Jon Turteltaub  |  PG  |  12p
 m<br />\nValley Girl (1983)  |  Dir. Martha Coolidge  |  R  |  2:15pm<br /
 >\nVampire’s Kiss (1988)  |  Dir. Robert Bierman  |  R  |  4pm<br />\nRais
 ing Arizona (1987)  |  Dir. Joel Coen  |  PG-13  |  5:50pm<br />\nWild at 
 Heart (1990)  |  Dir. David Lynch  |  R  |  7:30pm<br />\nMandy (2018)  | 
  Dir. Panos Cosmatos  |  Not rated  |  9:40pm</strong><br />\nFinals got y
 ou down? The 9-to-5 stressing you out? Swing by the IU Cinema and take a b
 reak from it all! Doors open at 11:30am with films screening back-to-back\
 , starting at 12pm. There will be no intermissions\, but we are scheduling
  a five-minute bathroom break between the start of each film. You can stay
  for as long or as little as you like!</p>\n<p>And\, this is big: we’re br
 eaking our own rules… that’s right\, SNACKS WILL BE ALLOWED! Snacks\, drin
 ks in resealable/enclosed containers (there are no cupholders in the Cinem
 a!)\, and finger foods that do not emit a strong odor will be allowed for 
 this event. Alcohol\, cigarettes\, electronic cigarettes\, and illicit dru
 gs are prohibited at IU Cinema.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
