X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Bloomington R
 estorations\, Inc. invites you to the 2023 18th Annual Daisy Days Plant Sa
 le and Museum Open Day on Saturday\, April 29\, from 11 a.m.-4 p.m. and Su
 nday\, April 30\, from 1-4 p.m. Plants are grown from seed\, harvested ons
 ite\, or sourced from Spence Restoration Nursery\, since 1998 Indiana’s pr
 emier native plant supplier. Experts are on-hand during the sale to answer
  questions and guide selections. Tours of the main house will also be avai
 lable from 1-4 p.m. on Saturday. The Farmstead is listed on the National R
 egister of Historic Places and is owned and maintained by Bloomington Rest
 orations\, Inc.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
