 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Suze and Arth
 ur are an Eisenhower-era couple leading traditional lives on New York’s Lo
 wer East Side consisting of housework\, domesticity\, and compliant\, unas
 suming gender roles–that is\, until they encounter a gang of leather-clad 
 greasers known as The Young Gents.</p>\n<p>A very funny\, campy celebratio
 n of erotic liberation written and directed by Amanda Kramer (95 min • co-
 sponsored by Cidada Cinema)</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
