UID:ai1ec-108471@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015804Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:garden@hhfoodbank.org
DESCRIPTION:Come join the Hoosier Hills Food Bank as they tend our 1 acre g
 arden at Will Detmer Park\, 4140 W Vernal Pike in Bloomington. Volunteers 
 will help to grow thousands of pounds of fresh and healthy produce for dis
 tribution to neighbors across 5 counties. Gardeners of all experience leve
 ls can help to give back to the community while picking up a few tips and 
 tricks on growing veggies using sustainable methods. Open volunteer hours 
 are every Monday and Friday from 9am to Noon. Please wear closed toed shoe
 s\, gloves and sun protection recommended. For questions\, or for weather 
 cancellations\, please email Cory at garden@hhfoodbank.org
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230501T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20230501T120000
LOCATION:Will Detmer Park\, 4140 W Vernal Pike\, Bloomington\, IN 47404
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20230505T090000
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Open Hours for the Garden Volunteer Program  at Hoosier Hills Food 
 Bank
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/garden-volunteer-program-at-hoosier-hills-food-b
 ank/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Come join the
  Hoosier Hills Food Bank as they tend our 1 acre garden at Will Detmer Par
 k\, 4140 W Vernal Pike in Bloomington. Volunteers will help to grow thousa
 nds of pounds of fresh and healthy produce for distribution to neighbors a
 cross 5 counties. Gardeners of all experience levels can help to give back
  to the community while picking up a few tips and tricks on growing veggie
 s using sustainable methods. Open volunteer hours are every Monday and Fri
 day from 9am to Noon. Please wear closed toed shoes\, gloves and sun prote
 ction recommended. For questions\, or for weather cancellations\, please e
 mail Cory at garden@hhfoodbank.org</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
