BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-108831@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015804Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Door at 7pm    “Madeleines” is about a family of Jewish women f
 inding ways to love each other through shared emotions and the solace of b
 aking.  Spiced with poetry\, Yiddish and Spanish\, “Madeleines” centers on
  a recipe of the French teacakes\, Madeleines.  Two sisters\, in the wake 
 of their mother’s death\, discover a starling family secret embedded in th
 e recipe that may change their lives.\nDoors will open 30 minuted before e
 ach show at the Rose Fire Bay in the Waldron Arts Center. Will-call will b
 e available during regular box office hours\, on the day of the show will 
 call will be available at the Buskirk-Chumley Theater until 4pm. After tha
 t will-call will be available at the venue when doors open. The box office
  is not open on Sundays. The Sunday performance will-call will be availabl
 e during our regular hours until 4pm the day before the show. After that t
 he will call will be available at the venue when doors open.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230504T193000
LOCATION:Rose Firebay\, Waldron Arts Center\, 122 South Walnut St\, Bloomin
 gton
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20230506T193000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20230511T193000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20230513T193000
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:The Jewish Theatre of Bloomington presents: MADELEINES  written by 
 Bess Welden
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/the-jewish-theatre-of-bloomington-presents-madel
 eines-written-by-bess-welden/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Door 
 at 7pm</strong>    “Madeleines” is about a family of Jewish women finding 
 ways to love each other through shared emotions and the solace of baking. 
  Spiced with poetry\, Yiddish and Spanish\, “Madeleines” centers on a reci
 pe of the French teacakes\, Madeleines.  Two sisters\, in the wake of thei
 r mother’s death\, discover a starling family secret embedded in the recip
 e that may change their lives.</p>\n<p>Doors will open 30 minuted before e
 ach show at the Rose Fire Bay in the Waldron Arts Center. Will-call will b
 e available during regular box office hours\, on the day of the show will 
 call will be available at the Buskirk-Chumley Theater until 4pm. After tha
 t will-call will be available at the venue when doors open. The box office
  is not open on Sundays. The Sunday performance will-call will be availabl
 e during our regular hours until 4pm the day before the show. After that t
 he will call will be available at the venue when doors open.</p>\n</BODY><
 /HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
