BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-108984@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015804Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:https://www.meditationinbloomington.org/may-5-life-of-buddha-movie-
 kadampa
DESCRIPTION:“The Life of Buddha” is a movie of a play performed at Manjushr
 i Kadampa Meditation Center by Kadampa performers. This delightful and mov
 ing dramatic presentation\, inspired by Venerable Geshe-la and his teachin
 gs\, recounts Buddha’s life story\, in particular the twelve principal dee
 ds of Buddha\, revealing the essential characteristics of a spiritual life
 . \n“This is a holy\, spiritual play. Every part of this play\nshows great
  meaning. It is not an ordinary play”\n— Venerable Geshe Kelsang Gyatso Ri
 npoche\nGen Kelsang Chokyi will give some inspiration about the upcoming I
 nternational Spring Festival at Manjushri KMC. The upcoming International 
 Festival will have special commentary to the Liberating Prayer and Interna
 tional Refuge Vow Ceremony with\nGen-la Kelsang Dekyong.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230505T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20230505T193000
LOCATION:Kadampa Meditation Center\, 234 N. Morton St. Bloomington\, IN 474
 04
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:LIFE OF BUDDHA MOVIE
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/life-of-buddha-movie/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>“The Life of 
 Buddha” is a movie of a play performed at Manjushri Kadampa Meditation Cen
 ter by Kadampa performers. This delightful and moving dramatic presentatio
 n\, inspired by Venerable Geshe-la and his teachings\, recounts Buddha’s l
 ife story\, in particular the twelve principal deeds of Buddha\, revealing
  the essential characteristics of a spiritual life. </p>\n<p>“This is a ho
 ly\, spiritual play. Every part of this play<br />\nshows great meaning. I
 t is not an ordinary play”<br />\n— Venerable Geshe Kelsang Gyatso Rinpoch
 e</p>\n<p>Gen Kelsang Chokyi will give some inspiration about the upcoming
  International Spring Festival at Manjushri KMC. The upcoming Internationa
 l Festival will have special commentary to the Liberating Prayer and Inter
 national Refuge Vow Ceremony with<br />\nGen-la Kelsang Dekyong. </p>\n</B
 ODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
