DTSTAMP:20260331T015804Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Class #2: May 6\, 10 AM-Noon\nGrowing and foraging medicinal he
 rbs\nHerbs used for digestive problems.\nSusan Clearwater is a holistic nu
 rse\, clinical herbalist\, and author of The Art of Herbal Healing\, a han
 ds-on exploration into the world of herbalism. From gardening\, harvesting
 \, and creating herbal teas and other preparations to learning which herbs
  are helpful for specific conditions\, The Art of Herbal Healing is a comp
 rehensive reference containing a wealth of information.
