 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Class #2: May
  6\, 10 AM-Noon<br />\nGrowing and foraging medicinal herbs<br />\nHerbs u
 sed for digestive problems.</p>\n<p>Susan Clearwater is a holistic nurse\,
  clinical herbalist\, and author of The Art of Herbal Healing\, a hands-on
