BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-108834@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015804Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:“Madeleines” is about a family of Jewish women finding ways to 
 love each other through shared emotions and the solace of baking.  Spiced 
 with poetry\, Yiddish and Spanish\, “Madeleines” centers on a recipe of th
 e French teacakes\, Madeleines.  Two sisters\, in the wake of their mother
 ’s death\, discover a starling family secret embedded in the recipe that m
 ay change their lives.\nDoors will open 30 minuted before each show at the
  Rose Fire Bay in the Waldron Arts Center. Will-call will be available dur
 ing regular box office hours\, on the day of the show will call will be av
 ailable at the Buskirk-Chumley Theater until 4pm. After that will-call wil
 l be available at the venue when doors open. The box office is not open on
  Sundays. The Sunday performance will-call will be available during our re
 gular hours until 4pm the day before the show. After that the will call wi
 ll be available at the venue when doors open.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230507T150000
LOCATION:Rose Firebay\, Waldron Arts Center\, 122 South Walnut St\, Bloomin
 gton
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:The Jewish Theatre of Bloomington presents: MADELEINES  written by 
 Bess Welden
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/the-jewish-theatre-of-bloomington-presents-madel
 eines-written-by-bess-welden-2/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>“Madeleines” 
 is about a family of Jewish women finding ways to love each other through 
 shared emotions and the solace of baking.  Spiced with poetry\, Yiddish an
 d Spanish\, “Madeleines” centers on a recipe of the French teacakes\, Made
 leines.  Two sisters\, in the wake of their mother’s death\, discover a st
 arling family secret embedded in the recipe that may change their lives.</
 p>\n<p>Doors will open 30 minuted before each show at the Rose Fire Bay in
  the Waldron Arts Center. Will-call will be available during regular box o
 ffice hours\, on the day of the show will call will be available at the Bu
 skirk-Chumley Theater until 4pm. After that will-call will be available at
  the venue when doors open. The box office is not open on Sundays. The Sun
 day performance will-call will be available during our regular hours until
  4pm the day before the show. After that the will call will be available a
 t the venue when doors open.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
