CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Registration is open. Green Gardeners is for people who want to
  learn how to garden together! Join beginning gardener Maggie to learn how
  to garden without a yard. We’ll learn how to transplant plants into a fiv
 e-gallon bucket. We’ll also learn about soil\, sun\, and water needs\, and
  which plants are best for container gardening. Participants will leave wi
 th their own five-gallon bucket to get started. We’ll collaborate\, troubl
 eshoot\, and discuss how to find information to become better gardeners. A
 ge 16 and up. Please register.
