 p/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Regis
 tration is open.</strong> Green Gardeners is for people who want to learn 
 how to garden together! Join beginning gardener Maggie to learn how to gar
 den without a yard. We’ll learn how to transplant plants into a five-gallo
 n bucket. We’ll also learn about soil\, sun\, and water needs\, and which 
 plants are best for container gardening. Participants will leave with thei
 r own five-gallon bucket to get started. We’ll collaborate\, troubleshoot\
 , and discuss how to find information to become better gardeners. Age 16 a
 nd up. Please register.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
