DESCRIPTION:This spring\, Constellation Stage & Screen and the Buskirk-Chum
 ley Theater are teaming up to bring a brand new interactive-screening even
 t to Bloomington audiences. Introducing: Mamma Mia: Sing-Along Edition\, s
 creening on Friday\, May 12 at 7:30pm at the Buskirk-Chumley Theater. Tick
 ets are on sale now through the Constellation Stage & Screen Box Office.\n
 Mamma Mia tells the story of a bride-to-be trying to find her real father\
 , using hit songs by the popular 1970s group ABBA. This smash-hit film\, b
 ased on the stage musical of the same name\, was originally released in 20
 08. Featuring a star-studded cast – including Meryl Streep\, Amanda Seyfri
 ed\, Pierce Brosnan\, Colin Firth\, and Christine Baranski – Mamma Mia is 
 an movie musical not to be missed.\nTaking place over Mother’s Day weekend
 \, Constellation and BCT’s screening is the perfect Mother’s Day celebrati
 on or girls’ night out! Be sure to dress in your Mamma Mia best (whether d
 isco or island inspired)\, as we’ll be kicking off the screening with a sh
 ort\, yet fun\, pre-show activity\, including a costume contest and Dancin
 g Queen dance off.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230512T193000
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater\, 114 E Kirkwood Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47
 408
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Constellation Stage & Screen and Buskirk-Chumley Theater Presents: 
 MAMMA MIA: SING-ALONG EDITION
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/constellation-stage-screen-and-buskirk-chumley-t
 heater-presents-mamma-mia-sing-along-edition/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>This spring\,
  Constellation Stage & Screen and the Buskirk-Chumley Theater are teaming 
 up to bring a brand new interactive-screening event to Bloomington audienc
 es. Introducing: Mamma Mia: Sing-Along Edition\, screening on Friday\, May
  12 at 7:30pm at the Buskirk-Chumley Theater. Tickets are on sale now thro
 ugh the Constellation Stage & Screen Box Office.</p>\n<p>Mamma Mia tells t
 he story of a bride-to-be trying to find her real father\, using hit songs
  by the popular 1970s group ABBA. This smash-hit film\, based on the stage
  musical of the same name\, was originally released in 2008. Featuring a s
 tar-studded cast – including Meryl Streep\, Amanda Seyfried\, Pierce Brosn
 an\, Colin Firth\, and Christine Baranski – Mamma Mia is an movie musical 
 not to be missed.</p>\n<p>Taking place over Mother’s Day weekend\, Constel
 lation and BCT’s screening is the perfect Mother’s Day celebration or girl
 s’ night out! Be sure to dress in your Mamma Mia best (whether disco or is
 land inspired)\, as we’ll be kicking off the screening with a short\, yet 
 fun\, pre-show activity\, including a costume contest and Dancing Queen da
 nce off.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
