UID:ai1ec-108761@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015804Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:info@soulcraftbloomington.com\; http://www.soulcraftbloomington.com
 /
DESCRIPTION:A community mending circle with Nina Montenegro\, author/illust
 rator of the book Mending Life: A Handbook for Repairing Clothes and Heart
 s.  Bring your well-loved clothing to repair alongside friends new and old
 . Patch a hole\, stitch up a tear\, replace a button\, riddle through a zi
 pper repair.  Mending is an act of great care\, peace\, and mindfulness\, 
 and is better done alongside others\, preferably with abundant laughter. A
 ll levels of sewing welcome. Some supplies will be on hand but please brin
 g anything you need if you have it.  \nIf you have questions\, email info@
 soulcraftbloomington.com or visit www.soulcraftbloomington.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230513T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20230513T170000
LOCATION:Soulcraft Studio\, 3370 East Bethel Ln Bloomington\, IN 47408
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Community Mending Circle
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/community-mending-circle/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>A community m
 ending circle with Nina Montenegro\, author/illustrator of the book Mendin
 g Life: A Handbook for Repairing Clothes and Hearts.  Bring your well-love
 d clothing to repair alongside friends new and old. Patch a hole\, stitch 
 up a tear\, replace a button\, riddle through a zipper repair.  Mending is
  an act of great care\, peace\, and mindfulness\, and is better done along
 side others\, preferably with abundant laughter. All levels of sewing welc
 ome. Some supplies will be on hand but please bring anything you need if y
 ou have it.  </p>\n<p>If you have questions\, email info@soulcraftblooming
 ton.com or visit www.soulcraftbloomington.com</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
