DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Stone Belt Arc presents “Belt Out Loud!\, a benefit concert fea
 turing Hank Ruff\, at 8 p.m. May 13. Hank Ruff’s music combines elements o
 f traditional country sounds with modern influences\, bringing classic ele
 ments of distinctive country sound back into mainstream country music. \nA
 ttendees can enjoy a night of music while also supporting a great cause. T
 he proceeds from the event will go towards helping Stone Belt provide serv
 ices to individuals with developmental disabilities in our community\, suc
 h as employment training\, day and residential services\, and advocacy ser
 vices. So come out and support a great cause while enjoying some great mus
 ic!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230513T200000
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theatre\, 114 East Kirkwood Ave\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Belt Out Loud! – a Stone Belt Benefit\, featuring Hank Ruff
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/belt-out-loud-a-stone-belt-benefit-featuring-han
 k-ruff/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Stone Belt Ar
 c presents “Belt Out Loud!\, a benefit concert featuring Hank Ruff\, at 8 
 p.m. May 13. Hank Ruff’s music combines elements of traditional country so
 unds with modern influences\, bringing classic elements of distinctive cou
 ntry sound back into mainstream country music. </p>\n<p>Attendees can enjo
 y a night of music while also supporting a great cause. The proceeds from 
 the event will go towards helping Stone Belt provide services to individua
 ls with developmental disabilities in our community\, such as employment t
 raining\, day and residential services\, and advocacy services. So come ou
 t and support a great cause while enjoying some great music! </p>\n</BODY>
 </HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
