DESCRIPTION:Must pre-register to attend by emailing darksidetroupe@gmail.co
 m.\n  Dark Side is an FCBD® style dance troupe and FatChanceBellyDance® Pa
 rtner Studio based in Bloomington\, IN. We formed in early 2006 with the g
 oal of exploring and promoting the strength\, power\, and grace of belly d
 ance\, as well as celebrating the community-building aspects of improvisat
 ional group dance. \nOur 4-week class sessions are $45.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230514T124500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20230514T134500
LOCATION:Windfall Dancers Studio\, 1101 N Dunn St\, Bloomington\, IN 47408
