DESCRIPTION:A soft-spoken girl named Cáit is sent by her parents to live wi
 th a pair of distant relatives. Cáit spends the summer on an idyllic Irish
  farm\, and along the way\, changes her life. The Quiet Girl is the first 
 Irish-language film to be nominated for an Academy Award. (in Gaeiic with 
 subtitles\; 87 min)
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230520T154500
LOCATION:IU Fine Arts Theater (upstairs)\, 1201 East 7th Street\, on the no
 rth side of Showalter Fountain\, next to the IU Auditorium
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20230521T154500
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Ryder Film Series: THE QUIET GIRL (Shows at 3:45pm and 6:45pm)
