BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-109428@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Bloomington Chamber Singers\, one of the area’s premier vocal e
 nsembles\, will hold auditions Tuesday\, May 23 and Tuesday\, August 8 fro
 m 6:30 to 9 pm at St. Mark’s United Methodist Church\, 100 N. St Rd 46\, B
 loomington. In its 54th season\, BCS is a 40-voice mixed chorus that is op
 en by audition to experienced choral singers of all ages. Openings are ava
 ilable in all sections. 2023-2024 repertoire will include Mendelssohn’s El
 ijah\, Vivaldi’s Gloria\, and J. S. Bach’s Magnificat\, BWV 243. Additiona
 l information about auditions\, including signups for audition times\, and
  contact information can be found on this webpage: https://www.chambersing
 ers.info/auditions
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230523T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20230523T210000
LOCATION:St. Mark's United Methodist Church\, 100 North State Road 46\, Blo
 omington
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20230808T183000
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Auditions for Bloomington Chamber Singers
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/auditions-for-bloomington-chamber-singers/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Bloomington C
 hamber Singers\, one of the area’s premier vocal ensembles\, will hold aud
 itions Tuesday\, May 23 and Tuesday\, August 8 from 6:30 to 9 pm at St. Ma
 rk’s United Methodist Church\, 100 N. St Rd 46\, Bloomington. In its 54th 
 season\, BCS is a 40-voice mixed chorus that is open by audition to experi
 enced choral singers of all ages. Openings are available in all sections. 
 2023-2024 repertoire will include Mendelssohn’s Elijah\, Vivaldi’s Gloria\
 , and J. S. Bach’s Magnificat\, BWV 243. Additional information about audi
 tions\, including signups for audition times\, and contact information can
  be found on this webpage: https://www.chambersingers.info/auditions</p>\n
 </BODY></HTML>
