CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Be sure to dress up in your best dragon or dragon rider costume
 s! This movie is rated PG. All ages.\nSummary:\nHiccup is a Norse teenager
  from the island of Berk\, where fighting dragons is a way of life. His pr
 ogressive views and weird sense of humor make him a misfit\, despite the f
 act that his father is chief of the clan. Tossed into dragon-fighting scho
 ol\, he endeavors to prove himself as a true Viking\, but when he befriend
 s an injured dragon he names Toothless\, he has the chance to plot a new c
 ourse for his people’s future.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230605T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20230605T160000
LOCATION:Auditorium\, Monroe County Public Library\, 303 E Kirkwood Ave\, B
 loomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Family Movie Afternoon: How to Train Your Dragon
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/family-movie-afternoon-how-to-train-your-dragon/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p> Be sure to d
 ress up in your best dragon or dragon rider costumes! This movie is rated 
 PG. All ages.<br />\nSummary:<br />\nHiccup is a Norse teenager from the i
 sland of Berk\, where fighting dragons is a way of life. His progressive v
 iews and weird sense of humor make him a misfit\, despite the fact that hi
 s father is chief of the clan. Tossed into dragon-fighting school\, he end
 eavors to prove himself as a true Viking\, but when he befriends an injure
 d dragon he names Toothless\, he has the chance to plot a new course for h
 is people’s future.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
