DESCRIPTION:Mark Bingham\, David Gulyas\, Dave Conrad\, Tom Marron\, and Je
 rome Deupree will join Mark Bingham for a blast from the past as they recr
 eate the sounds of psych rock band Screaming Gypsy Bandits. They’ll be per
 forming the entirety of the band’s 1973 album In the Eye\,plus songs from 
 Back to Doghead and some of Caroline Peyton’s recorded songs. David T. Jam
 es opening!
