 ryone!\nCurrent MCHC members and Cook employees receive an early access da
 y on June 7! Join today at monroehistory.org/join-and-give/.\nAll items ar
 e donated from the public and proceeds of the annual Garage Sale support t
 he preservation of the collections\, programs\, and exhibits of the Monroe
  County History Center.
