DESCRIPTION:This long unseen masterpiece from György Fehér\, loosely based 
 on Friedrich Dürrenmatt’s 1958 crime novella The Pledge\, follows a season
 ed homicide detective whose obsession with catching a child murderer compe
 ls him to use a young girl as bait. Hungary  115 minutes  w/subtitles
