 /
DESCRIPTION:Join Amy Leyenbeck\, local kairomancer and women’s circle leade
 r\, in a revelatory workshop designed to tap into the diverse\, wild\, and
  often unconscious aspects within you. Using art and creativity\, along wi
 th synchronicity and intuition\, we will craft totem cards with deeply per
 sonal imagery\, relevance\, and meaning. Opening these doorways allows us 
 to tap into deeper knowledge and learn about our lives\, situations\, alon
 g with receive messages and guidance from ourselves. These bespoke images 
 can serve as powerful touchstones as you travel through life.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230610T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20230610T120000
LOCATION:Soulcraft Studio\, 3370 East Bethel Ln Bloomington\, IN
SEQUENCE:0
