 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p> Join Amy Ley
 enbeck\, local kairomancer and women’s circle leader\, in a revelatory wor
 kshop designed to tap into the diverse\, wild\, and often unconscious aspe
 cts within you. Using art and creativity\, along with synchronicity and in
 tuition\, we will craft totem cards with deeply personal imagery\, relevan
 ce\, and meaning. Opening these doorways allows us to tap into deeper know
 ledge and learn about our lives\, situations\, along with receive messages
  and guidance from ourselves. These bespoke images can serve as powerful t
 ouchstones as you travel through life.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
