UID:ai1ec-110061@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Lauren is a singer/songwriter from Lafayette\, IN. Her music cr
 osses genres of folk\, indie rock\, and pop. She has won awards for her so
 ngwriting and has received growing recognition in recent years. Her first 
 single “Songwriter” was released in 2021. Currently she is working on an u
 pcoming single set to be released early summer that features the band ATLY
 S. You can find her music on all streaming platforms
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230614T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20230614T160000
LOCATION:Juniper Art Gallery\, 615 W. Kirkwood Ave\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Acoustic Afternoon with Lauren Grace
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/acoustic-afternoon-with-lauren-grace/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Lauren is a s
 inger/songwriter from Lafayette\, IN. Her music crosses genres of folk\, i
 ndie rock\, and pop. She has won awards for her songwriting and has receiv
 ed growing recognition in recent years. Her first single “Songwriter” was 
 released in 2021. Currently she is working on an upcoming single set to be
  released early summer that features the band ATLYS. You can find her musi
 c on all streaming platforms</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
