DESCRIPTION:Join us for a collaborative program series with Ivy Tech Commun
 ity College. Instructors from different departments will drop by to demons
 trate the tools and activities available in their programs. For each event
  attended\, you’ll be entered to win a free class at Ivy Tech that will be
  available for you and one of your caregivers. The drawing will occur afte
 r the last session. Ages 12–19.\n  June 14: The Entrepreneurship departmen
 t and School of IT will host various activities.\nJune 28: The HVAC and In
 dustrial Technology departments will host with equipment and an electrical
  activity.\nJuly 12: The Nursing and Healthcare departments will host.\nJu
 ly 19: The Culinary department will host a “Board Building” activity\, ref
 erring to charcuterie and fruit/cheese boards.
