 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Join us for a
  collaborative program series with Ivy Tech Community College. Instructors
  from different departments will drop by to demonstrate the tools and acti
 vities available in their programs. For each event attended\, you’ll be en
 tered to win a free class at Ivy Tech that will be available for you and o
 ne of your caregivers. The drawing will occur after the last session. Ages
  12–19.</p>\n<p>  June 14: The Entrepreneurship department and School of I
