BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-110108@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:cicadacinema@gmail.com\; https://cicadacinema.com/products/but-im-a
 -cheerleader-june-15-back-door-dusk
DESCRIPTION:BUT I’M A CHEERLEADER  \n1999 • USA • 84 minutes\nThursday\, Ju
 ne 15th\nat The Back Door (207 S College Ave)\n$10 | 21+\nShowtime: Dusk (
 ~9pm)\n*Outside on the patio!\n(Inside if it rains)\n\nTRAILER\nSynopsis: 
 One of the definitive queer classics of the late nineties\, this cult favo
 rite balances hilariously campy satire with sweet romantic comedy. Natasha
  Lyonne stars as Megan Bloomfield\, a bubbly\, all-American high school ch
 eerleader who fantasizes about her fellow squad mates but doesn’t believe 
 she could possibly be a lesbian. When her parents stage an intervention an
 d send her to True Directions\, a conversion therapy camp run by the terri
 fying Mary Brown (Cathy Moriarty)\, Megan paradoxically discovers her true
  self. Employing deliberately kitschy production design influenced by John
  Waters\, director Jamie Babbit crafts a subversive send-up of traditional
  gender stereotypes that\, while largely overlooked on its release\, now s
 eems positively ahead of its time.\nTickets: https://cicadacinema.com/prod
 ucts/but-im-a-cheerleader-june-15-back-door-dusk.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230615T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20230615T233000
LOCATION:The Back Door @ 207 S College Ave
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Cicada Cinema presents “But I’m A Cheerleader”
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/cicada-cinema-presents-but-im-a-cheerleader/
X-COST-TYPE:external
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><b>BUT I’M A 
 CHEERLEADER  </b></p>\n<p><i>1999 • USA • 84 minutes</i></p>\n<p><i>Thursd
 ay\, June 15th</i><i><br />\n</i><i>at </i><b><i>The Back Door</i></b><b><
 i> (207 S College Ave)</i></b><b><i><br />\n</i></b><i>$10 | 21+</i><stron
 g><br />\n</strong><i><span style='font-weight: 400\;'>Showtime: Dusk (~9p
 m)</span></i></p>\n<p><i><strong>*Outside on the patio!<br />\n</strong>(I
 nside if it rains)<br />\n</i></p>\n<p><a title='But I'm A Cheerleader Tra
 iler' href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HnUvneNxoz8' target='_blank' r
 el='noopener'><b>TRAILER</b></a></p>\n<p>Synopsis: One of the definitive q
 ueer classics of the late nineties\, this cult favorite balances hilarious
 ly campy satire with sweet romantic comedy. Natasha Lyonne stars as Megan 
 Bloomfield\, a bubbly\, all-American high school cheerleader who fantasize
 s about her fellow squad mates but doesn’t believe she could possibly be a
  lesbian. When her parents stage an intervention and send her to True Dire
 ctions\, a conversion therapy camp run by the terrifying Mary Brown (Cathy
  Moriarty)\, Megan paradoxically discovers her true self. Employing delibe
 rately kitschy production design influenced by John Waters\, director Jami
 e Babbit crafts a subversive send-up of traditional gender stereotypes tha
 t\, while largely overlooked on its release\, now seems positively ahead o
 f its time.</p>\n<p>Tickets: <a class='ai1ec-ticket-url-exported' href='ht
 tps://cicadacinema.com/products/but-im-a-cheerleader-june-15-back-door-dus
 k'>https://cicadacinema.com/products/but-im-a-cheerleader-june-15-back-doo
 r-dusk</a>.</p></BODY></HTML>
X-COST:$10
X-TICKETS-URL:https://cicadacinema.com/products/but-im-a-cheerleader-june-1
 5-back-door-dusk
