UID:ai1ec-110137@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Throne of Iron\nSounds from a wood paneled basement\, fueled by
  cheap beer\, and driven to adventure.\nVeilcaste\nWe are Veilcaste from I
 ndianapolis\, IN. We play Doom/Sludge Metal and we started in the winter o
 f 2010\, and until 2020 we were known as Conjurer. Our third LP “Precipice
 ” came out February 10th 2023.\nFaerie Ring\nThe hazy and gloomy stoner do
 om band from Evansville\, Indiana\, channels their love for bombastic riff
 s\, soaring vocals\, high fantasy\, and science fiction into Weary Travele
 r\, a mystical and weed-inspired romp recorded by Alex Kercheval (Coven) a
 nd set for release\nthrough King Volume Records on April 14\, 2023.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230617T223000
LOCATION:The Bishop Bar\, 123 S Walnut St\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Throne of Iron w/ Veilcaste & Faerie Ring
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/throne-of-iron-w-veilcaste-faerie-ring/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Throne of Iro
 n<br />\nSounds from a wood paneled basement\, fueled by cheap beer\, and 
 driven to adventure.</p>\n<p>Veilcaste<br />\nWe are Veilcaste from Indian
 apolis\, IN. We play Doom/Sludge Metal and we started in the winter of 201
 0\, and until 2020 we were known as Conjurer. Our third LP “Precipice” cam
 e out February 10th 2023.</p>\n<p>Faerie Ring<br />\nThe hazy and gloomy s
 toner doom band from Evansville\, Indiana\, channels their love for bombas
 tic riffs\, soaring vocals\, high fantasy\, and science fiction into Weary
  Traveler\, a mystical and weed-inspired romp recorded by Alex Kercheval (
 Coven) and set for release<br />\nthrough King Volume Records on April 14\
 , 2023.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
