CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Registration is open  See live Indiana birds of prey\, includin
 g falcons\, hawks\, and owls\, as well as specimens and biofacts (bird win
 gs and parts). Learn about the natural history of common Indiana species\,
  diurnal and nocturnal traits and behaviors\, and how our actions affect t
 hese birds. The importance of habitat and respect and care for our environ
 ment will also be discussed. Age 6 and up. Please register.
