 b so his parents don’t evict him\, escape his girlfriend long enough to ca
 pture a new woman’s heart (Debbie\, played by Nia Long)\, and survive a cl
 imactic confrontation with the neighborhood menace (Tom Lister Jr. as Deeb
 o). The incredible ensemble cast also features John Witherspoon\, Anna Mar
 ia Hartsford\, Regina King\, Faizon Love\, Chris Tucker\, and DJ Pooh. [91
  min\; comedy\, drama\; English]
