 s is an open gathering\, with the purpose of experiencing fiber arts as a 
 form of self-care and relaxation.\nBring your portable fiber project and j
 oin us for afternoon of fiber and friendship! NEW time! 1-3pm\nCall to let
  us know you’ll be joining us. 812-822-1663!
