DESCRIPTION:Registration is open. Join this book club to discuss nature-foc
 used reads each month. You’ll also learn how to become more ecologically-m
 inded through activities and speakers designed to enhance our reading. Thi
 s month\, join us for an activity or speaker designed to enhance our knowl
 edge of Indigenous culture at Winslow Woods Park (2301 S. Highland Ave.)\,
  while we discuss Fresh Banana Leaves: Healing Indigenous Landscapes Throu
 gh Indigenous Science by Jessica Hernandez. We’ll bring the blankets\, you
  bring any chairs or sun protection you might need!
