BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-110576@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:A ragtag crew of deep-core oil drillers are the best hope NASA 
 and the world has to stop a giant asteroid hurtling toward Earth. Harry St
 amper (Bruce Willis) has one week to get his boys back together and traine
 d up to be astronauts capable of first landing on a space rock the size of
  Texas\, then detonating a nuclear weapon to blow it off its collision cou
 rse with our planet. Michael Bay just may be the only director who could c
 reate a Hollywood blockbuster disaster action movie of this level to find 
 a place in the Criterion Collection. Ben Affleck\, Billy Bob Thornton\, Wi
 ll Patton\, William Fichtner\, Liv Tyler\, Owen Wilson\, Steve Buscemi\, P
 eter Stomare\, Michael Clarke Duncan\, Keith David\, and Jason Isaacs roun
 d out the deep bench of talent in this epic fight for human survival. The 
 soundtrack is pretty damn good\, too. [151 min\; action\, sci-fi\; English
 ]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230629T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. Seventh Street Bloomington\,(on the North side
  of the IU Auditorium\, across from Hoagy)
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Film: ARMAGEDDON\, the 25th Anniversary Screening
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/film-armageddon-the-25th-anniversary-screening/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>A ragtag crew
  of deep-core oil drillers are the best hope NASA and the world has to sto
 p a giant asteroid hurtling toward Earth. Harry Stamper (Bruce Willis) has
  one week to get his boys back together and trained up to be astronauts ca
 pable of first landing on a space rock the size of Texas\, then detonating
  a nuclear weapon to blow it off its collision course with our planet. Mic
 hael Bay just may be the only director who could create a Hollywood blockb
 uster disaster action movie of this level to find a place in the Criterion
  Collection. Ben Affleck\, Billy Bob Thornton\, Will Patton\, William Fich
 tner\, Liv Tyler\, Owen Wilson\, Steve Buscemi\, Peter Stomare\, Michael C
 larke Duncan\, Keith David\, and Jason Isaacs round out the deep bench of 
 talent in this epic fight for human survival. The soundtrack is pretty dam
 n good\, too. [151 min\; action\, sci-fi\; English]</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
