 roducts/therapy-dogs-june-30-hopscotch-8pm
DESCRIPTION:Synopsis: Ethan and Justin are students trying to make sense of
  their high school existence. In what will be the last chapter of their te
 enage lives\, they decide to make the ultimate senior video in the search 
 for answers. Exploring teenage suburbia in a no-brakes adventure\, questio
 ns arise whether there’s more to their lives than simply growing up.\nTick
 ets: https://cicadacinema.com/products/therapy-dogs-june-30-hopscotch-8pm.
