X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Synopsis: Eth
 an and Justin are students trying to make sense of their high school exist
 ence. In what will be the last chapter of their teenage lives\, they decid
 e to make the ultimate senior video in the search for answers. Exploring t
 eenage suburbia in a no-brakes adventure\, questions arise whether there’s
  more to their lives than simply growing up.</p>\n<p>Tickets: <a class='ai
 1ec-ticket-url-exported' href='https://cicadacinema.com/products/therapy-d
 ogs-june-30-hopscotch-8pm'>https://cicadacinema.com/products/therapy-dogs-
 june-30-hopscotch-8pm</a>.</p></BODY></HTML>
X-COST:$8
X-TICKETS-URL:https://cicadacinema.com/products/therapy-dogs-june-30-hopsco
 tch-8pm
END:VEVENT
