 brate our Nation’s Independence. Fireworks will begin at dusk near the Edg
 ewood Schools Cross Country and Tennis Courts. Food Trucks will be on site
  to provide great food and snacks. This event is made possible by donation
 s from local businesses and community members. Rain Date will be the follo
 wing Saturday\, July 15th. Donations are always welcome. </p>\n</BODY></HT
 ML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
