 ntation (violin\, guitars\, bass) and repertoire pay tribute to a unique m
 usical group created in Paris\, France\, over 80 years ago—the Quintette d
 u Hot Club de France\, in the musical style of. Django Reinhardt and Steph
 ane Grappelli.
