 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Bleu Django i
 s an acoustic gypsy jazz/swing combo. Its instrumentation (violin\, guitar
 s\, bass) and repertoire pay tribute to a unique musical group created in 
 Paris\, France\, over 80 years ago—the Quintette du Hot Club de France\, i
 n the musical style of. Django Reinhardt and Stephane Grappelli.</p>\n</BO
 DY></HTML>
