 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><b>JAZZ ON A 
 SUMMER’S DAY<br />\n</b></p>\n<p><i><span style='font-weight: 400\;'>1959 
 • USA • 88 minutes • 4k Restoration from camera negative<br />\n</span></i
 ></p>\n<p><i><span style='font-weight: 400\;'>Saturday\, July 8th</span></
 i><i><span style='font-weight: 400\;'><br />\n</span></i><i><span style='f
 ont-weight: 400\;'>at </span></i><b><i>Lower Cascades Park (<span class='L
 rzXr'>2851 Old State Rd 37)</span> </i></b><b><i><br />\n</i></b><i><span 
 style='font-weight: 400\;'>FREE\, no ticket needed | All Ages</span></i> <
 strong><br />\n</strong><i><span style='font-weight: 400\;'>Showtime: Dusk
  (~9pm)</span></i></p>\n<p><i><span style='font-weight: 400\;'><strong>*OU
 TDOOR SCREENING in the park*<br />\n</strong></span></i><span style='font-
 weight: 400\;'><strong>-Bring your own</strong></span><span style='font-we
 ight: 400\;'><strong> chair-</strong></span><i><span style='font-weight: 4
 00\;'><br />\n</span></i></p>\n<p><a title='Jazz on a Summer's Day Trailer
 ' href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WWS1tt3ydV8' target='_blank' rel='
 noopener'><b>TRAILER</b></a></p>\n<p><span style='font-weight: 400\;'>Syno
 psis: </span>Filmed at the 1958 Newport Jazz Festival in Rhode Island and 
 directed by world-renowned photographer Bert Stern\, <em>Jazz on a Summer’
 s Day</em> features intimate performances by an all-star line-up of musica
 l legends including Louis Armstrong\, Thelonious Monk\, Gerry Mulligan\, A
 nita O’Day\, Chuck Berry\, Dinah Washington\, and closes with a beautiful 
 rendition of <em>The Lord’s Prayer</em> by Mahalia Jackson at midnight to 
 usher in Sunday morning.</p>\n<p>*In partnership with City of Bloomington 
 Park & Recreation.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
