DESCRIPTION:Potluck at 5pm\, Music at 6pm\nKate Long- Founder of Rodeola\, 
 local hero\, prolific songstress. Check out the album Arlene.\nHeartland R
 amble Revue- is the vision quest of a well seasoned band of songwriters fr
 om across the country. Together creating another human experience for the 
 ages. Recording\, filming and interviewing the inspired ones of the world 
 around them. They’re making a movie to figure out what the hell is going o
 n out here…in the Heartland of America.\nMatthew Welde (Nashville\, TN)\nN
 ate Porter (rural Oregon)\nVince and Jimmy DeWald (Nashville\, TN)\nStefan
 ie Clark Harris (New Haven\, CT)\nJack Lorang (Taos\, NM)\nMatt Lundquist 
 (Bloomington\, IN)
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230709T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20230709T210000
LOCATION:The Switchyard House Show Venue\, 1417 South Monon Dr.\, Bloomingt
 on
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Kate Long / Heartland Ramble Revue
