X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Potlu
 ck at 5pm\, Music at 6pm</strong><br />\nKate Long- Founder of Rodeola\, l
 ocal hero\, prolific songstress. Check out the album Arlene.<br />\nHeartl
 and Ramble Revue- is the vision quest of a well seasoned band of songwrite
 rs from across the country. Together creating another human experience for
  the ages. Recording\, filming and interviewing the inspired ones of the w
 orld around them. They’re making a movie to figure out what the hell is go
 ing on out here…in the Heartland of America.<br />\nMatthew Welde (Nashvil
 le\, TN)<br />\nNate Porter (rural Oregon)<br />\nVince and Jimmy DeWald (
 Nashville\, TN)<br />\nStefanie Clark Harris (New Haven\, CT)<br />\nJack 
 Lorang (Taos\, NM)<br />\nMatt Lundquist (Bloomington\, IN)</p>\n</BODY></
 HTML>
