 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>After an idyl
 lic date night full of red wine and a late-night motorcycle ride\, Mia sto
 ps at a Parisian bistro to take shelter from a downpour. Her reprieve is s
 hattered when a gunman opens fire. Three months later\, with a hazy memory
  of the attack\, Mia finds herself returning to the bistro where the shoot
 ing happened. In the process\, she forms bonds with fellow survivors\, inc
 luding wry banker Thomas and orphaned teenager Félicia. When she remembers
  that a stranger helped her make it through the attack\, Mia resolves to f
 ind him. Virginie Efira (Other People’s Children) stars</p>\n</BODY></HTML
 >
