UID:ai1ec-110928@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Ladies and gentlemen\, get ready for a night of pure Hollywood 
 magic with our spectacular burlesque show dedicated to the golden era of T
 inseltown!\nStep into a world of glamour and sophistication as our talente
 d performers transport you back in time to an era of classic Hollywood mov
 ies\, iconic stars\, and unforgettable moments. With stunning costumes\, c
 aptivating choreography\, and sultry music\, our burlesque show pays homag
 e to the greatest films and stars of all time.\nIn this intimate setting b
 urlesque show\, you will go journey through the ages\, showcasing the best
  of burlesque inspired by Hollywood’s most iconic movies and stars.\nWizar
 d of Oz to Halloween\, our burlesque show is a celebration of the greatest
  moments in Hollywood history. You’ll be swept off your feet by the glamou
 r\, elegance\, and sensuality of our performers as they bring the silver s
 creen to life before your very eyes.\nOur Hollywood burlesque show is the 
 perfect evening out with friends\, a unique date night\, or a special trea
 t for yourself. We promise an unforgettable experience that will leave you
  wanting to come back for more.\nSo come and join us for a night of Hollyw
 ood magic\, book your tickets now and get ready to be dazzled by our stunn
 ing performers!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230715T210000
LOCATION:The Pink Poodle\, 917 North Fairview St.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Sinful Cinema – Burlesque at The Pink Poodle (18+)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/sinful-cinema-burlesque-at-the-pink-poodle-18/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Ladies and ge
 ntlemen\, get ready for a night of pure Hollywood magic with our spectacul
 ar burlesque show dedicated to the golden era of Tinseltown!<br />\nStep i
 nto a world of glamour and sophistication as our talented performers trans
 port you back in time to an era of classic Hollywood movies\, iconic stars
 \, and unforgettable moments. With stunning costumes\, captivating choreog
 raphy\, and sultry music\, our burlesque show pays homage to the greatest 
 films and stars of all time.<br />\nIn this intimate setting burlesque sho
 w\, you will go journey through the ages\, showcasing the best of burlesqu
 e inspired by Hollywood’s most iconic movies and stars.<br />\nWizard of O
 z to Halloween\, our burlesque show is a celebration of the greatest momen
 ts in Hollywood history. You’ll be swept off your feet by the glamour\, el
 egance\, and sensuality of our performers as they bring the silver screen 
 to life before your very eyes.<br />\nOur Hollywood burlesque show is the 
 perfect evening out with friends\, a unique date night\, or a special trea
 t for yourself. We promise an unforgettable experience that will leave you
  wanting to come back for more.<br />\nSo come and join us for a night of 
 Hollywood magic\, book your tickets now and get ready to be dazzled by our
  stunning performers!</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
