UID:ai1ec-111061@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:The grossest gross-out gore comedy since Peter Jackson’s DEAD A
 LIVE! Residents of the suburban cul-de-sac Pebbles Court receive unexpecte
 d samples of an experimental vitamin made by a strange health spa named Vi
 muville. When the town adds the powder to their diets\, they experience ha
 llucinogenic visions—and worse\, their bodies mutate\, ooze\, and melt. Wr
 iter/director/composer Philip Brophy’s notorious slime-filled cult classic
  remains one of the last great Ozploitation films\, packed with outrageous
  1990s techno and show-stopping shocks that would make Rob Bottin blush.\n
 Tickets: https://cicadacinema.com/products/body-melt-july-27-orbit-room-8p
 m.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230727T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20230727T220000
LOCATION:Orbit Room\, 107 North College Ave Suite 001 (Underground)\, Bloom
 ington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Cicada Cinema presents “Body Melt” (1993)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/cicada-cinema-presents-body-melt-1993/
X-COST-TYPE:external
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>The grossest 
 gross-out gore comedy since Peter Jackson’s DEAD ALIVE! Residents of the s
 uburban cul-de-sac Pebbles Court receive unexpected samples of an experime
 ntal vitamin made by a strange health spa named Vimuville. When the town a
 dds the powder to their diets\, they experience hallucinogenic visions—and
  worse\, their bodies mutate\, ooze\, and melt. Writer/director/composer P
 hilip Brophy’s notorious slime-filled cult classic remains one of the last
  great Ozploitation films\, packed with outrageous 1990s techno and show-s
 topping shocks that would make Rob Bottin blush.</p>\n<p>Tickets: <a class
 ='ai1ec-ticket-url-exported' href='https://cicadacinema.com/products/body-
 melt-july-27-orbit-room-8pm'>https://cicadacinema.com/products/body-melt-j
 uly-27-orbit-room-8pm</a>.</p></BODY></HTML>
X-COST:$5
X-TICKETS-URL:https://cicadacinema.com/products/body-melt-july-27-orbit-roo
 m-8pm
END:VEVENT
