BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-111245@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Sounds From the Black Hole\na concert series featuring experime
 ntal music and explorations of sound\, occurring (usually) every 4th Satur
 day of the month. This month’s show is the 5th Saturday and features a dig
 ital video installation by Lyndsey Gillespie.\n$7 /// ALL-AGES TICKETS AT 
 ORBITBTOWN.COM\nDrekka: silence is the sound inside. Using cassettes and r
 ecordings of mysterious origin\, Drekka creates hypnagogic moments where t
 ime folds over itself. http://www.bluesanct.com/bands/drekka/ https://drek
 kalivearchive.bandcamp.com/\nRock N Roller Cola Wars: keyboard meditations
  on nostalgia with Adeptive Radiation drummer/vocalist and Melody Unasked 
 For host John Hardwick. https://wetpeltix.bandcamp.com/album/yes-throw\nHo
 gbite: Cheyenne and Wilbur play with their noise toys.\nLyndsey Gillespie:
  digital video artist playfully exploring our perceptions and subjective m
 eanings. https://lyndseygillespie.art/
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230729T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20230729T220000
LOCATION:Orbit Room\, 107 North College Ave Suite 001 (Underground)\, Bloom
 ington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Sounds From the Black Hole: Drekka / Rock N Roller Cola Wars / Hogb
 ite / Lyndsey Gillespie
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/sounds-from-the-black-hole-drekka-rock-n-roller-
 cola-wars-hogbite-lyndsey-gillespie/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Sounds From t
 he Black Hole<br />\na concert series featuring experimental music and exp
 lorations of sound\, occurring (usually) every 4th Saturday of the month. 
 This month’s show is the 5th Saturday and features a digital video install
 ation by Lyndsey Gillespie.<br />\n$7 /// ALL-AGES TICKETS AT ORBITBTOWN.C
 OM<br />\nDrekka: silence is the sound inside. Using cassettes and recordi
 ngs of mysterious origin\, Drekka creates hypnagogic moments where time fo
 lds over itself. http://www.bluesanct.com/bands/drekka/ https://drekkalive
 archive.bandcamp.com/<br />\nRock N Roller Cola Wars: keyboard meditations
  on nostalgia with Adeptive Radiation drummer/vocalist and Melody Unasked 
 For host John Hardwick. https://wetpeltix.bandcamp.com/album/yes-throw<br 
 />\nHogbite: Cheyenne and Wilbur play with their noise toys.<br />\nLyndse
 y Gillespie: digital video artist playfully exploring our perceptions and 
 subjective meanings. https://lyndseygillespie.art/</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
