  Bob plays sax on. They’re going to rip it up so check it out: https://www
 .youtube.com/watch?v=Fj5E1VRXnNI\nEddie Flowers & The Wax-Lip-Swamp-Dub: r
 ebirth of the WLSD featuring Craig Bell\, Chode\, Clark\, Heff and Bob Hea
 vens readying the prism to melt your lasers down and forge a bomb pop for 
 your brain!\nDon Marvel: debut solo performance for this local head.\nTick
 ets: https://www.orbitbtown.com/events/samuel-locke-ward-bob-bucko-jr-eddi
 e-flowers-wax-lip-swamp-dub-don-marvel.
