 d out-rock Friday night at The Orbit Room!<br />\n8pm / $10<br />\nBob Buc
 ko Jr. & Sam Locke Ward duo: sax/guitar duo from Iowa. Sam and Mike Watt (
 From Pedro/Minutemen) have a new album on Kill Rock Stars that Bob plays s
