 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Synopsis: </s
 pan>The Toro cheerleading squad from Rancho Carne High School in San Diego
  has got spirit\, spunk\, sass and a killer routine that’s sure to land th
 em the national championship trophy for the sixth year in a row. But for n
 ewly-elected team captain Torrance\, the Toros’ road to total cheer glory 
 takes a shady turn when she discovers that their perfectly-choreographed r
 outines were in fact stolen from the Clovers\, a hip-hop squad from East C
 ompton\, by the Toro’s former captain.</p>\n<p>Tickets: <a class='ai1ec-ti
 cket-url-exported' href='https://cicadacinema.com/products/bring-it-on-aug
 ust-11-back-door-dusk'>https://cicadacinema.com/products/bring-it-on-augus
 t-11-back-door-dusk</a>.</p></BODY></HTML>
X-COST:$10
