X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Join us on Sa
 turday\, August 12th for Constellation’s first Student Film Festival! We’l
 l be debuting short films made by our very own kid\, teen\, and adult stud
 ents from the 22/23 season! We’ll also be premiering last year’s Project C
 onstellation winning screenplay: Blue by Piper Parks.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
