DESCRIPTION:A newly restored film from the late 1930s by unsung French film
 maker Jean Grémillon\, Lady Killer is first collaboration between Grémillo
 n and legendary actor Jean Gabin. Adaptated from a novel by André Boucler\
 , it features the young Gabin as a foreign-legion Casanova – the “lady kil
 ler” of the title – who meets his match in the mysterious seductress Madel
 eine (Mireille Balin).
