 m-and-at-730pm/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>A newly resto
 red film from the late 1930s by unsung French filmmaker Jean Grémillon\, L
 ady Killer is first collaboration between Grémillon and legendary actor Je
 an Gabin. Adaptated from a novel by André Boucler\, it features the young 
 Gabin as a foreign-legion Casanova – the “lady killer” of the title – who 
 meets his match in the mysterious seductress Madeleine (Mireille Balin).</
 p>\n</BODY></HTML>
