BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-112445@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:About Jaws in 3D\nThe film that invented the modern blockbuster
 \, presented in 3D! When a young woman is killed by a shark in the New Eng
 land tourist town Amity Island\, Sheriff Martin Brody wants to close the b
 each but is overruled by the mayor\, fearing that the loss of tourist reve
 nue will cripple the town. Ichthyologist Matt Hooper and grizzled ship cap
 tain Quint offer to help Brody capture the killer beast\, and the trio eng
 age in an epic battle of man vs. nature.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230825T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. Seventh Street Bloomington\,(on the North side
  of the IU Auditorium\, across from Hoagy)
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Film: JAWS in 3D
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/film-jaws-in-3d/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div id='content
 ' class='collapsed individual-film__intro collapsed bg-none section'>\n<di
 v class='row'>\n<div class='layout'>\n<div class='text'>\n<p class='text s
 creening-highlight'>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class='section 
 bg-none individual-film__intro'>\n<div class='row'>\n<div class='layout'>
 \n<div class='text'>\n<h3 class='visually-hidden'>About Jaws in 3D</h3>\n<
 p>The film that invented the modern blockbuster\, presented in 3D! When a 
 young woman is killed by a shark in the New England tourist town Amity Isl
 and\, Sheriff Martin Brody wants to close the beach but is overruled by th
 e mayor\, fearing that the loss of tourist revenue will cripple the town. 
 Ichthyologist Matt Hooper and grizzled ship captain Quint offer to help Br
 ody capture the killer beast\, and the trio engage in an epic battle of ma
 n vs. nature.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
