 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div class='evca
 l_evdata_cell '>\n<div class='eventon_full_description'>\n<h3 class='padb5
  evo_h3'>Event Details</h3>\n<div class='eventon_desc_in'>\n<p>Swing by th
 e History Center on Saturday afternoon to get your portrait taken by the i
 ncredible Garrett Ann Walters! While you’re here\, check out highlights fr
 om her Pridefest portrait series\, on display through September 30.</p>\n<
 p>This event is free and open to the public. No appointment is necessary. 
 Light refreshments provided.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
