BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-112651@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:After shooting to fame as the hip-hop group the Style Boyz\, ch
 ildhood friends Conner (Andy Samberg)\, Owen (Jorma Taccone)\, and Lawrenc
 e (Akiva Schaffer) are torn apart by Conner’s out-of-control ego. Now a so
 lo star surrounded by screaming fans and mindless sycophants\, Conner’s wo
 rld comes crashing down when his sophomore album flops and his new tour’s 
 dwindling numbers necessitate a big opening act\, an unhinged rapper (Chri
 s Redd) whose popularity soon rivals Conner’s own. A fantastic satire of p
 op music and celebrity\, Popstar is bursting with hilarious cameos\, ridic
 ulous jokes\, and unexpectedly catchy songs. Doink-de-doink! [87 min\; com
 edy\, musical\; English]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230901T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. Seventh Street Bloomington\,(on the North side
  of the IU Auditorium\, across from Hoagy)
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Film: POPSTAR: NEVER STOP NEVER STOPPING
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/film-popstar-never-stop-never-stopping/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>After shootin
 g to fame as the hip-hop group the Style Boyz\, childhood friends Conner (
 Andy Samberg)\, Owen (Jorma Taccone)\, and Lawrence (Akiva Schaffer) are t
 orn apart by Conner’s out-of-control ego. Now a solo star surrounded by sc
 reaming fans and mindless sycophants\, Conner’s world comes crashing down 
 when his sophomore album flops and his new tour’s dwindling numbers necess
 itate a big opening act\, an unhinged rapper (Chris Redd) whose popularity
  soon rivals Conner’s own. A fantastic satire of pop music and celebrity\,
  <i>Popstar</i> is bursting with hilarious cameos\, ridiculous jokes\, and
  unexpectedly catchy songs. Doink-de-doink! [87 min\; comedy\, musical\; E
 nglish]</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
