UID:ai1ec-112656@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Calling all supporters of shelter dogs\, admirers of unique ble
 nds\, and lovers of all things canine! This one’s for every pup that’s a d
 elightful mix of breeds. Switchyard Brewing is excited to host a very spec
 ial all-ages pup meetup on Labor Day\, Monday\, September 4th\, from 6 PM 
 to 9 PM.\nWe’re dedicating this event to honor the charm and spirit of our
  mixed breed buddies\, many of whom have found their forever homes through
  rescue and adoption. $1 from every pint sold during the event will direct
 ly benefit the Monroe County Humane Association!\n\nAs part of our special
  day\, we’ve lined up several activities. Capture the joyous moments with 
 your pup at our photo booth\, be part of the group photo to mark this uniq
 ue gathering\, and rest assured\, every well-behaved pup will receive a sp
 ecial treat with pup packs from our friends at Monroe County Humane Associ
 ation!\n\nWhile our focus is on mixed breeds\, we welcome all well-behaved
  dogs\, regardless of their pedigree.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230904T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20230904T210000
LOCATION:Switchyard Brewery\, 419 North Walnut Street\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Patio Pup Meet Up: Mutts & Mixed Breeds
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/patio-pup-meet-up-muts-mixed-breeds/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Calling all s
 upporters of shelter dogs\, admirers of unique blends\, and lovers of all 
 things canine! This one’s for every pup that’s a delightful mix of breeds.
  Switchyard Brewing is excited to host a very special all-ages pup meetup 
 on Labor Day\, Monday\, September 4th\, from 6 PM to 9 PM.</p>\n<div class
 ='xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs'>We’re dedicating this event t
 o honor the charm and spirit of our mixed breed buddies\, many of whom hav
 e found their forever homes through rescue and adoption. $1 from every pin
 t sold during the event will directly benefit the Monroe County Humane Ass
 ociation!</div>\n<div></div>\n<div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkb
 s xtlvy1s'>As part of our special day\, we’ve lined up several activities.
  Capture the joyous moments with your pup at our photo booth\, be part of 
 the group photo to mark this unique gathering\, and rest assured\, every w
 ell-behaved pup will receive a special treat with pup packs from our frien
 ds at Monroe County Humane Association!</div>\n<div></div>\n<div class='x1
 1i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'>While our focus is on mixed breed
 s\, we welcome all well-behaved dogs\, regardless of their pedigree.</div>
 \n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
