 le Bernese Mountain Dogs.</div>\n<div></div>\n<div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr
  x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'>To make the event even more enjoyable\, we’ve a
 rranged for a pup photo booth for charming snapshots\, a group photo for a
  memorable keepsake\, and every well-behaved canine participant will recei
