DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Have a houseplant you’re willing to trade? Want to share some e
 xtra cuttings? Bring them in\, meet fellow plant enthusiasts\, and find a 
 new plant for your home! Don’t have a plant to swap? No problem! We’ll hav
 e extras to share. All plants should be healthy\, labeled (if possible)\, 
 and be in soil or have rooted cuttings in water. Please only bring pots yo
 u are willing to part with. Age 16 and up.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230916T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20230916T160000
LOCATION:Meeting Room A & B Combo\, Ellettsville Branch of the Monroe Count
 y Public Library\, 700 West Temperance St.\, Ellettsville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Houseplant Swap (Age 16 and up)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/houseplant-swap-age-16-and-up/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Have a housep
 lant you’re willing to trade? Want to share some extra cuttings? Bring the
 m in\, meet fellow plant enthusiasts\, and find a new plant for your home!
  Don’t have a plant to swap? No problem! We’ll have extras to share. All p
 lants should be healthy\, labeled (if possible)\, and be in soil or have r
 ooted cuttings in water. Please only bring pots you are willing to part wi
 th. Age 16 and up.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
