DESCRIPTION:Novel Horizons is not a traditional book club\, and there are n
 o mandatory readings. Instead\, in this low-stress club\, you will read\, 
 watch\, play\, or listen to media that follows a specific theme. This mont
 h’s theme is magical realism. Drinks and snacks will be provided. Age 18 a
 nd up\; recommended for ages 18–32.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230921T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20230921T200000
LOCATION:Program Room 2B\, Monroe County Public Library\, 303 E. Kirkwood A
 ve.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Novel Horizons: A Mixed Media Club (Age 18+)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/novel-horizons-a-mixed-media-club-age-18/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Novel Horizon
 s is not a traditional book club\, and there are no mandatory readings. In
 stead\, in this low-stress club\, you will read\, watch\, play\, or listen
  to media that follows a specific theme. This month’s theme is magical rea
 lism. Drinks and snacks will be provided. Age 18 and up\; recommended for 
 ages 18–32.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-113169@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Please join us on September 21 at 7:00 pm ET as we welcome Aust
 ralian educator and filmmaker Maree Crabbe for a conversation about talkin
 g with teenagers about pornography.\nHosted by sex researcher\, educator\,
  and author Dr. Debby Herbenick\, the Bloomington Sex Salon was created to
  foster campus-community conversations about sexuality topics. Come\, grab
  a drink\, and enjoy. Our format goes like this: for the first 30-40 minut
 es\, Debby will ask Maree questions about her work in the area of teaching
  about pornography as well as creating educational programs for parents\, 
 schools\, and communities. The next 20-30 minutes are Q&A with the audienc
 e.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230921T190000
LOCATION:The Bishop Bar\, 123 S Walnut St\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Sex Salon\, Hosted by Dr. Debby Herbenick
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/sex-salon-hosted-by-dr-debby-herbenick/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Please join u
 s on September 21 at 7:00 pm ET as we welcome Australian educator and film
 maker Maree Crabbe for a conversation about talking with teenagers about p
 ornography.</p>\n<p>Hosted by sex researcher\, educator\, and author Dr. D
 ebby Herbenick\, the Bloomington Sex Salon was created to foster campus-co
 mmunity conversations about sexuality topics. Come\, grab a drink\, and en
 joy. Our format goes like this: for the first 30-40 minutes\, Debby will a
 sk Maree questions about her work in the area of teaching about pornograph
 y as well as creating educational programs for parents\, schools\, and com
 munities. The next 20-30 minutes are Q&A with the audience.</p>\n</BODY></
 HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
