UID:ai1ec-113281@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Inquisitive journalist Grace Collier is horrified when she witn
 esses her neighbor\, fashion model Danielle Breton\, violently murder a ma
 n. Panicking\, she calls the police. But when the detective arrives at the
  scene and finds nothing amiss\, Grace is forced to take matters into her 
 own hands. Her first move is to recruit private investigator Joseph Larch\
 , who helps her to uncover a secret about Danielle’s past that has them bo
 th seeing double.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230922T220000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. Seventh Street Bloomington\,(on the North side
  of the IU Auditorium\, across from Hoagy)
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Movie: SISTERS
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/movie-sisters/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Inquisitive j
 ournalist Grace Collier is horrified when she witnesses her neighbor\, fas
 hion model Danielle Breton\, violently murder a man. Panicking\, she calls
  the police. But when the detective arrives at the scene and finds nothing
  amiss\, Grace is forced to take matters into her own hands. Her first mov
 e is to recruit private investigator Joseph Larch\, who helps her to uncov
 er a secret about Danielle’s past that has them both seeing double. </p>\n
 </BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
