BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-113385@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:This heartfelt and exuberant documentary introduces audiences t
 o filmmaker Želimir Žilnik’s prolific body of work and his unwavering effo
 rt to portray society’s most marginalized populations with deep humanism a
 nd compassion.\nAbout ŽŽŽ: Journal About Želimir Žilnik/Žurnal o Želimiru 
 Žilniku\nA leading figure in Yugoslavia’s Black Wave film movement of the 
 1960s and 1970s\, Želimir Žilnik is among the most influential and widely 
 acclaimed filmmakers from southeastern Europe. This heartfelt and exuberan
 t documentary  introduces audiences to Žilnik’s prolific body of work\, wh
 ich spans six decades\, and to his unwavering effort to portray society’s 
 most marginalized populations with deep humanism and compassion. [92 min\;
  documentary\; Serbian with English subtitles]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230926T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. Seventh Street Bloomington\,(on the North side
  of the IU Auditorium\, across from Hoagy)
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Film:  ŽŽŽ: JOURNAL ABOUT ŽELIMIR ŽILNIK
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/film-zzz-journal-about-zelimir-zilnik/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p> This heartfe
 lt and exuberant documentary introduces audiences to filmmaker Želimir Žil
 nik’s prolific body of work and his unwavering effort to portray society’s
  most marginalized populations with deep humanism and compassion.<br />\nA
 bout ŽŽŽ: Journal About Želimir Žilnik/Žurnal o Želimiru Žilniku</p>\n<p>A
  leading figure in Yugoslavia’s Black Wave film movement of the 1960s and 
 1970s\, Želimir Žilnik is among the most influential and widely acclaimed 
 filmmakers from southeastern Europe. This heartfelt and exuberant document
 ary  introduces audiences to Žilnik’s prolific body of work\, which spans 
 six decades\, and to his unwavering effort to portray society’s most margi
 nalized populations with deep humanism and compassion. [92 min\; documenta
 ry\; Serbian with English subtitles]</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
