BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-113502@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Synopsis: From the makers of the DAIMAJIN trilogy comes YOKAI M
 ONSTERS\, a hallucinatory series of Theremin-fueled films that combine Kai
 ju-styled beasties with epic mythological storylines. In YOKAI MONSTERS: S
 POOK WARFARE (the second movie in the series)\, an evil Babylonian vampire
  is accidentally resurrected by a group of treasure hunters. And it’s up t
 o the Yokai monsters to stop this unholy bloodsucker from destroying the w
 orld! Combining the iconic surrealism of HAUSU with monsters that are as a
 dorable as baby Yoda (and as ferocious as Godzilla)\, SPOOK WARFARE is an 
 unmissable chapter in the Japanese horror-fantasy canon. This movie will g
 ive your audiences everything they need\, including smiles\, joy\, and a d
 emon vampire with the ability to clone itself.\n*In partnership with The O
 rbit Room\, The American Genre Film Archive and Vulture Video\, our Cicada
  Underground series comes from the ethos that while as imperfect as the pe
 ople who made them\, genre films deserved to be screened to both enrich ou
 r lives and have a good time doing it!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20230928T200000
LOCATION:Orbit Room\, 107 North College Ave Suite 001 (Underground)\, Bloom
 ington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:CICADA CINEMAS UNDERGROUND PRESENTS: YOKAI MONSTERS: SPOOK WARFARE
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/cicada-cinemas-underground-presents-yokai-monste
 rs-spook-warfare/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Synopsis: Fro
 m the makers of the DAIMAJIN trilogy comes YOKAI MONSTERS\, a hallucinator
 y series of Theremin-fueled films that combine Kaiju-styled beasties with 
 epic mythological storylines. In YOKAI MONSTERS: SPOOK WARFARE (the second
  movie in the series)\, an evil Babylonian vampire is accidentally resurre
 cted by a group of treasure hunters. And it’s up to the Yokai monsters to 
 stop this unholy bloodsucker from destroying the world! Combining the icon
 ic surrealism of HAUSU with monsters that are as adorable as baby Yoda (an
 d as ferocious as Godzilla)\, SPOOK WARFARE is an unmissable chapter in th
 e Japanese horror-fantasy canon. This movie will give your audiences every
 thing they need\, including smiles\, joy\, and a demon vampire with the ab
 ility to clone itself.</p>\n<p>*In partnership with The Orbit Room\, The A
 merican Genre Film Archive and Vulture Video\, our Cicada Underground seri
 es comes from the ethos that while as imperfect as the people who made the
 m\, genre films deserved to be screened to both enrich our lives and have 
 a good time doing it! </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
