BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-113506@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Poodle enthusiasts and all dog lovers\, listen up! Switchyard B
 rewing is excited to host our all-ages pup meetup on Monday\, October 2nd\
 , from 6 PM to 9 PM. This get-together is all about celebrating the grace 
 and intellect of Poodles.\nThe day’s festivities include a pup photo booth
  for capturing those ‘pawfect’ moments\, a group photo to remember the fun
 \, and special pup packs for every well-behaved attendee\, thanks to Monro
 e County Humane Association!\nWhile we’re shining the spotlight on Poodles
 \, all well-behaved breeds are more than welcome to join the fun. And let’
 s not forget our star guest – Mocha the Bernedoodle\, who has been granted
  an honorary Poodle pass for the day!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20231002T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20231002T210000
LOCATION:Switchyard Brewery\, 419 North Walnut Street\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Patio Pup Meet Up: Poodles
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/patio-pup-meet-up-poodles/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Poodle enthus
 iasts and all dog lovers\, listen up! Switchyard Brewing is excited to hos
 t our all-ages pup meetup on Monday\, October 2nd\, from 6 PM to 9 PM. Thi
 s get-together is all about celebrating the grace and intellect of Poodles
 .<br />\nThe day’s festivities include a pup photo booth for capturing tho
 se ‘pawfect’ moments\, a group photo to remember the fun\, and special pup
  packs for every well-behaved attendee\, thanks to Monroe County Humane As
 sociation!<br />\nWhile we’re shining the spotlight on Poodles\, all well-
 behaved breeds are more than welcome to join the fun. And let’s not forget
  our star guest – Mocha the Bernedoodle\, who has been granted an honorary
  Poodle pass for the day!</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
