X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>This visit fr
 om the widely acclaimed Serbian filmmaker will explore his prolific six-de
 cade career and his films that have documented\, anticipated\, and critica
 lly engaged with pivotal sociopolitical events with an experimental docume
 ntary style that blurs film genres. </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
