BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-113767@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Hari Kondabolu is a comedian\, writer and podcaster based in Br
 ooklyn. The NY Times called him “one of the most exciting political comics
  in stand-up today” and described his 2018 Netflix special Warn Your Relat
 ives as “an incisively funny and formally adventurous hour that reveals a 
 comic in command of his powers.” The special was named on many “Best of” l
 ists\, including for Time\, Paste Magazine\, Cosmopolitan\, E! Online\, an
 d Mashable. He was also named one of 2018’s “Comics To Watch” by Variety. 
 Hari currently hosts the new Netflix food competition series Snack vs Chef
  along with Megan Stalter.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20231006T190000
LOCATION:Comedy Attic\, Corner of 4th and Walnut (upstairs)\, Bloomington
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20231007T190000
SEQUENCE:0
