DESCRIPTION:From 10 am–3 pm. Art supplies provided.  All ages welcome! Arti
 sts’ demonstrations\, music\, and storytelling throughout the day!\n All a
 rt completed for judging must follow the guidelines below.\n·         NO R
 EGISTRATION FEE:  Free event. No advance registration needed.\n·         A
 rtists must check in at the pavilion between 9.30-11 am the day of the eve
 nt. \n·         Original artwork eligible in any medium done in Bloomingto
 n the day of the event.\n·         Open to professional and emerging artis
 ts of all ages and skill levels.\n·         Canvasses or multi-media paper
  must be stamped before beginning.\n·         Supplies are available to ar
 tists for painting on Bryant Park grounds. \n·         Completed artwork f
 or judging must be delivered by 3 pm at Woodlawn Pavilion. \nArtist’s name
  and contact info on the back. Do NOT sign artwork until after judging.\nW
 et oil paintings should be in a frame for safe handling (or BYO easel.)\nA
 wards will be given for artists in the following categories in ALL media:
 \nProfessional Artists\nAdult Artists\nTeens (Ages 12-17)\nYouth (Ages 7-1
 1)\nCollaborative Art
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20231007T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20231007T150000
LOCATION:Bryan Park - Woodlawn Pavilion (Next to the Swimming Pool) 1001 S 
 Henderson St
SEQUENCE:0
