CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:The Dollop is a US history podcast with comedian hosts Dave Ant
 hony and Gareth Reynolds. History buff Dave decided to turn his hobby into
  a podcast. Each episode he reads one weird and disturbing story from the 
 American past to Gareth\, who has never heard the tale. Gareth’s hilarious
  reactions are why The Dollop is in the top 20 downloaded comedy podcasts 
 in the US\, Canada\, and Australia.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20231007T200000
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theatre\, 114 East Kirkwood Ave\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:The Dollop Podcast Live
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/the-dollop-podcast-live/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>The Dollop is
  a US history podcast with comedian hosts Dave Anthony and Gareth Reynolds
 . History buff Dave decided to turn his hobby into a podcast. Each episode
  he reads one weird and disturbing story from the American past to Gareth\
 , who has never heard the tale. Gareth’s hilarious reactions are why The D
 ollop is in the top 20 downloaded comedy podcasts in the US\, Canada\, and
  Australia.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
