BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-113727@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:9pm /// $8 /// 21+\nLate show of experimental music.\nIgor Von 
 de Heilichtson III has been performing as Satan’s God since 1996 with the 
 release of The Future Hell Destroyed. Using voice and bass guitar\, Satan’
 s God makes interdimensional prog that bears little resemblance to any of 
 Earth’s music. Satan’s God last infamous show in Bloomington was on Hallow
 een of 2007 at The Cinemat. Don’t miss this rare experience — you will not
  forget it.\nhttps://www.youtube.com/user/voidconsequence/videos\nAcid 87 
 is a mysterious creature from St. Louis\, MO making experimental noise. Al
 so plays in the punk band Soda Boys.\nhttps://ageofhorus.bandcamp.com/albu
 m/ambassadors-of-peace\nRock N Roller Cola Wars – improvisations on voice 
 and keyboard\, member of Adeptive Radiation\, Sid Yiddish’s Candy Store He
 nchmen\, Children of Scare-Midget and Alcorine of the Alps.\nhttps://wetpe
 ltix.bandcamp.com/album/yes-throw\nThe Worcel bros are exploring new terri
 tory with their project Brikjaard. features members of FIIT\, Swan Wash\, 
 Lake Daggers\, Chud\, Cowboys\, Heavy Mother\, etc.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20231007T210000
LOCATION:Orbit Room\, 107 North College Ave Suite 001 (Underground)\, Bloom
 ington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Satan’s God / Acid 87 / Rock N Roller Cola Wars / Brikjaard
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/satans-god-acid-87-rock-n-roller-cola-wars-brikj
 aard/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-WP-IMAGES-URL:thumbnail\;https://wfhb.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/2023
 1007-satans-god-232x300.jpg\;232\;300\,medium\;https://wfhb.org/wp-content
 /uploads/2023/10/20231007-satans-god-232x300.jpg\;232\;300\,large\;https:/
 /wfhb.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/20231007-satans-god-232x300.jpg\;232\
 ;300\,full\;https://wfhb.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/20231007-satans-go
 d-232x300.jpg\;232\;300
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><img src='htt
 ps://wfhb.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/20231007-satans-god-232x300.jpg' 
 alt='' width='232' height='300' class='alignnone size-medium wp-image-1137
 96' /></p>\n<p>9pm /// $8 /// 21+<br />\nLate show of experimental music.<
 /p>\n<p>Igor Von de Heilichtson III has been performing as Satan’s God sin
 ce 1996 with the release of The Future Hell Destroyed. Using voice and bas
 s guitar\, Satan’s God makes interdimensional prog that bears little resem
 blance to any of Earth’s music. Satan’s God last infamous show in Blooming
 ton was on Halloween of 2007 at The Cinemat. Don’t miss this rare experien
 ce — you will not forget it.<br />\nhttps://www.youtube.com/user/voidconse
 quence/videos</p>\n<p>Acid 87 is a mysterious creature from St. Louis\, MO
  making experimental noise. Also plays in the punk band Soda Boys.<br />\n
 https://ageofhorus.bandcamp.com/album/ambassadors-of-peace</p>\n<p>Rock N 
 Roller Cola Wars – improvisations on voice and keyboard\, member of Adepti
 ve Radiation\, Sid Yiddish’s Candy Store Henchmen\, Children of Scare-Midg
 et and Alcorine of the Alps.<br />\nhttps://wetpeltix.bandcamp.com/album/y
 es-throw</p>\n<p>The Worcel bros are exploring new territory with their pr
 oject Brikjaard. features members of FIIT\, Swan Wash\, Lake Daggers\, Chu
 d\, Cowboys\, Heavy Mother\, etc.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-COST:8
