CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Pug enthusiasts and all dog lovers\, mark your calendars! Switc
 hyard Brewing is elated to host our all-ages pup meetup on Monday\, Octobe
 r 9th\, from 6 PM to 9 PM. This particular gathering is dedicated to the a
 dorable and sociable Pugs.\nAs part of the evening’s festivities\, we’re s
 etting up a pup photo booth for cute snapshots\, organizing a group photo 
 for the memory books\, and every well-behaved furry guest will receive spe
 cial pup packs from the generous Monroe County Humane Association!\nEven t
 hough we’re focusing on Pugs for this event\, we warmly invite all well-ma
 nnered breeds to participate.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20231009T180000
LOCATION:Switchyard Brewery\, 419 North Walnut Street\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Patio Pup Meet Up: Pugs
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/patio-pup-meet-up-pugs/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Pug enthusias
 ts and all dog lovers\, mark your calendars! Switchyard Brewing is elated 
 to host our all-ages pup meetup on Monday\, October 9th\, from 6 PM to 9 P
 M. This particular gathering is dedicated to the adorable and sociable Pug
 s.<br />\nAs part of the evening’s festivities\, we’re setting up a pup ph
 oto booth for cute snapshots\, organizing a group photo for the memory boo
 ks\, and every well-behaved furry guest will receive special pup packs fro
 m the generous Monroe County Humane Association!<br />\nEven though we’re 
 focusing on Pugs for this event\, we warmly invite all well-mannered breed
 s to participate. </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
