 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Join us for a
  night of movies\, snacks\, and discussion as we make our way through the 
 greatest movies of all time! From cult classics to award-winning to movies
  “you just have to see for yourself\,” we’ll watch and chat about all of t
 he movies we consider to be the best of the best. Snacks will be provided.
  Ages 12–19. </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
