BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-114210@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Please register if you are interested. Join us on the third Thu
 rsday of the month to discuss a dynamic mix of fiction and nonfiction. Thi
 s month’s selection is Inciting Joy by Ross Gay. \nSummary:\nGay’s poetica
 lly influenced prose is nothing short of joyful. Blending the serious and 
 the playful\, this essay collection incites joy with writings about a wide
  range of actions and places: dancing\, orchards\, teaching\, skateboardin
 g\, basketball courts\, technology’s absence\, death\, authentic gratitude
 \, and more. For Gay\, joy is also incited by courage and honesty\; his es
 says have a through line of offering the deeply personal and speaking trut
 h to power.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20231019T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20231019T140000
LOCATION:Meeting Room A\, Ellettsville Branch of the Monroe County Public L
 ibrary\, 700 West Temperance St.\, Ellettsville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Ellettsville Book Group: ‘Inciting Joy’ (Age 18+)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/ellettsville-book-group-inciting-joy-age-18/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Pleas
 e register if you are interested.</strong> Join us on the third Thursday o
 f the month to discuss a dynamic mix of fiction and nonfiction. This month
 ’s selection is Inciting Joy by Ross Gay. </p>\n<p>Summary:<br />\nGay’s p
 oetically influenced prose is nothing short of joyful. Blending the seriou
 s and the playful\, this essay collection incites joy with writings about 
 a wide range of actions and places: dancing\, orchards\, teaching\, skateb
 oarding\, basketball courts\, technology’s absence\, death\, authentic gra
 titude\, and more. For Gay\, joy is also incited by courage and honesty\; 
 his essays have a through line of offering the deeply personal and speakin
 g truth to power.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-114212@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Please register if you are interested.  Join us for a spooky\, 
 suspenseful game of Dread\, where a teetering Jenga tower decides success 
 or failure. Are you afraid?!
