 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Enter
  at the lower level door on Jackson Street nearest the corner of 6th and J
 ackson.</strong><br />\nWe will sing from 10:00 a.m. to 3:00 p.m.\, with a
  traditional potluck dinner on the grounds at noon.<br />\nThere will not 
 be a stove or oven available but plenty of plugs and table space for crock
 pots.<br />\nSocial with a spaghetti supper at Barb’s house across the str
 eet in the evening.<br />\nThere will be singing from both the 1991 revisi
 on The Sacred Harp and The Shenandoah Harmony. Loaner song books will be a
 vailable. A voluntary donation will be taken to help cover expenses.<br />
 \nDoors will be open around 9am and are asking everyone to register even i
 f not leading a song. There will be breakfast snacks and drinks.<br />\nFe
 el free to drop by to observe if you have limited time! </p>\n</BODY></HTM
