 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>A bourgeois F
 rench couple–idealistic organic farmers–settle in a Galician village. Thei
 r earnest enthusiasm reeks of patronizing privilege to the poor Spanish fa
 rmers who have toiled on the land for generations. Tensions between locals
  and foreigners boil over in this edge-of-your-seat thriller. </p>\n</BODY
 ></HTML>
