BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-114171@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Within the span of 3 years\, comedian Ben Wasserman lost his da
 d\, granddad\, uncle\, and four friends. In Live After Death\, currently o
 n tour at funeral homes and cemeteries across the country\, Ben blends com
 edy\, clowning\, and crowd work as he leads the audience on a hilarious ye
 t moving journey through grief\, honoring and celebrating the ones we’ve l
 ost along the way. Expect vulnerable conversation\, juggling\, a séance\, 
 and some dancing as well! If interested visit liveafterdeathshow.com to le
 arn more!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20231024T193000
LOCATION:Allen Funeral Home and Crematory\, 4155 S Old State Road 37 Bloomi
 ngton IN 47401
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Live After Death: A comedy show about grief and loss
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/live-after-death-a-comedy-show-about-grief-and-l
 oss/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Within the sp
 an of 3 years\, comedian Ben Wasserman lost his dad\, granddad\, uncle\, a
 nd four friends. In Live After Death\, currently on tour at funeral homes 
 and cemeteries across the country\, Ben blends comedy\, clowning\, and cro
 wd work as he leads the audience on a hilarious yet moving journey through
  grief\, honoring and celebrating the ones we’ve lost along the way. Expec
 t vulnerable conversation\, juggling\, a séance\, and some dancing as well
 ! If interested visit liveafterdeathshow.com to learn more!</p>\n</BODY></
 HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
