DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Sounds From the Black Hole\na concert series featuring experime
 ntal music and explorations of sound\, occurring every 4th Saturday of the
  month.\nDemonologists: Blackened Noise / Horror Electronics from Central 
 Indiana. Demonologists have been around since the mid-00s though I think t
 his is their first time in Bloomington. Their catalogue is quite varied an
 d features many collaborations. One recent personal favorite is a collabor
 ation with Junko Hiroshige of Hijokaidan released on Torn Light.\nhttps://
 demonologists.bandcamp.com/\nhttps://www.discogs.com/artist/831341-Demonol
 ogists\nHideous Figure: Matt recently moved here from Chicago and this is 
 his first show in town.\nhttps://www.instagram.com/hideous.figure/\nHideou
 s Figure: Gutter Boy (NSFW)\nLather: your host warps field recordings\, gu
 itar\, mixer feedback and some other junk into layered soundscapes.\nhttps
 ://lather.bandcamp.com/\nhttps://www.deathwave.tv/artists/lather/
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20231028T190000
LOCATION:Orbit Room\, 107 North College Ave Suite 001 (Underground)\, Bloom
 ington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Sounds From the Black Hole: Demonologists / Hideous Figure / Lather
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/sounds-from-the-black-hole-demonologists-hideous
 -figure-lather-2/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Sounds From t
 he Black Hole<br />\na concert series featuring experimental music and exp
 lorations of sound\, occurring every 4th Saturday of the month.</p>\n<p><s
 trong>Demonologists</strong>: Blackened Noise / Horror Electronics from Ce
 ntral Indiana. Demonologists have been around since the mid-00s though I t
 hink this is their first time in Bloomington. Their catalogue is quite var
 ied and features many collaborations. One recent personal favorite is a co
 llaboration with Junko Hiroshige of Hijokaidan released on Torn Light.<br 
 />\nhttps://demonologists.bandcamp.com/<br />\nhttps://www.discogs.com/art
 ist/831341-Demonologists</p>\n<p><strong>Hideous Figure</strong>: Matt rec
 ently moved here from Chicago and this is his first show in town.<br />\nh
 ttps://www.instagram.com/hideous.figure/<br />\n<a href='https://youtu.be/
 BCqybaZ3B6g'>Hideous Figure: Gutter Boy (NSFW)</a></p>\n<p><strong>Lather<
 /strong>: your host warps field recordings\, guitar\, mixer feedback and s
 ome other junk into layered soundscapes.<br />\nhttps://lather.bandcamp.co
 m/<br />\nhttps://www.deathwave.tv/artists/lather/</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
