 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div class='x11i
 5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'>Led by French-Canadian musician Jon
 y Perron\, JonyP trio is not your typical Jazz trio. With a modern\, groov
 y approach to old Jazz standards\, spiced with Latin flavors and sprinkled
  with mesmerizing solos\, this musical experience will forever be engraved
  in your memories.</div>\n<div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xt
 lvy1s'>Jony Perron – Drums<br />\nKurt Baer – Saxophone<br />\nIan Ottinge
 r – Bass</div>\n<div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'>The
  house band will open the evening with a memorable and outstanding perform
 ance from 6-7pm\, and then after a short break\, the Open Jam Session will
  begin!</div>\n<div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'>Any 
 Jazz musicians are welcome\, from beginner to advanced. The band will be a
 vailable to play with you. All handmade Ebenor Drums will be available for
  the drummers\, just bring your sticks and brushes! Any other musician\, p
 lease bring your own instrument.</div>\n</BODY></HTML>
