UID:ai1ec-114770@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:Monroe County Humane Association\; 812-333-6242\; http://monroehuma
 ne.org/
DESCRIPTION:The MONROE COUNTY HUMANE ASSOCIATION Mobile Vaccine Clinic will
  be at the Animal Care Campus on November 5 from 1-3 p.m. where your dogs 
 and cats will have access to vaccines and basic wellness services. All are
  welcome and no appointment is needed!\nMCHA Mobile Vaccine Clinics offer 
 a range of services\, including legally mandated rabies vaccines for pets 
 aged 12 weeks and older.\nAlso providing nail trims\, anal gland expressio
 ns\, microchips\, and preventive measures for flea\, tick\, and heartworm.
 \nThese clinics are intended for healthy dogs and cats\, and are not a sub
 stitute for your pet’s annual wellness check-up with your primary veterina
 rian.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20231105T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20231105T150000
LOCATION:MCHA Animal Care Campus\, 791 S Fieldstone Blvd\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Mobile Vaccine Clinic
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/mobile-vaccine-clinic/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p align='center
 '>The MONROE COUNTY HUMANE ASSOCIATION Mobile Vaccine Clinic will be at th
 e Animal Care Campus on November 5 from 1-3 p.m. where your dogs and cats 
 will have access to vaccines and basic wellness services. All are welcome 
 and no appointment is needed!</p>\n<p align='center'>MCHA Mobile Vaccine C
 linics offer a range of services\, including legally mandated rabies vacci
 nes for pets aged 12 weeks and older.</p>\n<p align='center'>Also providin
 g nail trims\, anal gland expressions\, microchips\, and preventive measur
 es for flea\, tick\, and heartworm.</p>\n<p align='center'>These clinics a
 re intended for healthy dogs and cats\, and are not a substitute for your 
 pet’s annual wellness check-up with your primary veterinarian.</p>\n</BODY
 ></HTML>
END:VEVENT
