BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-114619@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Rylee Short is a composer and horn player from Louisville\, Ken
 tucky. They lost a lot of their early media promotion with their name chan
 ge and transition but have been producing either scores or recorded produc
 tions since 2008. A lot of their work explores the collaboration between d
 isciplines\, either combining spoken word\, written poetry\, dance\, fluxu
 s\, video media or even the combination of all. Rylee is fascinated by how
  each individual artistic expression changes and transmutes under live col
 laboration.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20231106T190000
LOCATION:Backspace Gallery\, inside Bonne Fête\, 112 West 6th Street
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Urban Deer Performance Series: Rylee Short / Ortet
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/urban-deer-performance-series/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Rylee Short i
 s a composer and horn player from Louisville\, Kentucky. They lost a lot o
 f their early media promotion with their name change and transition but ha
 ve been producing either scores or recorded productions since 2008. A lot 
 of their work explores the collaboration between disciplines\, either comb
 ining spoken word\, written poetry\, dance\, fluxus\, video media or even 
 the combination of all. Rylee is fascinated by how each individual artisti
 c expression changes and transmutes under live collaboration.</p>\n</BODY>
 </HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
