BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-114826@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:In ancient times\, the Ukrainian hetman sent treasures with his
  son to the British bank\, hoping that Ukraine would be free one day and t
 he gold would help the people thrive. In the early 1990s\, KGB agents\, fo
 reign spies\, and local criminals are following the hetman’s descendant Iv
 an Polubotko\, entrusted with a mission of national importance: to retriev
 e the hetman’s gold. One of the best Ukrainian comedies of the period\, Hu
 nt for the Cossack Gold reflects on both the traumatic Soviet past and the
  uncertain Ukrainian future. [90 min\; comedy\; Ukrainian and Russian with
  English subtitles]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20231107T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. Seventh Street Bloomington\,(on the North side
  of the IU Auditorium\, across from Hoagy)
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Film: HUNT FOR THE COSSACK GOLD
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/film-hunt-for-the-cossack-gold/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>In ancient ti
 mes\, the Ukrainian hetman sent treasures with his son to the British bank
 \, hoping that Ukraine would be free one day and the gold would help the p
 eople thrive. In the early 1990s\, KGB agents\, foreign spies\, and local 
 criminals are following the hetman’s descendant Ivan Polubotko\, entrusted
  with a mission of national importance: to retrieve the hetman’s gold. One
  of the best Ukrainian comedies of the period\, <i>Hunt for the Cossack Go
 ld</i> reflects on both the traumatic Soviet past and the uncertain Ukrain
 ian future. [90 min\; comedy\; Ukrainian and Russian with English subtitle
 s]</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
