BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-114803@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Please register if you are interested.\nDo you love storytellin
 g? Are you interested in writing a short play and seeing your story perfor
 med by professional actors? Constellation Stage & Screen invites you to pa
 rticipate in MiniPlays\, a playwriting competition that has been a communi
 ty tradition for more than 40 years.\nIn this introductory workshop\, you’
 ll learn the basics of script writing and develop ideas for your very own 
 storyline and characters that fit within this year’s theme: Embracing Chan
 ge. You’ll leave the workshop well on your way to developing a 5–10 page s
 cript that you can submit to Constellation Stage & Screen for consideratio
 n through January 26\, 2024. Ages 9–12. Please register.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20231108T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20231108T180000
LOCATION:Meeting Room A\, Ellettsville Branch of the Monroe County Public L
 ibrary\, 700 West Temperance St.\, Ellettsville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:MiniPlays Writing Workshop with Constellation Stage & Screen (Ages 
 9-12)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/miniplays-writing-workshop-with-constellation-st
 age-screen-ages-9-12/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Pleas
 e register if you are interested.</strong></p>\n<p>Do you love storytellin
 g? Are you interested in writing a short play and seeing your story perfor
 med by professional actors? Constellation Stage & Screen invites you to pa
 rticipate in MiniPlays\, a playwriting competition that has been a communi
 ty tradition for more than 40 years.</p>\n<p>In this introductory workshop
 \, you’ll learn the basics of script writing and develop ideas for your ve
 ry own storyline and characters that fit within this year’s theme: Embraci
 ng Change. You’ll leave the workshop well on your way to developing a 5–10
  page script that you can submit to Constellation Stage & Screen for consi
 deration through January 26\, 2024. Ages 9–12. <b>Please register.</b></p>
 \n<div></div>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
