BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-114942@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Sergei Parajanov’s The Color of Pomegranates depicts the life o
 f 18th-century Armenian troubadour Sayat-Nova. Departing from traditional 
 narrative and dialogue techniques\, the film blends visual symbolism and a
 ural opulence to immerse viewers in the world of Armenian culture and spir
 ituality. The Color of Pomegranates is a unique and enduring work of avant
 -garde cinema that has captivated generations of audiences with its vibran
 t imagery and unconventional storytelling. [78 min\; drama\; Armenian with
  English subtitles]\nA Q&A with Arpi Movsesian (Notre Dame Dept. of Slavic
  Studies) and Nicoletta Rousseva (IU Dept. of Slavic and East European Lan
 guages and Cultures) will follow the screening.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20231109T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. Seventh Street Bloomington\,(on the North side
  of the IU Auditorium\, across from Hoagy)
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Film: THE COLOR OF POMEGRANATES
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/film-the-color-of-pomegranates/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Sergei Paraja
 nov’s <i>The Color of Pomegranates</i> depicts the life of 18th-century Ar
 menian troubadour Sayat-Nova. Departing from traditional narrative and dia
 logue techniques\, the film blends visual symbolism and aural opulence to 
 immerse viewers in the world of Armenian culture and spirituality. <i>The 
 Color of Pomegranates</i> is a unique and enduring work of avant-garde cin
 ema that has captivated generations of audiences with its vibrant imagery 
 and unconventional storytelling. [78 min\; drama\; Armenian with English s
 ubtitles]</p>\n<p><strong>A Q&A with Arpi Movsesian (Notre Dame Dept. of S
 lavic Studies) and Nicoletta Rousseva (IU Dept. of Slavic and East Europea
 n Languages and Cultures) will follow the screening.</strong></p>\n</BODY>
 </HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
