BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-115162@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Leadership\, Truth\, and Justice captures the stories and journ
 eys of various leaders in their search for truth in the face of adversity.
  Considering political\, legal\, social\, and bureaucratic contexts\, this
  film series explores the triumphs and travails of leaders navigating the 
 gap between the world they perceive and the world they aspire to create. T
 his film series further explores the explosive challenges in advancing jus
 tice as part of the search for truth. A reception with casual conversation
  will follow the film screening. Age 18 and up.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20231116T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20231116T210000
LOCATION:Meeting Room 1B & 1C Combo & the Auditorium\, Monroe County Public
  Library\, 303 East Kirkwood Ave\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:IU Cinema Presents: Leadership\, Truth\, and Justice (Age 18+)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/iu-cinema-presents-leadership-truth-and-justice-
 age-18/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><i>Leadership
 \, Truth\, and Justice</i> captures the stories and journeys of various le
 aders in their search for truth in the face of adversity. Considering poli
 tical\, legal\, social\, and bureaucratic contexts\, this film series expl
 ores the triumphs and travails of leaders navigating the gap between the w
 orld they perceive and the world they aspire to create. <a title='' href='
 https://cinema.indiana.edu/upcoming-films/series/leadership-truth-and-just
 iceip-truth-and-justice' target='_self' rel='noopener'>This film series</a
 > further explores the explosive challenges in advancing justice as part o
 f the search for truth. A reception with casual conversation will follow t
 he film screening. Age 18 and up.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
