UID:ai1ec-115190@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAbout 2046\nA train in a futuristic landsca
 pe takes passengers to a place where they can recapture their memories\, a
  place from which no one has ever returned. This is the premise of a novel
  by the womanizing sci-fi writer Chow\, who engages in passionate affairs 
 with a series of intriguing women he meets at the Oriental Hotel in Hong K
 ong. As Chow’s lovers offer him inspiration for his writing\, reality blen
 ds with fiction\, and the past commingles with the future. [127 min\; roma
 nce\, drama\; Cantonese and Mandarin with English subtitles]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20231117T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. Seventh Street Bloomington\,(on the North side
  of the IU Auditorium\, across from Hoagy)
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Film: 2046
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/film-2046/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div id='content
 ' class='collapsed individual-film__intro collapsed bg-none section'>\n<di
 v class='row'>\n<div class='layout'>\n<div class='text'>\n<p class='text s
 creening-highlight'><strong>. </strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div
 >\n<div class='section bg-none individual-film__intro'>\n<div class='row'>
 \n<div class='layout'>\n<div class='text'>\n<h3 class='visually-hidden'>Ab
 out 2046</h3>\n<p>A train in a futuristic landscape takes passengers to a 
 place where they can recapture their memories\, a place from which no one 
 has ever returned. This is the premise of a novel by the womanizing sci-fi
  writer Chow\, who engages in passionate affairs with a series of intrigui
 ng women he meets at the Oriental Hotel in Hong Kong. As Chow’s lovers off
 er him inspiration for his writing\, reality blends with fiction\, and the
  past commingles with the future. [127 min\; romance\, drama\; Cantonese a
 nd Mandarin with English subtitles]</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<
 /BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
