CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:One of the greatest game shows of all time has been adapted int
 o a stage show to give more fans access and more chances to win at “Wheel 
 of Fortune LIVE!” Guests are randomly selected to go on stage and feel lik
 e they stepped into the game show itself. The live stage show is the only 
 way you can have the chance to spin a full-sized replica of the iconic Whe
 el. At Wheel of Fortune LIVE!\, contestants are selected from the audience
  to go on stage for the chance to call consonants\, buy vowels\, and maybe
  even solve puzzles to win fantastic prizes\, including trips to destinati
 ons like Paris and Hawaii or up to $10\,000 in cash. Everyone gets in on t
 he fun and a chance to win at Wheel of Fortune LIVE! because there are aud
 ience games too!
