X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>This 
 month’s theme is food\, drink\, and culture.  <b>Optional: </b>Bring recip
 e cards to swap with others!</strong></p>\n<p>Novel Horizons is not a trad
 itional book club\, and there are no mandatory readings. Instead\, in this
  low-stress club\, you will read\, watch\, play\, or listen to media that 
 follows a specific theme.</p>\n<p> </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
