BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-115452@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Renowned Inuit lawyer Aaju Peter has led a lifelong fight for t
 he rights of her people. When her son suddenly dies\, Aaju embarks on a jo
 urney to reclaim her language and culture after a lifetime of whitewashing
  and forced assimilation. But is it possible to change the world and mend 
 your own wounds at  the same time? Documentary filmmaker Lin Alluna follow
 s Aaju Peter in her quest to reconnect with her own heritage while holding
  her colonizers accountable. [92 min\; documentary\; Danish\, Greenlandic\
 , English\, and Inuktitut with English subtitles]\nA Q&A with Gergana May 
 (IU Germanic Studies\, Norwegian Program) and Maxine Savage (University of
  Washington Scandinavian Studies) will follow the screening.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20231128T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East 7th St.\, Bloomington (on the North end of t
 he IU Auditorium)
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Film: TWICE COLONIZED
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/film-twice-colonized/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Renowned Inui
 t lawyer Aaju Peter has led a lifelong fight for the rights of her people.
  When her son suddenly dies\, Aaju embarks on a journey to reclaim her lan
 guage and culture after a lifetime of whitewashing and forced assimilation
 . But is it possible to change the world and mend your own wounds at  the 
 same time? Documentary filmmaker Lin Alluna follows Aaju Peter in her ques
 t to reconnect with her own heritage while holding her colonizers accounta
 ble. [92 min\; documentary\; Danish\, Greenlandic\, English\, and Inuktitu
 t with English subtitles]</p>\n<p><i><strong>A Q&A with Gergana May (IU Ge
 rmanic Studies\, Norwegian Program) and Maxine Savage (University of Washi
 ngton Scandinavian Studies) will follow the screening. </strong></i></p>\n
 </BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
