DESCRIPTION:The Town Hall is sponsored by the Brown County and Monroe Count
 y Leagues\nof Women Voters and the Greater Bloomington Chamber of Commerce
 .\nAudience members will be able to address legislators representing Monro
 e County\, outlining areas that they feel warrant attention during\nthe co
 ming state legislative session.\nAll legislators representing any part of 
 Monroe or Brown County have been invited.\nThe session will also be availa
 ble via Zoom\, To register to attend online\, go to https://lwv-bmc.org/le
 gis-\nupdates .\nCommunity Access Television Services has been invited to 
 record the Town Hall. If they are able to do so\,\nthe video will be avail
 able through the Monroe County Public Library / CATS website and linked fr
 om\nhttps://lwv-bmc.org/legis-updates .\nTo follow the work of the Indiana
  General Assembly go to its website\, http://iga.in.gov .
