 n Voters and the Greater Bloomington Chamber of Commerce.</p>\n<p>Audience
  members will be able to address legislators representing Monroe County\, 
 outlining areas that they feel warrant attention during<br />\nthe coming 
 state legislative session.<br />\nAll legislators representing any part of
  Monroe or Brown County have been invited.</p>\n<p>The session will also b
 e available via Zoom\, To register to attend online\, go to https://lwv-bm
 c.org/legis-<br />\nupdates .<br />\nCommunity Access Television Services 
