 >\nthe video will be available through the Monroe County Public Library / 
 CATS website and linked from<br />\nhttps://lwv-bmc.org/legis-updates .<br
  />\nTo follow the work of the Indiana General Assembly go to its website\
 , http://iga.in.gov .</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
