DESCRIPTION:“Holiday Home” is the theme for this Seasonal Open Day.\nDecora
 tions\, Music\, and Food will be shared to interpret the themes surroundin
 g A Farmstead Christmas.\nJanette Robertson will demonstrate quilting and 
 play her auto harp.\nIn the Parlor\, Holiday Music will be performed by Ma
 rk Weidenmayer\, Leah Savion\, Susie\nSullivan\, and Lisa Wickes.\nThe Far
 mhouse will be open for tours.\nCookies and Wassail will be served.
