 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>“Holiday Home
 ” is the theme for this Seasonal Open Day.</p>\n<p>Decorations\, Music\, a
 nd Food will be shared to interpret the themes surrounding A Farmstead Chr
 istmas.</p>\n<p>Janette Robertson will demonstrate quilting and play her a
 uto harp.</p>\n<p>In the Parlor\, Holiday Music will be performed by Mark 
 Weidenmayer\, Leah Savion\, Susie<br />\nSullivan\, and Lisa Wickes.</p>\n
 <p>The Farmhouse will be open for tours.</p>\n<p>Cookies and Wassail will 
