BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-115662@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Nick Cave’s first band\, The Birthday Party\, comes to life in 
 Mutiny In Heaven.\nNarrated exclusively by the original band members\, Mut
 iny in Heaven delves deep into a band’s psyche\,chronicling how Nick Cave 
 and his school friends startled audiences with their confrontational perfo
 rmances\,primal screams\, outlaw gothic horror\, and anarchic lifestyle. F
 eaturing never-before-seen personal footage from band members\, dynamic an
 imation sequences\, and jaw-dropping concert clips\, the film provides a s
 weaty\, electrifying front-row seat to one of the most legendary live acts
 . It’s destined to be an instant documentary classic. The film is the firs
 t fully authorized telling of The Birthday Party. Directed by Ian White.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20231207T200000
LOCATION:The Bishop Bar\, 123 South Walnut Street\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Cicada Cinema: ‘Mutiny in Heaven’ Film Screening
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/cicada-cinema-mutiny-in-heaven-film-screening/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Nick 
 Cave’s first band\, The Birthday Party\, comes to life in Mutiny In Heaven
 .</strong></p>\n<p>Narrated exclusively by the original band members\, Mut
 iny in Heaven delves deep into a band’s psyche\,chronicling how Nick Cave 
 and his school friends startled audiences with their confrontational perfo
 rmances\,primal screams\, outlaw gothic horror\, and anarchic lifestyle. F
 eaturing never-before-seen personal footage from band members\, dynamic an
 imation sequences\, and jaw-dropping concert clips\, the film provides a s
 weaty\, electrifying front-row seat to one of the most legendary live acts
 . It’s destined to be an instant documentary classic. The film is the firs
 t fully authorized telling of The Birthday Party. Directed by Ian White.</
 p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
