CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:Vicki King\; 931-980-9326
DESCRIPTION:This Holiday Vocal Music Program will feature Connie Shakalis\,
  Sandra Freund\, and Thomas King.\nAccompanists will be Vicki King and Don
 ald Freund.\n“Laudamus Te”  from the Vivaldi Gloria. The Christmas Song\, 
 Hark the Herald Angels Sing\,\nHome for the Holidays.\nAlso several Alfred
  Burt carols\, plus a couple of original carols written by Vicki and Thoma
 s King.\nJoin in as Sandra Freund leads group singing of favorite carols.
 \nThere is plenty of free parking.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20231208T131500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20231208T141500
LOCATION:Free Methodist Church\, 1121 S. Lincoln St.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
