X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>This Holiday 
 Vocal Music Program will feature Connie Shakalis\, Sandra Freund\, and Tho
 mas King.<br />\nAccompanists will be Vicki King and Donald Freund.</p>\n<
 p>“Laudamus Te”  from the Vivaldi Gloria. The Christmas Song\, Hark the He
 rald Angels Sing\,<br />\nHome for the Holidays.</p>\n<p>Also several Alfr
 ed Burt carols\, plus a couple of original carols written by Vicki and Tho
 mas King.</p>\n<p>Join in as Sandra Freund leads group singing of favorite
  carols.</p>\n<p>There is plenty of free parking.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
