BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-115818@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:It’s the eve of Christmas in northern Finland\, and an ‘archeol
 ogical’ dig has just unearthed the real Santa Claus. But this particular S
 anta isn’t the one you want coming to town. When the local children begin 
 mysteriously disappearing\, young Pietari and his father Rauno\, a reindee
 r hunter by trade\, capture the mythological being and attempt to sell San
 ta to the misguided leader of the multinational corporation sponsoring the
  dig. Santa’s elves\, however\, will stop at nothing to free their fearles
 s leader from captivity. What ensues is a wildly humorous nightmare – a fa
 ntastically bizarre polemic on modern day morality.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20231208T201500
LOCATION:IU Fine Arts (upstairs)\, 1201 East 7th Street\, on the north side
  of Showalter Fountain\, next to the IU Auditorium
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20231209T201500
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Ryder Film Series: RARE EXPORTS: A CHRISTMAS TALE
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/ryder-film-series-rare-exports-a-christmas-tale-
 6/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><span id='sum
 mary_blurb_538818' class='inline_expand_collapse inline_expanded'><span cl
 ass='blurb blurb_expanded'>It’s the eve of Christmas in northern Finland\,
  and an ‘archeological’ dig has just unearthed the real Santa Claus. But t
 his particular Santa isn’t the one you want coming to town. When the local
  children begin mysteriously disappearing\, young Pietari and his father R
 auno\, a reindeer hunter by trade\, capture the mythological being and att
 empt to sell Santa to the misguided leader of the multinational corporatio
 n sponsoring the dig. Santa’s elves\, however\, will stop at nothing to fr
 ee their fearless leader from captivity. What ensues is a wildly humorous 
 nightmare – a fantastically bizarre polemic on modern day morality.</span>
 </span></p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
