DESCRIPTION:Join Ama on a journey of self-discovery as she learns to embrac
 e her heritage and finds the strength to stand up for her family and cultu
 re—aided in no small part by her best friend Thijs and a giant porcupine! 
 Winner\, Grand Jury Award for Live Action Feature at the 2023 New York Int
 ernational Children’s Film Festival.
