 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Join Ama on a
  journey of self-discovery as she learns to embrace her heritage and finds
  the strength to stand up for her family and culture—aided in no small par
 t by her best friend Thijs and a giant porcupine! Winner\, Grand Jury Awar
 d for Live Action Feature at the 2023 New York International Children’s Fi
 lm Festival.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
