  budding childhood romance between Nora and Hae Sung\, classmates at a pri
 mary school in Seoul\, ends abruptly when Nora’s family emigrates to Canad
 a. Two decades later\, they are reunited in New York for one fateful week 
 as they confront notions of destiny and love\, and the choices that make a
