X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><em>Past Live
 s</em> is in the conversation as a BEST PICTURE candidate for this year’s 
 Academy Awards. A film about second chances\, if you missed <em>Past Lives
 </em> when we screened it this summer here’s your second chance….</p>\n<p>
 A budding childhood romance between Nora and Hae Sung\, classmates at a pr
 imary school in Seoul\, ends abruptly when Nora’s family emigrates to Cana
