 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Join us to wa
 tch a fun-filled magical story about the legendary guardians—Jack Frost\, 
 the Easter Bunny\, Santa Claus\, and the Tooth Fairy—together for the firs
 t time! When the evil boogeyman Pitch threatens to take over the world\, i
 t’s up to our beloved heroes to protect the hopes and dreams of all childr
 en. It’s a dazzling and heartwarming family film!</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
