UID:ai1ec-116348@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Did you get a new ukulele for Christmas and now you need to lea
 rn how to play it? Then come and join us for this Complete Beginner’s Ukul
 ele Workshop! The easy-to-learn and fun-to-play ukulele is the perfect fir
 st instrument for all ages or the perfect extra accompaniment for singing 
 along with friends and family.\nIn our Beginner Workshop\, you’ll learn al
 l the basics of the uke\, including the following: tuning\, beginner chord
 s\, scales\, how to improvise\, and how to play almost every song in the w
 orld with only 4 chords!!! Absolutely no experience is necessary for this 
 workshop (and you don’t even need your own ukulele to try it out)!\n\nTher
 e is a charge for this workshop\, so call 812-200-3300 to register and pay
  by phone!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240105T170000
LOCATION:Weed Patch Music\, 58 East Main Street\, Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Beginner’s Ukulele Workshop
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/beginners-ukulele-workshop/
