 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div class='xdj2
 66r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs'>Did you get a new ukulele for Chris
 tmas and now you need to learn how to play it? Then come and join us for t
 his Complete Beginner’s Ukulele Workshop! The easy-to-learn and fun-to-pla
 y ukulele is the perfect first instrument for all ages or the perfect extr
 a accompaniment for singing along with friends and family.</div>\n<div cla
 ss='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'>In our Beginner Workshop\, 
 you’ll learn all the basics of the uke\, including the following: tuning\,
  beginner chords\, scales\, how to improvise\, and how to play almost ever
 y song in the world with only 4 chords!!! Absolutely no experience is nece
 ssary for this workshop (and you don’t even need your own ukulele to try i
 t out)!</div>\n<div></div>\n<div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs 
 xtlvy1s'>There is a charge for this workshop\, so call 812-200-3300 to reg
 ister and pay by phone!</div>\n</BODY></HTML>
