BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-116382@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Jony P Trio plays 6-7 pm\, Open Jam w/Trio 7:30 pm\nLed by Fren
 ch-Canadian musician Jony Perron\, JonyP trio is not your typical Jazz tri
 o. With a modern\, groovy approach to old Jazz standards\, spiced with Lat
 in flavors and sprinkled with mesmerizing solos\, this musical experience 
 will forever be engraved in your memories.\nJony Perron – Drums\nKurt Baer
  – Saxophone\nIan Ottinger – Bass\nThe house band will open the evening wi
 th a memorable and outstanding performance from 6-7pm\, and then after a s
 hort break\, the Open Jam Session will begin!\nAny Jazz musicians are welc
 ome\, from beginner to advanced. The band will be available to play with y
 ou. All handmade Ebenor Drums will be available for the drummers\, just br
 ing your sticks and brushes! Any other musician\, please bring your own in
 strument.\nIf you have any questions\, please reach out at jonyp.artist@gm
 ail.com or via messenger.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240106T180000
LOCATION:Orbit Room\, 107 N College Ave #001\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Orbit Jazz Night\, with the Jony P Trio
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/orbit-jazz-night-with-the-jony-p-trio/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Jony 
 P Trio plays 6-7 pm\, Open Jam w/Trio 7:30 pm</strong></p>\n<div class='x1
 1i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'>Led by French-Canadian musician J
 ony Perron\, JonyP trio is not your typical Jazz trio. With a modern\, gro
 ovy approach to old Jazz standards\, spiced with Latin flavors and sprinkl
 ed with mesmerizing solos\, this musical experience will forever be engrav
 ed in your memories.</div>\n<div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs 
 xtlvy1s'>Jony Perron – Drums<br />\nKurt Baer – Saxophone<br />\nIan Ottin
 ger – Bass</div>\n<div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'>T
 he house band will open the evening with a memorable and outstanding perfo
 rmance from 6-7pm\, and then after a short break\, the Open Jam Session wi
 ll begin!<br />\nAny Jazz musicians are welcome\, from beginner to advance
 d. The band will be available to play with you. All handmade Ebenor Drums 
 will be available for the drummers\, just bring your sticks and brushes! A
 ny other musician\, please bring your own instrument.</div>\n<div class='x
 11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'>If you have any questions\, plea
 se reach out at jonyp.artist@gmail.com or via messenger.</div>\n</BODY></H
 TML>
