CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Paris in the 1930s — a playground for industrial heirs and debo
 nair architects\, but the City of Lights does not shine evenly for all. Ma
 deleine is a struggling actress. Her best friend Pauline is an unemployed 
 lawyer. They share a cramped flat and owe five months’ rent. Opportunity k
 nocks\, however\, after a lascivious theatrical producer turns up dead and
  Madeleine is accused of murder.
