 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Paris in the 
 1930s — a playground for industrial heirs and debonair architects\, but th
 e City of Lights does not shine evenly for all. Madeleine is a struggling 
 actress. Her best friend Pauline is an unemployed lawyer. They share a cra
 mped flat and owe five months’ rent. Opportunity knocks\, however\, after 
