BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-116713@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Sharing Dr. King’s sentiments\, the City of Bloomington Dr. Mar
 tin Luther King Jr. Birthday Celebration Commission is committed to amplif
 ying his message regarding the power of education during the 2024 celebrat
 ion and beyond. This year’s theme is Unlocking Freedom: The Transformative
  and Liberating Power of Education.\nThe Commission is pleased to announce
  that Jesse Hagopian\, an award-winning educator and a leading voice on is
 sues of educational equity\, the school-to-prison-pipeline\, standardized 
 testing\, the Black Lives Matter at School movement\, and social justice u
 nionism will be presenting the 2024 Birthday Celebration keynote speech.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240115T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240115T203000
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater\, 114 East Kirkwood Ave.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Dr. Martin Luther King Jr. Birthday Celebration
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/dr-martin-luther-king-jr-birthday-celebration-2/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Sharing Dr. K
 ing’s sentiments\, the City of Bloomington Dr. Martin Luther King Jr. Birt
 hday Celebration Commission is committed to amplifying his message regardi
 ng the power of education during the 2024 celebration and beyond. This yea
 r’s theme is <i>Unlocking Freedom: The Transformative and Liberating Power
  of Education</i>.</p>\n<p>The Commission is pleased to announce that Jess
 e Hagopian\, an award-winning educator and a leading voice on issues of ed
 ucational equity\, the school-to-prison-pipeline\, standardized testing\, 
 the Black Lives Matter at School movement\, and social justice unionism wi
 ll be presenting the 2024 Birthday Celebration keynote speech.</p>\n</BODY
 ></HTML>
END:VEVENT
