CONTACT:Megan Betz\; 812-339-5887\; http://mhcfoodpantry.org/chilly-cookoff
DESCRIPTION:The Hub fights off the chilly winter weather with a chili cook-
 off featuring chefs from throughout the local community. \nYou’ll enjoy sa
 mples of each soup\, vote for whom you think should earn the People’s Choi
 ce Award\, and watch the panel of judges deliberate and determine who has 
 the best overall\, best vegetarian\, and most creative chilis. ​\nBetween 
 chilis\, cool your palate with cinnamon roll from Two Sticks and ice cream
  from Chocolate Moose\nThe chili cook-off is a fundraiser for Mother Hubba
 rd’s Cupboard\nTo learn more about joining the cook-off visit mhcfoodpantr
 y.org/chilly-cookoff\n 
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240118T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240118T190000
LOCATION:Dimension Mill\, 642 N. Madison St. Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Chilly Cook-Off\, a fundraiser for Mother Hubbard’s Cupboard
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/chilly-cook-off/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p class='font_8
  wixui-rich-text__text'><span class='color_15 wixui-rich-text__text'>The H
 ub fights off the chilly winter weather with a chili cook-off featuring ch
 efs from throughout the local community. </span></p>\n<p class='font_8 wix
 ui-rich-text__text'><span class='color_15 wixui-rich-text__text'>You’ll en
 joy samples of each soup\, vote for whom you think should earn the People’
 s Choice Award\, and watch the panel of judges deliberate and determine wh
 o has the best overall\, best vegetarian\, and most creative chilis. </spa
 n><span class='wixui-rich-text__text'>​</span></p>\n<p class='font_8 wixui
 -rich-text__text'><span class='color_15 wixui-rich-text__text'>Between chi
 lis\, cool your palate with cinnamon roll from Two Sticks and ice cream fr
 om Chocolate Moose</span></p>\n<p>The chili cook-off is a fundraiser for M
 other Hubbard’s Cupboard</p>\n<p>To learn more about joining the cook-off 
 visit <a href='http://mhcfoodpantry.org/chilly-cookoff' target='_blank' re
 l='noopener' data-saferedirecturl='https://www.google.com/url?q=http://mhc
