  greener world. They gather monthly to share\nlibations and dialogue\, exp
 lore ideas and make new friends and business connections.\nThis month hear
  Jeff Stant\, Director of the Indiana Forest Alliance\, discuss S.2990\, t
 he\nrecently introduced bill that could expand the Charles C Deam Wilderne
 ss\, Indiana’s only protected wilderness.
