 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Green Drinks 
 Bloomington is a lively\, informal social networking event for people from
  all<br />\nwalks of life who are interested in making a greener world. Th
 ey gather monthly to share<br />\nlibations and dialogue\, explore ideas a
 nd make new friends and business connections.</p>\n<p>This month hear Jeff
  Stant\, Director of the Indiana Forest Alliance\, discuss S.2990\, the<br
  />\nrecently introduced bill that could expand the Charles C Deam Wildern
 ess\, Indiana’s only protected wilderness.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
