 s to be dying to win back his family. Although his ex lets him move back i
 n\, his three adult children—Margot (Gwyneth Paltrow)\, Chas (Ben Stiller)
 \, and Richie (Luke Wilson)—don’t react well to their father’s return. [11
 0 min\; comedy\, drama\; English]
