BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-116984@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Marsalis is known for his excellence in both classical and jazz
  genres\, and his arrangements and interpretations bear influence from a b
 road musical background. From his initial recognition as a young jazz lion
 \, he has expanded his vision as an instrumentalist\, composer\, bandleade
 r\, and educator\, crossing stylistic boundaries while maintaining an unwa
 vering creative integrity.\n \nThe Branford Marsalis Quartet\, formed in 1
 986\, remains his primary means of expression and will join him for the Bl
 oomington performance. The quartet’s most recent album\, The Secret Betwee
 n the Shadow and the Soul\, was met with critical acclaim\, earning a Gram
 my nomination and is considered the group’s most emotionally wide-ranging 
 and melody driven release to date.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240125T193000
LOCATION:IU Auditorium\, 1211 East 7th St.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:An Evening with Branford Marsalis
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/an-evening-with-branford-marsalis/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Marsalis is k
 nown for his excellence in both classical and jazz genres\, and his arrang
 ements and interpretations bear influence from a broad musical background.
  From his initial recognition as a young jazz lion\, he has expanded his v
 ision as an instrumentalist\, composer\, bandleader\, and educator\, cross
 ing stylistic boundaries while maintaining an unwavering creative integrit
 y.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>The Branford Marsalis Quartet\, formed in 1986\, rema
 ins his primary means of expression and will join him for the Bloomington 
 performance. The quartet’s most recent album\, <i>The Secret Between the S
 hadow and the Soul</i>\, was met with critical acclaim\, earning a Grammy 
 nomination and is considered the group’s most emotionally wide-ranging and
  melody driven release to date.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
