UID:ai1ec-117097@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:The Movie Angst is about raising awareness around anxiety and i
 s presented with the Nashville United Methodist Church. This is a free eve
 nt for the community!\nAngst is a film-based education program designed to
  raise awareness around anxiety\, with an emphasis on youth and families. 
 The film includes interviews with kids\, teens\, experts\, and parents. Ou
 r goal is to help people identify and understand the symptoms of anxiety a
 nd encourage them to reach out for help.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240127T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240127T170000
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S Van Buren St\, Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Film: Angst: Raising awareness around anxiety
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/film-angst-raising-awareness-around-anxiety/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>The Movie <em
 >Angst</em> is about raising awareness around anxiety and is presented wit
 h the Nashville United Methodist Church. This is a free event for the comm
 unity!</p>\n<p>Angst is a film-based education program designed to raise a
 wareness around anxiety\, with an emphasis on youth and families. The film
  includes interviews with kids\, teens\, experts\, and parents. Our goal i
 s to help people identify and understand the symptoms of anxiety and encou
 rage them to reach out for help.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
