BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-116293@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:Andrea Hadsell\; 812-332-2517 Ext. 3\; http://monroehistory.org/puz
 zlefest2024/
DESCRIPTION:The Monroe County History Center’s celebration of International
  Puzzle Day is back!  Join in for the annual Monroe County PuzzleFest supp
 orted by the Book Corner\, Press Puzzles\, and the Lilly Library.\nThis ye
 ar’s jigsaw competition will be in-person at the Switchyard Park Pavilion.
  There will also be a variety of programming throughout the day including 
 puzzle demonstrations\, presentations\, and other activities.\nThe popular
  puzzle sale and swap will also be open during the event. Bring puzzles in
  to swap and while you are there\, you can pick up craft kits and do-at-ho
 me puzzle activity packs.\n 
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240128T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240128T160000
LOCATION:Switchyard Park Pavilion
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:PuzzleFest 2024
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/puzzlefest-2024/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p style='font-w
 eight: 400\;'>The Monroe County History Center’s celebration of Internatio
 nal Puzzle Day is back!  Join in for the annual Monroe County PuzzleFest s
 upported by the Book Corner\, Press Puzzles\, and the Lilly Library.</p>\n
 <p style='font-weight: 400\;'>This year’s jigsaw competition will be in-pe
 rson at the Switchyard Park Pavilion. There will also be a variety of prog
 ramming throughout the day including puzzle demonstrations\, presentations
 \, and other activities.</p>\n<p style='font-weight: 400\;'>The popular pu
 zzle sale and swap will also be open during the event. Bring puzzles in to
  swap and while you are there\, you can pick up craft kits and do-at-home 
 puzzle activity packs.</p>\n<p> </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
