 \, learn about daily life in the U.S.\, gain confidence\, and meet new peo
 ple from around the world.\n\nIntermediate English skills are suggested. I
 f you do not speak English\, please fill out the VITAL Services form to le
 arn about programs for beginners. Conversation Groups are drop-in and no r
 egistration is needed.\nIf you have not attended a VITAL program before\, 
