CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:A seemingly simple taxi ride across Paris evolves into a profou
 nd meditation on the realities of the driver\, whose personal life is in s
 hambles\, and his fare\, an elderly woman whose warmth belies her surprisi
 ng past.\nDriving Madeleine is highlighted by two wonderful performances: 
 actor/director Dany Boon as a taxi driver having a bad day and legendary 9
 2-year-old French chanteuse Line Renaud as a woman in need of a ride.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240203T160000
LOCATION:IU Fine Arts Theater\, 1201 East 7th St. (on the 2nd floor)\, Bloo
 mington
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20240210T160000
