 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>A seemingly s
 imple taxi ride across Paris evolves into a profound meditation on the rea
 lities of the driver\, whose personal life is in shambles\, and his fare\,
  an elderly woman whose warmth belies her surprising past.</p>\n<p>Driving
  Madeleine is highlighted by two wonderful performances: actor/director Da
 ny Boon as a taxi driver having a bad day and legendary 92-year-old French
  chanteuse Line Renaud as a woman in need of a ride.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
