CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Based on the extraordinary character at the center of Charlie a
 nd the Chocolate Factory\, Roald Dahl’s most iconic children’s book and on
 e of the best-selling children’s books of all time\, “Wonka” tells the won
 drous story of how the world’s greatest inventor\, magician and chocolate-
 maker became the beloved Willy Wonka we know today.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240223T183000
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S Van Buren St\, Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Film: WONKA
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/film-wonka/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Based on the 
 extraordinary character at the center of Charlie and the Chocolate Factory
 \, Roald Dahl’s most iconic children’s book and one of the best-selling ch
 ildren’s books of all time\, “Wonka” tells the wondrous story of how the w
 orld’s greatest inventor\, magician and chocolate-maker became the beloved
  Willy Wonka we know today.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
