DESCRIPTION:Join us for dessert in the dark during WonderLab’s 2024 AfterHo
 urs Chocolate event. Eclipsed by Chocolate will feature a three course des
 sert experience to delight the senses and satiate chocolate lovers. During
  each course guest speakers and science experts will enlighten visitors ab
 out the science of heightened senses\, astronomy and outer space\, and fla
 vor conceptualization. Each course will be paired with select wines from O
 wen Valley Winery.
