 A rideshare driver picks up a passenger who helps him confront the past.</
 p>\n<p><strong>Red\, White and Blue </strong>– <span class='sc-466bb6c-1 d
 WufeH' role='presentation' data-testid='plot-l'>a single parent living pay
 check to paycheck is forced to cross state lines in search of an aborti</s
 pan>on.</p>\n<p><strong>Knight of Fortune </strong>– two widowers lean on 
 each other for emotional support. (in Swedish/Danish)</p>\n<p><strong>Invi
 ncible </strong>– the last 48 hours in the life of Marc-Antoine Bernier\, 
