BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-118867@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Led by French-Canadian musician Jony Perron\, JonyP trio is not
  your typical Jazz trio. With a modern\, groovy approach to old Jazz stand
 ards\, spiced with Latin flavors and sprinkled with mesmerizing solos\, th
 is musical experience will forever be engraved in your memories.\nJony Per
 ron – Drums\nKurt Baer – Saxophone\nSteve Mascari – Bass\nSpecial guest:\n
 Ted Kezio – Guitar\nRoss Martinie Eiler – Piano\nThe house band will open 
 the evening with a memorable and outstanding performance from 6-7pm\, and 
 then after a short break\, the Open Jam Session will begin!\nAny Jazz musi
 cians are welcome\, from beginner to advanced. The band will be available 
 to play with you. All handmade Ebenor Drums will be available for the drum
 mers\, just bring your sticks and brushes! Any other musician\, please bri
 ng your own instrument.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240302T180000
LOCATION:Orbit Room\, 107 North College Ave.\, Suite 001 (downstairs)\, Blo
 omington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Orbit Jazz Night with the Jony P Trio
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/orbit-jazz-night-with-the-jony-p-trio-3/
