BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-118868@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Finally\, somebody with a guitar and some songs!!! Good grief. 
 Hasn’t the world suffered long enough?!\nSimon P. Moore has a Fine Musical
  Product to sell you\, specifically a 12″ vinyl LP. Titled Simon P. Moore 
 Sings Tunes The Young People Will Enjoy\, this is a collection of 10 songs
  that are sure to stir your heart\, loins\, or even both!\nIn order to hop
 efully ensure that the evening also contains some element of entertainment
 \, your host has enlisted the aid of Benjamin Cartha Fowler and Chris Bart
 h\, whose musical performances are sure to make you temporarily forget you
  are merely being brought together with the rest of your community in orde
 r to have yet another commercial product shamelessly hawked at you.\nSerio
 usly\, this is going to be a really fun time. Doors open at 8\, show start
 s at 8:30\, and this is a FREE event\, though we will pass around a hat to
  make sure Chris and Ben get paid for their work.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240302T203000
LOCATION:Orbit Room\, 107 North College Ave.\, Suite 001 (downstairs)\, Blo
 omington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Simon P. Moore Album Release Party
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/simon-p-moore-album-release-party/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div class='xdj2
 66r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs'>Finally\, somebody with a guitar an
 d some songs!!! Good grief. Hasn’t the world suffered long enough?!</div>
 \n<div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'>Simon P. Moore ha
 s a Fine Musical Product to sell you\, specifically a 12″ vinyl LP. Titled
  Simon P. Moore Sings Tunes The Young People Will Enjoy\, this is a collec
 tion of 10 songs that are sure to stir your heart\, loins\, or even both!<
 /div>\n<div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'>In order to 
 hopefully ensure that the evening also contains some element of entertainm
 ent\, your host has enlisted the aid of Benjamin Cartha Fowler and Chris B
 arth\, whose musical performances are sure to make you temporarily forget 
 you are merely being brought together with the rest of your community in o
 rder to have yet another commercial product shamelessly hawked at you.</di
 v>\n<div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'>Seriously\, thi
 s is going to be a really fun time. Doors open at 8\, show starts at 8:30\
 , and this is a FREE event\, though we will pass around a hat to make sure
  Chris and Ben get paid for their work.</div>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
