UID:ai1ec-118995@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:In this beloved animated feature\, a deadly diphtheria epidemic
  strikes the remote town of Nome\, Alaska. With the life-saving medicine l
 ocated hundreds of miles away\, the residents decide to send out a sled-do
 g team. Balto—a half-wolf dog ignored by all except a goose\, Boris\, and 
 two polar bears—is chosen to run but is disqualified by lead dog Steele. W
 hen the other dogs get lost in the snow\, Balto risks his life to rescue t
 hem and deliver the medicine. All ages.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240304T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240304T193000
LOCATION:Auditorium\, Monroe County Public Library\, 303 East Kirkwood Ave.
 \, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Family Movie Night: Balto
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/family-movie-night-balto/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>In this belov
 ed animated feature\, a deadly diphtheria epidemic strikes the remote town
  of Nome\, Alaska. With the life-saving medicine located hundreds of miles
  away\, the residents decide to send out a sled-dog team. Balto—a half-wol
 f dog ignored by all except a goose\, Boris\, and two polar bears—is chose
 n to run but is disqualified by lead dog Steele. When the other dogs get l
 ost in the snow\, Balto risks his life to rescue them and deliver the medi
 cine. All ages.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
