UID:ai1ec-119008@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Many of you may know about the inspiration behind the Iditarod 
 Trail Sled Dog Race and recognize names like Balto or Togo\, but do you kn
 ow how the race itself came to be? Learn about the early days of the Idita
 rod and how it has evolved over the years with the documentary\, Purely Al
 askan. All ages are welcome\, but this documentary is aimed toward adults 
 and is not rated.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240305T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240305T200000
LOCATION:Auditorium\, Monroe County Public Library\, 303 East Kirkwood Ave.
 \, Bloomington
