 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div class='desc
 riptionContainer'>Many of you may know about the inspiration behind the Id
 itarod Trail Sled Dog Race and recognize names like Balto or Togo\, but do
  you know how the race itself came to be? Learn about the early days of th
 e Iditarod and how it has evolved over the years with the documentary\, <i
 >Purely Alaskan</i>. All ages are welcome\, but this documentary is aimed 
 toward adults and is not rated.</div>\n<div class='detailInfoItem'></div>
 \n</BODY></HTML>
