BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-119049@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Jonathan Glazer’s Oscar-nominated portrait of the seemingly mun
 dane life of a family whose complicity in the Holocaust reveals an unsettl
 ing brutality. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe commandant of Auschwitz\, Rudolf Höss (
 Christian Friedel\, Babylon Berlin)\, and his wife Hedwig (Sandra Hüller\,
  Anatomy of a Fall) strive to build a dream life for their family in a hou
 se and garden next to the camp. Nominated for five Academy Awards\, includ
 ing Best Picture\, Best Director\, Best Adapted Screenplay\, Best Internat
 ional Feature Film\, and Best Sound. [105 min\; drama\; German\, Polish\, 
 and Yiddish with English subtitles]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240306T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Film: THE ZONE OF INTEREST
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/film-the-zone-of-interest/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div id='content
 ' class='collapsed individual-film__intro collapsed bg-none section'>\n<di
 v class='row'>\n<div class='layout'>\n<div class='text'>\n<p class='text s
 creening-highlight'><strong> Jonathan Glazer’s Oscar-nominated portrait of
  the seemingly mundane life of a family whose complicity in the Holocaust 
 reveals an unsettling brutality. </strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</
 div>\n<div class='section bg-none individual-film__intro'>\n<div class='ro
 w'>\n<div class='layout'>\n<div class='text'>The commandant of Auschwitz\,
  Rudolf Höss (Christian Friedel\, <i>Babylon Berlin</i>)\, and his wife He
 dwig (Sandra Hüller\, <i>Anatomy of a Fall</i>) strive to build a dream li
 fe for their family in a house and garden next to the camp. Nominated for 
 five Academy Awards\, including Best Picture\, Best Director\, Best Adapte
 d Screenplay\, Best International Feature Film\, and Best Sound. [105 min\
 ; drama\; German\, Polish\, and Yiddish with English subtitles]</div>\n</d
 iv>\n</div>\n</div>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
