 An intimate look at the real people behind Amazon’s seasonal labor unit\, 
 CamperForce. [16 min\; documentary\; English]</p>\n<p><i><strong>Nomadland
 </strong></i><strong> (Chloe Zhao\, 2020\, R): </strong>A poetic character
  study on the forgotten and downtrodden\, <i>Nomadland</i> beautifully cap
 tures the restlessness left in the wake of the Great Recession as a woman 
