BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-119496@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Bring your vegetable and flower seeds to exchange with other co
 mmunity members and help the gardens of Monroe County grow! The Downtown L
 ibrary and Mother Hubbard’s Cupboard will also have free seeds available. 
 Any seeds left over from the Swap will be donated to the participating see
 d libraries so that they’re still available for the community.\n\nWhen don
 ating seeds\, please make sure your seeds are not from invasive plants and
  note the following:\n\n\nThe type and variety of seed\nThe year the seeds
  are from\nWhether the seeds are store-bought or self-saved\n\n\nWe ask th
 at you please package your seeds accordingly\; we will have tools and supp
 lies on-hand. All ages.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240316T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240316T130000
LOCATION:Program Room 2B and 2C Combo\, Monroe County Public Library\, 303 
 East Kirkwood Ave.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Spring Seed Swap
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/spring-seed-swap/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div>Bring your 
 vegetable and flower seeds to exchange with other community members and he
 lp the gardens of Monroe County grow! The Downtown Library and Mother Hubb
 ard’s Cupboard will also have free seeds available. Any seeds left over fr
 om the Swap will be donated to the participating seed libraries so that th
 ey’re still available for the community.</div>\n<div></div>\n<div>When don
 ating seeds\, please make sure your seeds are <b>not from invasive plants<
 /b> and note the following:</div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>The type and variety o
 f seed</li>\n<li>The year the seeds are from</li>\n<li>Whether the seeds a
 re store-bought or self-saved</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>We ask that you pl
 ease package your seeds accordingly\; we will have tools and supplies on-h
 and. All ages.</div>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
