CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION: \nClasses meet March 18\, March 25\, April 15\, and April 22. 
 Please register\; when you register\, you are signing up to attend all fou
 r class sessions.\nThis is a four-part series that introduces the basics o
 f making a quilt. Topics covered will include: parts of the quilt\, fabric
  selection\, sewing basics\, and cutting and piecing. This series assumes 
 no previous sewing experience and uses no special equipment. At the end of
  the series\, you will have completed two small projects. All supplies wil
 l be provided. Age 16 and up.
