CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Juniper Art Gallery is very excited to offer this brand new mem
 oir by Bloomington’s beloved Thupten Anyetsang. Although he has relocated 
 to the Philly area\, Thupten’s indelible spirit is still very much a part 
 of the Bloomington Community. His restaurant\, Little Tibet\, is located o
 n “Restaurant Row” (4th Street) and is now under the ownership of his neph
 ew.\nYou can pick up a copy of Thupten’s book at Juniper before or during 
 our book club event (March 20\, 2-3pm). Please stop by for a cup of hot te
 a or coffee and share in a conversation about Thupten’s AMAZING life!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240320T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240320T150000
LOCATION:Juniper Art Gallery\, 615 West Kirkwood Ave.\, Bloomington
