DESCRIPTION:Join us for an evening of eclipse-themed fun alongside musician
 s\, dancers\, and visiting lecturer Dr. Gabriel Lubell from the Jacobs Sch
 ool of Music!\n\n\nExplore the beauty of our place in the solar system thr
 ough the creative expression of music and dance\, woven together by the sc
 ience of a total solar eclipse. Prepare to be both informed and inspired!
 \nThis event is open to all ages. Registration is free but required. Eclip
 se glasses are included with registration.
