DESCRIPTION:Film Synopsis:\nWhen astronauts blast off from the planet Mars\
 , they leave behind Mark Watney (Matt Damon)\, presumed dead after a fierc
 e storm. With only a meager amount of supplies\, the stranded visitor must
  utilize his wits and spirit to find a way to survive on the hostile plane
 t. Meanwhile\, back on Earth\, members of NASA and a team of international
  scientists work tirelessly to bring him home while his crew mates hatch t
 heir own plan for a daring rescue mission.
