  they leave behind Mark Watney (Matt Damon)\, presumed dead after a fierce
  storm. With only a meager amount of supplies\, the stranded visitor must 
 utilize his wits and spirit to find a way to survive on the hostile planet
 . Meanwhile\, back on Earth\, members of NASA and a team of international 
 scientists work tirelessly to bring him home while his crew mates hatch th
 eir own plan for a daring rescue mission.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
