 > bestselling author whose work has been translated into more than 20 lang
 uages\, adapted into major motion pictures\, and won the <i>Los Angeles Ti
 mes</i> Book Prize. A former private investigator and reporter\, his writi
 ng has been praised by Stephen King\, Michael Connelly\, and Dean Koontz\,
  among many others. Raised in Bloomington\, Indiana\, he now lives in Indi
 ana and Maine. Age 16 and up. <b>This event is free and no tickets are req
 uired.</b></div>\n</BODY></HTML>
