 s'>Ian Nagoski is a music researcher and record producer in Baltimore\, Ma
 ryland. Over the past fifteen years\, he has made reissues of early 20th c
 entury recordings in languages other than English for labels including Dus
 t-to-Digital\, Tompkins Square\, his own Canary Records\, and others. His 
 enthusiastic talks have been hosted across America and Europe at in galler
 ies and nightclubs as well as institutions including the Library of Congre
 ss\, the Woody Guthrie Center\, and the Onassis Cultural Center in Athens 
 Greece and universities including UCLA\, Brandeis\, and the University of 
