DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special movie night where we’ll watch Disney’s ne
 west animated movie\, Wish. We’ll discover the magic of wishing upon a sta
 r while we enjoy snacks and crafts. All ages.\n\nSummary:\n“A young woman 
 named Asha possesses wild wishes for happiness. After making a wish on a s
 tarry night\, Asha is surprised when Star\, a ball of cosmic energy\, come
 s down to accompany her. Asha and Star must work together to defeat the ru
 thless ruler\, King Magnifico\, who threatens the safety of her local comm
 unity. With Asha’s unstoppable courage and Star’s magical powers\, nothing
  is impossible.”
