 <i>Wish</i>. We’ll discover the magic of wishing upon a star while we enjo
 y snacks and crafts. All ages.</div>\n<div></div>\n<div><u>Summary:</u></d
 iv>\n<div>“A young woman named Asha possesses wild wishes for happiness. A
 fter making a wish on a starry night\, Asha is surprised when Star\, a bal
 l of cosmic energy\, comes down to accompany her. Asha and Star must work 
