UID:ai1ec-120194@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Most shadow puppetry\, or wayang kulit\, in Bali tells tales fr
 om the great Indian epics – but this performance is from a new cycle of st
 ories called wayang tantri. In this story a king is planning a big celebra
 tion for the solar eclipse and sends his clown-servants to the forest to c
 ollect the needed supplies… but the king of the forest\, Suramaya\, does n
 ot like this plan. Come experience this unique depiction of an eclipse wit
 h beautiful animal puppets and a dynamic story with an environmental messa
 ge.\nFree and appropriate for all ages. Contains depictions of an eclipse.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240403T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240403T210000
LOCATION:IU Museum of Archaeology and Anthropology\, 416 North Indiana Ave.
 \, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Gerhana Matahari: A Balinese Eclipse Shadow Puppet Performance
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/gerhana-matahari-a-balinese-eclipse-shadow-puppe
 t-performance/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Most shadow p
 uppetry\, or wayang kulit\, in Bali tells tales from the great Indian epic
 s – but this performance is from a new cycle of stories called wayang tant
 ri. In this story a king is planning a big celebration for the solar eclip
 se and sends his clown-servants to the forest to collect the needed suppli
 es… but the king of the forest\, Suramaya\, does not like this plan. Come 
 experience this unique depiction of an eclipse with beautiful animal puppe
 ts and a dynamic story with an environmental message.</p>\n<p>Free and app
 ropriate for all ages. Contains depictions of an eclipse.</p>\n</BODY></HT
 ML>
END:VEVENT
