BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-120076@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:What is it that makes a story move you? Like really\, really mo
 ve you?\nAfter 15 years of making Radiolab and\, more recently\, More Perf
 ect\, Jad Abumrad found himself standing on a street corner\, staring down
  at a manhole cover and thinking: Indoor plumbing! Of course!\nJoin Jad as
  he deconstructs the process of finding and developing stories and creatin
 g new\, original work. He will unearth the hidden ingredients key to the s
 tories that inspire\, change\, and connect us all.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240404T193000
LOCATION:Buskirk Chumley Theater\, 114 E Kirkwood Ave.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Jad Abumrad: ‘The Miracle of Indoor Plumbing’ Patten Lecture Series
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/jad-abumrad-the-miracle-of-indoor-plumbing-patte
 n-lecture-series/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>What is it th
 at makes a story move you? Like really\, really move you?</p>\n<p>After 15
  years of making <em>Radiolab</em> and\, more recently\, <em>More Perfect<
 /em>\, Jad Abumrad found himself standing on a street corner\, staring dow
 n at a manhole cover and thinking: Indoor plumbing! Of course!</p>\n<p>Joi
 n Jad as he deconstructs the process of finding and developing stories and
  creating new\, original work. He will unearth the hidden ingredients key 
 to the stories that inspire\, change\, and connect us all.</p>\n</BODY></H
 TML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
