CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Judy has had stand-up specials on HBO\, Comedy Central and LOGO
 . She was a part of Netflix’s Stand Out: An LGBTQ+ Celebration. She is the
  author of Yes I Can Say That: When They Come For The Comedians\, We Are A
 ll In Trouble\, a critically acclaimed book about free speech and cancel c
 ulture which debuted as the number one comedy release on Amazon and was fe
 atured in the New York Times Book Review. Judy is also host of the hit pod
 cast\, Kill Me Now with Judy Gold.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240405T190000
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, Corner of 4th and Walnut (upstairs)\, Bloomingt
 on
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20240406T190000
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Judy Gold (shows at 7 pm and 9:30 pm)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/judy-gold-shows-at-7-pm-and-930-pm/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Judy has had 
 stand-up specials on HBO\, Comedy Central and LOGO. She was a part of Netf
 lix’s Stand Out: An LGBTQ+ Celebration. She is the author of <strong><a hr
 ef='https://judygold.com/about/#writer'>Yes I Can Say That: When They Come
  For The Comedians\, We Are All In Trouble</a></strong>\, a critically acc
 laimed book about free speech and cancel culture which debuted as the numb
 er one comedy release on Amazon and was featured in the New York Times Boo
 k Review. Judy is also host of the hit podcast\, <strong><a href='https://
 judygold.com/about/#podcaster'>Kill Me Now with Judy Gold</a></strong>.</p
 >\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
