BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-120458@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:The new film by Wim Wenders (Wings of Desire) is one of the nom
 inees for Best International Feature Film.\nOutside of his structured life
  in Tokyo\, Hirayama (Kôji Yakusho) cherishes music on cassette tapes\, bo
 oks\, and taking photos of trees. Unexpected encounters reveal more of his
  story in a deeply moving and poetic reflection on finding beauty in the w
 orld around us. An absorbing slice-of-life drama led by a remarkable Kôji 
 Yakusho performance.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240407T163000
LOCATION:IU Radio and Television Theater\, Radio & Television Theater (RTV 
 251) is at 1229 East 7th Street\, Bloomington
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20240414T163000
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Ryder Film Series: PERFECT DAYS
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/ryder-film-series-perfect-days/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><span class='
 c-productDetails_description g-text-xsmall'>The new film by Wim Wenders (W
 ings of Desire) is one of the nominees for Best International Feature Film
 .</span></p>\n<p><span class='c-productDetails_description g-text-xsmall'>
 Outside of his structured life in Tokyo\, Hirayama (Kôji Yakusho) cherishe
 s music on cassette tapes\, books\, and taking photos of trees. Unexpected
  encounters reveal more of his story in a deeply moving and poetic reflect
 ion on finding beauty in the world around us. An absorbing slice-of-life d
 rama led by a remarkable Kôji Yakusho performance.</span></p>\n</BODY></HT
 ML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
