BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-120902@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:The party kicks off at the John Waldron Arts Center on Sunday\,
  April 21\, at 2:00pm\, with a brief program beginning at 2:30pm. Just us 
 for appetizers\, a Silent Auction\, and performances of popular 80’s pop\,
  rock\, and country hits. Enter to win our costume contest by dressing up 
 in your best 1980’s attire\, or as your favorite Steel Magnolias character
 . Stay after the event for a free screening of the classic movie Stage Doo
 r\, beginning at 4:00pm. Ticket price includes appetizers and a free drink
  from the Constellation Stage & Screen bar.
