 t Auction\, and performances of popular 80’s pop\, rock\, and country hits
 . Enter to win our costume contest by dressing up in your best 1980’s atti
 re\, or as your favorite <em>Steel Magnolias</em> character. Stay after th
 e event for a free screening of the classic movie <em>Stage Door</em>\, be
 ginning at 4:00pm. Ticket price includes appetizers and a free drink from 
