UID:ai1ec-121126@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Brown County Game Conference (BroCoCon) is a family-friendly co
 nsumer game show hosted by The Toy Chest. It is designed to be fun to atte
 nd with the whole family or without kids. We will have games to learn and 
 play (as well as purchase) in strategy\, family\, party\, and preschool ca
 tegories. There will also be special events\, game tournaments\, preschool
  game highlights\, outdoor games\, and strategy game instruction. General 
 admission tickets allow admission to the general event from 10am-5pm as we
 ll as continued access to open-play spaces.\n*Children 5 and under are fre
 e\nAdult Game Night\nIn the evening we host an 18+ adult game night\, whic
 h boasts game speed dating (play a game until the bell dings\, them move t
 o the next table) and a cash bar. The ticket for this event is sold separa
 tely and can be attended without attending the daytime event. Adult Game N
 ight Tickets allow admission to the game night hosted from 7-10
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240427T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240427T220000
LOCATION:Brown County Inn\, 51 State Road 46 East\, Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:BroCoCon – Family Gaming Event
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/brococon-family-gaming-event/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Brown County 
 Game Conference (BroCoCon) is a family-friendly consumer game show hosted 
 by The Toy Chest. It is designed to be fun to attend with the whole family
  or without kids. We will have games to learn and play (as well as purchas
 e) in strategy\, family\, party\, and preschool categories. There will als
 o be special events\, game tournaments\, preschool game highlights\, outdo
 or games\, and strategy game instruction. General admission tickets allow 
 admission to the general event from 10am-5pm as well as continued access t
 o open-play spaces.</p>\n<p>*Children 5 and under are free</p>\n<p>Adult G
 ame Night<br />\nIn the evening we host an 18+ adult game night\, which bo
 asts game speed dating (play a game until the bell dings\, them move to th
 e next table) and a cash bar. The ticket for this event is sold separately
  and can be attended without attending the daytime event. Adult Game Night
  Tickets allow admission to the game night hosted from 7-10</p>\n</BODY></
 HTML>
END:VEVENT
