BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-121042@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Indiana natives saluting the music of John Cougar Mellencamp. B
 ringing the biggest Hoosier hits and the deepest cuts to the heartland of 
 America. American Fools brings the feel-good groove of John (Cougar) Melle
 ncamp’s songs to life on the stage. We take you on a journey through his c
 areer including tracks like: Hurts So Good\, Cherry Bomb\, Jack & Diane\, 
 R.O.C.K. in the USA\, I Need A Lover (that won’t drive me crazy)\, Lonely 
 Ol’ Night\, Thundering Hearts\, China Girl\, Crumblin Down\, Rain on the S
 carecrow\, Pink Houses.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240427T193000
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S Van Buren St\, Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:American Fools: The Music of John Mellencamp
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/american-fools-the-music-of-john-mellencamp-3/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Indiana nativ
 es saluting the music of John Cougar Mellencamp. Bringing the biggest Hoos
 ier hits and the deepest cuts to the heartland of America. American Fools 
 brings the feel-good groove of John (Cougar) Mellencamp’s songs to life on
  the stage. We take you on a journey through his career including tracks l
 ike: Hurts So Good\, Cherry Bomb\, Jack & Diane\, R.O.C.K. in the USA\, I 
 Need A Lover (that won’t drive me crazy)\, Lonely Ol’ Night\, Thundering H
 earts\, China Girl\, Crumblin Down\, Rain on the Scarecrow\, Pink Houses.<
 /p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
