UID:ai1ec-121028@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Marianne\, a painter\, is commissioned to do the wedding portra
 it of Héloïse\, a young woman who has just left the convent. Héloïse is a 
 reluctant bride to be and Marianne must paint her without her knowing. She
  observes her by day\, to paint her in secret.\nA singularly rich period p
 iece\, Portrait of a Lady on Fire finds stirring\, thought-provoking drama
  within a powerfully acted romance.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240427T200000
LOCATION:Buskirk Chumley Theater\, 114 E Kirkwood Ave.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Film: Portrait of a Lady on Fire
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/film-portrait-of-a-lady-on-fire-2/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Marianne\, a 
 painter\, is commissioned to do the wedding portrait of Héloïse\, a young 
 woman who has just left the convent. Héloïse is a reluctant bride to be an
 d Marianne must paint her without her knowing. She observes her by day\, t
 o paint her in secret.</p>\n<p>A singularly rich period piece\, <em>Portra
 it of a Lady on Fire</em> finds stirring\, thought-provoking drama within 
 a powerfully acted romance.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
