 ' class='amh-block amh-text col-md-12' data-block-type='text'>\n<div class
 ='amh-content'>\n<p>See how we can use oral history and traditional source
 s to map where they lived—the common and the bold. The Hoosier Character i
 nitiative is under construction for America’s 250th birthday in 2026.</p>
