CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Inspired by a story by Elinor Glyn\, who uses the simple pronou
 n to encapsulate the spirit of the sexually-liberated youth of Prohibition
 -era America\, a saucy lingerie salesgirl sets her sights on the handsome 
 owner (Antonio Moreno) of the department store in which she works. Leading
  him on a romantic chase from the Hotel Ritz to the whirling attractions o
 f Coney Island\, Betty Lou (Bow) decides to crash a high-society yacht par
 ty in a last-ditch effort to get her man.\n21+
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240502T200000
LOCATION:The Back Door\, 207 S College Ave
SEQUENCE:0
