CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Unveil the mysteries within and embark on a transformative jour
 ney at our exclusive workshop: “Whisper in the Shadows.”\nExplore the Dept
 hs:Find the hidden recesses of your psyche and embrace the power of shadow
  work. This workshop offers a safe space for deep introspection and person
 al growth.\nUnlock Your Potential:Discover the hidden truths and untapped 
 potential within your shadow self. Through insightful exercises and discus
 sions\, you’ll gain valuable tools for self-exploration and empowerment.\n
 Gothic Elegance Meets Tea Party Delights:Immerse yourself in a decadent go
 thic tea party experience. Savor enchanting brews\, indulge in delectable 
 treats\, and revel in the ambiance of dark elegance as you connect with fe
 llow seekers.\nEmbrace the Shadows:Embrace the darkness within and let you
 r inner light shine brighter than ever before. Join us for an unforgettabl
 e day of self-discovery and indulgence as we whisper secrets in the shadow
 s.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240504T180000
LOCATION:The Burnished Raven\, 311 East Winslow Road\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Whisper in the Shadows: A Journey of Self-Discovery (and a Goth Tea
