DESCRIPTION:Dine Out for the Library at Juannita’s (620 W. Kirkwood Avenue\
 , Bloomington)\, a Mexican restaurant that has been serving the local comm
 unity since 2013. Juannita’s is passionate about grilling up some flavorfu
 l carne asada and squeezing up some juicy limes to make the perfect burrit
 os\, nachos\, or tacos. Their Abuela Juannita’s authentic food and drink b
 rand focuses on fresh ingredients for a rich flavor in every bite with gre
 at care to their convenient food service.\nShow your flyer and Juannita’s 
 will donate 20% of your tab to help make great library programs possible. 
 Enjoy lunch or dinner from 11 AM–10 PM on Mondays\, May 6 and 20\, and Wed
 nesdays\, May 8 and 22.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240506T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240506T220000
LOCATION:Juannita's\, 620 West Kirkwood Ave.\, Bloomington
