BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-121479@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Hairspray – a 2007 musical romantic comedy film based on the 20
 02 Broadway musical\, which in turn was based on John Waters’ 1988 comedy 
 film of the same name –  is an energetic\, wholly entertaining musical rom
 p.  Its contagious songs will make you want to get up and start dancing!\n
 In 1960s Baltimore\, dance-loving teen Tracy Turnblad auditions for a spot
  on “The Corny Collins Show” and wins!\nShe becomes an overnight celebrity
 \, a trendsetter in dance\, fun and fashion. Perhaps her new status as a t
 een sensation is enough to topple Corny’s reigning dance queen and bring r
 acial integration to the show.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240507T193000
LOCATION:Buskirk Chumley Theater\, 114 E Kirkwood Ave.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Film: HAIRSPRAY
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/film-hairspray/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Hairspray – a
  2007 musical romantic comedy film based on the 2002 Broadway musical\, wh
 ich in turn was based on John Waters’ 1988 comedy film of the same name – 
  is an energetic\, wholly entertaining musical romp.  Its contagious songs
  will make you want to get up and start dancing!</p>\n<p>In 1960s Baltimor
 e\, dance-loving teen Tracy Turnblad auditions for a spot on “The Corny Co
 llins Show” and wins!</p>\n<p>She becomes an overnight celebrity\, a trend
 setter in dance\, fun and fashion. Perhaps her new status as a teen sensat
 ion is enough to topple Corny’s reigning dance queen and bring racial inte
 gration to the show.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
