UID:ai1ec-121942@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Join the Monroe County History Center on Sunday\, June 9th\, 20
 24\, for an unforgettable free event with IU alum and LGBTQ+ advocate Jim 
 Fielding! Dive into Fielding’s fascinating journey as he shares insights f
 rom his career at powerhouse brands like Disney and DreamWorks. Be inspire
 d by his story of determination and authentic leadership\, and learn how t
 o bring out the best in yourself and your community. Experience an engagin
 g interview-style conversation with Fielding\, led by Justin Robertson of 
 WFHB’s BloomingOUT\, followed by a book signing. Don’t miss this exciting 
 opportunity to connect and celebrate! Hardcover books will be available fo
 r purchase. All are welcome!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240509T150000
LOCATION:Monroe County History Center\, 202 E 6th St\, Bloomington\, IN
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:All Pride\, No Ego: A Conversation and Book Signing with Jim Fieldi
 ng
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/all-pride-no-ego-a-conversation-and-book-signing
 -with-jim-fielding/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><span style='
 font-family: trebuchet ms\, sans-serif\;'>Join the Monroe County History C
 enter on Sunday\, June 9th\, 2024\, for an unforgettable free event with I
 U alum and LGBTQ+ advocate Jim Fielding! Dive into Fielding’s fascinating 
 journey as he shares insights from his career at powerhouse brands like Di
 sney and DreamWorks. Be inspired by his story of determination and authent
 ic leadership\, and learn how to bring out the best in yourself and your c
 ommunity. Experience an engaging interview-style conversation with Fieldin
 g\, led by Justin Robertson of WFHB’s BloomingOUT\, followed by a book sig
 ning. Don’t miss this exciting opportunity to connect and celebrate! Hardc
 over books will be available for purchase. All are welcome!</span></p>\n</
 BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
