DESCRIPTION:The Indiana Limestone Symposium & Monroe County Parks and Recre
 ation invite you to an afternoon of limestone carving at Karst Farm Park.
 \nWatch carvers from the area demonstrate the art of limestone carving or 
 try your own skill with a hands-on experience.\nEvent dates: May 4 & May 1
 8\, 12p-4p.\nEvent Location: Shelter 7 area at Karst Farm Park\nFor more i
 nformation about the Symposium check out the website: limestonesymposium.o
 rg
