 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>The Indiana L
 imestone Symposium & Monroe County Parks and Recreation invite you to an a
 fternoon of limestone carving at Karst Farm Park.<br />\nWatch carvers fro
 m the area demonstrate the art of limestone carving or try your own skill 
 with a hands-on experience.<br />\nEvent dates: May 4 & May 18\, 12p-4p.<b
 r />\nEvent Location: Shelter 7 area at Karst Farm Park<br />\nFor more in
 formation about the Symposium check out the website: limestonesymposium.or
 g</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
