DESCRIPTION:Some of our staff has been so inspired by the monthly Lesbian T
 ea Dance in Louisville that we want to throw a Tea Dance here in town!\nTh
 is is an afternoon social event meant to foster community! We’ll have…\n~ 
 DJ on the patio\n~ Pizza Pop-Up by Sandy\n~ Pool table on the patio\n~ Dri
 nk specials\nFrom 1pm to 5pm on Saturday\, May 18th! No cover!\nAll lesbia
 ns\, those who are lesbian adjacent\, dyk3s\, sapphics\, and sweethearts w
 elcome! This is meant to be an inclusive event. No TERFS! 🙂
