 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Some of our s
 taff has been so inspired by the monthly Lesbian Tea Dance in Louisville t
 hat we want to throw a Tea Dance here in town!</p>\n<p>This is an afternoo
 n social event meant to foster community! We’ll have…</p>\n<p>~ DJ on the 
 patio<br />\n~ Pizza Pop-Up by Sandy<br />\n~ Pool table on the patio<br /
 >\n~ Drink specials</p>\n<p>From 1pm to 5pm on Saturday\, May 18th! No cov
