 uled for a tour of the Midwest in July of 2024\, and have just released th
 eir second studio release\, “Merlyns Quest.”\nMoon Goons from Indianapolis
 \, Indiana is titanic goblin-prog drenched in psychedelia. Known for visua
 l stimulation and auditory extravagance. Music best suited for space weird
 os and worms.
