BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-121932@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:The Comedy of Errors tells the story of two sets of identical t
 wins who were accidentally separated at birth. Antipholus of Syracuse and 
 his servant\, Dromio of Syracuse\, arrive in Ephesus\, which turns out to 
 be the home of their twin brothers\, Antipholus of Ephesus and his servant
 \, Dromio of Ephesus. When the Syracusans encounter the friends and famili
 es of their twins\, a series of wild mishaps based on mistaken identities 
 lead to wrongful beatings\, a near-seduction\, the arrest of Antipholus of
  Ephesus\, and false accusations of infidelity\, theft\, madness\, and mor
 e. You know\, just another weekend in Btown!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240530T190000
LOCATION:Waldron HIll and Buskirk Park\, 331 S. Washington St. Bloomington\
 , IN
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20240530T190000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20240531T190000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20240601T190000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20240606T190000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20240607T190000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20240608T190000
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:35th Annual Shakespeare in the Park: The Comedy of Errors
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/35th-annual-shakespeare-in-the-park-the-comedy-o
 f-errors/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><em>The Comed
 y of Errors </em>tells the story of two sets of identical twins who were a
 ccidentally separated at birth. Antipholus of Syracuse and his servant\, D
 romio of Syracuse\, arrive in Ephesus\, which turns out to be the home of 
 their twin brothers\, Antipholus of Ephesus and his servant\, Dromio of Ep
 hesus. When the Syracusans encounter the friends and families of their twi
 ns\, a series of wild mishaps based on mistaken identities lead to wrongfu
 l beatings\, a near-seduction\, the arrest of Antipholus of Ephesus\, and 
 false accusations of infidelity\, theft\, madness\, and more. You know\, j
 ust another weekend in Btown!</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
