DESCRIPTION:There will be food\, art\, music\, games\, and story time activ
 ities. All ages are welcome – there will be something for everyone! Events
  include planting a memorial garden and a vigil for Palestine. June 1st is
  also International Children’s Day\, and the Liberated Zone intends for th
 is event to honor all of the lost children of Gaza.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240601T110000
LOCATION:Dunn Meadow\, N Indiana Ave\, Bloomington\, IN
