 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>There will be
  food\, art\, music\, games\, and story time activities. All ages are welc
 ome – there will be something for everyone! Events include planting a memo
 rial garden and a vigil for Palestine. June 1st is also International Chil
 dren’s Day\, and the Liberated Zone intends for this event to honor all of
  the lost children of Gaza.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
