CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:The Comedy of Errors tells the story of two sets of identical t
 wins who were accidentally separated at birth. Antipholus of Syracuse and 
 his servant\, Dromio of Syracuse\, arrive in Ephesus\, which turns out to 
 be the home of their twin brothers\, Antipholus of Ephesus and his servant
 \, Dromio of Ephesus. When the Syracusans encounter the friends and famili
 es of their twins\, a series of wild mishaps based on mistaken identities 
 lead to wrongful beatings\, a near-seduction\, the arrest of Antipholus of
  Ephesus\, and false accusations of infidelity\, theft\, madness\, and mor
 e. You know\, just another weekend in Btown!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240602T140000
LOCATION:Waldron HIll and Buskirk Park\, 331 S. Washington St. Bloomington\
 , IN
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20240602T140000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20240609T140000
