 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>2024 marks th
 e 42nd. anniversary of  Young@Heart \, the world’s pre-eminent octogenaria
 n rock ‘n’ roll chorus. Started in 1982 as an informal sing-along at a Wes
 tern Massachusetts meals site for the elderly\, it has grown into a stereo
 type-defying\, globetrotting musical extravaganza.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
