UID:ai1ec-122063@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Join the fun at Brown County Playhouse for an unforgettable eve
 ning of laughter and entertainment with Neil Simon’s beloved comedy\, “The
  Odd Couple.” Witness the hilarious antics of Felix Ungar and Oscar Madiso
 n as their mismatched personalities collide in a riotous tale of friendshi
 p\, love\, and chaos.\nThis community theater production features a talent
 ed cast of local actors\, “The Odd Couple” promises uproarious moments\, h
 eartwarming camaraderie\, and a delightful escape into the world of Neil S
 imon’s iconic characters. Get ready for an evening of side-splitting laugh
 ter and unforgettable performances!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240609T143000
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S. Van Buren St Nashville\, IN
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20240609T143000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20240616T143000
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:The Odd Couple
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/the-odd-couple-2/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Join the fun 
 at Brown County Playhouse for an unforgettable evening of laughter and ent
 ertainment with Neil Simon’s beloved comedy\, “The Odd Couple.” Witness th
 e hilarious antics of Felix Ungar and Oscar Madison as their mismatched pe
 rsonalities collide in a riotous tale of friendship\, love\, and chaos.</p
 >\n<p>This community theater production features a talented cast of local 
 actors\, “The Odd Couple” promises uproarious moments\, heartwarming camar
 aderie\, and a delightful escape into the world of Neil Simon’s iconic cha
 racters. Get ready for an evening of side-splitting laughter and unforgett
 able performances!</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
