CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:A volunteer attorney will return calls to registered individual
 s from 3-5:30 pm.  Receive advice on Civil Legal Issues including:\n    Fa
 mily law (child support\, custody\, divorce\, parenting time)\n    Guardia
 nships\n    Powers of Attorney\n    Protective Orders\n    Simple Wills an
 d Small Estates\nReceive advice on Housing Legal Issues including:\n    Ev
 iction/Housing Issues\n    Damages Hearings\n    Sealing of Eviction Recor
 ds\nIndividuals calling the Legal Aid Phone Clinic can expect to receive a
  brief consultation to answer civil or housing legal matters over the phon
 e. Registered individuals must be available between 3 pm and 5:30 pm to an
 swer a call from an attorney.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240611T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240611T140000
LOCATION:Registration required by calling 812.378.0358 between noon and 2 p
 m on the day of the clinic.
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Free Legal Aid Phone Clinic for Brown County Residents who cannot a
 fford an attorney
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/free-legal-aid-phone-clinic-for-brown-county-res
 idents-who-cannot-afford-an-attorney/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong> A vo
 lunteer attorney will return calls to registered individuals from 3-5:30 p
 m.</strong>  Receive advice on Civil Legal Issues including:</p>\n<p>    F
 amily law (child support\, custody\, divorce\, parenting time)<br />\n    
 Guardianships<br />\n    Powers of Attorney<br />\n    Protective Orders<b
 r />\n    Simple Wills and Small Estates</p>\n<p>Receive advice on Housing
  Legal Issues including:</p>\n<p>    Eviction/Housing Issues<br />\n    Da
 mages Hearings<br />\n    Sealing of Eviction Records</p>\n<p>Individuals 
 calling the Legal Aid Phone Clinic can expect to receive a brief consultat
 ion to answer civil or housing legal matters over the phone. Registered in
 dividuals must be available between 3 pm and 5:30 pm to answer a call from
  an attorney.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
