CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Learners will enjoy friendly conversation\, practice their writ
 ing skills\, learn about daily life in the United States\, gain confidence
  in written and oral expression\, and meet new people from around the worl
 d.\nComplete an initial registration at the VITAL office (Downtown Library
 \, second floor)\, and then drop in to any English Language Group. Registr
 ation includes a brief level assessment. Intermediate English skills are s
 uggested. Visit VITAL English Language Groups to learn more about language
  levels.\nFor information about programs for beginner English speakers\, p
 lease fill out the VITAL Services Request Form.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240612T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240612T120000
LOCATION:Meeting Room 2C\, Monroe County Public Library\, 303 East Kirkwood
  Ave.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
