 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Learners will
  enjoy friendly conversation\, practice their writing skills\, learn about
  daily life in the United States\, gain confidence in written and oral exp
 ression\, and meet new people from around the world.</p>\n<p>Complete an i
 nitial registration at the VITAL office (Downtown Library\, second floor)\
 , and then drop in to any English Language Group. Registration includes a 
 brief level assessment. Intermediate English skills are suggested. Visit V
 ITAL English Language Groups to learn more about language levels.</p>\n<p>
 For information about programs for beginner English speakers\, please fill
  out the VITAL Services Request Form.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
