BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-123064@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:This presentation will track culinary celebrity Padma Lakshmi’s
  evolving avatars across time and different nodes in a multi-platform tran
 snational media ecosystem. Who is Padma Lakshmi? An “exotic” upper caste I
 ndian American woman whose beauty predictably paved her journey towards gl
 obal celebrity? A scrappy immigrant survivor of trauma whose life story se
 rves as a testimony to the American dream’s accessibility? A popular femin
 ist figure whose mediated food politics—leavened with inclusive nationalis
 m—on a digital streaming platform upholds the causes of gender and race eq
 uity?
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240621T180000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Discussion: ASSEMBLING THE INGREDIENTS OF CULINARY CELEBRITY: PADMA
  LAKSHMI AND THE MULTI-PLATFORM DIASPORIC IMAGINARY
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/discussion-assembling-the-ingredients-of-culinar
 y-celebrity-padma-lakshmi-and-the-multi-platform-diasporic-imaginary/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>This presenta
 tion will track culinary celebrity Padma Lakshmi’s evolving avatars across
  time and different nodes in a multi-platform transnational media ecosyste
 m. Who is Padma Lakshmi? An “exotic” upper caste Indian American woman who
 se beauty predictably paved her journey towards global celebrity? A scrapp
 y immigrant survivor of trauma whose life story serves as a testimony to t
 he American dream’s accessibility? A popular feminist figure whose mediate
 d food politics—leavened with inclusive nationalism—on a digital streaming
  platform upholds the causes of gender and race equity?</p>\n</BODY></HTML
 >
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
