BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-122842@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015805Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:After releasing four Top Ten Billboard albums\, North Carolina 
 based Nu-Blu has quickly established themselves as one of the top Acoustic
  acts in the music industry\, delivering a set of songs that range from th
 e melancholy to the exuberant\, and at every step they prove they’ve got a
  knack for finding their way into the deeper parts of you.\nOver the years
 \, they’ve turned many heads\, garnering major headlines with their George
  Jones inspired tribute single “Jesus and Jones“ featuring Rock and Roll H
 all of Fame singer ‘Soul Man’ Sam Moore (of the iconic duo Sam and Dave). 
 The award-winning band has also made appearances on Fox News in the past\,
  while also having their music featured on CBS “Sunday Morning.”  Recently
  they have moved into the role of helping bring Bluegrass to the masses\, 
 serving as the permanent host of the nationally-syndicated TV show “Bluegr
 ass Ridge\,” which airs in 120 million homes worldwide.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240621T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240621T213000
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater\, 114 E Kirkwood Ave\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:NU-BLU: Bluegrass from North Carolina\, with opener Father Kentucky
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/nu-blu-bluegrass-from-north-carolina/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>After releasi
 ng four Top Ten Billboard albums\, North Carolina based Nu-Blu has quickly
  established themselves as one of the top Acoustic acts in the music indus
 try\, delivering a set of songs that range from the melancholy to the exub
 erant\, and at every step they prove they’ve got a knack for finding their
  way into the deeper parts of you.</p>\n<p>Over the years\, they’ve turned
  many heads\, garnering major headlines with their George Jones inspired t
 ribute single <u>“<a href='https://open.spotify.com/track/5ZmfK5EuF2iHA6T5
 foLv9W' target='_blank' rel='noopener' data-saferedirecturl='https://www.g
 oogle.com/url?q=https://open.spotify.com/track/5ZmfK5EuF2iHA6T5foLv9W&sour
 ce=gmail&ust=1718209478695000&usg=AOvVaw1OKPHZiwD3EyI3knIxYoWf'>Jesus and 
 Jones</a>“</u> featuring Rock and Roll Hall of Fame singer ‘Soul Man’ Sam 
 Moore (of the iconic duo Sam and Dave). The award-winning band has also ma
 de appearances on Fox News in the past\, while also having their music fea
 tured on CBS “Sunday Morning.”  Recently they have moved into the role of 
 helping bring Bluegrass to the masses\, serving as the permanent host of t
 he nationally-syndicated TV show <u><a href='http://cjmproductions.com/blu
 egrass-ridge/' target='_blank' rel='noopener' data-saferedirecturl='https:
 //www.google.com/url?q=http://cjmproductions.com/bluegrass-ridge/&source=g
 mail&ust=1718209478695000&usg=AOvVaw3e5YUC-m5nIx0SCMrqV4ZS'>“Bluegrass Rid
 ge\,”</a></u> which airs in 120 million homes worldwide.</p>\n</BODY></HTM
 L>
END:VEVENT
