DESCRIPTION:Dan Aykroyd and John Belushi star as Elwood and Jake Blues in t
 his Chicago favorite\, filled with music\, comedy and chaos. Jake Blues\, 
 just out from prison\, puts together his old band to save the Catholic hom
 e where he and his brother Elwood were raised. However\, after playing sev
 eral gigs and making a few enemies\, including Nazis\, country singers\, a
 nd the Chicago Police Department\, the brothers face daunting odds to deli
 ver the money on time.
