 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><b></b><b>Dan
  Aykroyd and John Belushi star as Elwood and Jake Blues in this Chicago fa
 vorite\, filled with music\, comedy and chaos. Jake Blues\, just out from 
 prison\, puts together his old band to save the Catholic home where he and
  his brother Elwood were raised. However\, after playing several gigs and 
 making a few enemies\, including Nazis\, country singers\, and the Chicago
  Police Department\, the brothers face daunting odds to deliver the money 
 on time.</b></p>\n</BODY></HTML>
