CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:The Brown County Touch-A-Truck event is a free\, hands-on event
  that provides kids with the opportunity to see\, touch and explore their 
 favorite big trucks\, heavy equipment and emergency vehicles as well as in
 teract with community support leaders including police officers\, firemen\
 , construction workers and more! Bring the entire family to get up close w
 ith these vehicles\, learn about what they do\, how they work and how they
  benefit our community! All donations benefit Brown County Weekend Backpac
 ks\, a community-led\, totally-volunteer program whose goal is keeping hun
 gry children fed with nutritious food all weekend long.\n​
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240622T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240622T130000
LOCATION:Brown County Music Center\, 200 Maple Leaf Boulevard\, Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Touch-a-Truck fundraiser for the Brown County Weekend Backpacks foo
 d security program
