X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>The Brown Cou
 nty Touch-A-Truck event is a free\, hands-on event that provides kids with
  the opportunity to see\, touch and explore their favorite big trucks\, he
 avy equipment and emergency vehicles as well as interact with community su
 pport leaders including police officers\, firemen\, construction workers a
 nd more! Bring the entire family to get up close with these vehicles\, lea
 rn about what they do\, how they work and how they benefit our community! 
 <strong>All donations benefit Brown County Weekend Backpacks\, a community
 -led\, totally-volunteer program whose goal is keeping hungry children fed
  with nutritious food all weekend long.</strong></p>\n<p>​</p>\n</BODY></H
 TML>
