 \n<p>“Mayor’s Team at the Table”</p>\n<p>This is a community outreach prog
 ram that invites Market-goers to engage with the mayor and various departm
 ent heads from the City of Bloomington government. This Saturday\, Bloomin
 gton Police Chief Mike Diekhoff\, will be greeting the public at the Marke
 t between 10 a.m. and 12 p.m.</strong></p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
