DESCRIPTION:The history of Bloomington Punk is still being written… at Stre
 etdance Rewind\, an outdoor punk music festival in front of the Monroe Cou
 nty History Center. On Saturday\, June 29th\, festivities can be found on 
 East 6th Street between Washington and Lincoln featuring performances by l
 ocal bands\, headlined by Yellow Rain. Streetdance Rewind kicks off at 5 p
 m on the lawn of the Monroe County History Center with activities for all 
 ages\, food trucks\, a tattoo flash pop-up with Jereme Galloway\, and much
  more.
