BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-123495@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Hoss Ridgeway is a clean comedian who has traveled the country 
 performing in churches\, schools\, clubs\, and cruises. Hoss is a regular 
 on the Huckabee Show and has a DryBar Special. When he is not on the comed
 y stage Hoss is the Head Pastor at Turning Point Christian Church in Frank
 lin\, Indiana.\n \nSteve Rivera is a clean Comedian and founder of Gutty’s
  Comedy Clubs. For nearly 25 years Steve has made it his purpose to bring 
 good\, family-friendly comedy people everywhere. He is currently partnerin
 g with WHMB TV 40 to produce a new TV show called “Doctor Gutty’s Comedy C
 linic”\, which is planned to air weekly on WHMB’s primetime.\n \nDennis To
 oley has performed clean comedy for over 30 years and has shared his comed
 ic insights in clubs\, churches\, cruises\, and corporate events. His favo
 rite performance was entertaining for the troops at Walter Reed Hospital. 
 Dennis believes that laughter is one of the greatest gifts God gave to man
 kind and he wants to do his part to share the gift of laughter wherever he
  can.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240712T193000
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S Van Buren St\, Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Gutty’s Comedy Night (Hoss Ridgeway\, Steve Rivera\, and Dennis Too
 ley)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/guttys-comedy-night-hoss-ridgeway-steve-rivera-a
 nd-dennis-tooley/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Hoss Ridgeway
  is a clean comedian who has traveled the country performing in churches\,
  schools\, clubs\, and cruises. Hoss is a regular on the Huckabee Show and
  has a DryBar Special. When he is not on the comedy stage Hoss is the Head
  Pastor at Turning Point Christian Church in Franklin\, Indiana.</p>\n<p> 
 </p>\n<p>Steve Rivera is a clean Comedian and founder of Gutty’s Comedy Cl
 ubs. For nearly 25 years Steve has made it his purpose to bring good\, fam
 ily-friendly comedy people everywhere. He is currently partnering with WHM
 B TV 40 to produce a new TV show called “Doctor Gutty’s Comedy Clinic”\, w
 hich is planned to air weekly on WHMB’s primetime.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Denni
 s Tooley has performed clean comedy for over 30 years and has shared his c
 omedic insights in clubs\, churches\, cruises\, and corporate events. His 
 favorite performance was entertaining for the troops at Walter Reed Hospit
 al. Dennis believes that laughter is one of the greatest gifts God gave to
  mankind and he wants to do his part to share the gift of laughter whereve
 r he can.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
