BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-123825@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Known for their electrifying performances and commitment to hon
 oring Tom Petty’s musical legacy\, PettyBreakers are set to deliver an unf
 orgettable night of pure rock ‘n’ roll energy. From the infectious hooks o
 f “Free Fallin’” and “Runnin’ Down a Dream” to the soul-stirring balladry 
 of “Wildflowers\,” PettyBreakers flawlessly recreates the magic of the ico
 nic hits that will have you singing\, dancing\, and reminiscing about the 
 glory days of rock ‘n’ roll.\n“We’re beyond excited to bring the heart and
  soul of Tom Petty’s music to the Brown County Playhouse\,” says Ozzie Man
 cinelli\, lead singer/guitarist of PettyBreakers. “Tom’s music has touched
  the lives of so many\, and it’s an honor for us to pay tribute to his leg
 acy on stage. Get ready to rock with us on July 13th!”\nDon’t miss your ch
 ance to experience the magic of PettyBreakers live at the Brown County Pla
 yhouse on July 13th. Get your tickets now and prepare to be transported on
  a journey through the greatest hits of one of rock’s true legends.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240713T193000
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S Van Buren St\, Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:The PettyBreakers
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/the-pettybreakers/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Known for the
 ir electrifying performances and commitment to honoring Tom Petty’s musica
 l legacy\, PettyBreakers are set to deliver an unforgettable night of pure
  rock ‘n’ roll energy. From the infectious hooks of “Free Fallin’” and “Ru
 nnin’ Down a Dream” to the soul-stirring balladry of “Wildflowers\,” Petty
 Breakers flawlessly recreates the magic of the iconic hits that will have 
 you singing\, dancing\, and reminiscing about the glory days of rock ‘n’ r
 oll.</p>\n<p>“We’re beyond excited to bring the heart and soul of Tom Pett
 y’s music to the Brown County Playhouse\,” says Ozzie Mancinelli\, lead si
 nger/guitarist of PettyBreakers. “Tom’s music has touched the lives of so 
 many\, and it’s an honor for us to pay tribute to his legacy on stage. Get
  ready to rock with us on July 13th!”</p>\n<p>Don’t miss your chance to ex
 perience the magic of PettyBreakers live at the Brown County Playhouse on 
 July 13th. Get your tickets now and prepare to be transported on a journey
  through the greatest hits of one of rock’s true legends.</p>\n</BODY></HT
 ML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
