BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-123750@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy an afternoon of music and history as we take you back to 
 1949! Heavy hors d’oeuvres will be served and you will be entertained by:
 \n\nThe Dan Nix Big Band\nThe Playhouse Youth Camp Skit\nMagic and Ventril
 oquism\nA Silent Auction\n\nAlong with the entertainment\,  you will be ab
 le to hear stories of our past as well as a vision of the future of our be
 loved theater!\nGuests are invited to embrace the elegance and charm of th
 e 1940s. Please join us in your best vintage-inspired outfits\, or evening
  wear is suggested.\nThe Dan Nix Big Band\, a formidable 19-piece jazz ens
 emble\, is celebrated for its electrifying performances and exceptional ro
 ster of talent. Known for hosting Grammy artists such as Jeff Hamilton\, J
 on Hamar\, and Tamir Hendelman\, the group has played at many events and v
 enues across Indiana\, including Circle of Lights and Fountain Square Thea
 ter. Their dynamic shows and sophisticated artistry are a testament to the
  vibrant modern jazz scene\, making significant contributions to Indiana’s
  cultural landscape and establishing themselves as a prominent force in ja
 zz.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240714T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240714T173000
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S Van Buren St\, Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Brown County Playhouse 75th Anniversary Celebration
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/brown-county-playhouse-75th-anniversary-celebrat
 ion/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Enjoy an afte
 rnoon of music and history as we take you back to 1949! Heavy hors d’oeuvr
 es will be served and you will be entertained by:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The Dan N
 ix Big Band</li>\n<li>The Playhouse Youth Camp Skit</li>\n<li>Magic and Ve
 ntriloquism</li>\n<li>A Silent Auction</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Along with the ente
 rtainment\,  you will be able to hear stories of our past as well as a vis
 ion of the future of our beloved theater!</p>\n<p>Guests are invited to em
 brace the elegance and charm of the 1940s. Please join us in your best vin
 tage-inspired outfits\, or evening wear is suggested.</p>\n<p>The Dan Nix 
 Big Band\, a formidable 19-piece jazz ensemble\, is celebrated for its ele
 ctrifying performances and exceptional roster of talent. Known for hosting
  Grammy artists such as Jeff Hamilton\, Jon Hamar\, and Tamir Hendelman\, 
 the group has played at many events and venues across Indiana\, including 
 Circle of Lights and Fountain Square Theater. Their dynamic shows and soph
 isticated artistry are a testament to the vibrant modern jazz scene\, maki
 ng significant contributions to Indiana’s cultural landscape and establish
 ing themselves as a prominent force in jazz.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
