BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-123826@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:The Doobie Brothers have been rocking the world for more than 5
 0 years. Their brilliantly crafted songs create the rich tapestry of sound
  that has become life’s soundtrack for multiple generations. Their music h
 as developed through distinct phases\, with hard-rocking early 70s hits li
 ke China Grove giving way to the soulful and sophisticated material of the
  late 70s when Michael McDonald’s smooth vocals defined the Doobie Brother
 s’ sound. In 2021\, Minute by Minute was formed to pay tribute to this mus
 ical dynasty. This 7-piece live show was created with the simple goal of c
 apturing every nuance of a live Doobie Brothers performance. The talented 
 veteran musicians of Minute By Minute cover all eras of the Doobie Brother
 s with virtuosity and joy. Their love for the music is evident in every no
 te of this uplifting\, high-energy show. Minute by Minute will have you da
 ncing and singing! Join us at the Playhouse for a celebration of the music
  of one of the greatest rock bands of the last century!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240719T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240719T203000
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S Van Buren St\, Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Minute By Minute – The Ultimate Doobie Brothers Tribute
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/minute-by-minute-the-ultimate-doobie-brothers-tr
 ibute/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>The Doobie Br
 others have been rocking the world for more than 50 years. Their brilliant
 ly crafted songs create the rich tapestry of sound that has become life’s 
 soundtrack for multiple generations. Their music has developed through dis
 tinct phases\, with hard-rocking early 70s hits like China Grove giving wa
 y to the soulful and sophisticated material of the late 70s when Michael M
 cDonald’s smooth vocals defined the Doobie Brothers’ sound. In 2021\, Minu
 te by Minute was formed to pay tribute to this musical dynasty. This 7-pie
 ce live show was created with the simple goal of capturing every nuance of
  a live Doobie Brothers performance. The talented veteran musicians of Min
 ute By Minute cover all eras of the Doobie Brothers with virtuosity and jo
 y. Their love for the music is evident in every note of this uplifting\, h
 igh-energy show. Minute by Minute will have you dancing and singing! Join 
 us at the Playhouse for a celebration of the music of one of the greatest 
 rock bands of the last century!</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
