CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Bring some records\, turn the group on to your sounds. This is 
 an informal meeting of record enthusiasts\, with coffee being provided . D
 J’s are encouraged to play 3 selections or 15 minutes and talk about their
  technique.\nCollectors are encouraged to play a side or two and talk abou
 t their selection with the group.\nSome talking points include\; where did
  you purchase your record\, what sort of genre is it\, what makes this rec
 ord special to you or any other interesting facts about your collection.
