 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Bring some re
 cords\, turn the group on to your sounds. This is an informal meeting of r
 ecord enthusiasts\, with coffee being provided . DJ’s are encouraged to pl
 ay 3 selections or 15 minutes and talk about their technique.</p>\n<p>Coll
 ectors are encouraged to play a side or two and talk about their selection
  with the group.</p>\n<p>Some talking points include\; where did you purch
 ase your record\, what sort of genre is it\, what makes this record specia
 l to you or any other interesting facts about your collection.</p>\n</BODY
 ></HTML>
