BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-123818@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:A cute baby alligator named Ramon is scornfully flushed down th
 e toilet by a little girl’s father. Rejected by humanity\, Ramon grows up 
 in the city’s sewers\, feasting on the discarded bodies of hormone-pumped 
 lab animals from a shady corporation\, his metabolism\, and anger\, rising
  rapidly. Now Ramon’s time has come. He will have his revenge… on us! This
  Jawsploitation classic was written by John Sayles\, and stars Robert Fors
 ter in a role positively driven by male pattern baldness.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240725T190000
LOCATION:The Orbit Room\, 107 N College Ave\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Cicada Cinema presents: Alligator (1980)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/cicada-cinema-presents-alligator-1980/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><b>A cute bab
 y alligator named Ramon is scornfully flushed down the toilet by a little 
 girl’s father. Rejected by humanity\, Ramon grows up in the city’s sewers\
 , feasting on the discarded bodies of hormone-pumped lab animals from a sh
 ady corporation\, his metabolism\, and anger\, rising rapidly. Now Ramon’s
  time has come. He will have his revenge… on us! This Jawsploitation class
 ic was written by John Sayles\, and stars Robert Forster in a role positiv
 ely driven by male pattern baldness.</b></p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-123898@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy an evening with singer/songwriter duo Matthew and Gunnar 
 Nelson as they play acoustic versions of their hits! With Special Guest Ph
 il Pierle.\nVIP seating is “Front & Center” seats in the first 4 rows\nKno
 wn for their songwriting prowess and magnetic stage presence\, Matthew and
  Gunnar have captivated audiences worldwide with their exceptional talent.
  With one number-one hit and five top-10 singles under their belt\, along 
 with four number-one MTV videos and over five million records sold\, Nelso
 n is a force to be reckoned with in the music industry.\n \nThe musical jo
 urney of Matthew and Gunnar Nelson began at a young age\, honing their ski
 lls in vocal\, bass\, and drums while playing originals in the hayloft abo
 ve their parents’ Studio City California farm. Inspired by the vibrant Cal
 ifornia country rock movement and their father’s success with the classic 
 song “Garden Party\,” the twins dedicated themselves to music from an earl
 y age.\n \nToday\, as the seventh generation of entertainers in their fami
 ly\, Matthew and Gunnar Nelson embody the enduring legacy of America’s mos
 t extraordinary show business family. Their debut album\, “After The Rain\
 ,” catapulted them to stardom with its exceptional songwriting and commerc
 ially savvy rock sound. Their hit single (I Can’t Live Without Your) Love 
 and Affection made history\, securing the Nelsons’ place in the Guinness B
 ook of World Records as the only family to achieve a number-one record in 
 three successive generations.\n \nDon’t miss this incredible opportunity t
 o experience the magic of Nelson live at the historic Brown County Playhou
 se. Join in on an evening filled with unforgettable music\, mesmerizing pe
 rformances\, and the enduring legacy of a remarkable family.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240725T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240725T203000
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S Van Buren St\, Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:An Evening With Nelson
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/an-evening-with-nelson/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Enjoy an even
 ing with singer/songwriter duo Matthew and Gunnar Nelson as they play acou
 stic versions of their hits! With Special Guest Phil Pierle.</p>\n<p>VIP s
 eating is “Front & Center” seats in the first 4 rows</p>\n<p>Known for the
 ir songwriting prowess and magnetic stage presence\, Matthew and Gunnar ha
 ve captivated audiences worldwide with their exceptional talent. With one 
 number-one hit and five top-10 singles under their belt\, along with four 
 number-one MTV videos and over five million records sold\, Nelson is a for
 ce to be reckoned with in the music industry.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>The musica
 l journey of Matthew and Gunnar Nelson began at a young age\, honing their
  skills in vocal\, bass\, and drums while playing originals in the hayloft
  above their parents’ Studio City California farm. Inspired by the vibrant
  California country rock movement and their father’s success with the clas
 sic song “Garden Party\,” the twins dedicated themselves to music from an 
 early age.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Today\, as the seventh generation of entertai
 ners in their family\, Matthew and Gunnar Nelson embody the enduring legac
 y of America’s most extraordinary show business family. Their debut album\
 , “After The Rain\,” catapulted them to stardom with its exceptional songw
 riting and commercially savvy rock sound. Their hit single (I Can’t Live W
 ithout Your) Love and Affection made history\, securing the Nelsons’ place
  in the Guinness Book of World Records as the only family to achieve a num
 ber-one record in three successive generations.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Don’t mi
 ss this incredible opportunity to experience the magic of Nelson live at t
 he historic Brown County Playhouse. Join in on an evening filled with unfo
 rgettable music\, mesmerizing performances\, and the enduring legacy of a 
 remarkable family.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
