BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-123953@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Reimagining Opera for Kids is welcoming community members from 
 all over south central Indiana to sing\, play\, and participate behind the
  scenes for the 2024-25 season! A charming collection of Aesop’s Fables by
  Anthony Plog will offer many singing and instrumental roles. All voice ty
 pes and instruments are welcome in this community-based troupe that focuse
 s on bringing age appropriate performances to schools and community center
 s in south central Indiana.\nSign up for a time (singers and instrumentali
 sts) to meet the production team and audition on July 26 at MCPL:  https:/
 /calendly.com/ed–ddef/rok-community-auditions\n \nOr contact pm@reimaginin
 goperaforkids.org to set up a different day/time to audition or learn abou
 t behind-the-scenes opportunities!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240726T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240726T170000
LOCATION:MCPL Auditorium\, 303 E Kirkwood\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Reimagining Opera for Kids Call-Out
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/reimagining-opera-for-kids-call-out/
X-COST-TYPE:free
