 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Reimagining O
 pera for Kids is welcoming community members from all over south central I
 ndiana to sing\, play\, and participate behind the scenes for the 2024-25 
 season! A charming collection of Aesop’s Fables by Anthony Plog will offer
  many singing and instrumental roles. All voice types and instruments are 
 welcome in this community-based troupe that focuses on bringing age approp
 riate performances to schools and community centers in south central India
 na.</p>\n<p>Sign up for a time (singers and instrumentalists) to meet the 
 production team and audition on July 26 at MCPL:  <a href='https://nam12.s
 afelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcalendly.com%2Fed--ddef
 %2Frok-community-auditions&data=05%7C02%7Ckcarball%40iu.edu%7Ca747972eb64d
