CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:A Classic Rock show\, performed note for note to album perfecti
 on. Presented in an exciting concert format the way you remember it! Inspi
 red by 70’s arena Rock legends\, Led Zeppelin\, Pink Floyd\, Deep Purple\,
  Boston\, Styx\, plus other over-the-top classic icons!\nThe Classic Rock 
 Experience combines live theatrical aspects into an incredible audio and v
 isual production. The show creates an authentic 70’s rock concert recreati
 on in performing the greatest classic rock music anthems of the 1970’s!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240726T193000
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S Van Buren St\, Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:The Classic Rock Experience
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/the-classic-rock-experience/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>A Classic Roc
 k show\, performed note for note to album perfection. Presented in an exci
 ting concert format the way you remember it! Inspired by 70’s arena Rock l
 egends\, Led Zeppelin\, Pink Floyd\, Deep Purple\, Boston\, Styx\, plus ot
 her over-the-top classic icons!</p>\n<p>The Classic Rock Experience combin
 es live theatrical aspects into an incredible audio and visual production.
  The show creates an authentic 70’s rock concert recreation in performing 
 the greatest classic rock music anthems of the 1970’s!</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
