CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate the wonderful Jim with friends and family galore
 .\nPlease come to share your love and memories. This will be an opportunit
 y to laugh (loudly) and fraternize lovingly\, all in the spirit of Jim.\nA
  brief program will take place from 4:30-5\, where we will hear from Jim’s
  wife Erika\, son Johnathan\, and sister Dawn.\nAfterwards\, there will be
  room to snack\, play games\, make buttons\, look at photos\, and share in
  the love of Jim.\nThis event will take place in the Frangipani Room.
