 ) and fraternize lovingly\, all in the spirit of Jim.<br />\nA brief progr
 am will take place from 4:30-5\, where we will hear from Jim’s wife Erika\
 , son Johnathan\, and sister Dawn.<br />\nAfterwards\, there will be room 
 to snack\, play games\, make buttons\, look at photos\, and share in the l
 ove of Jim.<br />\nThis event will take place in the Frangipani Room.</p>
 \n</BODY></HTML>
