BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-124444@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:There will be 4 people per table with each round changing out o
 ne player to the next table. This will continue until everyone has had a c
 hance to play with each other\, to keep things fair and cordial\, with poi
 nts being tallied at the end of the final switch. A winner will then be de
 clared! This is for anyone familiar with Euchre and not new beginners. Not
  a player\, come hang out with us\, watch and maybe learn how to play for 
 the next time. Only those that pay the $5 entry will be scheduled and elig
 ible to play so that there is an even amount of players!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240802T183000
LOCATION:Morgenstern Books\, 849 Auto Mall Road\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Friday Nights at Morgenstern’s – Euchre Tournament
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/friday-nights-at-morgensterns-euchre-tournament/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>There will be
  4 people per table with each round changing out one player to the next ta
 ble. This will continue until everyone has had a chance to play with each 
 other\, to keep things fair and cordial\, with points being tallied at the
  end of the final switch. A winner will then be declared! This is for anyo
 ne familiar with Euchre and not new beginners. Not a player\, come hang ou
 t with us\, watch and maybe learn how to play for the next time. Only thos
 e that pay the $5 entry will be scheduled and eligible to play so that the
 re is an even amount of players!</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
