 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Emil Wakim is
  a stand-up comedian and writer based in Brooklyn\, NY by way of Bloomingt
 on\, Indiana. He recently made his late-night television debut on The Toni
 ght Show with Jimmy Fallon and can be seen on the latest season of Comedy 
