BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-123822@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:No filmmakers capture the playful chaos of action cinema’s Gold
 en Age like Andy and Arlene Sidaris (HARD TICKET TO HAWAII). When agent Pi
 casso Trigger (John Aprea\, THE GODFATHER: PART II) is killed by arch-crim
 inal Miguel Ortiz\, the Agency decides to send a trio of female agents out
  with the task of bringing Ortiz down. The ladies must use all of their sk
 ills\, specialized weaponry\, and physical attributes in order to track do
 wn Trigger’s killer! The follow-up to the invincible HARD TICKET TO HAWAII
 \, PICASSO TRIGGER is another over-the-top winner from exploitation cinema
 ’s most eminent power couple.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240815T190000
LOCATION:The Orbit Room\, 107 N College Ave\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Cicada Cinema presents: Picasso Trigger (1988)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/cicada-cinema-presents-picasso-trigger-1988/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><b>No filmmak
 ers capture the playful chaos of action cinema’s Golden Age like Andy and 
 Arlene Sidaris (HARD TICKET TO HAWAII). When agent Picasso Trigger (John A
 prea\, THE GODFATHER: PART II) is killed by arch-criminal Miguel Ortiz\, t
 he Agency decides to send a trio of female agents out with the task of bri
 nging Ortiz down. The ladies must use all of their skills\, specialized we
 aponry\, and physical attributes in order to track down Trigger’s killer! 
 The follow-up to the invincible HARD TICKET TO HAWAII\, PICASSO TRIGGER is
  another over-the-top winner from exploitation cinema’s most eminent power
  couple.</b></p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
