BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-125081@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Beth Stelling is a comedian\, writer and actress based in Los A
 ngeles. Her new Netflix special “If You Didn’t Want Me Then” topped every 
 ‘Best of 2023’ list. Her half-hour special is also on Netflix in the first
  season of The Standups. Conan O’Brien produced Beth’s previous hour speci
 al for HBO Max called “Girl Daddy.” Beth has been a writer for the followi
 ng television series: Rick and Morty\, Strange Planet\, The Last O.G.\, I 
 Love You America with Sarah Silverman\, Another Period and Crashing on HBO
 . She’s a sought-after punch-up writer for feature films following her suc
 cess as an on-set writer for the Universal hit\, Good Boys. She has guest 
 starred on Amazon’s Red Oaks\, Corporate on Comedy Central\, and she playe
 d Ms. Fish on the Peacock comedy Rutherford Falls.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240816T190000
LOCATION:Comedy Attic\, The Back Door\, The Atlas Ballroom\, Buskirk-Chumle
 y Theater
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20240817T190000
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Beth Stelling (shows at 7pm and 9:30pm)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/beth-stelling-shows-at-7pm-and-930pm/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Beth Stelling
  is a comedian\, writer and actress based in Los Angeles. Her new Netflix 
 special “If You Didn’t Want Me Then” topped every ‘Best of 2023’ list. Her
  half-hour special is also on Netflix in the first season of The Standups.
  Conan O’Brien produced Beth’s previous hour special for HBO Max called “G
 irl Daddy.” Beth has been a writer for the following television series: Ri
 ck and Morty\, Strange Planet\, The Last O.G.\, I Love You America with Sa
 rah Silverman\, Another Period and Crashing on HBO. She’s a sought-after p
 unch-up writer for feature films following her success as an on-set writer
  for the Universal hit\, Good Boys. She has guest starred on Amazon’s Red 
 Oaks\, Corporate on Comedy Central\, and she played Ms. Fish on the Peacoc
 k comedy Rutherford Falls.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
