BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-124928@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:“Marigold aims to highlight femininity in Jazz – especially my 
 own experiences as a female jazz trombonist – and my compositions combine 
 a variety of influences from modern jazz to my first musical inspirations 
 like Etta James\, J.J. Johnson\, and Earth Wind\, & Fire. My most recent r
 esearch (submitted for publication) on gender discrimination in jazz heavi
 ly influenced the desire to record my music\, as I discovered how few wome
 n were/are able to overcome the implicit biases of jazz culture\, oftentim
 es lacking opportunities to record their music.”
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240816T203000
LOCATION:The Bishop Bar\, 123 South Walnut St.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Leah Warman Album Release
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/leah-warman-album-release/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>“Marigold aim
 s to highlight femininity in Jazz – especially my own experiences as a fem
 ale jazz trombonist – and my compositions combine a variety of influences 
 from modern jazz to my first musical inspirations like Etta James\, J.J. J
 ohnson\, and Earth Wind\, & Fire. My most recent research (submitted for p
 ublication) on gender discrimination in jazz heavily influenced the desire
  to record my music\, as I discovered how few women were/are able to overc
 ome the implicit biases of jazz culture\, oftentimes lacking opportunities
  to record their music.”</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
