 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>A colorful co
 ncert featuring the flute—one of the most popular instruments in 18th-cent
 ury Europe in both concert and folk genres—this program explores Baroque m
 usic across continental Europe alongside Celtic music from Ireland and Sco
 tland\, all played on period instruments.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
