BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-125176@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:The opera takes place in a zoo of robot “animals” in a dome-cov
 ered city that is part of a worldwide network of such cities\, connected b
 y travel tubes\, sealed off from the outside.  The time is the late twenty
 -first century\, after humans\, afraid of the wild outside\, have moved in
 doors.\n​\nThe setting is a futuristic zoo populated not by animals but by
  robots in animal form. Mooch\, an orphan girl\, convinces the zookeeper t
 o hire her to fix the robots when they break down\, but she secretly repro
 grams them to be increasingly wild.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240822T123000
LOCATION:Parkview Church of the Nazarene\, 1750 IN-46\, Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Chamberfest Brown County Presents: Mooch the Magnificent\, a Childr
 en’s Opera for 3rd\, 4th and 5th graders
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/chamberfest-brown-county-presents-mooch-the-magn
 ificent-a-childrens-opera-for-3rd-4th-and-5th-graders/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>The opera tak
 es place in a zoo of robot “animals” in a dome-covered city that is part o
 f a worldwide network of such cities\, connected by travel tubes\, sealed 
 off from the outside.  The time is the late twenty-first century\, after h
 umans\, afraid of the wild outside\, have moved indoors.</p>\n<p>​</p>\n<p
 >The setting is a futuristic zoo populated not by animals but by robots in
  animal form. Mooch\, an orphan girl\, convinces the zookeeper to hire her
  to fix the robots when they break down\, but she secretly reprograms them
  to be increasingly wild.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
