CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Registration is required and participants must commit to attend
 ing as many of the sessions as possible. Participants must by age 65 and o
 lder.\nInstructor Kristin Thompson\, local musician and owner of Weed Patc
 h Music Company\, has created a curriculum and practice materials especial
 ly for older adults\, featuring large print music and songs we all know an
 d love.\nParticipants will learn:\nUkulele basics\, including chords\, str
 umming patterns and styles of playing\nCollaborative playing (jamming) wit
 h a goal of learning to confidently play together.\n8 ukulele songs and be
  ready to show off their new skills at a performance and reception at the 
 Library for family and friends.
