 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Regis
 tration is required and participants must commit to attending as many of t
 he sessions as possible. Participants must by age 65 and older.</strong><b
 r />\nInstructor Kristin Thompson\, local musician and owner of Weed Patch
  Music Company\, has created a curriculum and practice materials especiall
 y for older adults\, featuring large print music and songs we all know and
  love.</p>\n<p>Participants will learn:</p>\n<p>Ukulele basics\, including
  chords\, strumming patterns and styles of playing<br />\nCollaborative pl
 aying (jamming) with a goal of learning to confidently play together.<br /
 >\n8 ukulele songs and be ready to show off their new skills at a performa
 nce and reception at the Library for family and friends.</p>\n</BODY></HTM
 L>
