BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-125306@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Decades after the collapse of civilization\, the tyrannical Imm
 ortan Joe enslaves apocalypse survivors inside his the desert fortress. Wh
 en the warrior Furiosa (Charlize Theron) leads the despot’s five wives in 
 a daring escape\, she develops an unlikely alliance with Max (Tom Hardy)\,
  a loner and former captive. Fortified in a massive armored truck\, they t
 ry to outrun the ruthless warlord and his henchmen in a deadly high-speed 
 chase through the Wasteland. Winner of six Oscars\, Mad Max: Fury Road is 
 considered one of the best films of the 2010s—and one of the best action f
 ilms of all time—thanks in large part to its lead performances\, mind-blow
 ing physical stunts\, a narrative about the dangers of anti-environmentali
 sm\, and deeply felt emotional heft. [160 min\; action\, sci-fi\, adventur
 e\; English]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240823T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Movie: MAD MAX: FURY ROAD (in 3D)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/movie-mad-max-fury-road-3d/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Decades after
  the collapse of civilization\, the tyrannical Immortan Joe enslaves apoca
 lypse survivors inside his the desert fortress. When the warrior Furiosa (
 Charlize Theron) leads the despot’s five wives in a daring escape\, she de
 velops an unlikely alliance with Max (Tom Hardy)\, a loner and former capt
 ive. Fortified in a massive armored truck\, they try to outrun the ruthles
 s warlord and his henchmen in a deadly high-speed chase through the Wastel
 and. Winner of six Oscars\, Mad Max: Fury Road is considered one of the be
 st films of the 2010s—and one of the best action films of all time—thanks 
 in large part to its lead performances\, mind-blowing physical stunts\, a 
 narrative about the dangers of anti-environmentalism\, and deeply felt emo
 tional heft. [160 min\; action\, sci-fi\, adventure\; English]</p>\n</BODY
 ></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
