UID:ai1ec-125007@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Green Drinks Bloomington is a lively\, informal social networki
 ng event for people from all walks of life who are interested in making a 
 greener world. We gather monthly to share libations and dialogue\, explore
  ideas and make new friends and business connections. Join GDB on Wednesda
 y\, August 28\, to hear Dr. Michael Hamburger\, Professor of Earth and Atm
 ospheric Sciences at Indiana University\, and Dr. Adam Scribner\, Director
  of STEM Education Initiatives at Indiana University\, speak about educati
 ng for a changing climate.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240828T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240828T193000
LOCATION:Upland Brewing Company Wood Shop\, 354 W 11th St\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Green Drinks Bloomington
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/green-drinks-bloomington-3/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Green Drinks 
 Bloomington is a lively\, informal social networking event for people from
  all walks of life who are interested in making a greener world. We gather
  monthly to share libations and dialogue\, explore ideas and make new frie
 nds and business connections. Join GDB on Wednesday\, August 28\, to hear 
 Dr. Michael Hamburger\, Professor of Earth and Atmospheric Sciences at Ind
 iana University\, and Dr. Adam Scribner\, Director of STEM Education Initi
 atives at Indiana University\, speak about educating for a changing climat
 e.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
