BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-125439@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:$1 from each “Live at Buskirk-Chumley Theater” ticket sale will
  benefit a local nonprofit or cause. Proceeds from August’s show will be d
 onated to Indiana Recovery Alliance\, a drug-user human rights advocacy or
 ganization.\nMourning Star is a 5-piece stargaze band hailing from the Blo
 omington college scene. mourning star began their extra-terrestrial take o
 ver in February of 2024. They combine dreamy landscapes of sound with loud
  abrasive noise like a chainsaw cutting through a flower. Experimenting wi
 th different sounds\, visual performance\, and instrumentation\; every mou
 rning star show is a little bit different!\nFort Wayne alternative rock ba
 nd\, Seventh Cloud\, consists of five members creating a range of noise fr
 om traditional shoegaze to a heavier take on dream pop.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240829T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240829T210000
LOCATION:Buskirk Chumley Theater\, 114 E Kirkwood Ave.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Mourning Star and Seventh Cloud
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/mourning-star-and-seventh-cloud/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>$1 from each 
 “Live at Buskirk-Chumley Theater” ticket sale will benefit a local nonprof
 it or cause. Proceeds from August’s show will be donated to Indiana Recove
 ry Alliance\, a drug-user human rights advocacy organization.<br />\nMourn
 ing Star is a 5-piece stargaze band hailing from the Bloomington college s
 cene. mourning star began their extra-terrestrial take over in February of
  2024. They combine dreamy landscapes of sound with loud abrasive noise li
 ke a chainsaw cutting through a flower. Experimenting with different sound
 s\, visual performance\, and instrumentation\; every mourning star show is
  a little bit different!</p>\n<p>Fort Wayne alternative rock band\, Sevent
 h Cloud\, consists of five members creating a range of noise from traditio
 nal shoegaze to a heavier take on dream pop.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
