 e some collaborative fun with a bunch of supportive adults on a Thursday a
 fternoon?! Then join seasoned improvers\, Thomas Kelly\, Will Sonheim\, an
 d Alex Prichodko for a two-hour intensive workshop in which you’ll explore
  the power of emotion\, discover the heightened stakes of even the most mu
 ndane human interaction\, and follow the fun that is organically arising b
 etween you and scene partner without forcing it<strong>!</p>\n</BODY></HTM
 L>
END:VEVENT
