BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-125911@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:For one night only a gaggle of Chicago’s best improvisers will 
 create characters\, comedy\, and narrative inspired by the photography of 
 Clarissa Bonet! Clarisa’s exhibition\, titled Chasing Light\, draws on a m
 ix of lived experience\, observation\, and research contemplating topics s
 uch as pedestrianism\, anonymity\, urban planning\, surveillance\, and the
  divide between public and private space. In real-time our visiting improv
 isers will go back and forth with Clarissa using her photos and her explan
 ation of her journey to create them as the catalyst for silly scenes\, ear
 nest stories\, and hilarious scenarios ranging from the smallest meet-cute
  to the grandest odyssey!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240905T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240905T220000
LOCATION:FAR Center for Contemporary Arts\, 505 West 4th St.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Chasing Laughs: Comedy Inspired by Art Inspired by Life – Improv in
 spired by the photography of Clarissa Bonet
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/chasing-laughs-comedy-inspired-by-art-inspired-b
 y-life-improv-inspired-by-the-photography-of-clarissa-bonet/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>For o
 ne night only a gaggle of Chicago’s best improvisers will create character
 s\, comedy\, and narrative inspired by the photography of Clarissa Bonet! 
 Clarisa’s exhibition\, titled Chasing Light\, draws on a mix of lived expe
 rience\, observation\, and research contemplating topics such as pedestria
 nism\, anonymity\, urban planning\, surveillance\, and the divide between 
 public and private space. In real-time our visiting improvisers will go ba
 ck and forth with Clarissa using her photos and her explanation of her jou
 rney to create them as the catalyst for silly scenes\, earnest stories\, a
 nd hilarious scenarios ranging from the smallest meet-cute to the grandest
  odyssey!</strong></p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
