UID:ai1ec-122470@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Join the Bloomington Jazz Orchestra\, with guest artists Rachel
  Caswell and Carl Weinberg\, for a lovely evening concert in the Switchyar
 d Park bandshell!\nThe 20-piece adult big band is under the leadership of 
 Janis Stockhouse and is composed of many fine area jazz musicians. Their p
 rogram will include selections from the Basie\, Kenton\, Ellington\, Herma
 n\, and Gordon Goodwin big bands as well as others.\nBring a lawn chair an
 d some food and drinks\, the weather is forecasted to be beautiful!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240908T180000
LOCATION:Switchyard Park\, 1601 S Rogers St\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:An Evening with the Bloomington Jazz Orchestra
