X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Join the Bloo
 mington Jazz Orchestra\, with guest artists Rachel Caswell and Carl Weinbe
 rg\, for a lovely evening concert in the Switchyard Park bandshell!</p>\n<
 p>The 20-piece adult big band is under the leadership of Janis Stockhouse 
 and is composed of many fine area jazz musicians. Their program will inclu
 de selections from the Basie\, Kenton\, Ellington\, Herman\, and Gordon Go
 odwin big bands as well as others.</p>\n<p>Bring a lawn chair and some foo
 d and drinks\, the weather is forecasted to be beautiful!</p>\n</BODY></HT
 ML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
