CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Runner is the story of two young strangers finding each other a
 cross the vast American landscape when Haas meets Will after the sudden de
 ath of her father. Filmed in Indiana in 2021 and then premiered at TIFF in
  2022\, Runner has been in more than 100 festivals worldwide and was honor
 ed with the special jury prize at San Sebastian and the Ingmar Bergman Int
 ernational Debut Award at the Goteborg Film Festival.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240910T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Film: RUNNER (Q&A with the filmmaker to follow)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/film-runner-qa-with-the-filmmaker-to-follow/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Runner is the
  story of two young strangers finding each other across the vast American 
 landscape when Haas meets Will after the sudden death of her father. Filme
 d in Indiana in 2021 and then premiered at TIFF in 2022\, Runner has been 
 in more than 100 festivals worldwide and was honored with the special jury
  prize at San Sebastian and the Ingmar Bergman International Debut Award a
 t the Goteborg Film Festival. </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
