CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Sophie is a Boston-based musician and percussive dancer with a 
 singular approach to music. She was brought up in old time music and leans
  into the magnetism of the tradition through her innovative and curious ap
 proach. Franco-American musician and songwriter Jean-Baptiste brings an in
 ventive and unique Nouveau-Traditionelle approach to mandolin and guitar p
 laying. He charms crowds with his sense of humor\, folksy aphorisms\, and 
 most of all his masterful and seasoned playing.
