 e is a Boston-based musician and percussive dancer with a singular approac
 h to music. She was brought up in old time music and leans into the magnet
 ism of the tradition through her innovative and curious approach. Franco-A
 merican musician and songwriter Jean-Baptiste brings an inventive and uniq
 ue Nouveau-Traditionelle approach to mandolin and guitar playing. He charm
 s crowds with his sense of humor\, folksy aphorisms\, and most of all his 
 masterful and seasoned playing.</strong></p>\n</BODY></HTML>
