DESCRIPTION:Every year comrades (imprisoned and otherwise) run\, walk or ro
 ll 5 kilometers on the same day to create connections beyond the prison wa
 lls and raise money for those locked up inside.\nRDTW is a non-competitive
  event. Everyone is encouraged to participate according to their physical 
 preferences.\nBring a water bottle. Wear clothes you feel comfortable movi
 ng in.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240915T130000
LOCATION:Bryan Park\, 1001 S Henderson St\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Running Down the Walls 2024
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/rdtw-2024/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Every year co
 mrades (imprisoned and otherwise) run\, walk or roll 5 kilometers on the s
 ame day to create connections beyond the prison walls and raise money for 
 those locked up inside.<br />\nRDTW is a non-competitive event. Everyone i
 s encouraged to participate according to their physical preferences.<br />
 \nBring a water bottle. Wear clothes you feel comfortable moving in.</p>\n
 </BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
