X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Doubl
 e down with Claire Arbogast and Shana Ritter in the multimedia release of 
 two remarkable novels.<br />\nCoupled with powerful music and images\, hea
 r Arbogast and Ritter read from novels that are centuries apart but sister
 s in their resilient women standing firm in turbulent times.<br />\nArboga
 st’s “If Not the Whole Truth\,” called “historically rich with . . .searin
 g contemporary relevance” by Kirkus Reviews\, is releasing in bookstores a
 nd on Amazon on September 10.<br />\nRitter’s new edition of “In the Time 
 of Leaving\,” called “A captivating meditation on home\, leaving\, and lon
 ging full of beautiful writing\,” by readers\, will be available on Amazon
  in September.<br />\nQ&A\, Burning Convictions open mic\, book signing.</
 strong></p>\n</BODY></HTML>
