BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-125811@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:Brown County Music Center\; 812.988.5323 ext. 1\; boxoffice@brownco
 untymusiccenter.com\; https://www.browncountymusiccenter.com/events/detail
 /new-date-beth-hart
DESCRIPTION:Doors Open 6:00pm | Tickets purchased for original date will be
  honored.\nBeth wants to express her deep gratitude to everyone for their 
 patience and understanding while she tended to her health.\n_____\nGRAMMY®
 -nominated powerhouse vocalist Beth Hart is as real as it gets. In a music
  industry full of glossy production and airbrushed photoshoots\, this is o
 ne artist who throws down her cards\, shares her darkest secrets and invit
 es you to join her for the ride.\nNew fans might know Beth as the all-conq
 uering global icon\, dubbed “extraordinary” by The Times and “daring\, bro
 oding and angry” by The Guardian. But to understand her rollercoaster back
 story\, you need only read the War In My Mind lyric sheet.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240915T193000
LOCATION:Brown County Music Center\, 200 Maple Leaf Blvd\, Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Beth Hart
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/beth-hart/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Doors
  Open 6:00pm | Tickets purchased for original date will be honored.</stron
 g></p>\n<p>Beth wants to express her deep gratitude to everyone for their 
 patience and understanding while she tended to her health.<br />\n_____<br
  />\nGRAMMY®-nominated powerhouse vocalist Beth Hart is as real as it gets
 . In a music industry full of glossy production and airbrushed photoshoots
 \, this is one artist who throws down her cards\, shares her darkest secre
 ts and invites you to join her for the ride.</p>\n<p>New fans might know B
 eth as the all-conquering global icon\, dubbed “extraordinary” by The Time
 s and “daring\, brooding and angry” by The Guardian. But to understand her
  rollercoaster backstory\, you need only read the War In My Mind lyric she
 et.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
