  about the state of book bans and censorship in recognition of Banned Book
 s Week. </p>\n<p>With censorship and book bans on the rise\, it is becomin
 g increasingly important that we recognize and celebrate the value of our 
 freedom to read. The Education Library. The workshop on will discuss book 
 bans\, censorship\, and visual literacy strategies to produce successful d
 isplays for the showcase.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
