DESCRIPTION:Event by Elvin HOME/Lothlorien New Page\nWild Magick Gathering 
 is our annual community gathering in celebration of the harvest\, the end 
 of summer\, and the Autumnal Equinox. This year the festival is nicely boo
 kended by the Full Harvest Moon just before and the Equinox on the morning
  of the final day. There will be rituals\, workshops\, drumming\, and danc
 ing around the fire\, vendors selling their crafts and wares\, conversatio
 ns and laughter. Come join us in the changing colors beneath the trees of 
 Lothlorien!
