 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Event
  by Elvin HOME/Lothlorien New Page</strong><br />\nWild Magick Gathering i
 s our annual community gathering in celebration of the harvest\, the end o
 f summer\, and the Autumnal Equinox. This year the festival is nicely book
 ended by the Full Harvest Moon just before and the Equinox on the morning 
