BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-126142@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:https://cicadacinema.com/products/black-roses-september-19-orbit-ro
 om-7pm
DESCRIPTION:Synopsis: From the director of ROCK ’N’ ROLL NIGHTMARE comes a 
 different kind of heavy metal madness! All hell breaks loose when the meta
 l band Black Roses kicks off their tour by making a deal with the Devil hi
 mself. As the headbanging teens in the crowd begin turning into bloodthirs
 ty demons and the body count starts rising\, it’s up to their teacher to r
 estore order to their small town. A prime piece of 80s Satanic Panic canon
 \, BLACK ROSES features an all-metal soundtrack with original music by Liz
 zie Borden and\, as the original video box boasted\, “BLOODSHED\, RIOTS\, 
 and horrible MASS MURDERS!”\n*In partnership with The Orbit Room\, The Ame
 rican Genre Film Archive and Vulture Video\, our Cicada Underground series
  comes from the ethos that while as imperfect as the people who made them\
 , genre films deserved to be screened to both enrich our lives and have a 
 good time doing it!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240919T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240919T203000
LOCATION:Orbit Room\, downstairs at 107 N College Ave\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Cicada Cinema presents: Black Roses (1988)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/cicada-cinema-presents-black-roses/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div class='prod
 uct__description rte'>\n<p><strong>Synopsis</strong>: From the director of
  ROCK ’N’ ROLL NIGHTMARE comes a different kind of heavy metal madness! Al
 l hell breaks loose when the metal band Black Roses kicks off their tour b
 y making a deal with the Devil himself. As the headbanging teens in the cr
 owd begin turning into bloodthirsty demons and the body count starts risin
 g\, it’s up to their teacher to restore order to their small town. A prime
  piece of 80s Satanic Panic canon\, BLACK ROSES features an all-metal soun
 dtrack with original music by Lizzie Borden and\, as the original video bo
 x boasted\, “BLOODSHED\, RIOTS\, and horrible MASS MURDERS!”</p>\n<p><em>*
 In partnership with <strong><a href='https://www.facebook.com/orbitroombto
 wn/'>The Orbit Room</a></strong>\, <strong><a href='https://www.americange
 nrefilm.com/'>The American Genre Film Archive</a></strong> and <strong><a 
 href='https://instagram.com/vulturevideo'>Vulture Video</a></strong>\, our
  <strong>Cicada Underground</strong> series comes from the ethos that whil
 e as imperfect as the people who made them\, genre films deserved to be sc
 reened to both enrich our lives and have a good time doing it!</em></p>\n<
 /div>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
