DESCRIPTION:The Roy Sieber Symposium will focus on exploring the diverse di
 mensions of African art history\, and bring together leading scholars\, re
 searchers\, and experts in the field to engage in thought-provoking discus
 sions\, share research findings\, and foster collaboration—all in celebrat
 ion of the enduring legacy of Roy Sieber.\nThe Roy Sieber Symposium is sup
 ported by the African Studies Program\, the Department of Art History\, an
 d the Tanner-Opperman Fund in Honor of Roy Sieber.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240920T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240920T154500
