SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:The Roy Sieber Symposium
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/the-roy-sieber-symposium/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>The Roy Siebe
 r Symposium will focus on exploring the diverse dimensions of African art 
 history\, and bring together leading scholars\, researchers\, and experts 
 in the field to engage in thought-provoking discussions\, share research f
 indings\, and foster collaboration—all in celebration of the enduring lega
 cy of Roy Sieber.</p>\n<p><strong>The Roy Sieber Symposium is supported by
  the African Studies Program\, the Department of Art History\, and the Tan
 ner-Opperman Fund in Honor of Roy Sieber.</strong></p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
