CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:https://www.comedyattic.com/events/99002
DESCRIPTION:Door Time: 8:45 PM\nMax Manticof is a Latino and Jewish standup
  comedian\, writer\, and actor born and raised in Queens\, NY. He has been
  seen on Amazon Prime’s “Basement Yard” with host Joe Santagato\, as well 
 as “Lyft Comics” on Kevin Hart’s LOL Network. When he’s not headlining aro
 und the country Max has enjoyed touring with Tim Dillon\, Leonard Ouzts\, 
 Matt Rife\, and more. Known for his wildly popular “Street Talk Comedy” wh
 ich has since produced 100+ shows in 15+ cities around the country and was
  selected as a Just For Laughs New Face of Comedy in 2023.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240920T211500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240920T230000
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, upstairs at 123 S Walnut St\, Bloomington (4th 
 and Walnut)
RRULE:FREQ=DAILY;UNTIL=20240921T235959Z
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Max Manticof’s Comedy Attic Debut!
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/max-manticofs-comedy-attic-debut-lateshow/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Door 
 Time: 8:45 PM</strong><br />\nMax Manticof is a Latino and Jewish standup 
 comedian\, writer\, and actor born and raised in Queens\, NY. He has been 
 seen on Amazon Prime’s “Basement Yard” with host Joe Santagato\, as well a
 s “Lyft Comics” on Kevin Hart’s LOL Network. When he’s not headlining arou
 nd the country Max has enjoyed touring with Tim Dillon\, Leonard Ouzts\, M
 att Rife\, and more. Known for his wildly popular “Street Talk Comedy” whi
 ch has since produced 100+ shows in 15+ cities around the country and was 
 selected as a Just For Laughs New Face of Comedy in 2023.</p>\n</BODY></HT
 ML>
END:VEVENT
