BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-126953@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:THE ANNUAL CUSTOMER APPRECIATION DAY!\nCome and enjoy the Smith
 ville Farmers’ Market Customer Appreciation Day\, which will be filled wit
 h great items from the vendors\, good food\, great music and of course the
  raffle\, all as a thank you for the tremendous support this season! Stock
  up items from the vendors throughout the day and stay for grilled brats\,
  hot dogs\, drinks and more\, which will be free for all the customers. Al
 so\, don’t forget to get your name in for the raffle this week as well as 
 on the 21st\, for some nice handmade items. The market starts at 8am\, foo
 d starts cooking soon afterwards!!! Thanks again for all the community sup
 port this year!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240921T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240921T120000
LOCATION:7555 S Strain Ridge Rd\, Bloomington (up under the shelter)
