 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>THE ANNUAL CU
 STOMER APPRECIATION DAY!<br />\nCome and enjoy the Smithville Farmers’ Mar
 ket Customer Appreciation Day\, which will be filled with great items from
  the vendors\, good food\, great music and of course the raffle\, all as a
  thank you for the tremendous support this season! Stock up items from the
  vendors throughout the day and stay for grilled brats\, hot dogs\, drinks
  and more\, which will be free for all the customers. Also\, don’t forget 
 to get your name in for the raffle this week as well as on the 21st\, for 
 some nice handmade items. The market starts at 8am\, food starts cooking s
 oon afterwards!!! Thanks again for all the community support this year!</p
 >\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
