DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:https://www.bloomingtonwinterfarmersmarket.com/woolery-farmers-mark
 et
DESCRIPTION:The Double Standards – Dena El Saffar and Rick Maxwell will ser
 enade the market with jazz standards while you enjoy your morning shopping
  or relax with some breakfast and tea or coffee. Come sit and stay awhile\
 , with The Double Standards!\nSvetla and In Accord – Svetla Vladeva majore
 d in accordion and piano at the Academy of Music\, Dance and Fine Arts in 
 Plovdiv\, Bulgaria. In Accord is a diverse accordion quintet formed almost
  two decades ago. Together they will play a mix of traditional folk tunes 
 and various musical genres sure to delight!\n***This Week’s Vendors***\nAa
 haa Chai\, Brown County Coffee\, Brick House Bakery\, FirstLite Farm\, Gra
 ber’s Produce\, Heartland Family Farm\, Larissa Danielle\, Littlest Bird F
 arm\, Living Roots Farm\, Moon Pennies\, Muddy Fork Bakery\, Segovia\, The
  Chile Woman\, Wagler’s Produce
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240921T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240921T120000
