SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Woolery Farmers Market\, with music from Double Standards (8:30-10A
 M)\, Svetla and In Accord (10:30-Noon)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/woolery-farmers-market-2024-09-21/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>The D
 ouble Standards</strong> – Dena El Saffar and Rick Maxwell will serenade t
 he market with jazz standards while you enjoy your morning shopping or rel
 ax with some breakfast and tea or coffee. Come sit and stay awhile\, with 
 The Double Standards!</p>\n<p><strong>Svetla and In Accord</strong> – Svet
 la Vladeva majored in accordion and piano at the Academy of Music\, Dance 
 and Fine Arts in Plovdiv\, Bulgaria. In Accord is a diverse accordion quin
 tet formed almost two decades ago. Together they will play a mix of tradit
 ional folk tunes and various musical genres sure to delight!</p>\n<p>***Th
 is Week’s Vendors***<br />\nAahaa Chai\, Brown County Coffee\, Brick House
  Bakery\, FirstLite Farm\, Graber’s Produce\, Heartland Family Farm\, Lari
 ssa Danielle\, Littlest Bird Farm\, Living Roots Farm\, Moon Pennies\, Mud
 dy Fork Bakery\, Segovia\, The Chile Woman\, Wagler’s Produce</p>\n</BODY>
 </HTML>
