BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-126884@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:https://huntershoneyfarm.com/events/event/hunters-honey-farm-honey-
 harvest-festival//
DESCRIPTION:We’ve harvested our honey and invite you to watch us extract an
 d bottle this year’s crop.\nCome out to the honey farm and:\n – Watch a be
 ekeeper working in a live beehive\n – Watch us extract this year’s honey c
 rop\n – Have lunch at our Busy Bee Cafe\n – Enjoy family activities such a
 s pony rides\, horseback rides\, a pony cart\, carriage rides\, hayrides\,
  and more!\nThis year we’re celebrating 114 years of keeping bees in India
 na.\nPlease join us as we share the joys of the harvest season with our co
 mmunity!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240921T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240921T160000
LOCATION:Hunter's Honey Farm\, 6501 W Honey Ln\, Martinsville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Honey Harvest Festival
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/honey-harvest-festival-2024/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>We’ve harvest
 ed our honey and invite you to watch us extract and bottle this year’s cro
 p.<br />\nCome out to the honey farm and:<br />\n – Watch a beekeeper work
 ing in a live beehive<br />\n – Watch us extract this year’s honey crop<br
  />\n – Have lunch at our Busy Bee Cafe<br />\n – Enjoy family activities 
 such as pony rides\, horseback rides\, a pony cart\, carriage rides\, hayr
 ides\, and more!<br />\nThis year we’re celebrating 114 years of keeping b
 ees in Indiana.<br />\nPlease join us as we share the joys of the harvest 
 season with our community!</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
