BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-126855@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:812.322.2363\; thecatscloset1@gmail.com\; https://www.thecatscloset
 1.com/
DESCRIPTION:CATURDAY is a family friendly event for all ages! you can enjoy
  food from various food trucks\, shop from a variety of local small busine
 sses\, pet adoptable cats and even dance the night away with music and yar
 d games!\nCATURDAY is an adoption event to benefit the cats at the Greene 
 County Humane Society and The Cat’s Closet. Inside The Cat’s Closet you’ll
  be able to shop more vintage nostalgia and play with 20+ adoptable cats a
 nd kittens! This event helps us generate adoptions for the kitties at the 
 shelter that otherwise would be living on the streets or spending their yo
 uth in a cage. Even if you can’t adopt\, this event is still worth stoppin
 g by for good vibes and cat love!\nSpread the word to help us adopt as man
 y kitties as possible this September!\nCATURDAY is full of fun and funky v
 ibes for all. Follow our socials to stay updated on all things CATURDAY!!!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240921T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240921T170000
LOCATION:The Cat's Closet\, 223 S Pete Ellis Dr\, Suites 1 & 2 Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:CATURDAY
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/caturday/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>CATURDAY is a
  family friendly event for all ages! you can enjoy food from various food 
 trucks\, shop from a variety of local small businesses\, pet adoptable cat
 s and even dance the night away with music and yard games!</p>\n<p>CATURDA
 Y is an adoption event to benefit the cats at the Greene County Humane Soc
 iety and The Cat’s Closet. Inside The Cat’s Closet you’ll be able to shop 
 more vintage nostalgia and play with 20+ adoptable cats and kittens! This 
 event helps us generate adoptions for the kitties at the shelter that othe
 rwise would be living on the streets or spending their youth in a cage. Ev
 en if you can’t adopt\, this event is still worth stopping by for good vib
 es and cat love!</p>\n<p>Spread the word to help us adopt as many kitties 
 as possible this September!<br />\nCATURDAY is full of fun and funky vibes
  for all. Follow our socials to stay updated on all things CATURDAY!!!</p>
 \n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
