BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-126320@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Rain or Shine. Participants subject to change.\nJust like “mark
 et experiments” past\, the party in the parking lot of the shirt-shop-farm
 -stop duo will feature live music from local acts\, food\, drinks\, arts v
 endors\, craft activities\, free T-shirt printing (11:30-3:30\, if you bri
 ng your own shirt. blanks for sale.) and more. There will even be a limite
 d-edition Farm Stop shirt design available for printing. It’s a perfect en
 capsulation of Bloomington culture in a 7\,000-square-foot lot.\nMUSIC\n11
 :30 – Dusty Jacquet\n12:30 – Matt Lundquist (@mattlundquistmusic)\n1:30 – 
 Rearview Rhonda (@rearviewrhonda)\n2:30 – Hammer and the Hatchet (@hammera
 ndthehatchet)\n3:30 – Low Landers (@lowlanders_music)\nFOOD\n@orbit_room\,
  Top Shotta Jerk Chicken & Cuisine\, @planted_bloomington\, @bloomingtonfa
 rmstopcollective\nNON-FOOD VENDORS\n@blueasterstudio\, @byjeanelise\, @lle
