 g your own shirt. blanks for sale.) and more. There will even be a limited
 -edition Farm Stop shirt design available for printing. It’s a perfect enc
 apsulation of Bloomington culture in a 7\,000-square-foot lot.</p>\n<p><st
 rong>MUSIC</strong><br />\n11:30 – Dusty Jacquet<br />\n12:30 – Matt Lundq
