 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><blockquote><p>E
 at cake. Drink tea. Talk about Death. The Death Café is a group-directed d
 iscussion of death with no agenda\, objectives\, or themes. It is a discus
 sion group rather than grief support or counseling session. Bloomington’s 
 Death Café chapter is led by musician and hospice chaplain\, Rick Clayton\
 , and it meets monthly at Morgenstern Books.</p></blockquote>\n</BODY></HT
 ML>
END:VEVENT
