DESCRIPTION:American folk musicians Sally Rogers and Howie Bursen are comin
 g to Bloomington all the way from the migratory bird-laden marshes of Pomf
 ret\, Connecticut. Sally and Howie have been beloved performers for decade
 s\; their concerts feature original\, contemporary\, and traditional folk 
 songs and instrumentals\, accompanied by guitar\, mountain dulcimer\, banj
 o\, splendid voices and gorgeous harmonies\, spiced with plenty of humor.
 \n\n\nIf you have a lawn chair or blanket\, feel free to bring it along. P
 itch-in snacks are welcome.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240926T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240926T203000
LOCATION:416 E 1st St.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
