X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div>American fo
 lk musicians Sally Rogers and Howie Bursen are coming to Bloomington all t
 he way from the migratory bird-laden marshes of Pomfret\, Connecticut. Sal
 ly and Howie have been beloved performers for decades\; their concerts fea
 ture original\, contemporary\, and traditional folk songs and instrumental
 s\, accompanied by guitar\, mountain dulcimer\, banjo\, <i>splendid</i> vo
 ices and gorgeous harmonies\, spiced with plenty of humor.</div>\n<div></d
 iv>\n<div>\n<div>If you have a lawn chair or blanket\, feel free to bring 
 it along. Pitch-in snacks are welcome.</div>\n</div>\n</BODY></HTML>
