 et
DESCRIPTION:CANCELLED DUE TO STORMS\nJesse Jones is an Indiana-based singer
 -songwriter who enriches the dynamic music scene of Indianapolis with his 
 Folk and Alt-Country influences. Drawing from his Midwest roots\, he craft
 s heartfelt narratives in his songs that echo raw humanity\, profoundly co
 nnecting with his audience. Jess’s music is deeply personal\, powerfully e
 motive\, and available on his official site. Recognized on platforms like 
 Fox Network’s Indy Now\, his performances are well-received across Indiana
 .\nThe BurmaShaver(s) describe themselves as an “original new-wave Acousti
 c eccentric Americana folk-music duo”. Sounds pretty amazing\, right? Plus
 \, their music is available on all popular streaming services. Join us thi
 s Saturday for a real treat!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240928T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240928T120000
LOCATION:Woolery Mill\, 2250 W Sunstone Dr\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:[CANCELLED] Woolery Farmers Market\, with music from Jesse Jones (8
 :30-10AM) / The BurmaShaver(s) (10:30-Noon)
