X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>CANCE
 LLED DUE TO STORMS</strong><br />\n<strong><a href='https://jessejonestune
 s.bandcamp.com/' rel='noopener' target='_blank'>Jesse Jones</a></strong> i
 s an Indiana-based singer-songwriter who enriches the dynamic music scene 
 of Indianapolis with his Folk and Alt-Country influences. Drawing from his
  Midwest roots\, he crafts heartfelt narratives in his songs that echo raw
  humanity\, profoundly connecting with his audience. Jess’s music is deepl
 y personal\, powerfully emotive\, and available on his official site. Reco
 gnized on platforms like Fox Network’s Indy Now\, his performances are wel
 l-received across Indiana.</p>\n<p><strong><a href='https://theburmashaver
 s.com/' rel='noopener' target='_blank'>The BurmaShaver(s)</a></strong> des
 cribe themselves as an “original new-wave Acoustic eccentric Americana fol
 k-music duo”. Sounds pretty amazing\, right? Plus\, their music is availab
 le on all popular streaming services. Join us this Saturday for a real tre
 at! </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
