BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-126095@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:812.318.1236\; https://www.meditationinbloomington.org/fearless
DESCRIPTION:Fear and anxiety plague our world. As we deal with everything f
 rom minor insecurities and social anxiety to concerns about major world ev
 ents\, it’s hard to find a sense of safety and tranquility. Even worse\, o
 ur fears often stop us from doing what’s right for ourselves and others. 
 \nWe will also learn how to harness the five forces\, a special inner tool
 \, to bring about radical\, positive change in our life. Kadam Tom will hi
 ghlight key points from the teachings on the five forces given by Gen-la J
 ampa at the US Festival at IKRC Grand Canyon.\nThe retreat includes guided
  meditations\, short teachings as well as Q&A in the last session. Everyon
 e can benefit from this retreat — you don’t have to be Buddhist to partici
 pate.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240928T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240928T130000
LOCATION:Kadampa Meditation Center Bloomington\, 234 N Morton St\, Blooming
 ton
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Fearless Heart Meditation Retreat (In Person)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/fearless-heart-meditation-retreat-in-person/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Fear and anxi
 ety plague our world. As we deal with everything from minor insecurities a
 nd social anxiety to concerns about major world events\, it’s hard to find
  a sense of safety and tranquility. Even worse\, our fears often stop us f
 rom doing what’s right for ourselves and others. </p>\n<p>We will also lea
 rn how to harness the five forces\, a special inner tool\, to bring about 
 radical\, positive change in our life. Kadam Tom will highlight key points
  from the teachings on the five forces given by Gen-la Jampa at the US Fes
 tival at IKRC Grand Canyon.</p>\n<p>The retreat includes guided meditation
 s\, short teachings as well as Q&A in the last session. Everyone can benef
 it from this retreat — you don’t have to be Buddhist to participate.</p>\n
 </BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
