UID:ai1ec-126577@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:812.720.4840\; info@hardtruth.com\; https://hardtruth.com/event/har
 vest-festival/
DESCRIPTION:The event will move to the House of Rye in case of inclement we
 ather.\nCelebrating farmers with live music\, fall festivities\, and the t
 hird release of Hard Truth x Mellencamp Whiskey Co.\nSchedule:\nMeet the M
 akers: Meet-and-greet\, bottle signing with Hard Truth and Mellencamp Whis
 key Co.\, noon to 2 p.m.\n(A commemorative tasting glass will be given to 
 the first 100 guests to arrive.)\nThe Harvest Festival begins and whiskey 
 tent opens\, 2 p.m.\nLive Music\nStampede String Band\, 2-5 p.m.\nThe Clif
 fs\, 5:30-7 p.m.\nJustin Wells\, 7:30-9 p.m.\nEnjoy specialty fall cocktai
 ls and tastings of the new Hard Truth x Mellencamp Whiskey. Indulge in the
  s’mores station\, explore the autumn scenery with a hayride shuttle\, and
  get creative with pumpkin painting.\nVisit our whiskey tent for tastings\
 , carry-out bottles\, and relax in our cigar lounge.\nWe will have a varie
 ty of vendors in our marketplace\, offering pumpkins\, apple cider\, coffe
 e\, and more.\nWhether you’re here for the tastings\, family-friendly acti
 vities\, or to enjoy the beauty of fall\, our Harvest Festival promises a 
 day of fun and festivity.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240928T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240928T210000
LOCATION:Hard Truth Distillery\, 418 Old State Rd 46\, Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Harvest Festival\, featuring Stampede String Band\, The Cliffs\, Ju
 stin Wells
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/harvest-festival-featuring-stampede-string-band-
 the-cliffs-justin-wells/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><span style='
 text-decoration: underline'>The event will move to the House of Rye in cas
 e of inclement weather.</span><br />\n<strong>Celebrating farmers with liv
 e music\, fall festivities\, and the third release of Hard Truth x Mellenc
 amp Whiskey Co.</strong></p>\n<p>Schedule:<br />\nMeet the Makers: Meet-an
 d-greet\, bottle signing with Hard Truth and Mellencamp Whiskey Co.\, noon
  to 2 p.m.<br />\n(A commemorative tasting glass will be given to the firs
 t 100 guests to arrive.)<br />\nThe Harvest Festival begins and whiskey te
 nt opens\, 2 p.m.</p>\n<p>Live Music<br />\nStampede String Band\, 2-5 p.m
 .<br />\nThe Cliffs\, 5:30-7 p.m.<br />\nJustin Wells\, 7:30-9 p.m.</p>\n<
 p>Enjoy specialty fall cocktails and tastings of the new Hard Truth x Mell
 encamp Whiskey. Indulge in the s’mores station\, explore the autumn scener
 y with a hayride shuttle\, and get creative with pumpkin painting.</p>\n<p
 >Visit our whiskey tent for tastings\, carry-out bottles\, and relax in ou
 r cigar lounge.</p>\n<p>We will have a variety of vendors in our marketpla
 ce\, offering pumpkins\, apple cider\, coffee\, and more.</p>\n<p>Whether 
 you’re here for the tastings\, family-friendly activities\, or to enjoy th
 e beauty of fall\, our Harvest Festival promises a day of fun and festivit
 y.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
