BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-125620@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Sounds From the Black Hole is a concert series featuring experi
 mental music and explorations of sound.\nDIRECT MUTANT ACTION – Chicago tr
 io of Karissa Talanian\, Rush Falknor and Aaron Hovey.\nPsychedelic mindme
 lt freak jazz inspired by Acción Mutante (Álex de la Iglesia) + Action Dir
 ect (Masayuki Takayanagi) – Pure energy expanding outwards in every direct
 ion\, boundless world building until the radical collapse\, abstraction of
  Jazz & Sound\, seething energy unleashed and running free\, Fire Music to
  burn it all down\, to build a scorching nest for the Phoenix. DIRECT MUTA
 NT ACTION!\nXYLOCEPT – Project of Bloomington native Hazel Benton\, fka St
 roking Vines and member of the trio Without Whom. Hazel works with field r
 ecordings\, synth and bent electronics to create a blend of electronic\, a
 mbient and abstract soundscapes.\nhttps://xylocept.bandcamp.com/\nCRISPING
  LOVER – a new duo of longtime friends\, each of whom create unique and si
 ngular visions all on their own. Their collaboration is guaranteed to both
  mystify and entertain. Find their solo work under Rock N Roller Cola Wars
 \, Drekka\, Children of Scare-Midget\, 4k\, Alcorine of the Alps and more…
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240928T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240928T223000
LOCATION:The Orbit Room\, 107 N. College Ave.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Sounds From the Black Hole: Direct Mutant Action / Xylocept / Crisp
 ing Lover
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/sounds-from-the-black-hole-direct-mutant-action-
 xylocept-crisping-lover/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Sounds From t
 he Black Hole is a concert series featuring experimental music and explora
 tions of sound.</p>\n<p>DIRECT MUTANT ACTION – Chicago trio of Karissa Tal
 anian\, Rush Falknor and Aaron Hovey.<br />\nPsychedelic mindmelt freak ja
 zz inspired by Acción Mutante (Álex de la Iglesia) + Action Direct (Masayu
 ki Takayanagi) – Pure energy expanding outwards in every direction\, bound
 less world building until the radical collapse\, abstraction of Jazz & Sou
 nd\, seething energy unleashed and running free\, Fire Music to burn it al
 l down\, to build a scorching nest for the Phoenix. DIRECT MUTANT ACTION!<
 /p>\n<p>XYLOCEPT – Project of Bloomington native Hazel Benton\, fka Stroki
 ng Vines and member of the trio Without Whom. Hazel works with field recor
 dings\, synth and bent electronics to create a blend of electronic\, ambie
 nt and abstract soundscapes.<br />\n<a href='https://xylocept.bandcamp.com
 /' target='_blank' rel='noopener' data-saferedirecturl='https://www.google
 .com/url?q=https://xylocept.bandcamp.com/&source=gmail&ust=172504967507900
 0&usg=AOvVaw1TTX4oMYImSEjRiTx4cPes'>https://xylocept.bandcamp.com/</a></p>
 \n<p>CRISPING LOVER – a new duo of longtime friends\, each of whom create 
 unique and singular visions all on their own. Their collaboration is guara
 nteed to both mystify and entertain. Find their solo work under Rock N Rol
 ler Cola Wars\, Drekka\, Children of Scare-Midget\, 4k\, Alcorine of the A
 lps and more…</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
