 a (County Commissioner Dist. 3)\nMatt Pierce (IN House 61)\nJulie Thomas (
 County Commissioner Dist. 2)\nJoe Van Deventer (County Commissioner Dist. 
 3)\n\nCo-sponsors of the event are Greater Bloomington Chamber of Commerce
 \, League of Women Voters of Bloomington-Monroe County\, League of Women V
 oters of Brown County\, Monroe County Branch NAACP\, Monroe County NOW.
