 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Candidates fo
 r Indiana Senate\, Indiana House of Representatives\, and Monroe County Co
 mmissioner in November’s general election are invited. Candidates will res
 pond briefly to questions\, then meet and converse with voters. <strong>No
  registration required.</strong></p>\n<p>Confirmed participants <strong>in
 clude</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Michelle Higgs (IN House 60)</li>\n<li>Thom
 as Horrocks (IN House 62)</li>\n<li>Jody Madeira (County Commissioner Dist
 . 3)</li>\n<li>Matt Pierce (IN House 61)</li>\n<li>Julie Thomas (County Co
 mmissioner Dist. 2)</li>\n<li>Joe Van Deventer (County Commissioner Dist. 
