DESCRIPTION:All Ages | Dressing up and taking photos is encouraged! Themed 
 bracelet making kits for the first 24 guests.\nCoded Crafts is a new event
  series through Parks and Recreation that intends to bring people with sim
 ilar pop culture interests together while also discovering city parks. Tou
 r a different city park each month\, meet new friends\, and make and trade
  friendship bracelets. Learn how to bead while participating in pop cultur
 e trivia\, games\, and show and tell your fan items or stories with others
 !
