X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>All A
 ges | Dressing up and taking photos is encouraged! Themed bracelet making 
 kits for the first 24 guests.</strong><br />\n<strong>Coded Crafts</strong
 > is a new event series through Parks and Recreation that intends to bring
  people with similar pop culture interests together while also discovering
  city parks. Tour a different city park each month\, meet new friends\, an
 d make and trade friendship bracelets. Learn how to bead while participati
 ng in pop culture trivia\, games\, and show and tell your fan items or sto
 ries with others!</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
