DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:https://www.visitbloomington.com/things-to-do/downtown/food-truck-f
 riday/
DESCRIPTION:Food Truck Friday is a beloved Bloomington event — experience t
 he family-friendly community tradition yourself next time you visit B-Town
 .  \nSwing by to grab some delicious\, locally-made food\, enjoy the ameni
 ties at Switchyard Park\, and experience live music & performances from lo
 cal artists.\nLimited seating is available\, but bringing your own lawn ch
 air(s) is advised to ensure you have a place to sit. You do not have to pa
 y admission to attend Food Truck Friday — the only cost is the food and be
 verages you choose to purchase.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241004T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241004T200000
LOCATION:Switchyard Park\, 1601 S Rogers St\, Bloomington
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;UNTIL=20241025T235959Z;BYDAY=FR;WKST=MO
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Food Truck Friday
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/food-truck-friday-2024-10/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Food Truck Fr
 iday is a beloved Bloomington event — experience the family-friendly commu
 nity tradition yourself next time you visit B-Town.  </p>\n<p>Swing by to 
 grab some delicious\, locally-made food\, enjoy the amenities at Switchyar
 d Park\, and experience live music & performances from local artists.</p>
 \n<p>Limited seating is available\, but bringing your own lawn chair(s) is
  advised to ensure you have a place to sit. You do not have to pay admissi
 on to attend Food Truck Friday — the only cost is the food and beverages y
 ou choose to purchase. </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
