BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-126849@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:https://northstarcapoeira.com/new-page-1
DESCRIPTION:Please mark your calendars and plan on attending an amazing Afr
 o-Brazilian performance.\n“Coco Maduro” CD release and North Star Capoeira
  Angola Celebration will be happening on Friday the 4th and Saturday the 5
 th of October.\nOn Friday the 4th\, we are planning to start at 5pm with a
  reception open to the public to show a video with the process of CD recor
 ding\, followed by a Capoeira Angola performance Roda with participation o
 f two Brazilian Capoeira Masters – Mestre Deraldo from Boston and Mestre G
 rande from NY. We are planning on finishing around 8pm on the 4th.\nPlease
  come to watch\, to participate\, and increase your Capoeira Angola skills
  with these amazing Mestre’s. Coco Maduro our second CD will be available 
 for those interested. An event T-shirt will be available for purchase. Nor
 th Star Capoeira and Mestre Iuri invite you to be a part of Capoeira Angol
 a history.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241004T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241004T200000
LOCATION:Banneker Community Center\, 930 W 7th St\, Bloomington
RRULE:FREQ=DAILY;UNTIL=20241005T235959Z
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:North Star Capoeira Celebration and 2nd CD release event – Coco Mad
 uro
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/north-star-capoeira-celebration-and-2nd-cd-relea
 se-event-coco-maduro-2024-10-04/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Please mark y
 our calendars and plan on attending an amazing Afro-Brazilian performance.
 </p>\n<p class=''>“Coco Maduro” CD release and North Star Capoeira Angola 
 Celebration will be happening on Friday the 4th and Saturday the 5th of Oc
 tober.</p>\n<p class=''><strong>On Friday the 4th</strong>\, we are planni
 ng to start at 5pm with a reception open to the public to show a video wit
 h the process of CD recording\, followed by a Capoeira Angola performance 
 Roda with participation of two Brazilian Capoeira Masters – Mestre Deraldo
  from Boston and Mestre Grande from NY. We are planning on finishing aroun
 d 8pm on the 4th.</p>\n<p class=''>Please come to watch\, to participate\,
  and increase your Capoeira Angola skills with these amazing Mestre’s. Coc
 o Maduro our second CD will be available for those interested. An event T-
 shirt will be available for purchase. North Star Capoeira and Mestre Iuri 
 invite you to be a part of Capoeira Angola history.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
