BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-126930@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:David Sloma\, Gallery Coordinator at By Hand Gallery\; 812-334-3255
 \; managerbyhand@gmail.com\; https://www.byhandgallery.com
DESCRIPTION:October 4th-November 16th.\n‘Echoes in Watercolor’ Paintings by
  MinHsuan Peng\nMinHsuan Peng says . “This is my first solo show”. My pain
 ting reflects both the world around me but also who I am: it is like the w
 orld rains on me with pearls of thoughts and messages\, which bounce off t
 he unique angles of my mind and onto the paper.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241004T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241004T200000
LOCATION:By Hand Gallery\, inside Fountain Square Mall at 101 W Kirkwood Su
 ite 109\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Opening Reception: Gallery Walk Show
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/opening-reception-gallery-walk-show/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>October 4th-N
 ovember 16th.<br />\n<strong>‘Echoes in Watercolor’ Paintings by MinHsuan 
 Peng</strong><br />\nMinHsuan Peng says . “This is my first solo show”. My
  painting reflects both the world around me but also who I am: it is like 
 the world rains on me with pearls of thoughts and messages\, which bounce 
 off the unique angles of my mind and onto the paper.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
