DESCRIPTION:One of the MOST essential tools in a witch’s toolkit is their b
 roomstick! No there are plenty of places where one could purchase an alrea
 dy-built broom\, but what if you could create one yourself?\nJoin Miss Son
 ja as she walks you through creating your very own witch’s broom\, complet
 e with all the bits and bobs to make it special to you! Attendees are requ
 ired to bring their own broomstick\, measuring at least 3-5 feet long. Oth
 er materials will be provided.\nThis class is available for 10 seats\, so 
 sign up before the bats leave the belfrey! Tickets are $65 each\, and you 
 get to take home your very own witch’s broom.
