UID:ai1ec-126264@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:812.988.5323 ext 1\; boxoffice@browncountymusiccenter.com\; https:/
 /www.browncountymusiccenter.com/events/detail/one-night-in-memphis
DESCRIPTION:Door Time 6:30 PM\n“One Night in Memphis” features over 90 minu
 tes of pure rockabilly\, country\, gospel and rock and roll in a very auth
 entic and energetic presentation featuring nationally known talent. The sh
 ow recreates that magical night of December 4\, 1956 when Elvis Presley\, 
 Carl Perkins\, Jerry Lee Lewis and Johnny Cash found themselves jamming at
  Sam Phillip’s Sun Studios in Memphis\, TN. Little did they know that thei
 r jam session was being recorded and preserved for all time\, representing
  all the performers in their prime and the very best music of that time.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241005T200000
LOCATION:Brown County Music Center\, 200 Maple Leaf Blvd\, Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:One Night in Memphis: The official and number one tribute to Elvis 
 Presley\, Carl Perkins\, Jerry Lee Lewis and Johnny Cash
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/one-night-in-memphis-the-official-and-number-one
 -tribute-to-elvis-presley-carl-perkins-jerry-lee-lewis-and-johnny-cash/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Door 
 Time 6:30 PM</strong><br />\n“One Night in Memphis” features over 90 minut
 es of pure rockabilly\, country\, gospel and rock and roll in a very authe
 ntic and energetic presentation featuring nationally known talent. The sho
 w recreates that magical night of December 4\, 1956 when Elvis Presley\, C
 arl Perkins\, Jerry Lee Lewis and Johnny Cash found themselves jamming at 
 Sam Phillip’s Sun Studios in Memphis\, TN. Little did they know that their
  jam session was being recorded and preserved for all time\, representing 
 all the performers in their prime and the very best music of that time.</p
 >\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
