UID:ai1ec-126470@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:https://www.comedyattic.com/shows/280601
DESCRIPTION:Door Time: 7:00 PM\nFrom Louisville\, the savagely funny Holly 
 Lynnea brings a biting wit and steely-eyed confidence honed over years in 
 the game. She is also a writer and actress who can be seen on Kevin Hart’s
  Laugh Out Loud Network show\, “You Look Like”\, “Stand Up Nashville” on t
 he Peacock Network and on the FOX network show\, “Laughs”. She regularly o
 pens for Roy Wood Jr. and tours with Chelsea Handler. Holly’s wisened and 
 commanding stage presence makes seeing her live truly unforgettable.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241010T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241010T214500
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, upstairs at 123 S Walnut St\, Bloomington (4th 
 and Walnut)
SEQUENCE:0
