X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Door 
 Time: 7:00 PM</strong><br />\nFrom Louisville\, the savagely funny Holly L
 ynnea brings a biting wit and steely-eyed confidence honed over years in t
 he game. She is also a writer and actress who can be seen on Kevin Hart’s 
 Laugh Out Loud Network show\, “You Look Like”\, “Stand Up Nashville” on th
 e Peacock Network and on the FOX network show\, “Laughs”. She regularly op
 ens for Roy Wood Jr. and tours with Chelsea Handler. Holly’s wisened and c
 ommanding stage presence makes seeing her live truly unforgettable.</p>\n<
 /BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
