BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-126928@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:https://www.bloomingtonwinterfarmersmarket.com/woolery-farmers-mark
 et
DESCRIPTION:Deke Hager and Phil Starkey\, both of the band GOUT\, will perf
 orm two sets of originals and a mix of classic folk\, blues\, and some Ame
 ricana Classics.\nDeke and Phil are both long time veterans of the regiona
 l music scene in various bands and guises. Since 2015 or so they have been
  playing together in local rock band GOUT playing most original songs they
  made up with fellow members Brad Wilhelm and Michael Schunn. They release
 d a demo of songs some years back and will probably do some more stuff lik
 e that in the future.\nOn October 12\, Deke and Phil will play some jams t
 hat appeared on the Ventilators (longtime band Deke was in) 2006 album rel
 ease\, as well as a couple from the 2012 album release “Songs of the Seas”
  by the Pirate Flags\, where Deke appears as ‘Captain Angus Neckbone.’\nAl
 so included in the 2 sets will be newer material from GOUT\, as well as tr
 aditional folk and blues and some old rock and roll songs.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241012T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241012T120000
LOCATION:Woolery Mill front lot\, 2250 W Sunstone Dr\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Woolery Farmers’ Market\, with music from Deke Hager + Phil Starkey
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/woolery-farmers-market-2024-10-12/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Deke 
 Hager and Phil Starkey\, both of the band GOUT</strong>\, will perform two
  sets of originals and a mix of classic folk\, blues\, and some Americana 
 Classics.</p>\n<p>Deke and Phil are both long time veterans of the regiona
 l music scene in various bands and guises. Since 2015 or so they have been
  playing together in local rock band GOUT playing most original songs they
  made up with fellow members Brad Wilhelm and Michael Schunn. They release
 d a demo of songs some years back and will probably do some more stuff lik
 e that in the future.</p>\n<p>On October 12\, Deke and Phil will play some
  jams that appeared on the Ventilators (longtime band Deke was in) 2006 al
 bum release\, as well as a couple from the 2012 album release “Songs of th
 e Seas” by the Pirate Flags\, where Deke appears as ‘Captain Angus Neckbon
 e.’</p>\n<p>Also included in the 2 sets will be newer material from GOUT\,
  as well as traditional folk and blues and some old rock and roll songs.</
 p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
