 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Welco
 me to the Second Annual Witch Faire!</strong><br />\nThe Witch Faire is a 
 yearly trade show where all things witchy and spooky are on display. We ha
 ve vendors from all across the states\, including several local vendors th
 at are favorites.</p>\n<p>Come peruse unique wares\, get a reading from ou
 r diviners\, and show off your costumes in our costume contest! Bring the 
