DESCRIPTION:2024 Cider Fest and 15th Anniversary at the Orchard! Celebrate 
 with cider tastings\, apple treats\, and fun activities for all ages. Enjo
 y guided tours\, live music\, pumpkin painting\, and more! Let’s make unfo
 rgettable memories together!\nThere will be an Orchard tour with Q&A\, loc
 al apple and cider tastings (BYOMug!)\, a community potluck with some spec
 ial guests and locally baked goodies\, as well as activities for the whole
  family (e.g.\, pumpkin and face painting\, games\, haikus\, and a free ra
 ffle). And\, with Halloween just around the corner\, we also welcome famil
 ies to come in costume!
