 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>2024 Cider Fe
 st and 15th Anniversary at the Orchard! Celebrate with cider tastings\, ap
 ple treats\, and fun activities for all ages. Enjoy guided tours\, live mu
 sic\, pumpkin painting\, and more! Let’s make unforgettable memories toget
 her!</p>\n<p>There will be an Orchard tour with Q&A\, local apple and cide
 r tastings (BYOMug!)\, a community potluck with some special guests and lo
 cally baked goodies\, as well as activities for the whole family (e.g.\, p
 umpkin and face painting\, games\, haikus\, and a free raffle). And\, with
