DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:Brown County Playhouse\; 812.988.6555\; info@browncountyplayhouse.o
 rg\; https://browncountyplayhouse.org/event/uncaged-zac-brown-tribute/
DESCRIPTION:Experience the electrifying energy of “Uncaged: Zac Brown Tribu
 te” that captures the essence of Zac Brown Band’s signature sound\, bringi
 ng you all the chart-topping hits and soulful melodies you know and love. 
 From “Chicken Fried” to “Colder Weather\,” every song is performed with pa
 ssion and precision\, making you feel like you’re at a live Zac Brown Band
  concert. Whether you’re a die-hard fan or just love great country music\,
  “Uncaged” promises a night of unforgettable music\, camaraderie\, and pur
 e entertainment.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241018T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241018T213000
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S Van Buren St\, Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Uncaged – Zac Brown Tribute
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/uncaged-zac-brown-tribute/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Experience th
 e electrifying energy of “Uncaged: Zac Brown Tribute” that captures the es
 sence of Zac Brown Band’s signature sound\, bringing you all the chart-top
 ping hits and soulful melodies you know and love. From “<strong>Chicken Fr
 ied</strong>” to “<strong>Colder Weather</strong>\,” every song is perform
 ed with passion and precision\, making you feel like you’re at a live Zac 
 Brown Band concert. Whether you’re a die-hard fan or just love great count
 ry music\, “Uncaged” promises a night of unforgettable music\, camaraderie
 \, and pure entertainment.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
