DESCRIPTION:Join us for a spooktacular time at Spring Mill State Park’s Sca
 recrow Weekend!\nBuild a scarecrow and place it in the village\, carve a p
 umpkin\, make a cornhusk scarecrow\, make a rag doll ghost\, and/or make a
  leather craft. Times for these fun fall activities will be posted in the 
 village on the day of the event. Pick up a schedule for the Scarecrow Week
 end events at the Grissom Memorial Office or the Grist Mill.\n*The village
  closes at 3 pm to prepare for Haunted Village*\n3:30 PM: Costume Parade i
 n the campground – Dress up in costume and arrive at the campground amphit
 heater no later than\n3:20 pm to be a part of this fun parade! Public welc
 ome.\n7:30 PM: Haunted Village – MUST HAVE PREPURCHASED TICKET TO ATTEND. 
 See details of the event on our calendar under the title\, “Haunted Villag
 e”.
