 illage on the day of the event. Pick up a schedule for the Scarecrow Weeke
 nd events at the Grissom Memorial Office or the Grist Mill.</p>\n<p>*The v
 illage closes at 3 pm to prepare for Haunted Village*<br />\n3:30 PM: Cost
 ume Parade in the campground – Dress up in costume and arrive at the campg
