DESCRIPTION:Presented by Resilience Productions and Monroe County History C
 enter\nThis original play exposes the contentious relationship between Bla
 ck and White suffrage movement leaders. It shows how two groups fighting f
 or a common good but whose differing worldviews created a yawning chasm re
 sulting in irreparable damage.\nWritten by Gladys DeVane (In Collaboration
  with Danielle Bruce) | Directed by Danielle Bruce\nWith Post-Show TalkBac
 k and Reception
