DESCRIPTION:IU Underground Film series\n\nQuite possibly cinema’s first fea
 ture length horror film\, this silent surreal fantasy of Dante’s Inferno h
 as stirred fear\, censorship\, and controversy since it was released in 19
 11. Returning to IU Cinema are the “musical shape shifters” Montopolis. Th
 e indie chamber music group from Texas is visiting Bloomington as part of 
 their national tour\, providing immersive live music for the delight and f
 right of cinema lovers across the country.
