 inema’s first feature length horror film\, this silent surreal fantasy of 
 Dante’s Inferno has stirred fear\, censorship\, and controversy since it w
 as released in 1911. Returning to IU Cinema are the “musical shape shifter
 s” Montopolis. The indie chamber music group from Texas is visiting Bloomi
 ngton as part of their national tour\, providing immersive live music for 
