 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>DOOR 
 TIME 7 pm</strong><br />\nThe Indiana University Latin Jazz Ensemble is a 
 22-piece ensemble led by trombonist Wayne Wallace and rhythm section coach
  Andy Miller. The ensemble plays the best of Afro-Caribbean dance music\, 
 as well as Latin Jazz from throughout the African diaspora.<br />\nPlease 
