BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-128102@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Q & A to follow. \nGlauber “Pro” Contessoto—an immigrant workin
 g multiple jobs and living in a 220-square-foot apartment—invests in the c
 ryptocurrency Dogecoin and soon becomes a millionaire and a hero to his gr
 owing YouTube following. While it’s easy to get rich online\, though\, as 
 Pro will soon discover\, it’s even easier to lose it all. This is Not Fina
 ncial Advice exposes the startling risks and rewards of today’s market thr
 ough expert commentary and the anxiety-inducing stories of real people try
 ing to make millions.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241022T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Documentary Film: THIS IS NOT FINANCIAL ADVICE
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/documentary-film-this-is-not-financial-advice/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Q & A
  to follow. </strong></p>\n<p>Glauber “Pro” Contessoto—an immigrant workin
 g multiple jobs and living in a 220-square-foot apartment—invests in the c
 ryptocurrency Dogecoin and soon becomes a millionaire and a hero to his gr
 owing YouTube following. While it’s easy to get rich online\, though\, as 
 Pro will soon discover\, it’s even easier to lose it all. <i>This is Not F
 inancial Advice</i> exposes the startling risks and rewards of today’s mar
 ket through expert commentary and the anxiety-inducing stories of real peo
 ple trying to make millions.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
