BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-127198@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:https://cicadacinema.com/products/slumber-party-massacre-october-24
 -orbit-room-7pm
DESCRIPTION:18+\nSynopsis: Amy Holden Jones turned down an editing job on E
 .T. to direct this movie. She made the right choice. Written as a commenta
 ry on the inherent sexism of slashers by feminist icon Rita Mae Brown (but
  shot completely straight)\, THE SLUMBER PARTY MASSACRE is a terrific insi
 de joke that also delivers the goods as a skid row photocopy of Halloween 
 — complete with a killer who gets figuratively castrated when the tip of h
 is power drill is hacked off. With its stylized photography\, plot points 
 that involve pizza\, and endlessly cool homemade synth score\, THE SLUMBER
  PARTY MASSACRE is a drop-dead masterpiece of subversive trash-horror.\n*I
 n partnership with The Orbit Room\, The American Genre Film Archive and Vu
 lture Video\, our Cicada Underground series comes from the ethos that whil
 e as imperfect as the people who made them\, genre films deserved to be sc
 reened to both enrich our lives and have a good time doing it!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241024T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241024T203000
LOCATION:The Orbit Room\, downstairs at 107 N College\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Cicada Underground presents: Slumber Party Massacre (1982)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/cicada-underground-presents-slumber-party-massac
 re-1982/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>18+<br />\n<s
 trong>Synopsis: </strong>Amy Holden Jones turned down an editing job on E.
 T. to direct this movie. She made the right choice. Written as a commentar
 y on the inherent sexism of slashers by feminist icon Rita Mae Brown (but 
 shot completely straight)\, THE SLUMBER PARTY MASSACRE is a terrific insid
 e joke that also delivers the goods as a skid row photocopy of Halloween —
  complete with a killer who gets figuratively castrated when the tip of hi
 s power drill is hacked off. With its stylized photography\, plot points t
 hat involve pizza\, and endlessly cool homemade synth score\, THE SLUMBER 
 PARTY MASSACRE is a drop-dead masterpiece of subversive trash-horror.</p>
 \n<p>*In partnership with The Orbit Room\, The American Genre Film Archive
  and Vulture Video\, our Cicada Underground series comes from the ethos th
 at while as imperfect as the people who made them\, genre films deserved t
 o be screened to both enrich our lives and have a good time doing it!</p>
 \n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-126966@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:https://www.comedyattic.com/shows/279046
DESCRIPTION:Door Time: 6:00 PM\nDerek Sheen is a cuddly mess of undiagnosed
  trauma and insecurity\, and a gifted\, one-of-a-kind storyteller. His abi
 lity to mine humor from the dank\, humid corners of the human condition ha
 s made him a cult favorite of comedy nerds around the globe.\nSheen has re
 leased four critically acclaimed albums with Minneapolis-based Stand Up! R
 ecords\, produced by Grammy nominees Dan Schlissel and also Matt Bayless (
 Mastodon\, Minus The Bear). He can be heard on Sirius/XM and seen on Amazo
 n Prime and has toured nationally with his comedy heroes Brian Posehn and 
 Patton Oswalt.\nThis Fall Sheen will embark on a national tour for his new
  show\, “MotherL*ver”\, about finding laughter in the darkest places imagi
 nable: grief and loss. It’s actually more fun than it sounds! Richard Lano
 ie of Serious Comedy Site – “Sheen more than proves there are still some g
 reat\, original\, and intelligently dark comics out there.”
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241024T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241024T204500
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, upstairs at 123 S Walnut St\, Bloomington (4th 
 and Walnut)
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Derek Sheen Makes His Comedy Attic Debut!
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/derek-sheen-makes-his-comedy-attic-debut/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Door 
 Time: 6:00 PM</strong><br />\nDerek Sheen is a cuddly mess of undiagnosed 
 trauma and insecurity\, and a gifted\, one-of-a-kind storyteller. His abil
 ity to mine humor from the dank\, humid corners of the human condition has
  made him a cult favorite of comedy nerds around the globe.</p>\n<p>Sheen 
 has released four critically acclaimed albums with Minneapolis-based Stand
  Up! Records\, produced by Grammy nominees Dan Schlissel and also Matt Bay
 less (Mastodon\, Minus The Bear). He can be heard on Sirius/XM and seen on
  Amazon Prime and has toured nationally with his comedy heroes Brian Poseh
 n and Patton Oswalt.</p>\n<p>This Fall Sheen will embark on a national tou
 r for his new show\, “MotherL*ver”\, about finding laughter in the darkest
  places imaginable: grief and loss. It’s actually more fun than it sounds!
  Richard Lanoie of Serious Comedy Site – “Sheen more than proves there are
  still some great\, original\, and intelligently dark comics out there.”</
 p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
