 l defenses and create your own magic slime! Walk through our Fear Factor T
 ent of creepy\, crawling\, chomping animals. Enjoy fall fun yard games\, c
 rafts\, and face painting.<br />\n<strong>7 pm: Spooky Movie Night- (Event
 ) </strong>Come see the movie showing on a big screen in the Sycamore Room
