DESCRIPTION:“Murder Along the Monon” explores the 1923 murder of Mitchell p
 oliceman William Sutherlin through a historic walk with costumed reenactor
 s and a presentation by Believe Paranormal of the results of their investi
 gation into sites relevant to the murder. A light supper will also be serv
 ed. Tickets will be on sale at the beginning of October at the Lawrence Co
 unty Museum.
