 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>“Murder Along
  the Monon” explores the 1923 murder of Mitchell policeman William Sutherl
 in through a historic walk with costumed reenactors and a presentation by 
