CONTACT:https://www.comedyattic.com/events/98998
DESCRIPTION:Door Time: 6:00 PM\nPunkie Johnson is a comedian and writer fro
 m New Orleans\, Louisiana who joined the cast of SATURDAY NIGHT LIVE in 20
 20. She also appeared on season 2 of HBO Max’s critically acclaimed series
 \, LOVE LIFE\, where her performance was hailed by Time Magazine as a “par
 ticular stand out.” Past credits include SPACE FORCE (Netflix)\, A BLACK L
 ADY SKETCH SHOW (HBO)\, and BILL BURR PRESENTS: THE RINGERS (Comedy Centra
 l). Punkie also served as a writer/consultant on Peacock’s upcoming series
  reboot QUEER AS FOLK. Punkie can next be seen in Orion’s BOTTOMS\, direct
 ed by Emma Seligman (Shiva Baby) and produced by Elizabeth Banks’s Brownst
 one Productions.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241025T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241025T204500
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, upstairs at 123 S Walnut St\, Bloomington (4th 
 and Walnut)
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:SPECIAL EVENT – Saturday Night Live’s Punkie Johnson Returns to The
  Comedy Attic!
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/saturday-night-lives-punkie-johnson-returns-to-t
 he-comedy-attic-earlyshow/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Door 
 Time: 6:00 PM</strong><br />\nPunkie Johnson is a comedian and writer from
  New Orleans\, Louisiana who joined the cast of SATURDAY NIGHT LIVE in 202
 0. She also appeared on season 2 of HBO Max’s critically acclaimed series\
 , LOVE LIFE\, where her performance was hailed by Time Magazine as a “part
 icular stand out.” Past credits include SPACE FORCE (Netflix)\, A BLACK LA
 DY SKETCH SHOW (HBO)\, and BILL BURR PRESENTS: THE RINGERS (Comedy Central
 ). Punkie also served as a writer/consultant on Peacock’s upcoming series 
 reboot QUEER AS FOLK. Punkie can next be seen in Orion’s BOTTOMS\, directe
 d by Emma Seligman (Shiva Baby) and produced by Elizabeth Banks’s Brownsto
 ne Productions.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
