 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>There will be
  singing from both the 1991 revision The Sacred Harp and The Shenandoah Ha
 rmony. Loaner song books will be available. Feel free to drop by to observ
 e if you have limited time!<br />\nDoors will be open around 9am and are a
 sking everyone to register even if not leading a song.<br />\nThere will b
