BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-127172@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:Bill Ream\; 812-349-3748\; reamw@bloomington.in.gov\; https://bloom
 ington.in.gov/parks/events/pumpkin-launch
DESCRIPTION:Gates open at 11 a.m. Launching begins at noon.\nFall has arriv
 ed and pumpkins are flying in the skies over the Monroe County Fairgrounds
 ! \nLauncher teams send pumpkins soaring through the air in competitions f
 or distance and accuracy. Get a team together to build and enter a pumpkin
  launching device! Cannons and chemically powered launchers are NOT permit
 ted.\nNot a builder? Not to worry! Watch the competitions\, and see pumpki
 ns splatter to the ground when we drop them from a bucket truck.\nThere is
  plenty more to do and see at the Pumpkin Launch\, including a children’s 
 area with fall-themed activities\, live music\, food vendors\, and the fes
 tive feel of fall.\nBring a lawn chair\, sit back\, and be amazed by launc
 h device ingenuity!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241026T110000
LOCATION:Monroe County Fairgrounds\, 5700 W Airport Rd\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Bloomington Pumpkin Launch
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/bloomington-pumpkin-launch-2024/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Gates
  open at 11 a.m. Launching begins at noon.</strong></p>\n<p>Fall has arriv
 ed and pumpkins are flying in the skies over the Monroe County Fairgrounds
 ! </p>\n<p>Launcher teams send pumpkins soaring through the air in competi
 tions for distance and accuracy. Get a team together to build and enter a 
 pumpkin launching device! Cannons and chemically powered launchers are NOT
  permitted.</p>\n<p>Not a builder? Not to worry! Watch the competitions\, 
 and see pumpkins splatter to the ground when we drop them from a bucket tr
 uck.</p>\n<p>There is plenty more to do and see at the Pumpkin Launch\, in
 cluding a children’s area with fall-themed activities\, live music\, food 
 vendors\, and the festive feel of fall.</p>\n<p>Bring a lawn chair\, sit b
 ack\, and be amazed by launch device ingenuity!</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
