CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Sounds From the Black Hole: a concert series featuring experime
 ntal music and explorations of sound.\nNia Petrol (soundcloud) is usually 
 behind the scenes\, running sound at Sounds From the Black Hole. She’ll be
  given the spotlight to show off her synth skills\, creating experimental 
 techno that contorts and mutates\, driving forward with constant motion wh
 ile ever changing.\n________________________\nSheetmetalgirl (instagram\, 
 bandcamp) abuses metal\, cassettes and herself to create blistering harsh 
 noise. Hails from Indianapolis\, IN and has been performing killer shows t
 here for several years. This will be Sheetmetalgirl’s first performance in
  Bloomington.\n________________________\nSklermbot (bandcamp\, youtube\, s
 potify) is the project of Benjamin Handel\, creating cinematic and eclecti
 c electronic sounds. Benjamin is a performer\, musical educator\, producer
  and arranger…making his first foray into solo live music.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241026T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241026T230000
LOCATION:Orbit Room\, downstairs at 107 N College Ave\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Sounds From the Black Hole: Nia Petrol / Sheetmetalgirl / Sklermbot
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/sounds-from-the-black-hole-nia-petrol-sheetmetal
 girl-sklermbot/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Sound
 s From the Black Hole: a concert series featuring experimental music and e
 xplorations of sound.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Nia Petrol</strong> (<a hre
 f='https://soundcloud.com/niapetrol' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>soundc
 loud</a>) is usually behind the scenes\, running sound at Sounds From the 
 Black Hole. She’ll be given the spotlight to show off her synth skills\, c
 reating experimental techno that contorts and mutates\, driving forward wi
 th constant motion while ever changing.<br />\n________________________<br
  />\n<strong>Sheetmetalgirl</strong> (<a href='https://www.instagram.com/a
 otkpta/' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>instagram</a>\, <a href='https://s
 heetmetalgirl.bandcamp.com/' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>bandcamp</a>) 
 abuses metal\, cassettes and herself to create blistering harsh noise. Hai
 ls from Indianapolis\, IN and has been performing killer shows there for s
 everal years. This will be Sheetmetalgirl’s first performance in Bloomingt
 on.<br />\n________________________<br />\n<strong>Sklermbot</strong> (<a 
 href='https://sklermbot.bandcamp.com/' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>band
 camp</a>\, <a href='https://www.youtube.com/@sklermbot' target='_blank' re
 l='noopener'>youtube</a>\, <a href='https://open.spotify.com/artist/3NMvEk
 wcO0ItPqEereSlVl' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>spotify</a>) is the proje
 ct of Benjamin Handel\, creating cinematic and eclectic electronic sounds.
  Benjamin is a performer\, musical educator\, producer and arranger…making
  his first foray into solo live music.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
