 men-led theatre companies for a play-reading festival\, “In Her Words: A C
 elebration of Female Playwrights\,” running October 27-29 at the Constella
 tion Playhouse!\nClosing out the festival on Tuesday\, October 29 at 7:00p
 m\, join Off Night Productions for a reading of Five Times In One Night by
  Chiara Atik\, a clever (and extremely funny) play about sex\, told in fiv
 e bite-size parts—each a self-contained story about different kinds of dam
 age and delight.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241029T190000
LOCATION:Constellation Playhouse\, 107 W. 9th Street\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Reading: Five Times In One Night
