 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Off Night Pro
 ductions is teaming up with three other local\, women-led theatre companie
 s for a play-reading festival\, “In Her Words: A Celebration of Female Pla
 ywrights\,” running October 27-29 at the Constellation Playhouse!</p>\n<p>
 Closing out the festival on Tuesday\, October 29 at 7:00pm\, join Off Nigh
 t Productions for a reading of Five Times In One Night by Chiara Atik\, a 
 clever (and extremely funny) play about sex\, told in five bite-size parts
 —each a self-contained story about different kinds of damage and delight.<
 /p>\n</BODY></HTML>
