CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:This keynote focuses on blockbusters that uphold the principles
  of DEI and how Nia DaCosta’s horror Blackbuster Candyman directly challen
 ges discrimination against historically marginalized populations. After th
 e keynote\, be sure to stick around for our 7pm screening of 2021’s Candym
 an.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241030T160000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:“‘SAY HIS NAME:’ BLACKBUSTERS IN A POST-DEI WORLD” – a  talk from D
 r. Robin R. Means Coleman and Dr. Novotny Lawrence\, co-editors of the for
 thcoming The Oxford Handbook of Black Horror Film (2024).
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/say-his-name-blackbusters-in-a-post-dei-world-a-
 talk-from-dr-robin-r-means-coleman-and-dr-novotny-lawrence-co-editors-of-t
 he-forthcoming-the-oxford-handbook-of-black-horror-film-2024/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>This keynote 
 focuses on blockbusters that uphold the principles of DEI and how Nia DaCo
 sta’s horror Blackbuster <i>Candyman</i> directly challenges discriminatio
 n against historically marginalized populations. After the keynote\, be su
 re to stick around for our 7pm screening of 2021’s <a href='https://cinema
 .indiana.edu/upcoming-films/screening/2024-fall-wednesday-october-30-700pm
 '><i>Candyman</i></a>.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
