DESCRIPTION:doors open at 6 p.m.\nWho will be crowned Bloomington’s Trivia 
 Champion? Teams compete over five Trivia nights for championship bragging 
 rights!\nThe winning team from each night will automatically qualify for t
 he Championship Tournament on Dec. 6. Cumulative point leaders also have a
  chance to qualify. At the end of the series\, the top teams will compete 
 to be Bloomington’s Trivia Champions!\nPrizes are awarded each night to th
 e top three teams. Register a team of six or fewer by the registration dea
 dline. Registration is $30 per team per night.\nThe Cabin Restaurant and L
 ounge will be on site with food\, soda\, beer\, and wine available for pur
 chase.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241101T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241101T210000
LOCATION:Switchyard Park - Pavilion\, 1601 S Rogers St\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Bloomington Trivia Championship Series
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/bloomington-trivia-championship-series-2024/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>doors
  open at 6 p.m.</strong><br />\nWho will be crowned Bloomington’s Trivia C
 hampion? Teams compete over five Trivia nights for championship bragging r
 ights!</p>\n<p>The winning team from each night will automatically qualify
  for the Championship Tournament on Dec. 6. Cumulative point leaders also 
 have a chance to qualify. At the end of the series\, the top teams will co
 mpete to be Bloomington’s Trivia Champions!</p>\n<p>Prizes are awarded eac
 h night to the top three teams. <a href='https://bloomington.in.gov/parks/
 events/trivia-championship'>Register</a> a team of six or fewer by the reg
 istration deadline. <a href='https://bloomington.in.gov/parks/events/trivi
 a-championship'>Registration</a> is $30 per team per night.</p>\n<p>The Ca
 bin Restaurant and Lounge will be on site with food\, soda\, beer\, and wi
 ne available for purchase.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
