BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-126976@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:https://www.comedyattic.com/events/98999
DESCRIPTION:Door Time: 6:00 PM\nJourdain Fisher has got it all. He is a hil
 arious comedian\, writer\, and actor. He has appeared on COMEDY CENTRAL\, 
 AFTER MIDNIGHT on CBS\, Youtube’s hit comedy channel DON’T TELL and has ma
 de two appearances on THE TONIGHT SHOW STARRING JIMMY FALLON where he rece
 ived a standing ovation both times. In fact\, his first performance went s
 o well that Jimmy hired him to be a staff writer. He has also written for 
 VICELAND\, NETFLIX and BET. He was a highlight at the prestigious Just For
  Laughs festival in Montreal as a New Face and was a finalist for Stand Up
  NBC. Jourdain has also performed at numerous festivals including SXSW\, M
 oontower\, Laugh Your Asheville Off\, Laughing Skull\, and Riot Comedy Fes
 t. Jourdain has gained attention on social media platforms with numerous v
 iral clips racking up millions of views on TikTok and Instagram. His debut
  Comedy Album “Good For You” can be found on all streaming platforms. When
  he is not touring he resides in New York City where he is a regular at Th
 e Comedy Cellar and Gotham Comedy Club.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241101T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241101T204500
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, upstairs at 123 S Walnut St\, Bloomington (4th 
 and Walnut)
RRULE:FREQ=DAILY;UNTIL=20241102T235959Z
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Jourdain Fisher’s Bloomington Debut!
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/jourdain-fishers-bloomington-debut-earlyshow/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Door 
 Time: 6:00 PM</strong><br />\nJourdain Fisher has got it all. He is a hila
 rious comedian\, writer\, and actor. He has appeared on COMEDY CENTRAL\, A
 FTER MIDNIGHT on CBS\, Youtube’s hit comedy channel DON’T TELL and has mad
 e two appearances on THE TONIGHT SHOW STARRING JIMMY FALLON where he recei
 ved a standing ovation both times. In fact\, his first performance went so
  well that Jimmy hired him to be a staff writer. He has also written for V
 ICELAND\, NETFLIX and BET. He was a highlight at the prestigious Just For 
 Laughs festival in Montreal as a New Face and was a finalist for Stand Up 
 NBC. Jourdain has also performed at numerous festivals including SXSW\, Mo
 ontower\, Laugh Your Asheville Off\, Laughing Skull\, and Riot Comedy Fest
 . Jourdain has gained attention on social media platforms with numerous vi
 ral clips racking up millions of views on TikTok and Instagram. His debut 
 Comedy Album “Good For You” can be found on all streaming platforms. When 
 he is not touring he resides in New York City where he is a regular at The
  Comedy Cellar and Gotham Comedy Club.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
