X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>The W
 riters Guild at Bloomington presents</strong><br />\nJoin the Writers Guil
 d for a fun-filled day at the Local Author Book Fair! This event will feat
 ure 32 local authors selling their books\, including notable writers Nate 
 Powell\, Rob Harrell\, Keiko Kasza\, Teresa Robeson\, and Tanya Konerman. 
 Fifteen literary genres represented (including 10 children’s authors)! Mus
 ic all day\, plus tamales\, cake\, cookies and coffee. FREE raffle. What e
 lse do you need on a beautiful fall day?</p>\n<p>Live Music All Day!<br />
 \nFood vendors\, including Tamales by Biviana Torres</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
