BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-126240@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Back 2 Mac’s 40+ song list spans all the hits of the chart-topp
 ing Buckingham / Nicks /McVie era\, solo hits\, and early classics by Pete
 r Green and Bob Welsh. Lush vocal harmonies and an easy-going playfulness 
 with the audience distinguishes Back 2 Mac performances from those of othe
 r tributes\, a result of the combined years of music-making among the band
  members who have performed and/or recorded with Bob Weir\, The Impression
 s\, Days of the New\, Josh Ritter\, Anais Mitchell\, Ian Anderson (Jethro 
 Tull) and Kevin Morby.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241102T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241102T210000
LOCATION:Mitchell Opera House\, 217 N 7th St\, Mitchell
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Back to Mac Tribute
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/back-to-mac-tribute/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Back 2 Mac’s 
 40+ song list spans all the hits of the chart-topping Buckingham / Nicks /
 McVie era\, solo hits\, and early classics by Peter Green and Bob Welsh. L
 ush vocal harmonies and an easy-going playfulness with the audience distin
 guishes Back 2 Mac performances from those of other tributes\, a result of
  the combined years of music-making among the band members who have perfor
 med and/or recorded with Bob Weir\, The Impressions\, Days of the New\, Jo
 sh Ritter\, Anais Mitchell\, Ian Anderson (Jethro Tull) and Kevin Morby.</
 p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
