CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Doors at 6:30 pm  $1 from each “Live at Buskirk-Chumley Theater
 ” ticket sale will benefit a local nonprofit or cause. Proceeds from Novem
 ber’s show will be donated to Beacon\, Inc.\, a solutions-based antipovert
 y organization\, dedicated to aiding and empowering people experiencing ex
 treme poverty\, especially hunger and homelessness. They provide daytime a
 nd overnight shelter\, hunger relief\, housing\, casework\, life essential
 s\, and more to hundreds of people each day and thousands each year. As th
 e largest nonprofit housing provider in Monroe County\, they are proud to 
 help people in poverty not only survive but thrive. Learn more about Beaco
 n\, Inc. at beaconinc.org.
