 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Doors at 6:30
  pm  $1 from each “Live at Buskirk-Chumley Theater” ticket sale will benef
 it a local nonprofit or cause. Proceeds from November’s show will be donat
 ed to Beacon\, Inc.\, a solutions-based antipoverty organization\, dedicat
 ed to aiding and empowering people experiencing extreme poverty\, especial
 ly hunger and homelessness. They provide daytime and overnight shelter\, h
 unger relief\, housing\, casework\, life essentials\, and more to hundreds
  of people each day and thousands each year. As the largest nonprofit hous
 ing provider in Monroe County\, they are proud to help people in poverty n
 ot only survive but thrive. Learn more about Beacon\, Inc. at beaconinc.or
 g.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
