DESCRIPTION:Unpredictable\, progressive\, and gifted journalist Fred Flarsk
 y (Seth Rogen) has a knack for getting into trouble. Charlotte Field (Char
 lize Theron)—a sophisticated and accomplished politician—is one of the mos
 t influential people in the world. When Fred unexpectedly runs into Charlo
 tte\, who also happens to be his childhood babysitter and first crush\, ri
 ght when she decides to make a run for the presidency\, she impulsively hi
 res Fred as her speechwriter. They embark on a whirlwind presidential camp
 aign that just may change the White House forever in this smart\, stylish\
 , funny\, and deeply warm romantic comedy. [123 min\; romantic comedy\; En
 glish]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241105T190000
