 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Unpredictable
 \, progressive\, and gifted journalist Fred Flarsky (Seth Rogen) has a kna
 ck for getting into trouble. Charlotte Field (Charlize Theron)—a sophistic
 ated and accomplished politician—is one of the most influential people in 
 the world. When Fred unexpectedly runs into Charlotte\, who also happens t
 o be his childhood babysitter and first crush\, right when she decides to 
 make a run for the presidency\, she impulsively hires Fred as her speechwr
 iter. They embark on a whirlwind presidential campaign that just may chang
 e the White House forever in this smart\, stylish\, funny\, and deeply war
 m romantic comedy. [123 min\; romantic comedy\; English]</p>\n</BODY></HTM
 L>
