 ased on who wins (or loses) the election. This Wednesday at The Sinkhole C
 raft Beer Bar\, 7pm-9pm. If the weather is clear the event will be outside
  and all ages.\n\nFeaturing guest pianist\, Albert Newberry who has perfor
 med at Carnegie Hall and Lincoln Center and won numerous awards including 
