UID:ai1ec-128024@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:rdobias@bgcbloomington.org
DESCRIPTION:All work will be outdoors assisting with leaf & outdoor propert
 y clean-up & shifts can either be 2 hours or 4 hours\, but all need to sta
 rt at 10 am. Volunteers should dress for the weather. If you have garden g
 loves or work gloves\, they can be helpful. There will be some rakes and y
 ard tools but if you have your own you like to bring\, wheelbarrows\, or l
 eaf blowers please bring them! There are restrooms and parking on site.  S
 ee you at the lake!\nCamp Rock is the beautiful setting that thousands of 
 kids throughout the years have enjoyed the magic of Summer Camp and Camp R
 ock and thousands more in the many years to come. To keep Camp Rock beauti
 ful and clean for the kids of today and in the future\, we have to care fo
 r the land.  For that\, we need you!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241109T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241109T130000
LOCATION:Camp Rock\, 7599 N Tunnel Rd\, Unionville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Camp Rock 2024 Clean Up Day
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/camp-rock-2024-clean-up-day/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>All work will
  be outdoors assisting with leaf & outdoor property clean-up & shifts can 
 either be 2 hours or 4 hours\, but all need to start at 10 am. Volunteers 
 should dress for the weather. If you have garden gloves or work gloves\, t
 hey can be helpful. There will be some rakes and yard tools but if you hav
 e your own you like to bring\, wheelbarrows\, or leaf blowers please bring
  them! There are restrooms and parking on site.  See you at the lake!</p>
 \n<p>Camp Rock is the beautiful setting that thousands of kids throughout 
 the years have enjoyed the magic of Summer Camp and Camp Rock and thousand
 s more in the many years to come. To keep Camp Rock beautiful and clean fo
 r the kids of today and in the future\, we have to care for the land.  For
  that\, we need you!</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
