BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-126126@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/event/abacab-tribute-to-genesis/
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to embark on a musical journey through the legendary 
 sounds of Genesis with “Abacab – Tribute to Genesis”! This extraordinary t
 ribute band brings the iconic hits and intricate compositions of Genesis t
 o life with stunning accuracy and passion. From the progressive rock anthe
 ms of the Peter Gabriel era to the chart-topping classics of Phil Collins\
 , “Abacab” delivers an unforgettable performance that captures the essence
  of one of rock’s most influential bands. Whether you’re a longtime Genesi
 s fan or new to their music\, this show promises to be an immersive experi
 ence that will leave you in awe. Secure your tickets now for an evening fi
 lled with masterful musicianship and timeless hits!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241109T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241109T213000
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S Van Buren St Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Abacab – Tribute to Genesis
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/abacab-tribute-to-genesis/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Get ready to 
 embark on a musical journey through the legendary sounds of Genesis with “
 Abacab – Tribute to Genesis”! This extraordinary tribute band brings the i
 conic hits and intricate compositions of Genesis to life with stunning acc
 uracy and passion. From the progressive rock anthems of the <strong>Peter 
 Gabriel era</strong> to the chart-topping classics of <strong>Phil Collins
 </strong>\, “Abacab” delivers an unforgettable performance that captures t
 he essence of one of rock’s most influential bands. Whether you’re a longt
 ime Genesis fan or new to their music\, this show promises to be an immers
 ive experience that will leave you in awe. Secure your tickets now for an 
 evening filled with masterful musicianship and timeless hits!</p>\n</BODY>
 </HTML>
END:VEVENT
