DESCRIPTION:A special Pop-up Chitlin Circuit facilitated by Indiana State P
 oet Laureate Curtis Crisler\, with an open mic to follow.  The Indiana Chi
 tlin Circuit is based on the historical Chitlin Circuit that sprouted duri
 ng the period of Jim Crow segregation. African American performers weren’t
  necessarily allowed to share a stage with white performers. A network of 
 live entertainment venues in the US emerged that catered to black audience
 s and black entertainers.\n\nSponsored in part by the Writers Guild at Blo
 omington\, Indiana Arts Commission\, Bloomington Arts Commission\, and the
  Bloomington Urban Enterprise Association
