UID:ai1ec-127967@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:https://www.comedyattic.com/shows/278933
DESCRIPTION:Door Time: 6:00 PM\nCaleb Synan is one of the hottest young com
 ics in the country. (Funny AND good looking!) His unique background as a p
 reacher’s kid from a small southern town gives him the ability to relate t
 o any and every crowd — even though he’s a big old millennial who lives in
  LA. Want proof? He’s performed on CONAN (twice!)\, Last Comic Standing (o
 nce!)\, and his first Comedy Central special “30” in 2022 (You can watch i
 t on YouTube!)\nHe’s also entertained our troops in South Korea and Japan.
  What a guy! It’s no wonder he won the title of “Wittiest” in Franklin Cou
 nty High School’s 2009 Yearbook. He even wrote this bio himself. And he’ll
  have a margarita with you if you play your cards right.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241114T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241114T204500
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, upstairs at 123 S Walnut St\, Bloomington (4th 
 and Walnut)
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Caleb Synan’s Bloomington Debut – One Night Only!
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/caleb-synans-bloomington-debut-one-night-only/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Door 
 Time: 6:00 PM</strong><br />\nCaleb Synan is one of the hottest young comi
 cs in the country. (Funny AND good looking!) His unique background as a pr
 eacher’s kid from a small southern town gives him the ability to relate to
  any and every crowd — even though he’s a big old millennial who lives in 
 LA. Want proof? He’s performed on CONAN (twice!)\, Last Comic Standing (on
 ce!)\, and his first Comedy Central special “30” in 2022 (You can watch it
  on YouTube!)</p>\n<p>He’s also entertained our troops in South Korea and 
 Japan. What a guy! It’s no wonder he won the title of “Wittiest” in Frankl
 in County High School’s 2009 Yearbook. He even wrote this bio himself. And
  he’ll have a margarita with you if you play your cards right.</p>\n</BODY
 ></HTML>
END:VEVENT
