BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-129028@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Hope for the Holidays\, presented by IU Credit Union\, is our s
 ixth annual holiday tree festival and charity auction to benefit New Hope 
 for Families\, serving families overcoming homelessness right here in our 
 community. Come see more than 50 unique and festive holiday trees decorate
 d by local businesses\, organizations\, groups and families. The festival 
 is free to attend and open to the public.\nThroughout the festival\, each 
 of the fantastic trees on display can be purchased for a special “Buy It N
 ow” price and any remaining entries will be auctioned off during an exciti
 ng live auction on the final night of the event. In addition to the lights
  and tinsel\, guests can also enjoy free cookies and hot cocoa along with 
 live entertainment every night!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241118T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241118T200000
LOCATION:Switchyard Park Pavillion\, 1601 South Rogers St.\, Bloomington
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20241119T180000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20241120T180000
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Hope for the Holidays – Bloomington’s annual holiday tree festival 
 presented by IU Credit Union to benefit New Hope for Families
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/hope-for-the-holidays-bloomingtons-annual-holida
 y-tree-festival-presented-by-iu-credit-union-to-benefit-new-hope-for-famil
 ies/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Hope for the 
 Holidays\, presented by IU Credit Union\, is our sixth annual holiday tree
  festival and charity auction to benefit New Hope for Families\, serving f
 amilies overcoming homelessness right here in our community. Come see more
  than 50 unique and festive holiday trees decorated by local businesses\, 
 organizations\, groups and families. The festival is free to attend and op
 en to the public.</p>\n<p>Throughout the festival\, each of the fantastic 
 trees on display can be purchased for a special “Buy It Now” price and any
  remaining entries will be auctioned off during an exciting live auction o
 n the final night of the event. In addition to the lights and tinsel\, gue
 sts can also enjoy free cookies and hot cocoa along with live entertainmen
 t every night!</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
