BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-129062@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Ravening follows the story of Nirmali\, a married pediatrician\
 , who encounters Sumon\, a young PhD student researching meat-eating pract
 ices in northeast India. Their shared culinary interest turns into a uniqu
 e and intense bond as they explore unusual meats together. What begins as 
 a seemingly innocent friendship spirals into forbidden obsession with ever
  more exotic meats. As Nirmali’s tastebuds grow more adventurous\, their r
 elationship takes a dark and bizarre turn.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241119T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Film: RAVENING
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/film-ravening/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><i>Ravening</
 i> follows the story of Nirmali\, a married pediatrician\, who encounters 
 Sumon\, a young PhD student researching meat-eating practices in northeast
  India. Their shared culinary interest turns into a unique and intense bon
 d as they explore unusual meats together. What begins as a seemingly innoc
 ent friendship spirals into forbidden obsession with ever more exotic meat
 s. As Nirmali’s tastebuds grow more adventurous\, their relationship takes
  a dark and bizarre turn.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
