CONTACT:812-988-6555\; https://browncountyplayhouse.org/event/wishbone-ash/
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for an unforgettable night of rock history with Wishb
 one Ash! Known for pioneering the twin-lead guitar sound\, Wishbone Ash ha
 s been thrilling audiences worldwide for decades. Their unique blend of pr
 ogressive rock\, blues\, and hard rock has earned them a dedicated followi
 ng and a place in rock history. With classic hits like “Phoenix” and “The 
 King Will Come\,” this performance promises to be a powerful showcase of m
 usical mastery and timeless energy. Don’t miss your chance to experience t
 he legendary sound of Wishbone Ash live!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241120T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241120T213000
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S Van Buren St\, Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Wishbone Ash
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/wishbone-ash/
