X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Get ready for
  an unforgettable night of rock history with Wishbone Ash! Known for pione
 ering the twin-lead guitar sound\, Wishbone Ash has been thrilling audienc
 es worldwide for decades. Their unique blend of progressive rock\, blues\,
  and hard rock has earned them a dedicated following and a place in rock h
 istory. With classic hits like “Phoenix” and “The King Will Come\,” this p
 erformance promises to be a powerful showcase of musical mastery and timel
 ess energy. Don’t miss your chance to experience the legendary sound of Wi
 shbone Ash live!</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
