UID:ai1ec-127979@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:https://www.comedyattic.com/shows/278915
DESCRIPTION:Door Time: 6:00 PM\nBased in Los Angeles by way of Atlanta\, Da
 ve Stone made his television debut on “The Late Late Show with Craig Fergu
 son” in 2013 and in the same year was selected to the prestigious “New Fac
 es” roster of the Just For Laughs Festival in Montreal. Since then\, he ha
 s been seen on season 8 of NBC’s “Last Comic Standing”\, Viceland’s “Floph
 ouse”\, Travel Channel’s “Cheat Day Chow Down”\, and his new YouTube comed
 y special “Pack a Lunch”.\nWhen not headlining clubs across the country\, 
 Dave can be heard voicing several characters on Adult Swim’s “Squidbillies
 ”\, co-hosting his paranormal podcast “The Boogie Monster” with Kyle Kinan
 e\, and co-hosting “The Stonebergs Podcast” with his wife\, Katie Strandbe
 rg.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241121T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241121T204500
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, upstairs at 123 S Walnut St\, Bloomington (4th 
 and Walnut)
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:One Night Only – Dave Stone’s Bloomington Debut!
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/one-night-only-dave-stones-bloomington-debut/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Door 
 Time: 6:00 PM</strong><br />\nBased in Los Angeles by way of Atlanta\, Dav
 e Stone made his television debut on “The Late Late Show with Craig Fergus
 on” in 2013 and in the same year was selected to the prestigious “New Face
 s” roster of the Just For Laughs Festival in Montreal. Since then\, he has
  been seen on season 8 of NBC’s “Last Comic Standing”\, Viceland’s “Flopho
 use”\, Travel Channel’s “Cheat Day Chow Down”\, and his new YouTube comedy
  special “Pack a Lunch”.</p>\n<p>When not headlining clubs across the coun
 try\, Dave can be heard voicing several characters on Adult Swim’s “Squidb
 illies”\, co-hosting his paranormal podcast “The Boogie Monster” with Kyle
  Kinane\, and co-hosting “The Stonebergs Podcast” with his wife\, Katie St
 randberg.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
