UID:ai1ec-127973@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:https://www.mitchelloperahouse.com/event/sounds-of-summer/
DESCRIPTION:Doors will open at 6:15 p.m.\nSounds of Summer is a tribute sho
 w based in Southern Indiana that includes over 30 familiar hits and tells 
 the story of America’s band – the Beach Boys. These four incredibly talent
 ed guys have known each other since grade school and shared a love of 1960
 ’s music and Beach Boys’ harmonies. The band has been playing across the n
 ation since 2015\, delivering audiences an authentic look and sound\, taki
 ng them back to memories of the 1960s. Sounds of Summer has received prais
 e for staying true to the Beach Boys sound and had the privilege of playin
 g a live hour-long special on AXS TV’s “World’s Greatest Tribute Bands” on
  September 2016. This show isn’t just fun…it’s fun\, fun\, fun!\nSounds of
  Summer is a Beach Boys tribute based out of Indiana. The show includes ov
 er 30 familiar hits and tells the story of America’s band – the Beach Boys
 . These two sets of first cousins have captured the familial sound of The 
 Beach Boys. They have toured the country playing a variety of theaters\, f
 estivals\, and concerts and performed an hour long special on AXS TV’s “Wo
 rld’s Greatest Tribute Bands”\, broadcasted live from Hollywood\, CA.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241123T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241123T210000
LOCATION:Mitchell Opera House\, 217 N 7th St\, Mitchell
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Sounds Of Summer
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/sounds-of-summer/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Doors
  will open at 6:15 p.m.</strong><br />\n<strong>Sounds of Summer</strong> 
 is a tribute show based in Southern Indiana that includes over 30 familiar
  hits and tells the story of America’s band – <strong>the Beach Boys</stro
 ng>. These four incredibly talented guys have known each other since grade
  school and shared a love of 1960’s music and Beach Boys’ harmonies. The b
 and has been playing across the nation since 2015\, delivering audiences a
 n authentic look and sound\, taking them back to memories of the 1960s. So
 unds of Summer has received praise for staying true to the Beach Boys soun
 d and had the privilege of playing a live hour-long special on AXS TV’s “W
 orld’s Greatest Tribute Bands” on September 2016. This show isn’t just fun
 …it’s fun\, fun\, fun!</p>\n<p>Sounds of Summer is a Beach Boys tribute ba
 sed out of Indiana. The show includes over 30 familiar hits and tells the 
 story of America’s band – the Beach Boys. These two sets of first cousins 
 have captured the familial sound of The Beach Boys. They have toured the c
 ountry playing a variety of theaters\, festivals\, and concerts and perfor
 med an hour long special on AXS TV’s “World’s Greatest Tribute Bands”\, br
 oadcasted live from Hollywood\, CA.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
