DESCRIPTION:Head to Bedford for the 10th Annual Becky’s Place Run for Hope 
 5K. All ages and fitness levels are welcome! The race will start and finis
 h in Downtown Bedford at the Downtown Depot.\nEnjoy a festive atmosphere w
 ith music\, friends\, family\, and snacks before and after the race at the
  start/finish line and during your time on the course. Race time is limite
 d to 1 1⁄2 hours. This is a chance to test your fitness\, enjoy a race exp
 erience and help to support Becky’s Place. Race will be timed by ABTiming.
 \n \n 
