CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Monroe County Board of Commissioners\, in collaboration with th
 e Hoosier Hills Food Bank\, is sponsoring a food drive at the Canopy of Li
 ghts. They will have a drop-off point for non-perishable food and monetary
  donations at the event and will continue to have donation barrels inside 
 the Courthouse Rotunda through Giving Tuesday\, November 28th.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241129T180000
