 he Bloomington Brass Band\, the Canopy of Lights Lighting and Photos with 
 Santa (7:30pm-9pm)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/holiday-activities-around-the-square-including-a
 -performance-by-the-bloomington-brass-band/
