 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Monro
 e County Board of Commissioners\, in collaboration with the Hoosier Hills 
 Food Bank\, is sponsoring a food drive at the Canopy of Lights. They will 
 have a drop-off point for non-perishable food and monetary donations at th
 e event and will continue to have donation barrels inside the Courthouse R
 otunda through Giving Tuesday\, November 28th.</strong></p>\n</BODY></HTML
 >
