UID:ai1ec-125686@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:The Monroe County Humane Association veterinary team is hosting
  a pop-up mobile vaccine clinic! No appointment needed\; all are welcome!
 \n\nA range of services are available\, including legally mandated rabies 
 vaccines for pets aged 12 weeks and older. Clinics also provide nail trims
 \, microchips\, and preventive measures for flea\, tick\, and heartworm.\n
 \nSubsidized rates are available to residents experiencing financial hards
 hip if they provide documentation. Cats must be in carriers\, and dogs mus
 t be leashed (no retractable leashes). Pets showing signs of illness or ag
 gression might be turned away.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241201T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241201T150000
LOCATION:MCHA Clinic\, 791 S Fieldstone Blvd\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Pop-Up Vaccine Clinic for Cats and Dogs
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/pop-up-vaccine-clinic-for-cats-and-dogs-3/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div>The <a href
 ='http://monroehumane.org'>Monroe County Humane Association</a> veterinary
  team is hosting a pop-up mobile vaccine clinic! No appointment needed\; a
 ll are welcome!</div>\n<div></div>\n<div>A range of services are available
 \, including legally mandated rabies vaccines for pets aged 12 weeks and o
 lder. Clinics also provide nail trims\, microchips\, and preventive measur
 es for flea\, tick\, and heartworm.</div>\n<div></div>\n<div>Subsidized ra
 tes are available to residents experiencing financial hardship if they pro
 vide documentation. Cats must be in carriers\, and dogs must be leashed (n
 o retractable leashes). Pets showing signs of illness or aggression might 
 be turned away.</div>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
