CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Bloomington’s own Nutcracker Ballet\, danced by children for ch
 ildren and families! This slightly abridged version of the classic Nutcrac
 ker Ballet follows Clara through her adventures after receiving a magical 
 gift from her Uncle Drosselmeyer. Watch Clara and the Nutcracker battle th
 e evil Mouse King\, dance through a swirl of snowflakes into the night and
  arrive in the magical Land of the Sweets presided over by the Sugar Plum 
 Fairy and her sweet courtiers. Was it all a dream? Or was it the magic of 
 Uncle Drosselmeyer and his gift?\nDoors open 30 minutes before each perfor
 mance.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241201T153000
LOCATION:Buskirk Chumley Theater\, 114 E Kirkwood Ave.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:The Children’s Nutcracker
