 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Bloomington’s
  own Nutcracker Ballet\, danced by children for children and families! Thi
 s slightly abridged version of the classic Nutcracker Ballet follows Clara
  through her adventures after receiving a magical gift from her Uncle Dros
 selmeyer. Watch Clara and the Nutcracker battle the evil Mouse King\, danc
 e through a swirl of snowflakes into the night and arrive in the magical L
 and of the Sweets presided over by the Sugar Plum Fairy and her sweet cour
 tiers. Was it all a dream? Or was it the magic of Uncle Drosselmeyer and h
 is gift?</p>\n<p>Doors open 30 minutes before each performance.</p>\n</BOD
 Y></HTML>
