DESCRIPTION:This month\, our featured exhibit is a fundraiser for Juniper A
 rt Gallery to help keep our FREE events available in the upcoming year.\nJ
 uniper’s Owner\, Jaime Sweany has chosen a diverse selection of artwork fr
 om her own personal collection (acquired over the past 50 years!) to offer
  up for sale on behalf of the gallery and her incredible staff.\nWe hope y
 ou will come visit and support our Regional Artists\, Artisan Shop\, and F
 REE creative events!
