 aime Sweany has chosen a diverse selection of artwork from her own persona
 l collection (acquired over the past 50 years!) to offer up for sale on be
 half of the gallery and her incredible staff.<br />\nWe hope you will come
  visit and support our Regional Artists\, Artisan Shop\, and FREE creative
  events!</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
