UID:ai1ec-126642@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:https://www.facebook.com/BloomingtonWinterFarmersMarket
DESCRIPTION:The Bloomington Winter Farmers’ Market is the oldest winter mar
 ket in Indiana as it enters its 21st year serving the community of Bloomin
 gton.\nThe BWFM has a diversity of vendors and products including fresh pr
 oduce\, local meat and poultry\, dairy products\, eggs\, maple syrup\, hon
 ey products\, breads\, baked goods\, jams and sauces\, prepared foods\, lo
 cally roasted coffee\, cut flowers\, seeds and plants\, artisanal crafts a
 nd many other items. You can find everything you need for nourishing winte
 r meals along with local crafts\, seasonal gifts and shareable treats!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241207T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241207T123000
EXDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20241228T090000
EXDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20250111T090000
LOCATION:Switchyard Park - Pavilion\, 1601 S Rogers St\, Bloomington
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;UNTIL=20250329T235959Z;BYDAY=SA;WKST=MO
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Bloomington Winter Farmers’ Market
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/bloomington-winter-farmers-market-2024-2025/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>The <a href='
 https://www.bloomingtonwinterfarmersmarket.com/' target='_blank'>Bloomingt
 on Winter Farmers’ Market</a> is the oldest winter market in Indiana as it
  enters its 21st year serving the community of Bloomington.</p>\n<p>The BW
 FM has a diversity of vendors and products including fresh produce\, local
  meat and poultry\, dairy products\, eggs\, maple syrup\, honey products\,
  breads\, baked goods\, jams and sauces\, prepared foods\, locally roasted
  coffee\, cut flowers\, seeds and plants\, artisanal crafts and many other
  items. You can find everything you need for nourishing winter meals along
  with local crafts\, seasonal gifts and shareable treats!</p>\n</BODY></HT
 ML>
END:VEVENT
