DESCRIPTION:Now happily settled with the Brown family in Windsor Gardens\, 
 Paddington has become a popular member of the community\, spreading joy an
 d marmalade wherever he goes. While searching for the perfect present for 
 his beloved Aunt Lucy’s 100th birthday\, Paddington spots a unique pop-up 
 book in Mr. Gruber’s antique shop and embarks on a series of odd jobs to b
 uy it. Hilarity and adventure ensues when the book is stolen and Paddingto
 n and the Browns must unmask the thief.
