 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Now happily s
 ettled with the Brown family in Windsor Gardens\, Paddington has become a 
 popular member of the community\, spreading joy and marmalade wherever he 
 goes. While searching for the perfect present for his beloved Aunt Lucy’s 
 100th birthday\, Paddington spots a unique pop-up book in Mr. Gruber’s ant
 ique shop and embarks on a series of odd jobs to buy it. Hilarity and adve
 nture ensues when the book is stolen and Paddington and the Browns must un
 mask the thief.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
