X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Come one\, co
 me all\, and see the magnificent KRAMPUS BIZAAR 2024!</p>\n<p>This will be
  the second annual Krampus event put on at the Bloomington Brewing Company
  in partnership with <a href='https://www.krampusamerica.com/krampus-group
 s-across-america/southern-indiana-krampus-society'>Southern Indiana Krampu
 s Society</a>!</p>\n<p>Dazzle yourself with hand-picked vendors sporting a
 ll sorts of wares during this Krampus-themed trade show. Bring the kids an
 d let them get treats at booths\, but beware – one of our Krampuses just m
 ay come out to deliver switchings!</p>\n<p>Enjoy a wonderful fire performa
 nce by INFERNO VORTEX\, bringing all the excitement you’d expect to a kram
 pus event. Are you planning to be naughty or nice?<br />\n<strong>Presente
 d by <a href='https://www.twigandasheventplanning.com/'>Twig & Ash Pagan E
