CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Krista Detor brings back her live holiday show for two nights a
 t the Constellation Playhouse. Joined by bandmates Dena El Saffar\, David 
 Weber\, Steve Mascari\, Pat Otto\, and Rod Taylor – with guests including 
 Sam Bartlett & Eric Schedler\, this holiday show promises some brand new m
 usic\, and\, as always\, SURPRISE guests! A holiday mini-market of local a
 rtists and artisans\, as well as Beer & Wine and holiday snack offerings m
 ake this a perfect way to celebrate the season in community and some of Bl
 oomington’s most talented performers! Grab a ticket and a cup of holiday c
 heer and buckle up for a wild holiday romp!
