 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Krista Detor 
 brings back her live holiday show for two nights at the Constellation Play
 house. Joined by bandmates Dena El Saffar\, David Weber\, Steve Mascari\, 
 Pat Otto\, and Rod Taylor – with guests including Sam Bartlett & Eric Sche
 dler\, this holiday show promises some brand new music\, and\, as always\,
  SURPRISE guests! A holiday mini-market of local artists and artisans\, as
  well as Beer & Wine and holiday snack offerings make this a perfect way t
 o celebrate the season in community and some of Bloomington’s most talente
 d performers! Grab a ticket and a cup of holiday cheer and buckle up for a
  wild holiday romp!</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
