BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-129674@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:For more than 17 years\, the Bloomington Christmas Sing-Along h
 as been a tradition in our community. A unique\, free\, family-friendly ev
 ent where you will hear Christmas arrangements like never before. Local mu
 sicians join forces with a children’s choir\, Jacob’s School of Music stud
 ents and local churches. Don’t miss this one-of-a-kind experience featurin
 g an eclectic variety of musical styles. Afterwards\, share in the after-g
 low with wonderful homemade cookies and hot cocoa. Doors open at 6:30 pm a
 t Trinity Reformed Church. More details found at https://trinityreformed.o
 rg/christmas2024/\nThis year we are pleased to benefit The Hannah Center. 
 If you are able\, please bring donation items like baby formula\, diapers 
 or new baby clothes. Learn more at hannahcenter.org
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241213T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241213T210000
LOCATION:Trinity Reformed Church\, 2401 South Endwright Road\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Bloomington Christmas Sing-Along (to benefit The Hannah Center)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/bloomington-christmas-sing-along-to-benefit-the-
 hannah-center/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>For more than
  17 years\, the Bloomington Christmas Sing-Along has been a tradition in o
 ur community. A unique\, free\, family-friendly event where you will hear 
 Christmas arrangements like never before. Local musicians join forces with
  a children’s choir\, Jacob’s School of Music students and local churches.
  Don’t miss this one-of-a-kind experience featuring an eclectic variety of
  musical styles. Afterwards\, share in the after-glow with wonderful homem
 ade cookies and hot cocoa. Doors open at 6:30 pm at Trinity Reformed Churc
 h. More details found at https://trinityreformed.org/christmas2024/</p>\n<
 p>This year we are pleased to benefit The Hannah Center. If you are able\,
  please bring donation items like baby formula\, diapers or new baby cloth
 es. Learn more at hannahcenter.org</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
