CONTACT:Susan E. Middlestadt\; 812.272.4759\; semiddle@iu.edu\; https://hhs
 mg.shambhala.org/program-details/?id=738476
DESCRIPTION:Doors open at 8:30 for registration and set up. Sitting begins 
 at 9:00. \nHoosier Heartland Shambhala Meditation Group (HHSMG) is holding
  a half-day meditation retreat. Come and meditate with others in an inspir
 ational setting. We alternate between sitting meditation and walking medit
 ation/yoga with a tea break mid-morning. Bring a lunch and join us for con
 versation afterwards. At noon\, we will have some dharma books to share fo
 r a $5 donation.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241214T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241214T120000
LOCATION:Center for Wholism\, 2401 N Walnut St\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Half-Day Saturday Meditation Retreat
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/half-day-saturday-meditation-retreat-2024-12-14/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Doors
  open at 8:30 for registration and set up. Sitting begins at 9:00. </stron
 g><br />\n<a href='https://hhsmg.shambhala.org/' rel='noopener' target='_b
 lank'>Hoosier Heartland Shambhala Meditation Group (HHSMG)</a> is holding 
 a half-day meditation retreat. Come and meditate with others in an inspira
 tional setting. We alternate between sitting meditation and walking medita
 tion/yoga with a tea break mid-morning. Bring a lunch and join us for conv
 ersation afterwards. At noon\, we will have some dharma books to share for
  a $5 donation.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
