BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-130239@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:https://wonderlab.org/event/wonderlab-new-years-eve-2024/
DESCRIPTION:Recommended Ages: 0-10 years\nSkip the late bedtime and celebra
 te New Year’s Eve at WonderLab! Staying up until midnight isn’t always ide
 al for young ones\, but at WonderLab\, they can enjoy all the fun early an
 d with an educational twist. Our early evening party includes learning abo
 ut science\, all things Glitter!\, and rocking in the New Year with an ear
 ly evening dance party and countdown.\nThis New Year’s Eve\, ring in 2025 
 and ensure that your children have a memorable celebration\, get plenty of
  physical activity\, and are ready to head home and rest well before the a
 dult festivities begin.\nPresented By: WonderLab Museum of Science Health 
 and Technology
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241231T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241231T180000
LOCATION:WonderLab Museum\, 308 W 4th St\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:WonderLab New Year’s Eve 2024!
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/wonderlab-new-years-eve-2024/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Recom
 mended Ages: 0-10 years</strong><br />\nSkip the late bedtime and celebrat
 e New Year’s Eve at WonderLab! Staying up until midnight isn’t always idea
 l for young ones\, but at WonderLab\, they can enjoy all the fun early and
  with an educational twist. Our early evening party includes learning abou
 t science\, all things Glitter!\, and rocking in the New Year with an earl
 y evening dance party and countdown.</p>\n<p>This New Year’s Eve\, ring in
  2025 and ensure that your children have a memorable celebration\, get ple
 nty of physical activity\, and are ready to head home and rest well before
  the adult festivities begin.<br />\n<strong>Presented By: WonderLab Museu
 m of Science Health and Technology</strong></p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
