BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-130091@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Hike and Seek is a wonderful opportunity for you and your presc
 hooler to explore nature together with other children of a similar age. We
 ’ll take a gentle-paced hike\, noticing the wonders of nature unfolding ar
 ound us. Each hike is a new adventure\, as nature is always changing\, so 
 no two hikes will ever be the same! Please dress for the weather. Only chi
 ldren need to be registered\, but at least one adult is required to stay a
 nd participate. Adults will check in upon arrival. \nSPECIAL NOTE: Registr
 ation for this event is offered ONLY through Bloomington Parks & Recreatio
 n. “Resale” or transfer of registration is NOT accepted through third part
 ies. If you are offered tickets to this event\, it is a SCAM.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250107T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250107T110000
LOCATION:RCA Community Park\, 1400 West RCA Park Drive\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Hike and Seek (For ages 2-6yrs. with parent)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/hike-and-seek-for-ages-2-6yrs-with-parent/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Hike and Seek
  is a wonderful opportunity for you and your preschooler to explore nature
  together with other children of a similar age. We’ll take a gentle-paced 
 hike\, noticing the wonders of nature unfolding around us. Each hike is a 
 new adventure\, as nature is always changing\, so no two hikes will ever b
 e the same! Please dress for the weather. Only children need to be registe
 red\, but at least one adult is required to stay and participate. Adults w
 ill check in upon arrival. </p>\n<p>SPECIAL NOTE: Registration for this ev
 ent is offered ONLY through Bloomington Parks & Recreation. “Resale” or tr
 ansfer of registration is NOT accepted through third parties. If you are o
 ffered tickets to this event\, it is a SCAM.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
