 at the Waldron Firebay.\nThe Monroe County Civic Theatre (MCCT) is current
 ly looking for people to help behind the scenes with everything from sets 
 to costumes and beyond. If you’re interested but unable to attend open aud
 itions (and/or how you can be a part of the tech team)\, please contact Be
 cky Stapf 812-929-2352
