 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>No si
 gn up necessary.<br />\nAuditions will be readings from sides of the show.
  Parts available for 3 women and 8 men!</strong> The show is March 14-23 a
 t the Waldron Firebay.</p>\n<p>The Monroe County Civic Theatre (MCCT) is c
 urrently looking for people to help behind the scenes with everything from
