CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:noodles.com/order
DESCRIPTION:What easier way to support MCHA’s mission than by attending a D
 ine & Donate event and enjoying a delicious meal in the process? This even
 ing\, Noodles & Co. will donate 25% of eligible sales during the event to 
 MCHA. Funds raised will directly support MCHA’s programs. If ordering in p
 erson\, use code GIVING25 or mention MCHA when ordering.\nThis fundraiser 
 only applies to the Eastland Plaza location during the specific date and t
 ime listed. Orders placed for delivery through third-party apps like UberE
 ats and GrubHub won’t count toward the fundraiser.﻿
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250109T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250109T200000
LOCATION:Noodles & Co (Eastland Plaza only)\, 2560 E 3rd St\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Dine and Donate for Monroe County Humane Association
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/dine-donate-mcha-2025-01-09/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>What easier w
 ay to support MCHA’s mission than by attending a Dine & Donate event and e
 njoying a delicious meal in the process? This evening\, Noodles & Co. will
  donate 25% of eligible sales during the event to MCHA. Funds raised will 
 directly support MCHA’s programs. <strong>If ordering in person\, use code
  GIVING25 or mention MCHA when ordering.</strong></p>\n<p>This fundraiser 
 only applies to the Eastland Plaza location during the specific date and t
 ime listed. Orders placed for delivery through third-party apps like UberE
 ats and GrubHub won’t count toward the fundraiser.﻿</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
