CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Film | Age: 18+\nSynopsis: Prepare to question everything you t
 hought you knew about roundhouse kicks\, thongs\, and katana beheadings. J
 oe (Matt Hannon\, Sylvester Stallone’s one-time bodyguard) is the Samurai 
 Cop\, a rock of a man who will do literally whatever it takes to punish cr
 iminals—even if that means taking dozens of innocent lives in the process.
  Teamed with a truly hilarious partner (Mark Frazer)\, Joe embarks on a mi
 ndmelting sex-and-violence-fueled adventure against evil ninjas\, drug dea
 lers\, and genre legend Robert Z’Dar (MANIAC COP)! Directed by prolific Ir
 anian ex-pat Amir Shervan\, the reckless and outrageous SAMURAI COP is a t
 rue treasure of the trash-action pantheon.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250116T190000
LOCATION:The Orbit Room\, downstairs at 107 N College Ave\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Cicada Cinema presents: Samurai Cop (1991\, Unrated)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/cicada-cinema-presents-samurai-cop-1991-unrated/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Film 
 | Age: 18+</strong><br />\n<strong>Synopsis:</strong> Prepare to question 
 everything you thought you knew about roundhouse kicks\, thongs\, and kata
 na beheadings. Joe (Matt Hannon\, Sylvester Stallone’s one-time bodyguard)
  is the Samurai Cop\, a rock of a man who will do literally whatever it ta
 kes to punish criminals—even if that means taking dozens of innocent lives
  in the process. Teamed with a truly hilarious partner (Mark Frazer)\, Joe
  embarks on a mindmelting sex-and-violence-fueled adventure against evil n
 injas\, drug dealers\, and genre legend Robert Z’Dar (MANIAC COP)! Directe
 d by prolific Iranian ex-pat Amir Shervan\, the reckless and outrageous SA
 MURAI COP is a true treasure of the trash-action pantheon.</p>\n</BODY></H
 TML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
