BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-130707@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:MAKE-UP FOR 1/10 SCREENING | All Ages | Documentary\nSynopsis: 
 In the dense forests of the Eastern Himalayas\, moths are whispering somet
 hing to us. In the dark of night\, two curious observers shine a light on 
 this secret universe. Together\, they are on an expedition to decode these
  nocturnal creatures in a remote ecological “hot spot” on the border of In
 dia and Bhutan. The result is a deeply immersive film that transports audi
 ences to a rarely-seen place and urges us all to look more closely at the 
 hidden interconnections of the natural world.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250117T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250117T213000
LOCATION:Hopscotch Coffee + Kitchen\, 235 W Dodds St\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Cicada Cinema presents: Nocturnes (2024)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/cicada-cinema-presents-nocturnes-2024-makeup/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>MAKE-
 UP FOR 1/10 SCREENING | All Ages | Documentary</strong><br />\n<strong>Syn
 opsis: </strong>In the dense forests of the Eastern Himalayas\, moths are 
 whispering something to us. In the dark of night\, two curious observers s
 hine a light on this secret universe. Together\, they are on an expedition
  to decode these nocturnal creatures in a remote ecological “hot spot” on 
 the border of India and Bhutan. The result is a deeply immersive film that
  transports audiences to a rarely-seen place and urges us all to look more
  closely at the hidden interconnections of the natural world.</p>\n</BODY>
 </HTML>
END:VEVENT
