DESCRIPTION:Host: Refugee Support Network\nAll local immigrant assistance g
 roups including Exodus\, El Centro\, Refugee Support Network\, and congreg
 ational and community groups will gather proactively to share strategies a
 nd build solidarity for anticipating changes to immigration policy. Bloomi
 ngton Mayor Kerry Thomson will speak at the beginning\, and after group in
 troductions attendees will have the opportunity to learn more about the gr
 oups in small break-out sessions.
