 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Host:
  Refugee Support Network</strong><br />\nAll local immigrant assistance gr
 oups including Exodus\, El Centro\, Refugee Support Network\, and congrega
 tional and community groups will gather proactively to share strategies an
 d build solidarity for anticipating changes to immigration policy. Bloomin
 gton Mayor Kerry Thomson will speak at the beginning\, and after group int
 roductions attendees will have the opportunity to learn more about the gro
 ups in small break-out sessions.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
