UID:ai1ec-130665@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:When monstrous creatures began rising from the sea\, they jumps
 tarted a never-ending war for humanity’s survival. To combat the Kaiju mon
 sters\, massive robots called Jaegers were developed for global defense. B
 ut as the Jaegers become less able to beat back the Kaiju threat\, and wit
 h humanity on the verge of defeat\, the forces defending mankind have no c
 hoice but to turn to two unlikely heroes—a washed-up former pilot and an u
 ntested trainee—who are teamed to drive a legendary but seemingly obsolete
  Jaeger from the past as our last hope.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250121T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250121T213000
LOCATION:IU Cinema (east side of the IU Auditorium)\, 1213 E 7th St\, Bloom
 ington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Pacific Rim in 3D (2013\, PG-13) w/ Additional Films and Guests
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/pacific-rim-in-3d-2013-pg-13/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>When monstrou
 s creatures began rising from the sea\, they jumpstarted a never-ending wa
 r for humanity’s survival. To combat the Kaiju monsters\, massive robots c
 alled Jaegers were developed for global defense. But as the Jaegers become
  less able to beat back the Kaiju threat\, and with humanity on the verge 
 of defeat\, the forces defending mankind have no choice but to turn to two
  unlikely heroes—a washed-up former pilot and an untested trainee—who are 
 teamed to drive a legendary but seemingly obsolete Jaeger from the past as
  our last hope.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
