CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Squirrels are among the most common wildlife spotted in our are
 a\, but did you know Indiana is home to state-endangered squirrel species?
  It’s true! Join us for a hike where we’ll search for signs of squirrels a
 nd explore the important role they play in maintaining a balanced ecosyste
 m.\nSPECIAL NOTE: Registration for this event is offered ONLY through Bloo
 mington Parks & Recreation. “Resale” or transfer of registration is NOT ac
 cepted through third parties. If you are offered tickets to this event\, i
 t is a SCAM.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250125T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250125T153000
LOCATION:RCA Community Park - Large Shelter\, 1400 W RCA Park Dr\, Blooming
 ton
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Squirrel Appreciation Day
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/squirrel-appreciation-day/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Squirrels are
  among the most common wildlife spotted in our area\, but did you know Ind
 iana is home to state-endangered squirrel species? It’s true! Join us for 
 a hike where we’ll search for signs of squirrels and explore the important
  role they play in maintaining a balanced ecosystem.<br />\nSPECIAL NOTE: 
 Registration for this event is offered ONLY through Bloomington Parks & Re
 creation. “Resale” or transfer of registration is NOT accepted through thi
 rd parties. If you are offered tickets to this event\, it is a SCAM. </p>
 \n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
