BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-131181@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Master filmmaker Fellini partnered with his iconic wife and mus
 e\, Giulietta Masina\, for this phantasmagoric character study\, which is 
 also the director’s first color feature. Drawing on details from her own l
 ife\, Masina is Juliet\, a woman dabbling in spiritualism and whose hold o
 n reality begins to slip when she learns that her husband is having an aff
 air\, sending her on a hallucinatory journey of self-discovery in which me
 mories\, dreams\, and supernatural forces merge in a kaleidoscopic gestalt
 . With virtuosic cinematography from Gianni di Venanzo and a fearless lead
  performance by Masina\, this is one of Fellini’s most visionary films.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250125T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Film: Juliet of the Spirits
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/juliet-of-the-spirits-giulietta-degli-spiriti/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Master filmma
 ker Fellini partnered with his iconic wife and muse\, Giulietta Masina\, f
 or this phantasmagoric character study\, which is also the director’s firs
 t color feature. Drawing on details from her own life\, Masina is Juliet\,
  a woman dabbling in spiritualism and whose hold on reality begins to slip
  when she learns that her husband is having an affair\, sending her on a h
 allucinatory journey of self-discovery in which memories\, dreams\, and su
 pernatural forces merge in a kaleidoscopic gestalt. With virtuosic cinemat
 ography from Gianni di Venanzo and a fearless lead performance by Masina\,
  this is one of Fellini’s most visionary films. </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
