 is “Number One Fan.” But as her love for his work turns to dangerous obses
 sion\, he realizes he must plot his greatest story yet: how to escape with
  his life.  This spine-tingling Stephen King classic\, adapted for the sta
 ge by two-time Academy Award-winner William Goldman\, will grip you until 
 the very end!
