DESCRIPTION:Set in France in 1889\, the film follows the life of Dodin Bouf
 fant (Benoît Magimel) as a chef living with his personal cook and lover Eu
 génie (Juliette Binoche). They share a long history of gastronomy and love
 \, but Eugénie refuses to marry Dodin\, so the food lover decides to do so
 mething he has never done before: cook for her. [135 min\; drama\, history
 \, romance\; French with English subtitles]
