CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Doors at 6pm \n“CAMP” is a vibrant and inclusive queer comedy s
 howcase that celebrates the diverse voices of the LGBTQ+ community. It pro
 vides a safe\, welcoming space where queer performers can express themselv
 es freely\, sharing their stories\, jokes\, and acts with an audience that
  values authenticity and humor. Through laughter\, CAMP highlights the ric
 hness of queer experiences while fostering connection\, understanding\, an
 d fun.Trivia at 8:30pm
