X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Doors
  at 6pm </strong><br />\n“CAMP” is a vibrant and inclusive queer comedy sh
 owcase that celebrates the diverse voices of the LGBTQ+ community. It prov
 ides a safe\, welcoming space where queer performers can express themselve
 s freely\, sharing their stories\, jokes\, and acts with an audience that 
 values authenticity and humor. Through laughter\, CAMP highlights the rich
 ness of queer experiences while fostering connection\, understanding\, and
  fun.<strong>Trivia at 8:30pm</strong></p>\n</BODY></HTML>
