BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-132167@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:About Kneecap\nFormer schoolteacher JJ and local hoods/casual d
 rug dealers Naoise and Liam Og are Kneecap\, an unlikely trio rapping in t
 heir native Irish and unlikely figureheads of a civil rights movement to s
 ave their mother tongue. But first they must overcome police\, paramilitar
 ies\, and politicians trying to silence their defiant sound while their an
 archic approach to life makes them their own worst enemies. In this fierce
 ly original sex\, drugs and hip-hop quasi-biopic\, Kneecap play themselves
 \, laying down a global rallying cry for the defense of native cultures. F
 irst Irish-language film  to premiere at the Sundance Film Festival (and a
 t IU Cinema!). [135 min\; comedy\, drama\; English and Irish with  English
  subtitles]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250221T220000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:IU Cinema Not-Quite Midnights: KNEECAP
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/iu-cinema-not-quite-midnights-kneecap/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>About Kneecap
 </p>\n<p>Former schoolteacher JJ and local hoods/casual drug dealers Naois
 e and Liam Og are Kneecap\, an unlikely trio rapping in their native Irish
  and unlikely figureheads of a civil rights movement to save their mother 
 tongue. But first they must overcome police\, paramilitaries\, and politic
 ians trying to silence their defiant sound while their anarchic approach t
 o life makes them their own worst enemies. In this fiercely original sex\,
  drugs and hip-hop quasi-biopic\, Kneecap play themselves\, laying down a 
 global rallying cry for the defense of native cultures. First Irish-langua
 ge film  to premiere at the Sundance Film Festival (and at IU Cinema!). [1
 35 min\; comedy\, drama\; English and Irish with  English subtitles]</p>\n
 </BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
