BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-132059@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Doors at 5:30pm\nJoin the IU Student Foundation at the Buskirk 
 Chumley Theater for IU Sing A Cappella 2025 on Saturday February 22nd! IU 
 Sing A Cappella will showcase talented student groups performing for the o
 pportunity to sing at the 2025 Little 500 races. IU Sing is a campus music
 al competition that\, for more than 80 years\, has gathered student groups
  to create and perform original productions. With its rich history of host
 ing student events\, IUSF is proud to revive this time-honored IU traditio
 n for a new generation.\nFunds raised from IU Sing will benefit the 2025 S
 tudents Helping Students campaign.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250222T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250222T210000
LOCATION:Buskirk Chumley Theater\, 114 E Kirkwood Ave.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:IU Sing A Cappella
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/iu-sing-a-cappella/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Doors
  at 5:30pm</strong></p>\n<p>Join the IU Student Foundation at the Buskirk 
 Chumley Theater for IU Sing A Cappella 2025 on Saturday February 22nd! IU 
 Sing A Cappella will showcase talented student groups performing for the o
 pportunity to sing at the 2025 Little 500 races. IU Sing is a campus music
 al competition that\, for more than 80 years\, has gathered student groups
  to create and perform original productions. With its rich history of host
 ing student events\, IUSF is proud to revive this time-honored IU traditio
 n for a new generation.</p>\n<p>Funds raised from IU Sing will benefit the
  2025 Students Helping Students campaign.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
