BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-132258@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Mendez is an intuitive songwriter\, melodies channeled through 
 ether\, a storyteller who across his catalog has chronicled vivid violence
  and instability — a wallet chain to the head\, a crack house arrest\, the
  misdeeds from addiction that hang around like a ghost of past lives — but
  it’s threaded together with love songs\, too\, with odes to friendship\, 
 true dedication\, the things that can buoy one through the worst. Mendez h
 as a habit of noticing those things\, of finding the light\, exacting poet
 ry from even the bleakest\, shit-caked situations. In his songs there is a
 n innate ability to balance grit with gentleness\, cruelties rewritten thr
 ough preternatural sweetness\, a heart thrumming unendingly\, confidently\
 , through the dark.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250228T200000
LOCATION:The Bishop Bar\, 123 South Walnut St.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Greg Mendez with Hemlock and Kay Krull  (18+)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/greg-mendez-with-hemlock-and-kay-krull-18/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Mendez is an 
 intuitive songwriter\, melodies channeled through ether\, a storyteller wh
 o across his catalog has chronicled vivid violence and instability — a wal
 let chain to the head\, a crack house arrest\, the misdeeds from addiction
  that hang around like a ghost of past lives — but it’s threaded together 
 with love songs\, too\, with odes to friendship\, true dedication\, the th
 ings that can buoy one through the worst. Mendez has a habit of noticing t
 hose things\, of finding the light\, exacting poetry from even the bleakes
 t\, shit-caked situations. In his songs there is an innate ability to bala
 nce grit with gentleness\, cruelties rewritten through preternatural sweet
 ness\, a heart thrumming unendingly\, confidently\, through the dark.</p>
 \n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
