CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:1999 | USA | PG-13 | DCP\nJuggling laugh-out-loud humor\, swash
 buckling action\, chilling special effects\, and swooning romance with equ
 al parts sincerity and style\, The Mummy offers all the thrills you could 
 want.
