BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-130457@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the Spring Equinox with us at our magical little plan
 t shop! Join us for a fun and educational terrarium-making workshop where 
 we’ll guide you through the process of creating your very own living maste
 rpiece. We’ll explain each layer of the terrarium— from the base to the be
 autiful plants that will thrive within it. You’ll have the chance to choos
 e up to 4 plants from our selection to personalize your creation! All mate
 rials for inside the terrarium are provided\, but feel free to bring your 
 own unique vessel (we recommend one at least 6″ in diameter) or purchase o
 ne in store when you arrive. Let’s welcome the season of renewal by bringi
 ng a bit of nature into your space.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250309T140000
LOCATION:oak.\, 116 W 6th St #101\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Spring Equinox Terrarium Workshop
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/spring-equinox-terrarium-workshop/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Celebrate the
  Spring Equinox with us at our magical little plant shop! Join us for a fu
 n and educational terrarium-making workshop where we’ll guide you through 
 the process of creating your very own living masterpiece. We’ll explain ea
 ch layer of the terrarium— from the base to the beautiful plants that will
  thrive within it. You’ll have the chance to choose up to 4 plants from ou
 r selection to personalize your creation! All materials for inside the ter
 rarium are provided\, but feel free to bring your own unique vessel (we re
 commend one at least 6″ in diameter) or purchase one in store when you arr
 ive. Let’s welcome the season of renewal by bringing a bit of nature into 
 your space.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
