CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:This month’s Folklore Night features presentations by Adriane P
 ontecorvo and chloē fourte. All ages. Free\, but donations are welcome to 
 support the Folklore and Ethnomusicology Student Associations. The usual “
 jam” will not be featured this month\, though musicians are encouraged to 
 reach out about performing at future events\nLive from the Fillmore: Non-P
 rofit Media in a Technocapitalist Dystopia\nAgainst forces of dramatic eco
 nomic disparity and ongoing gentrification\, Poor People’s Radio aims to s
 erve San Francisco’s low-income populace with programming like Uplift\, a 
 show created in tandem with the Church of John Coltrane.
