DESCRIPTION:At 7pm\, join us for our monthly full moon ritual! Takes place 
 indoors. No preparation necessary\, just yourself and an open mind. This r
 itual will be led by Kae and Raine\, drawing on both eclectic and Nordic p
 ractices. Ritual attendance is free\, though donations to keep ritual supp
 lies up are appreciated.
