CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Becky Stapf. A group of ten people gather at the ma
 nsion on Soldier Island\, just off the coast of Devon. They are invited un
 der a variety of pretenses: for employment\, for a detective case\, or jus
 t for a good time. Before the party truly gets under way\, a recording pla
 ys that accuses each guest of murder. Baffled\, these strangers realize th
 at they have no idea who their host is\, and when the first guest is murde
 red\, they understand that they have been brought to the island by a mania
 c who intends to dispense his own perverted form of justice.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250315T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250315T213000
LOCATION:John Waldron Arts Center Firebay\, 122 South Walnut St.\, Blooming
 ton
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20250321T193000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20250322T193000
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Monroe County Civic Theater presents: ‘And Then There Were None’
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/monroe-county-civic-theater-presents-and-then-th
 ere-were-none/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Directed by B
 ecky Stapf. A group of ten people gather at the mansion on Soldier Island\
 , just off the coast of Devon. They are invited under a variety of pretens
 es: for employment\, for a detective case\, or just for a good time. Befor
 e the party truly gets under way\, a recording plays that accuses each gue
 st of murder. Baffled\, these strangers realize that they have no idea who
  their host is\, and when the first guest is murdered\, they understand th
 at they have been brought to the island by a maniac who intends to dispens
 e his own perverted form of justice.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
