UID:ai1ec-132990@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Becky Stapf.  A group of ten people gather at the m
 ansion on Soldier Island\, just off the coast of Devon. They are invited u
 nder a variety of pretenses: for employment\, for a detective case\, or ju
 st for a good time. Before the party truly gets under way\, a recording pl
 ays that accuses each guest of murder. Baffled\, these strangers realize t
 hat they have no idea who their host is\, and when the first guest is murd
 ered\, they understand that they have been brought to the island by a mani
 ac who intends to dispense his own perverted form of justice.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250316T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250316T160000
LOCATION:John Waldron Arts Center Firebay\, 122 South Walnut St.\, Blooming
 ton
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20250323T140000
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Monroe County Civic Theater presents: ‘And Then There Were None’
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/monroe-county-civic-theater-presents-and-then-th
 ere-were-none-2/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Directed by B
 ecky Stapf.  A group of ten people gather at the mansion on Soldier Island
 \, just off the coast of Devon. They are invited under a variety of preten
 ses: for employment\, for a detective case\, or just for a good time. Befo
 re the party truly gets under way\, a recording plays that accuses each gu
 est of murder. Baffled\, these strangers realize that they have no idea wh
 o their host is\, and when the first guest is murdered\, they understand t
 hat they have been brought to the island by a maniac who intends to dispen
 se his own perverted form of justice.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
