BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-132939@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Doors at 5pm\nOrbit is celebrating St Patty’s Day the only way 
 we know how.\nGreat Music and Hotdogs. We will have small amount of specia
 lty items for the day. We are so happy to announce the aligning of the pla
 nets have brought us a headliner that has been dreamed of for years. Thin 
 Glizzy (Southern Indiana’s Premier Tribute Group to the Best Band from Ire
 land Ever)\nNick Harley is gonna come back to the gulch to serenade us wit
 h his string band maybe will even hear a Pogues tune. The Montvales from C
 incy will be making their Orbit Debut\nWho knows who else will end up on t
 he bill?
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250317T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250317T223000
LOCATION:Orbit Room\, 107 North College Ave.\, Suite 001 (downstairs)\, Blo
 omington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:St. Glizzy’s Day: Thin Glizzy // Nick Harley // The Montvales
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/st-glizzys-day-thin-glizzy-nick-harley-the-montv
 ales/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Doors
  at 5pm</strong><br />\nOrbit is celebrating St Patty’s Day the only way w
 e know how.<br />\nGreat Music and Hotdogs. We will have small amount of s
 pecialty items for the day. We are so happy to announce the aligning of th
 e planets have brought us a headliner that has been dreamed of for years. 
 Thin Glizzy (Southern Indiana’s Premier Tribute Group to the Best Band fro
 m Ireland Ever)<br />\nNick Harley is gonna come back to the gulch to sere
 nade us with his string band maybe will even hear a Pogues tune. The Montv
 ales from Cincy will be making their Orbit Debut<br />\nWho knows who else
  will end up on the bill?</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
