DESCRIPTION:Join us on an incredible journey into the world of Tarot with S
 cott Kellogg! His workshop will be a deep dive into symbolism\, intuition\
 , and unlocking the mysteries of the cards. From insightful discussions to
  hands-on exercises\, every moment will feel like a step into the magical 
 realms of self-discovery. Scott’s unique approach to Tarot will leave you 
 inspired and connected. You will leave grateful for the shared energy and 
 wisdom from fellow Tarot enthusiasts! Come ready to embrace this newfound 
 knowledge and let the cards guide the way.
