  incredible journey into the world of Tarot with Scott Kellogg! His worksh
 op will be a deep dive into symbolism\, intuition\, and unlocking the myst
 eries of the cards. From insightful discussions to hands-on exercises\, ev
 ery moment will feel like a step into the magical realms of self-discovery
 . Scott’s unique approach to Tarot will leave you inspired and connected. 
 You will leave grateful for the shared energy and wisdom from fellow Tarot
  enthusiasts! Come ready to embrace this newfound knowledge and let the ca
 rds guide the way.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
