CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:A TRIPLE TREAT with music by two incredible\, international sin
 ger-songwriters\, Carrie Newcomer and Krista Detor\, with pre-show music b
 y accordion virtuoso – Svetla Vladeva. Proceeds from the fundraiser will g
 o toward supporting our May production of 4000 Miles by Amy Herzog. Ticket
 s for the production will be available for purchase at the event.\nCarrie 
 Newcomer is an internationally touring Emmy-winning performer\, Grammy-ack
 nowledged songwriter\, recording artist\, poet\, activist\, educator\, a S
 ubtack author\, Podcast Co-Host. Carrie has 20 nationally released albums 
 including A Great Wild Mercy. Newcomer has also released three companion b
 ooks of poetry & essays. Described as “A prairie mystic” (Boston Globe) an
 d one who “asks all the right questions” (Rolling Stone)\nKrista Detor is 
 an award-winning Musician\, Composer\, & Writer. She’s been recognized by 
 the Indiana Legislature for Contributions to the Arts\, as well as feature
 d on the award-winning ‘Wilderness Plots\, ‘in steady rotation on PBS Nati
 onal. “An artist of rare ability with a deep poetic gift … a small miracle
 ” (Rolling Stone)\nSvetla Vladeva is an accomplished musician and a multi-
 instrumentals. She has performed as a soloist and with many ensembles loca
 lly\, nationally and internationally.\nBountiful\, scrumptious brunch food
 s will be provided after the program.
