 pectedly sympathetic to the couple\, and when his boss wants the playwrigh
 t’s lover for himself\, Wiesler must determine where his true loyalties li
 e. Oscar winner for Best Foreign Film (2006). [137 min\; thriller\; German
  with English subtitles]
