CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Please join the IU Asian Culture Center and the City of Bloomin
 gton at the kickoff celebration of the 2025 Asian American and Pacific Isl
 ander Heritage Month on March 27\, 2025\, from 5:00 to 8:30 pm at the Busk
 irk-Chumley Theater. The event’s featured activities represent the diversi
 ty within IU and the broader Bloomington community. It includes a showcase
  of Asian arts and crafts for kids and Asian food trucks outside of the Th
 eater from 5:00pm-7:00pm\, followed by cultural performances and fashion s
 how until 8:30pm. This event is open to all ages\, there will be something
  for everyone!
