 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Please join t
 he IU Asian Culture Center and the City of Bloomington at the kickoff cele
 bration of the 2025 Asian American and Pacific Islander Heritage Month on 
 March 27\, 2025\, from 5:00 to 8:30 pm at the Buskirk-Chumley Theater. The
  event’s featured activities represent the diversity within IU and the bro
 ader Bloomington community. It includes a showcase of Asian arts and craft
 s for kids and Asian food trucks outside of the Theater from 5:00pm-7:00pm
