UID:ai1ec-133499@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Doors at 6:30pm “Around the World in 4 Days” is a feature-lengt
 h portrait of Bloomington’s Lotus World Music & Arts Festival by Lotus vol
 unteer Merrill Hatlen\, who began documenting LotusFest in 2000.\nUsing ex
 cerpts from performances in several venues\, as well as behind the scenes 
 footage and interviews\, the film includes artists from across the globe. 
 It received a documentary award at the Global Film and Music Festival in G
 reat Falls\, Virginia.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250331T190000
LOCATION:Buskirk Chumley Theater\, 114 E Kirkwood Ave.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Around the World in Four Days: A documentary showcasing the Lotus W
 orld Music and Arts Festival
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/around-the-world-in-four-days-a-documentary-show
 casing-the-lotus-world-music-and-arts-festival/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Doors
  at 6:30pm</strong> “Around the World in 4 Days” is a feature-length portr
 ait of Bloomington’s Lotus World Music & Arts Festival by Lotus volunteer 
 Merrill Hatlen\, who began documenting LotusFest in 2000.</p>\n<p>Using ex
 cerpts from performances in several venues\, as well as behind the scenes 
 footage and interviews\, the film includes artists from across the globe. 
 It received a documentary award at the Global Film and Music Festival in G
 reat Falls\, Virginia.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-130788@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:locallive@wfhb.org\; https://wfhb.org/category/music/live-sessions/
