UID:ai1ec-133718@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Don’t miss your chance to experience this magical\, musical ret
 elling of “Hansel and Gretel”! All ages.\nReimagining Opera for Kids is a 
 Bloomington-based traveling children’s opera troupe that gives free childr
 en’s opera performances to kids and families throughout Monroe County and 
 its surrounding counties. Their mission is to introduce children and youth
  to performing arts through free or accessibly-subsidized performance and 
 curriculum guides\, and to give musicians the opportunity to hone and shar
 e their performance skills through community engagement.\nThis program is 
 in partnership with Reimagining Opera for Kids.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250403T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250403T183000
LOCATION:Auditorium\, Monroe County Public Library\, 303 East Kirkwood Ave.
 \, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Reimagining Opera For Kids – Bloomington Symphony Orchestra
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/reimagining-opera-for-kids-bloomington-symphony-
 orchestra/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Don’t miss yo
 ur chance to experience this magical\, musical retelling of “Hansel and Gr
 etel”! All ages.</p>\n<p>Reimagining Opera for Kids is a Bloomington-based
  traveling children’s opera troupe that gives free children’s opera perfor
 mances to kids and families throughout Monroe County and its surrounding c
 ounties. Their mission is to introduce children and youth to performing ar
 ts through free or accessibly-subsidized performance and curriculum guides
 \, and to give musicians the opportunity to hone and share their performan
 ce skills through community engagement.</p>\n<p>This program is in partner
 ship with Reimagining Opera for Kids.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
