UID:ai1ec-133644@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Doors at 7:30pm\nAnother Round is Indiana University’s premier 
 all-male a cappella group. Established in 1996\, Another Round has enterta
 ined audiences in Bloomington and beyond for over two decades. By pairing 
 their rich harmonies with their signature sense of humor\, Another Round p
 uts their audiences in the middle of a truly unique entertainment experien
 ce. Their chemistry and showmanship leave you with a feeling of hometown c
 harm unique to the group’s beloved Bloomington\, Indiana. Join us for a ni
 ght of music you will not forget!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250404T200000
LOCATION:Buskirk Chumley Theater\, 114 E Kirkwood Ave.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Another Round’s Spring Concert
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/another-rounds-spring-concert/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Doors
  at 7:30pm</strong><br />\nAnother Round is Indiana University’s premier a
 ll-male a cappella group. Established in 1996\, Another Round has entertai
 ned audiences in Bloomington and beyond for over two decades. By pairing t
 heir rich harmonies with their signature sense of humor\, Another Round pu
 ts their audiences in the middle of a truly unique entertainment experienc
 e. Their chemistry and showmanship leave you with a feeling of hometown ch
 arm unique to the group’s beloved Bloomington\, Indiana. Join us for a nig
 ht of music you will not forget!</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
