DESCRIPTION:The Bloomington Music Expo returns on Saturday\, April 5\, 2025
 \, at the Switchyard Park Pavilion in Bloomington\, Indiana. Come shop for
  new and pre-loved vinyl\, CDs\, tapes\, posters\, music memorabilia\, and
  more! Food trucks on site! Show hours are 10 a.m.-4 p.m. Admission is $2.
  Door prize drawings at 11 a.m. and 1 p.m. Learn more at https://ftrvinyl.
 com/bloomington-music-expo/\nQuestions can be sent to Jeremy Bonfiglio at 
 jeremybonfiglio@att.net.
