 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>The Bloomingt
 on Music Expo returns on Saturday\, April 5\, 2025\, at the Switchyard Par
 k Pavilion in Bloomington\, Indiana. Come shop for new and pre-loved vinyl
 \, CDs\, tapes\, posters\, music memorabilia\, and more! Food trucks on si
 te! Show hours are 10 a.m.-4 p.m. Admission is $2. Door prize drawings at 
 11 a.m. and 1 p.m. Learn more at https://ftrvinyl.com/bloomington-music-ex
