UID:ai1ec-122678@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the corner of Maple & Vine\, where every day is 1955
 .\n\n\nKatha and Ryu have become allergic to their 21st-century lives. Whe
 n they meet a charismatic man from a community of 1950s re-enactors\, they
  decide to forsake cell phones and DoorDash for cigarettes and Tupperware 
 parties. But after moving to this compulsively authentic world\, Katha and
  Ryu are surprised by what their new neighbors – and they themselves – are
  willing to sacrifice for happiness.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250405T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250405T160000
LOCATION:Constellation Playhouse\, 107 W 9th St\, Bloomington
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20250405T140000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20250406T140000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20250412T140000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20250413T140000
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Maple and Vine
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/maple-and-vine-2/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div><i>Welcome 
 to the corner of Maple & Vine\, where every day is 1955.</i></div>\n<div>
 \n<div>\n<p>Katha and Ryu have become allergic to their 21st-century lives
 . When they meet a charismatic man from a community of 1950s re-enactors\,
  they decide to forsake cell phones and DoorDash for cigarettes and Tupper
 ware parties. But after moving to this compulsively authentic world\, Kath
 a and Ryu are surprised by what their new neighbors – and they themselves 
 – are willing to sacrifice for happiness.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</BODY></HT
 ML>
END:VEVENT
