BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-133810@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:In this Howard Hawks classic\, the manager of an airmail compan
 y in South America is planning for a perilous flight when he suddenly meet
 s a traveling entertainer\, who falls for him and tries to persuade him to
  stay behind. Featuring the talents of Cary Grant\, Jean Arthur\, Rita Hay
 worth\, Richard Barthelmess\, and Thomas Mitchell\, Only Angels Have Wings
  received two Academy Award nominations for Best Visual Effects and Best C
 inematography – Black & White (1940).
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250405T160000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:City Lights Film Series: ONLY ANGELS HAVE WINGS
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/city-lights-film-series-only-angels-have-wings/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>In this Howar
 d Hawks classic\, the manager of an airmail company in South America is pl
 anning for a perilous flight when he suddenly meets a traveling entertaine
 r\, who falls for him and tries to persuade him to stay behind. Featuring 
 the talents of Cary Grant\, Jean Arthur\, Rita Hayworth\, Richard Barthelm
 ess\, and Thomas Mitchell\, Only Angels Have Wings received two Academy Aw
 ard nominations for Best Visual Effects and Best Cinematography – Black & 
 White (1940).</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
