BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-133645@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Doors at 7:30pm\nEstablished in 1999\, Ladies First has been en
 tertaining audiences with its renditions of classic and popular music for 
 25 years. In 2000\, the group advanced to the Midwest Semifinals of the Na
 tional Championships of Collegiate a Cappella and toured California with t
 he IUAA. Since then\, Ladies First has been awarded 3rd in the ICCA Distri
 ct Competition and hosted the 2015 ICCA Quarterfinals at Indiana Universit
 y where they placed in the top 10. In 2012\, the group had the honor of pe
 rforming with Madonna and Cee Lo Green at Super Bowl XLVI in Indianapolis.
  Since the debut of their self-titled album in April 2000\, the group has 
 released six additional albums. Ladies First also released two singles in 
 2022\, “Parting Glass” and “What a Wonderful World”. Currently\, the group
  is working on their 7th studio album to be released this semester! Althou
 gh the love for making music brings the group together\, it is the lifelon
 g friendships that keeps the legacy of Ladies First strong throughout the 
 years.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250405T200000
LOCATION:Buskirk Chumley Theater\, 114 E Kirkwood Ave.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Ladies First A Cappella Spring Showcase
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/ladies-first-a-cappella-spring-showcase-2/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Doors
  at 7:30pm</strong><br />\nEstablished in 1999\, Ladies First has been ent
 ertaining audiences with its renditions of classic and popular music for 2
 5 years. In 2000\, the group advanced to the Midwest Semifinals of the Nat
 ional Championships of Collegiate a Cappella and toured California with th
 e IUAA. Since then\, Ladies First has been awarded 3rd in the ICCA Distric
 t Competition and hosted the 2015 ICCA Quarterfinals at Indiana University
  where they placed in the top 10. In 2012\, the group had the honor of per
 forming with Madonna and Cee Lo Green at Super Bowl XLVI in Indianapolis. 
 Since the debut of their self-titled album in April 2000\, the group has r
 eleased six additional albums. Ladies First also released two singles in 2
 022\, “Parting Glass” and “What a Wonderful World”. Currently\, the group 
 is working on their 7th studio album to be released this semester! Althoug
 h the love for making music brings the group together\, it is the lifelong
  friendships that keeps the legacy of Ladies First strong throughout the y
 ears. </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
