DESCRIPTION:Raised in Hopedale\, Massachusetts\, Dana began performing come
 dy onstage at age 17. After high school\, he studied communications and th
 eatre at the University of Massachusetts Amherst\, but after a year moved 
 to San Francisco to pursue a career in comedy. It was there he\, along wit
 h fellow comedian Alex Reid\, founded the San Francisco Comedy Condo in 19
 86.
