 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Raised in Hop
 edale\, Massachusetts\, Dana began performing comedy onstage at age 17. Af
 ter high school\, he studied communications and theatre at the University 
 of Massachusetts Amherst\, but after a year moved to San Francisco to purs
 ue a career in comedy. It was there he\, along with fellow comedian Alex R
 eid\, founded the San Francisco Comedy Condo in 1986.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
