CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate spring with us at our annual Spring Fusing Fest!
  Everyone\, ages 5 and up\, can join in the fun by creating their very own
  collaged fused glass suncatcher with vibrant glass pieces. Participants w
 ill begin with a clear fused glass blank then use pieces of glass in vario
 us sizes and shapes to bring their vision to life. Once completed to your 
 liking\, we will take it and fuse it in our kilns overnight. Pieces are av
 ailable for pick up the following Wednesday when we reopen. Don’t miss thi
 s opportunity to craft unique keepsakes that brighten your home!\nNo exper
 ience necessary!\nAges 5+
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250412T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250412T150000
LOCATION:Bloomington Creative Glass Center\, 229 West Grimes Lane\, Bloomin
 gton
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Spring Fusing Fest
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/spring-fusing-fest/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Come celebrat
 e spring with us at our annual Spring Fusing Fest! Everyone\, ages 5 and u
 p\, can join in the fun by creating their very own collaged fused glass su
 ncatcher with vibrant glass pieces. Participants will begin with a clear f
 used glass blank then use pieces of glass in various sizes and shapes to b
 ring their vision to life. Once completed to your liking\, we will take it
  and fuse it in our kilns overnight. Pieces are available for pick up the 
 following Wednesday when we reopen. Don’t miss this opportunity to craft u
 nique keepsakes that brighten your home!</p>\n<p>No experience necessary!<
 br />\nAges 5+</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
