BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-133975@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Lick Creek Band play a unique brand of “Eclectic Acoustic Music
 ” with a playlist of familiar songs that you love from different genres li
 ke Rock\, Soul\, Latin\, Blues\, Bluegrass and Jazz \, all flavored with t
 he sweetness of the traditional acoustic sound of Southern Indiana. Vocal 
 harmony is the most distinctive feature of the group. Three vocalists alte
 rnate lead and backup\, supported by two guitars\, upright bass\, harmonic
 a\, ukulele and handheld percussion. Their mission is to make you say\, ‘O
 h\, I love that song!’
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250412T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250412T210000
LOCATION:Mitchell Opera House\, 217 North 7th Street\, Mitchell
SEQUENCE:0
