 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Lick Creek Ba
 nd play a unique brand of “Eclectic Acoustic Music” with a playlist of fam
 iliar songs that you love from different genres like Rock\, Soul\, Latin\,
  Blues\, Bluegrass and Jazz \, all flavored with the sweetness of the trad
 itional acoustic sound of Southern Indiana. Vocal harmony is the most dist
 inctive feature of the group. Three vocalists alternate lead and backup\, 
 supported by two guitars\, upright bass\, harmonica\, ukulele and handheld
  percussion. Their mission is to make you say\, ‘Oh\, I love that song!’</
 p>\n</BODY></HTML>
