CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Gareth Edwards | 2010 | United Kingdom | R |\nSix years ago\, N
 ASA discovered the possibility of alien life within our solar system. A pr
 obe was launched to collect samples\, but crashed upon reentry over Centra
 l America. Soon after\, new life forms began to appear and half of Mexico 
 was quarantined as an “infected zone.” Today\, the American and Mexican mi
 litary still struggle to contain “the creatures.” Our story begins when a 
 U.S. journalist (Scoot McNairy) agrees to escort a shaken American tourist
  (Whitney Able) through the infected zone to the safety of the U.S. border
 . [94 min\; adventure\, sci-fi\, romance\, thriller\; English and Spanish 
 with English subtitles]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250415T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Beyond First Contact Film Series: MONSTERS
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/beyond-first-contact-film-series-monsters/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Gareth Edward
 s | 2010 | United Kingdom | R |<br />\nSix years ago\, NASA discovered the
  possibility of alien life within our solar system. A probe was launched t
 o collect samples\, but crashed upon reentry over Central America. Soon af
 ter\, new life forms began to appear and half of Mexico was quarantined as
  an “infected zone.” Today\, the American and Mexican military still strug
 gle to contain “the creatures.” Our story begins when a U.S. journalist (S
 coot McNairy) agrees to escort a shaken American tourist (Whitney Able) th
 rough the infected zone to the safety of the U.S. border. [94 min\; advent
 ure\, sci-fi\, romance\, thriller\; English and Spanish with English subti
 tles]</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
