UID:ai1ec-134316@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:When young Alice finds herself in a strange world where everyth
 ing seems upside down\, she must find her way home…and find herself along 
 the way. As she travels through Wonderland\, she encounters all of the ico
 nic characters that audiences have come to love: including the ever-tardy 
 White Rabbit\, the grinning Cheshire Cat\, a cool Caterpillar\, the wacky 
 Mad Hatter\, and the hot-tempered Queen of Hearts.Alice in Wonderland JR. 
 features Disney favorites such as “The Golden Afternoon\,” “The Unbirthday
  Song\,” and “Painting the Roses Red” along with brand-new songs\, includi
 ng music from the 2010 live-action film.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250418T190000
LOCATION:The Warehouse Bloomington\, 1525 S. Rogers St.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Stages Bloomington presents Disney’s Alice in Wonderland JR
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/stages-bloomington-presents-disneys-alice-in-won
 derland-jr/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>When young Al
 ice finds herself in a strange world where everything seems upside down\, 
 she must find her way home…and find herself along the way. As she travels 
 through Wonderland\, she encounters all of the iconic characters that audi
 ences have come to love: including the ever-tardy White Rabbit\, the grinn
 ing Cheshire Cat\, a cool Caterpillar\, the wacky Mad Hatter\, and the hot
 -tempered Queen of Hearts.Alice in Wonderland JR. features Disney favorite
 s such as “The Golden Afternoon\,” “The Unbirthday Song\,” and “Painting t
 he Roses Red” along with brand-new songs\, including music from the 2010 l
 ive-action film.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
