CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Tom Thakkar is a comedian you’ve seen on “The Tonight Show with
  Jimmy Fallon\,” “Comedy Central’s Stand Up Presents\,” “This Week at the 
 Comedy Cellar\,” “CONAN\,” and as the host of Comedy Central’s “Stand Up w
 ith Tom Thakkar.” He spent the first half of 2020 writing sketches and jok
 es for SyFy’s “The Movie Show\,” and before that he was the co-host of “Yo
 u Up with Nikki Glaser” on SiriusXM. Currently\, he hosts the podcast “Sta
 nd By Your Band\,” and when the world isn’t shut down by a pandemic\, he d
 oes stand up all around country and all around New York as a regular at Th
 e Comedy Cellar\, Caroline’s on Broadway\, New York Comedy Club\, Stand Up
  New York\, and more.
