 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Tom Thakkar i
 s a comedian you’ve seen on “The Tonight Show with Jimmy Fallon\,” “Comedy
  Central’s Stand Up Presents\,” “This Week at the Comedy Cellar\,” “CONAN\
 ,” and as the host of Comedy Central’s “Stand Up with Tom Thakkar.” He spe
 nt the first half of 2020 writing sketches and jokes for SyFy’s “The Movie
  Show\,” and before that he was the co-host of “You Up with Nikki Glaser” 
 on SiriusXM. Currently\, he hosts the podcast “Stand By Your Band\,” and w
 hen the world isn’t shut down by a pandemic\, he does stand up all around 
 country and all around New York as a regular at The Comedy Cellar\, Caroli
 ne’s on Broadway\, New York Comedy Club\, Stand Up New York\, and more.</p
 >\n</BODY></HTML>
