UID:ai1ec-134266@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Combine the vibrance of alcohol inks with the serenity of natur
 al landscapes in this new workshop with returning instructor Gail Fairfiel
 d!\nLearn to create deconstructed images of the natural world by harnessin
 g the fluid\, unpredictable nature of alcohol inks and exploring imaginati
 ve color combinations and textures that echo its inherent beauty. \nPrevio
 us experience with alcohol inks is recommended but not required for this c
 lass. Wherever you are on your creative journey\, Gail’s expert guidance w
 ill help you embrace the medium’s versatility and create stunning\, one-of
 -a-kind compositions. \nCome ready to experiment\, play\, and capture visi
 ons of the great outdoors on paper!\n    Cost of admission includes all su
 pplies.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250419T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250419T150000
LOCATION:Bloomington Fine Art Supply\, 207 South Rogers St.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Alcohol Ink: Abstract Landscapes
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/alcohol-ink-abstract-landscapes/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Combine the v
 ibrance of alcohol inks with the serenity of natural landscapes in this ne
 w workshop with returning instructor Gail Fairfield!</p>\n<p>Learn to crea
 te deconstructed images of the natural world by harnessing the fluid\, unp
 redictable nature of alcohol inks and exploring imaginative color combinat
 ions and textures that echo its inherent beauty. </p>\n<p>Previous experie
 nce with alcohol inks is recommended but not required for this class. Wher
 ever you are on your creative journey\, Gail’s expert guidance will help y
 ou embrace the medium’s versatility and create stunning\, one-of-a-kind co
 mpositions. </p>\n<p>Come ready to experiment\, play\, and capture visions
  of the great outdoors on paper!</p>\n<p>    Cost of admission includes al
 l supplies.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
