 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>1pm – DOORS O
 PEN<br />\nSchedule:<br />\n1:30pm – Introduction & Sound Healing Journey<
 /p>\n<p>Film Lineup & Q&As:</p>\n<p>2pm – Descending the Mountain (2021) –
  1hr 18 min<br />\nA Zen monk and a neuroscientist team up to explore the 
 effects of psilocybin in meditators.<br />\nFollowed by live Zoom Q&A with
  filmmakers<br />\n4pm – The Way of the Psychonaut (2020) – 1hr 27min<br /
 >\nStanislav Grof and the Journey of Consciousness explores psychology\, p
 sychedelics\, Holotropic Breathwork\, and the evolution of Grof’s work.<br
  />\nFollowed by live Zoom Q&A with filmmakers<br />\n7:30pm – The Song Th
 at Calls You Home (2020) – 1hr 13 min<br />\nA feature documentary on Ship
 ibo Shamanism and the Ayahuasca experience.<br />\nFollowed by live Zoom Q
 &A with filmmakers<br />\n9pm – Soma Vibe: Ecstatic Dance Experience A tra
 nsformative 2-hour journey with live music accompaniment.</p>\n</BODY></HT
 ML>
