CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Since 1997\, Saakumu Dance Troupe has been dedicated to introdu
 cing new audiences to traditional and contemporary Ghanaian dance and musi
 c. Saakumu Dance Troupe is the resident dance company of the Dagara Music 
 Center (DMC) in Ghana. Saakumu is driven by a passion for bringing innovat
 ive dances and world music to our audiences through performances in Ghana 
 and abroad.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250422T184500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250422T200000
LOCATION:Sweeney Hall\, 1201 East Third St.\, Bloomington
