BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-134919@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Doors at 5:30pm\n1969 was a year to remember. The Moon Landing.
  Woodstock. Sesame Street’s first season. The founding of our beloved Bloo
 mington Symphony Orchestra.\nOur upcoming gala celebrates some of the mile
 stones of that fabulous year.\n– Get down and get funky with a DJ / Karaok
 e spinning all your favorite tunes from the late 60s and early 70s\n– Look
  your coolest\, dude\, at our super hip photo booth\n– Enjoy fun snacks (i
 ncluded in ticket price)\, and themed cocktails (for card purchase)\n– We’
 ll also have a short program about the BSO’s past\, present and future\, a
 nd other fun ways for you to celebrate our milestone season.\nSo dust off 
 those bell bottoms and the tie dye\, and join us for a groovy evening of p
 eace\, love\, and music. It’s going to be outta sight!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250504T180000
LOCATION:Buskirk Chumley Theater\, 114 E Kirkwood Ave.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Get in the Groove! Celebrating 1969 to now with the Bloomington Sym
 phony
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/get-in-the-groove-celebrating-1969-to-now-with-t
 he-bloomington-symphony/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Doors
  at 5:30pm</strong><br />\n1969 was a year to remember. The Moon Landing. 
 Woodstock. Sesame Street’s first season. The founding of our beloved Bloom
 ington Symphony Orchestra.<br />\nOur upcoming gala celebrates some of the
  milestones of that fabulous year.<br />\n– Get down and get funky with a 
 DJ / Karaoke spinning all your favorite tunes from the late 60s and early 
 70s<br />\n– Look your coolest\, dude\, at our super hip photo booth<br />
 \n– Enjoy fun snacks (included in ticket price)\, and themed cocktails (fo
 r card purchase)<br />\n– We’ll also have a short program about the BSO’s 
 past\, present and future\, and other fun ways for you to celebrate our mi
 lestone season.<br />\nSo dust off those bell bottoms and the tie dye\, an
 d join us for a groovy evening of peace\, love\, and music. It’s going to 
 be outta sight!</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
