 , confidential legal IN-PERSON consultations for residents of Brown County
  who cannot afford an attorney.</strong><br />\nReceive advice on Civil Le
 gal Issues including:</p>\n<p>Family law (child support\, custody\, divorc
 e\, parenting time)<br />\nGuardianships<br />\nPowers of Attorney<br />\n
 Protective Orders<br />\nSimple Wills and Small Estates</p>\n<p>Receive ad
 vice on Housing Legal Issues including:<br />\nEviction/Housing Issues<br 
 />\nDamages Hearings<br />\nSealing of Eviction Records</p>\n</BODY></HTML
 >
END:VEVENT
