UID:ai1ec-135264@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Not your typical tribute band fare\, Griese delights audiences 
 using only his uncanny Taylor-like vocals & guitar playing\, and a uniquel
 y down-to-earth personality. No impersonations or theatrics\; just the gre
 at music of JT.\n“The next best thing to James\,” “his voice is spot on\,”
  “close my eyes and it’s JT\,” “I don’t like tributes but I LOVED this sho
 w\,” “James would be proud\,” “amazing guitar playing\,” “everything he do
 es honors JT” (from 500+ 5-star reviews). Come hear favorites like Fire an
 d Rain\, You’ve Got a Friend\, Shower the People\, How Sweet It Is\, and S
 teamroller\, as well as hidden gems and much more.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250510T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250510T210000
LOCATION:Mitchell Opera House\, 217 North 7th Street\, Mitchell
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Sweet Baby James (James Taylor Tribute)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/sweet-baby-james-james-taylor-tribute/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Not your typi
 cal tribute band fare\, Griese delights audiences using only his uncanny T
 aylor-like vocals & guitar playing\, and a uniquely down-to-earth personal
 ity. No impersonations or theatrics\; just the great music of JT.</p>\n<p>
 “The next best thing to James\,” “his voice is spot on\,” “close my eyes a
 nd it’s JT\,” “I don’t like tributes but I LOVED this show\,” “James would
  be proud\,” “amazing guitar playing\,” “everything he does honors JT” (fr
 om 500+ 5-star reviews). Come hear favorites like Fire and Rain\, You’ve G
 ot a Friend\, Shower the People\, How Sweet It Is\, and Steamroller\, as w
 ell as hidden gems and much more.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
