BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-135487@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:May in Indiana brings a chorus of songs\, including that of the
  “forest flutist”\, the wood thrush\, and the long\, overlapping\, musical
  trills of American toads. Experience the sounds of spring with creatures 
 of field and forest along with vocalist Stephanie Heidemann. Musical guest
 : Stephanie Heidemann–World/Early Music\, Soprano Originally from Michigan
 \, Stephanie has toured nationally with world music a cappella quartet VID
 A\, and is lead vocalist with The Soma Vibe Experience and Stephanie’s own
  band\, Starseed. Admission to Nature Sounds programs is free. Bring your 
 own seating.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250516T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250516T193000
LOCATION:Sherwood Oaks Park\, 1600 East Elliston Dr\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:CANCELED – Nature Sounds: Thrill of the Trill
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/nature-sounds-thrill-of-the-trill/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>May in Indian
 a brings a chorus of songs\, including that of the “forest flutist”\, the 
 wood thrush\, and the long\, overlapping\, musical trills of American toad
 s. <strong>Experience the sounds of spring with creatures of field and for
 est along with vocalist Stephanie Heidemann.</strong> Musical guest: Steph
 anie Heidemann–World/Early Music\, Soprano Originally from Michigan\, Step
 hanie has toured nationally with world music a cappella quartet VIDA\, and
  is lead vocalist with The Soma Vibe Experience and Stephanie’s own band\,
  Starseed. Admission to Nature Sounds programs is free. Bring your own sea
 ting.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
