 /bedford-farmers-market.html
DESCRIPTION:The Bedford Farmers Market consists of local farmers\, artisans
  and bakers\; all items for sale at the market are handmade/homegrown in L
 awrence County and within 75 miles from courthouse. Products available at 
 the Bedford Farmers Market include fresh produce\, plants\, farm fresh egg
 s\, local beef\, chicken and pork\, baked goods\, jams\, jellies\, sweet b
 read\, pies\, cinnamon rolls\, jewelry\, tie-dye\, pottery\, leather goods
 \, baby items\, candles\, walking sticks\, baskets\, crochet dolls/animals
  and a variety of other art/craft items.\nWe welcome new vendors/performer
 s throughout the season
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250517T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250517T120000
