RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;UNTIL=20251025T235959Z;BYDAY=SA;WKST=MO
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Bedford Farmers’ Market
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/bedford-farmers-market-2025/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>The Bedford F
 armers Market consists of local farmers\, artisans and bakers\; all items 
 for sale at the market are handmade/homegrown in Lawrence County and withi
 n 75 miles from courthouse. Products available at the Bedford Farmers Mark
 et include fresh produce\, plants\, farm fresh eggs\, local beef\, chicken
  and pork\, baked goods\, jams\, jellies\, sweet bread\, pies\, cinnamon r
 olls\, jewelry\, tie-dye\, pottery\, leather goods\, baby items\, candles\
 , walking sticks\, baskets\, crochet dolls/animals and a variety of other 
 art/craft items.</p>\n<p>We welcome new vendors/performers throughout the 
 season</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
