 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Brown County 
 Game Conference (BroCoCon) is a family-friendly consumer game show hosted 
 by The Toy Chest. It is designed to be fun to attend with the whole family
  or without kids. We will have games to learn and play (as well as purchas
 e) in strategy\, family\, party\, and preschool categories. There will als
 o be special events\, game tournaments\, preschool game highlights\, outdo
 or games\, and strategy game instruction. General admission tickets allow 
 admission to the general event from 10am-5pm as well as continued access t
 o open-play spaces.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
