 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Make somethin
 g beautiful that gives twice: once as a gift\, and again when it blooms! <
 strong>This spring workshop will introduce you to the art of handmade pape
 rs\, using recycled pulp\, flower petals\, and native Indiana wildflower s
 eeds. Each piece is plantable\, personal\, and planet-friendly.</strong> <
 /p>\n</BODY></HTML>
