BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-134861@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:Heartland Hollows Lavender Farm\; 812-510-3325\; enchantedfairytrai
 l@gmail.com\; https://www.centralinfairyfest.org/indianaenchantedfairyfest
 ival
DESCRIPTION:The Indiana Enchanted Fairy Festival returns each year on the t
 hird weekend in May. Step into a world of fantasy and enchantment! This is
  a two-day event filled with fairy-themed experiences\, featuring non-stop
  music and entertainment. Enjoy encounters with fairies\, engaging games\,
  and activities suitable for all ages. Don’t miss live unicorns\, mermaids
 \, aerial acrobatics\, and pirates. Plus\, browse through over 50 unique v
 endor shops.\nExperience a variety of interactive activities\, including a
 nimal encounters\, Maypole dancing\, a labyrinth\, and crafts. The festiva
 l takes place at Heartland Hollows Lavender Farm in Owen County\, Indiana\
 , just 10 minutes west of Spencer.\nWant to join the fun? You can sign up 
 as a festival volunteer or become a part of the fairy cast. If you’re inte
 rested in participating as a vendor or entertainer\, please visit our appl
 ications page for more information at www.centralinfairyfest.org/applicati
 ons or contact us at enchantedfairytrail@gmail.com.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250517T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250517T170000
LOCATION:Heartland Hollows Lavender Farm\, 9993 Newport Rd\, Bowling Green\
 , Indiana
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20250518T100000
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:The Indiana Enchanted Fairy Festival
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/134861/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>The Indiana E
 nchanted Fairy Festival returns each year on the third weekend in May. Ste
 p into a world of fantasy and enchantment! This is a two-day event filled 
 with fairy-themed experiences\, featuring non-stop music and entertainment
 . Enjoy encounters with fairies\, engaging games\, and activities suitable
  for all ages. Don’t miss live unicorns\, mermaids\, aerial acrobatics\, a
 nd pirates. Plus\, browse through over 50 unique vendor shops.</p>\n<p>Exp
 erience a variety of interactive activities\, including animal encounters\
 , Maypole dancing\, a labyrinth\, and crafts. The festival takes place at 
 Heartland Hollows Lavender Farm in Owen County\, Indiana\, just 10 minutes
  west of Spencer.</p>\n<p>Want to join the fun? You can sign up as a festi
 val volunteer or become a part of the fairy cast. If you’re interested in 
 participating as a vendor or entertainer\, please visit our applications p
 age for more information at www.centralinfairyfest.org/applications or con
 tact us at enchantedfairytrail@gmail.com.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
