DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Christopher Nolan | 2000 | USA | R\nLeonard Shelby (Guy Pearce)
  has one goal in life: vengeance for the assault and murder of his wife. T
 here’s just one problem: Leonard can’t remember who he is\, what he’s doin
 g\, who to trust\, or what he knows thanks to a rare disorder that regular
 ly wipes his short-term memory. Nolan’s twisty\, head-scratching three-han
 der co-stars indie darlings Carrie-Anne Moss and Joe Pantoliano\, was nomi
 nated for two Oscars\, and has been entered into the Library of Congress’ 
 National Film Registry. [113 min\; thriller\, mystery\; English]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250522T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Indie Auteurs film series: MEMENTO
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/indie-auteurs-film-series-memento/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Christopher N
 olan | 2000 | USA | R<br />\nLeonard Shelby (Guy Pearce) has one goal in l
 ife: vengeance for the assault and murder of his wife. There’s just one pr
 oblem: Leonard can’t remember who he is\, what he’s doing\, who to trust\,
  or what he knows thanks to a rare disorder that regularly wipes his short
 -term memory. Nolan’s twisty\, head-scratching three-hander co-stars indie
  darlings Carrie-Anne Moss and Joe Pantoliano\, was nominated for two Osca
 rs\, and has been entered into the Library of Congress’ National Film Regi
 stry. [113 min\; thriller\, mystery\; English]</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
