DESCRIPTION:Step into the stars and join us for a magical Astrological Them
 ed Craft Night at Gather! This after-hours DIY event is all about tapping 
 into the cosmic energy and creating something woo-woo to align with the un
 iverse’s vibes. Whether you’re a seasoned star-gazer or new to the metaphy
 sical world\, it’s the perfect night to unwind\, explore the mystical\, an
 d make something magical.\nFrom celestial decor to zodiac-themed pottery\,
  our DIY bar will have all the supplies you need to bring your cosmic crea
 tions to life.\nWhat’s Included:\nAstrology and zodiac-themed craft suppli
 es at our DIY bar\nA relaxing\, otherworldly vibe to connect with your spi
 ritual side\nIt’s a night for the curious\, the creative\, and the cosmic—
 channel your inner star\, and create something magical with us! 🌙
