 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Step into the
  stars and join us for a magical Astrological Themed Craft Night at Gather
 ! This after-hours DIY event is all about tapping into the cosmic energy a
 nd creating something woo-woo to align with the universe’s vibes. Whether 
 you’re a seasoned star-gazer or new to the metaphysical world\, it’s the p
 erfect night to unwind\, explore the mystical\, and make something magical
 .<br />\nFrom celestial decor to zodiac-themed pottery\, our DIY bar will 
 have all the supplies you need to bring your cosmic creations to life.<br 
 />\nWhat’s Included:<br />\nAstrology and zodiac-themed craft supplies at 
 our DIY bar<br />\nA relaxing\, otherworldly vibe to connect with your spi
 ritual side<br />\nIt’s a night for the curious\, the creative\, and the c
 osmic—channel your inner star\, and create something magical with us! 🌙</p
 >\n</BODY></HTML>
