CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Carmen Lagala masterfully blends silly\, dark\, and confessiona
 l humor with an approach that makes you feel like you’re up late getting b
 uzzed with a best friend. Carmen’s journey from a shy Vermont collegiate h
 all-of-fame athlete to a well-known New York City stand-up comedian is not
 hing short of inspiring. After performing throughout the country for over 
 15 years\, Carmen has developed a fearless approach to comedy\, leaving no
  topic off limits.
