 5pm/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Carmen Lagala
  masterfully blends silly\, dark\, and confessional humor with an approach
  that makes you feel like you’re up late getting buzzed with a best friend
 . Carmen’s journey from a shy Vermont collegiate hall-of-fame athlete to a
  well-known New York City stand-up comedian is nothing short of inspiring.
  After performing throughout the country for over 15 years\, Carmen has de
 veloped a fearless approach to comedy\, leaving no topic off limits.</p>\n
 </BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
