CONTACT:celticglenheritagelivestock@gmail.com\; https://www.celticglen.org/
 event-list
DESCRIPTION:Coffee with Goats – 10:00-10:50am\nPlay with the goats\, brush 
 them\, give them treats and learn about goat care as you sip your choice o
 f coffee\, tea\, or hot chocolate and eat a sweet treat.\n\nFarm Tour – 11
 :00-11:40am\nSee the farm in the lovely Uplands\, including Highland and I
 rish Dexter cattle\, sheep\, goats\, chickens\, and livestock guardian dog
 s. They are stuffed with baby lambs\, kids\, and calves right now! Learn a
 bout animal care and regenerative farming. Lots of time for questions and 
 pictures.\n\nDonkey Stroll – noon-12:50pm\nStroll the farm with our donkey
 s\, brush them\, give them treats\, and take lots of pictures. Contact wit
 h any accessibility concerns.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250524T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250524T125000
LOCATION:Celtic Glen Farm 1692 W Romona Rd\, Spencer
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Coffee With Goats\, Farm Tour and Donkey Stroll
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/coffee-with-goats-farm-tour-and-donkey-stroll/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div>Coffee with
  Goats – 10:00-10:50am</div>\n<div>Play with the goats\, brush them\, give
  them treats and learn about goat care as you sip your choice of coffee\, 
 tea\, or hot chocolate and eat a sweet treat.</div>\n<div></div>\n<div>Far
 m Tour – 11:00-11:40am</div>\n<div>See the farm in the lovely Uplands\, in
 cluding Highland and Irish Dexter cattle\, sheep\, goats\, chickens\, and 
 livestock guardian dogs. They are stuffed with baby lambs\, kids\, and cal
 ves right now! Learn about animal care and regenerative farming. Lots of t
 ime for questions and pictures.</div>\n<div></div>\n<div>Donkey Stroll – n
 oon-12:50pm</div>\n<div>Stroll the farm with our donkeys\, brush them\, gi
 ve them treats\, and take lots of pictures. Contact with any accessibility
  concerns.</div>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
