DESCRIPTION:Join us in the Bloomington Community Orchard to help kick off t
 he new growing season! We plan to get some spring plantings in the ground\
 , including fruit trees\, berry shrubs\, and companion plants. We will als
 o have some blackberry\, elderberry\, and other plant starts to give away 
 from our new Orchard Propagation Station!  The Orchard will provide snacks
  and drinks for volunteers\, since this overlaps our weekly Work & Learn D
 ay (1-4pm).\nSCHEDULE:\n– 1pm Event Begins\n– 1:15 Plantings (and live mus
 ic!)\n– 3:15 Food/Drinks & Raffle (free chance to win BCO merch!)\n– 3:30 
 Poetry Reading with Ross Gay!\n– 4pm Event Ends
