CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Experience contra dancing like never before at The Bishop (123 
 S Walnut St)\, on Wednesday\, May 28\, 2025. Dance to live pop covers by D
 o-Si-Do Radio\, with hits from Ed Sheeran\, Queen\, Chappell Roan\, Britne
 y Spears\, Billy Joel\, and more. No partner or experience needed—caller K
 yla Wargel will teach every dance\, so anyone can join in.\n\nA beginner l
 esson starts at 7:00 pm\, with dancing from 7:30 to 9:30 pm. Come for the 
 lesson or drop in anytime during the night! This event is 21+.\n\nExpect a
  packed\, high-energy crowd and an active dance floor—the room will get wa
 rm\, so wear comfortable clothes you can move in. For more details and upd
 ates\, visit dosidoradio.com. Hosted by the Bloomington Old-Time Music and
  Dance Group. Don’t miss this one-of-a-kind dance party!
