UID:ai1ec-135976@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Tom Tykwer | 1998 | Germany | R\nIn this visually and conceptua
 lly impressive film\, two-bit criminal Manni botches a delivery for his cr
 ime-lord boss\, losing $100\,000 in the process. With only 20 minutes to c
 ome up with the cash\, he calls on his girlfriend Lola for help. Lola spri
 nts the streets of Berlin in a series of overlapping scenarios\, trying to
  find the quickest way to save Manni from his boss and himself. [80 min\; 
 action\, thriller\; German with English subtitles]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250529T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Indie Auteurs Film Series: RUN LOLA RUN/LOLA RENNT
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/indie-auteurs-film-series-run-lola-run-lola-renn
 t/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Tom Tykwer | 
 1998 | Germany | R<br />\nIn this visually and conceptually impressive fil
 m\, two-bit criminal Manni botches a delivery for his crime-lord boss\, lo
 sing $100\,000 in the process. With only 20 minutes to come up with the ca
 sh\, he calls on his girlfriend Lola for help. Lola sprints the streets of
  Berlin in a series of overlapping scenarios\, trying to find the quickest
  way to save Manni from his boss and himself. [80 min\; action\, thriller\
 ; German with English subtitles]</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
