UID:ai1ec-135983@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Gints Zilbalodis | 2024 | Latvia | PG\nA wondrous journey\, thr
 ough realms natural and mystical\, Flow follows a courageous cat after his
  home is devastated by a great flood. Teaming up with a capybara\, a lemur
 \, a bird\, and a dog to navigate a boat in search of dry land\, they must
  rely on trust\, courage\, and wits to survive the perils of a newly aquat
 ic planet. Steeped in the soaring possibilities of visual storytelling\, F
 low is a feast for the senses and a treasure for the heart. [85 min\; adve
 nture\, family\, fantasy\; no dialogue]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250531T160000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:CINEkids International Children’s Film Series: FLOW
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/cinekids-international-childrens-film-series-flo
 w/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Gints Zilbalo
 dis | 2024 | Latvia | PG<br />\nA wondrous journey\, through realms natura
 l and mystical\, Flow follows a courageous cat after his home is devastate
 d by a great flood. Teaming up with a capybara\, a lemur\, a bird\, and a 
 dog to navigate a boat in search of dry land\, they must rely on trust\, c
 ourage\, and wits to survive the perils of a newly aquatic planet. Steeped
  in the soaring possibilities of visual storytelling\, Flow is a feast for
  the senses and a treasure for the heart. [85 min\; adventure\, family\, f
 antasy\; no dialogue]</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
