BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-136213@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Paul Verhoeven | 1997 | USA | R\n A new kind of war. When you b
 attle six trillion enemies that will eat you alive\, there are only two ru
 les: everyone fights\, and no one quits. Do you have what it takes to be a
  Roughneck on the right side of history?\nAbout Starship Troopers\nFrom th
 e sweeping galactic views of the Fleet Battle Station Ticonderoga to the d
 esolate alien planets teeming with shrieking\, fire-spitting\, brain-sucki
 ng enemies\, acclaimed director Paul Verhoeven crafts a dazzling antiwar e
 pic based on Robert A. Heinlein’s classic sci-fi adventure. Casper Van Die
 n\, Dina Meyer\, Denise Richards\, Jake Busey\, Neil Patrick Harris\, Patr
 ick Muldoon\, and Michael Ironside star as the courageous soldiers who tra
 vel deep into space for the ultimate showdown between the species.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250604T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Granfalloon Film Series: STARSHIP TROOPERS
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/granfalloon-film-series-starship-troopers/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Paul Verhoeve
 n | 1997 | USA | R<br />\n A new kind of war. When you battle six trillion
  enemies that will eat you alive\, there are only two rules: everyone figh
 ts\, and no one quits. Do you have what it takes to be a Roughneck on the 
 right side of history?<br />\nAbout Starship Troopers</p>\n<p>From the swe
 eping galactic views of the Fleet Battle Station Ticonderoga to the desola
 te alien planets teeming with shrieking\, fire-spitting\, brain-sucking en
 emies\, acclaimed director Paul Verhoeven crafts a dazzling antiwar epic b
 ased on Robert A. Heinlein’s classic sci-fi adventure. Casper Van Dien\, D
 ina Meyer\, Denise Richards\, Jake Busey\, Neil Patrick Harris\, Patrick M
 uldoon\, and Michael Ironside star as the courageous soldiers who travel d
 eep into space for the ultimate showdown between the species.</p>\n</BODY>
 </HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
