BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-136306@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Paulin Vieyra | 1981 | Senegal | Not Rated\n The only feature-l
 ength film directed by Paulin Vieyra\, this film shows an African state fa
 ced with political and economic difficulties. Q&A with Stéphane Vieyra to 
 follow.\nAbout En résidence surveillée/Under House Arrest\nIn his doctoral
  thesis\, a young academic encourages a return to the sources of African c
 ultural tradition while maintaining the gains of the West. [102 min\; dram
 a\; French with English subtitles]\nA Q&A with Stéphane Vieyra and Amadou 
 Ouedraogo (U.L. Lafayette) will follow the screening.\nThis event is part 
 of the Collections of Sembène and Vieyra Archival Workshop organized by th
 e Early African Cinemas Lab.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250605T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:En résidence surveillée/Under House Arrest
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/en-residence-surveillee-under-house-arrest/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Paulin Vieyra
  | 1981 | Senegal | Not Rated<br />\n The only feature-length film directe
 d by Paulin Vieyra\, this film shows an African state faced with political
  and economic difficulties. Q&A with Stéphane Vieyra to follow.<br />\nAbo
 ut En résidence surveillée/Under House Arrest</p>\n<p>In his doctoral thes
 is\, a young academic encourages a return to the sources of African cultur
 al tradition while maintaining the gains of the West. [102 min\; drama\; F
 rench with English subtitles]</p>\n<p>A Q&A with Stéphane Vieyra and Amado
 u Ouedraogo (U.L. Lafayette) will follow the screening.</p>\n<p>This event
  is part of the Collections of Sembène and Vieyra Archival Workshop organi
 zed by the Early African Cinemas Lab.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
