CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:The King’s Wife imagines a secret history of Catherine of Arago
 n and Anne Boleyn (the first wives of Henry VIII) and the untold story of 
 their friendship and struggle for power in a male dominated era. A revolut
 ionary pop musical by two-time Grammy-nominated songwriter\, Jamie Floyd\,
  and award-winning playwright\, Mêlisa Annis\, this bold reimagining of hi
 story explores the enduring legacy of extraordinary women.
