CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:Tom Henderson\; 317-250-4646\; W9YW@ARRL.net\; https://bloomingtonr
 adio.club/
DESCRIPTION:The Bloomington Amateur Radio Club (BARC) will meet Friday\, Ju
 ne 6\, 2025 at 7 pm at the First United Church (2420 E 3rd Street\, Bloomi
 ngton—use the East side entrance). Along with regular club business\, club
  president Tom Henderson will guide club members in a discussion on how th
 ey want to participate in the annual ARRL Field Day–a US-wide on-the-air r
 adio activity where ham radio stations are set up outside to practice emer
 gency communications. \nAll ages and backgrounds are invited. Meetings are
  the first non-holiday Friday of the month. Club information is at https:/
 /bloomingtonradio.club/.\n\nFor more information please contact BARC Presi
 dent Tom Henderson\, amateur radio call sign W9YW —317-250-4646 or W9YW@AR
 RL.net.       
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250606T190000
LOCATION:First United Church\, 2420 E. 3rd St\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Bloomington Amateur Radio Club Meeting
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/bloomington-amateur-radio-club-meeting/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div dir='ltr'><
 span style='font-family: times new roman\, new york\, times\, serif\;font-
 size: medium'><b>The Bloomington Amateur Radio Club</b><span> (BARC) will 
 meet Friday\, June 6\, 2025 at 7 pm at the First United Church (2420 E 3</
 span><sup>rd</sup><span> Street\, Bloomington—use the East side entrance).
  Along with regular club business\, club president Tom Henderson will guid
 e club members in a discussion </span>on how they want to participate in t
 he annual ARRL Field Day–a US-wide on-the-air radio activity where ham rad
 io stations are set up outside to practice emergency communications. </spa
 n></div>\n<p><span style='font-family: times new roman\, new york\, times\
 , serif\;font-size: medium'>All ages and backgrounds are invited. Meetings
  are the first non-holiday Friday of the month. Club information is at htt
 ps://bloomingtonradio.club/.</span></p>\n<div id='m_-4471249872648071268yd
 p127d2d4eyiv3061628218ydpd6374645yiv1679373691yqtfd23718'>\n<div><span sty
 le='font-family: times new roman\, new york\, times\, serif\;font-size: me
 dium'>For more information please contact BARC President Tom Henderson\, a
 mateur radio call sign W9YW —317-250-4646 or W9YW@ARRL.net.     </span><sp
 an style='font-family: Helvetica Neue\, Helvetica\, Arial\, sans-serif'><s
 pan style='font-size: medium'>  </span></span></div>\n</div>\n</BODY></HTM
 L>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
