DESCRIPTION:Want to be involved at LTB but performing isn’t for you? Become
  their next sound guru! Learn the ins and outs of sound-editing\, mechanic
 s\, and design! Handle mics\, run the soundboard\, and more! Hands-on expe
 rience for anyone interested in sound mechanics\, audio editing\, leadersh
 ip\, volunteer work\, and more! Great for college applications and resumes
 !\nWednesday June 4\, 6-8pm and Saturday June 7\, 12-4:30pm
