 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Want to be in
 volved at LTB but performing isn’t for you? Become their next sound guru! 
 Learn the ins and outs of sound-editing\, mechanics\, and design! Handle m
 ics\, run the soundboard\, and more! Hands-on experience for anyone intere
 sted in sound mechanics\, audio editing\, leadership\, volunteer work\, an
 d more! Great for college applications and resumes!</p>\n<p>Wednesday June
  4\, 6-8pm and Saturday June 7\, 12-4:30pm</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
