UID:ai1ec-136604@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Christopher Guest | 2000 | USA | PG-13\nThis satirical mockumen
 tary follows a group of contenders for the Mayflower Kennel Club crown and
  their…quirky…human handlers as they compete to be best in show. No one ha
 s done this genre better than Christopher Guest\, and he’s in top form her
 e with his cast of regulars\, who just happen to be comedy icons Eugene Le
 vy\, Catherine O’Hara\, Fred Willard\, Jennifer Coolidge\, Parker Posey\, 
 Michael Hitchcock\, Michael McKean\, John Michael Higgins\, Jane Lynch\, a
 nd Guest himself.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250612T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:25th Anniversary Screening: BEST IN SHOW
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/25th-anniversary-screening-best-in-show/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Christopher G
 uest | 2000 | USA | PG-13<br />\nThis satirical mockumentary follows a gro
 up of contenders for the Mayflower Kennel Club crown and their…quirky…huma
 n handlers as they compete to be best in show. No one has done this genre 
 better than Christopher Guest\, and he’s in top form here with his cast of
  regulars\, who just happen to be comedy icons Eugene Levy\, Catherine O’H
 ara\, Fred Willard\, Jennifer Coolidge\, Parker Posey\, Michael Hitchcock\
 , Michael McKean\, John Michael Higgins\, Jane Lynch\, and Guest himself.<
 /p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
