DESCRIPTION:Joel Coen\, Ethan Coen | 1996 | USA | R\nYou will never look at
  a woodchipper in the same way again.\nIn this seven-time Oscar-nominated 
 film\, things go terribly awry when small-time Minnesota car salesman Jerr
 y Lundegaard (William H. Macy) hires two thugs (Steve Buscemi and Peter St
 ormare) to kidnap his wife so he can  collect the ransom from his wealthy 
 father-in-law. Once people start dying\, the very chipper and very pregnan
 t police chief Marge Gunderson (Frances McDormand\, who won an Oscar for h
 er performance) takes the case. Is she up for this challenge? You betcha.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250614T160000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:FARGO
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/fargo/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Joel Coen\, E
 than Coen | 1996 | USA | R<br />\n<strong>You will never look at a woodchi
 pper in the same way again.</strong><br />\nIn this seven-time Oscar-nomin
 ated film\, things go terribly awry when small-time Minnesota car salesman
  Jerry Lundegaard (William H. Macy) hires two thugs (Steve Buscemi and Pet
 er Stormare) to kidnap his wife so he can  collect the ransom from his wea
 lthy father-in-law. Once people start dying\, the very chipper and very pr
 egnant police chief Marge Gunderson (Frances McDormand\, who won an Oscar 
 for her performance) takes the case. Is she up for this challenge? You bet
 cha.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
