UID:ai1ec-136051@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:Cicada Cinema
DESCRIPTION:After the tragic death of his father\, 18 year old Totone is th
 rust into the unexpected and very adult role of looking after his younger 
 sister and their failing family farm in the Jura section of France.  He as
 sumes even more responsibility when he enters a cash competition for the b
 est Comte cheese made in this western part of the French Alps. A “verité” 
 look at the hardscrabble life of French agriculture\, it is simultaneously
  a coming of age story and above all an ode to the love of cheese.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250614T200000
LOCATION:Hopscotch Coffee\, 325 w. Dodds\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Cicada Cinema presents Holy Cow (2025)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/cicada-cinema-presents-holy-cow-2025/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>After the tra
 gic death of his father\, 18 year old Totone is thrust into the unexpected
  and very adult role of looking after his younger sister and their failing
  family farm in the Jura section of France.  He assumes even more responsi
 bility when he enters a cash competition for the best Comte cheese made in
  this western part of the French Alps. A “verité” look at the hardscrabble
  life of French agriculture\, it is simultaneously a coming of age story a
 nd above all an ode to the love of cheese.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
