CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Doors at 8:30pm\nJerry David DeCicca is a vocational rehabilita
 tion provider for special education students and adults\, and a songwriter
 . He’s also produced albums for Ed Askew (Tin Angel Records)\, Bob Martin 
 (Worried Songs)\, Will Beeley (Tompkins Square)\, Chris Gantry (“Dreams of
  the Everyday Housewife”) & Larry Jon Wilson (Heartworn Highways/Drag City
 )\, and worked on reissue projects for Numero Group. In 2022 & 2024\, he t
 oured with Bill Callahan in the U.S. and overseas. He lives in the rural t
 own of Bulverde\, TX with his two dogs\, three cats\, five toads\, and wif
 e. His previous band\, The Black Swans\, released 5 albums and toured for 
 10 years.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250614T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250614T233000
LOCATION:Orbit Room\, 107 North College Ave.\, Suite 001 (downstairs)\, Blo
 omington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Jerry David DeCicca // T.V. Mike
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/jerry-david-decicca-t-v-mike/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Doors
  at 8:30pm</strong><br />\nJerry David DeCicca is a vocational rehabilitat
 ion provider for special education students and adults\, and a songwriter.
  He’s also produced albums for Ed Askew (Tin Angel Records)\, Bob Martin (
 Worried Songs)\, Will Beeley (Tompkins Square)\, Chris Gantry (“Dreams of 
 the Everyday Housewife”) & Larry Jon Wilson (Heartworn Highways/Drag City)
 \, and worked on reissue projects for Numero Group. In 2022 & 2024\, he to
 ured with Bill Callahan in the U.S. and overseas. He lives in the rural to
 wn of Bulverde\, TX with his two dogs\, three cats\, five toads\, and wife
 . His previous band\, The Black Swans\, released 5 albums and toured for 1
 0 years.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
