BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-136052@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:The shimmering finale in Rudy Ray Moore’s cycle of Seventies bl
 axploitation gems — with a gritty PSA twist.\n\nRudy wholeheartedly domina
 tes the role of retired cop cum celebrity DJ at the Blueberry Hill Disco. 
 All is beautifully funky\, until his nephew flips out on a strange new str
 eet drug called “angel dust”. The Disco Godfather vows “to personally come
  down on the suckers that’s producing this shit!”\, slaps drug dealers\, f
 orces the kingpin to inhale his own product through a gas mask\, and still
  finds time to pilot the Blueberry Hill. “Put a little slide in yo’ glide\
 ,” he pleads to the patrons\, “put some weight on it!”\nThe scenes of drug
 -induced hallucinations and the tour of the hospital’s “PCP ward” hurtle t
 his movie beyond Dolemite\, beyond the stratosphere of strangeness and int
 o Coffin Joe territory. Bring your own ambulance!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250619T190000
LOCATION:Orbit Room - 107 N. College Ave suite 001\, underground
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Cicada Cinema presents Disco Godfather (1979)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/cicada-cinema-presents-disco-godfather-1979/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>The shimmerin
 g finale in Rudy Ray Moore’s cycle of Seventies blaxploitation gems — with
  a gritty PSA twist.</p>\n<div>\n<p>Rudy wholeheartedly dominates the role
  of retired cop cum celebrity DJ at the Blueberry Hill Disco. All is beaut
 ifully funky\, until his nephew flips out on a strange new street drug cal
 led “angel dust”. The Disco Godfather vows “to personally come down on the
  suckers that’s producing this shit!”\, slaps drug dealers\, forces the ki
 ngpin to inhale his own product through a gas mask\, and still finds time 
 to pilot the Blueberry Hill. “Put a little slide in yo’ glide\,” he pleads
  to the patrons\, “put some weight on it!”</p>\n<p>The scenes of drug-indu
 ced hallucinations and the tour of the hospital’s “PCP ward” hurtle this m
 ovie beyond Dolemite\, beyond the stratosphere of strangeness and into Cof
 fin Joe territory. Bring your own ambulance!</p>\n</div>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
