CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Experience the Ultimate Culinary Showdown at Hard Truth Distill
 ing Co. – WFC Live Fire!\nGet ready for an unforgettable experience as Har
 d Truth Distilling Co. hosts one of the most exciting competitions in food
  sport — the World Food Championships (WFC) Live Fire event!\nAt WFC Live 
 Fire\, the heat is real and the stakes are even higher. Chefs from across 
 the country will battle it out using only wood and charcoal — no gas\, no 
 electric\, just pure\, authentic fire mastery. Armed with nothing but thei
 r skills and a 1-hour\, 45-minute countdown\, these talented competitors m
 ust conquer open flames to create mouthwatering dishes that will leave you
  in awe.\nHard Truth’s breathtaking 325-acre campus sets the perfect backd
 rop for this celebration of bold flavors\, intense competition\, and smoky
  perfection. This isn’t your typical low-and-slow barbecue — it’s fast\, f
 ierce\, and fiery!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250628T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250628T210000
LOCATION:Hard Truth Distilling Company\, 418 Old State Road 46\, Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:The Charred Truth Live Fire Cook-off\, with music from: Time Travel
 ers (12pm-2:45pm)\, The Tonk Band (3pm-5:45pm)\, Zach Wolfe & The Coyotes 
 (6pm-9pm)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/the-charred-truth-live-fire-cook-off-with-music-
 from-time-travelers-12pm-245pm-the-tonk-band-3pm-545pm-zach-wolfe-the-coyo
 tes-6pm-9pm/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Experience th
 e Ultimate Culinary Showdown at Hard Truth Distilling Co. – WFC Live Fire!
 <br />\nGet ready for an unforgettable experience as Hard Truth Distilling
  Co. hosts one of the most exciting competitions in food sport — the World
  Food Championships (WFC) Live Fire event!<br />\nAt WFC Live Fire\, the h
 eat is real and the stakes are even higher. Chefs from across the country 
 will battle it out using only wood and charcoal — no gas\, no electric\, j
 ust pure\, authentic fire mastery. Armed with nothing but their skills and
  a 1-hour\, 45-minute countdown\, these talented competitors must conquer 
 open flames to create mouthwatering dishes that will leave you in awe.<br 
 />\nHard Truth’s breathtaking 325-acre campus sets the perfect backdrop fo
 r this celebration of bold flavors\, intense competition\, and smoky perfe
 ction. This isn’t your typical low-and-slow barbecue — it’s fast\, fierce\
 , and fiery! </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
