BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-130771@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/event/the-ultimate-doors-2025/
DESCRIPTION:Classic Rock\, Live Shows\, Music\nThe Ultimate Doors was forme
 d with the intention of preserving The Doors’ music and performances as we
 ll as bringing an authentic experience to the old and the new generations 
 of Doors fans.\nWith great attention to detail\, The Ultimate Doors provid
 e their audiences with an authentic looking and sounding tribute to Jim Mo
 rrison & The Doors. Every piece of equipment on stage is exactly what The 
 Doors used in the 1960s from the instruments and amps to the clothing and 
 microphones. The Ultimate Doors leaves no stone unturned in bringing an au
 thentic Doors tribute show to the stage.\nThe four musicians within the Ul
 timate Doors who take on the roles of Jim Morrison\, Ray Manzarek\, Robby 
 Krieger and John Densmore do not take the job of portraying their idols li
 ghtly. They bring a professional\, high-energy\, authentic production to t
 he stage night after night in order to transport their audiences back to t
 he late 1960s.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250628T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250628T213000
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S. Van Buren St\, Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:The Ultimate Doors
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/the-ultimate-doors/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Classic Rock\
 , Live Shows\, Music<br />\nThe Ultimate Doors was formed with the intenti
 on of preserving The Doors’ music and performances as well as bringing an 
 authentic experience to the old and the new generations of Doors fans.</p>
 \n<p>With great attention to detail\, The Ultimate Doors provide their aud
 iences with an authentic looking and sounding tribute to Jim Morrison & Th
 e Doors. <strong>Every piece of equipment on stage is exactly what The Doo
 rs used in the 1960s from the instruments and amps to the clothing and mic
 rophones. </strong>The Ultimate Doors leaves no stone unturned in bringing
  an authentic Doors tribute show to the stage.</p>\n<p>The four musicians 
 within the Ultimate Doors who take on the roles of Jim Morrison\, Ray Manz
 arek\, Robby Krieger and John Densmore do not take the job of portraying t
 heir idols lightly. They bring a professional\, high-energy\, authentic pr
 oduction to the stage night after night in order to transport their audien
 ces back to the late 1960s.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
