 arks and Recreation has a long history of hosting live music in city parks
 \, and of showcasing local musical talent. The Performing Arts Series pres
 ented by Visit Bloomington provides many accessible venues for outdoor per
 formances\, and promotes music as a way for local residents to experience 
 different musical cultures and to bring neighbors together.</p>\n</BODY></
 HTML>
END:VEVENT
