CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:On Saturday\, July 12\, at 6:00pm\, local artists will gather a
 t The Sinkhole to pay tribute to the legendary composer and member of the 
 Beach Boys\, Brian Wilson (1942-2025) who passed away on June 11\, 2025. L
 ocal acts include Dakota Curtis\, Greg Moore\, U-Station Agents\, Bryn Cro
 wsong\, American Pirates\, Spencer Heuring (from Honkytonk Tuesday) and mo
 re. Weather permitting\, the outdoor area will be all-ages. Keep updated b
 y following The Sinkhole @thesinkholebeerbar on Facebook. Food will be on-
 site from Slop Shop food truck.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250712T180000
LOCATION:The Sinkhole Craft Beer Bar 313 E Winslow Rd\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Brian Wilson Tribute Concert
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/brian-wilson-tribute-concert/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>On Saturday\,
  July 12\, at 6:00pm\, local artists will gather at The Sinkhole to pay tr
 ibute to the legendary composer and member of the Beach Boys\, Brian Wilso
 n (1942-2025) who passed away on June 11\, 2025. Local acts include Dakota
  Curtis\, Greg Moore\, U-Station Agents\, Bryn Crowsong\, American Pirates
 \, Spencer Heuring (from Honkytonk Tuesday) and more. Weather permitting\,
  the outdoor area will be all-ages. Keep updated by following The Sinkhole
  @thesinkholebeerbar on Facebook. Food will be on-site from Slop Shop food
  truck.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
