DESCRIPTION:Calling all dancing queens and super troupers! Sing along to hi
 t songs from the 1970s group ABBA. This smash-hit movie musical\, based on
  the stage show of the same name\, is the story of a bride-to-be trying to
  find her real father. Be sure to dress in your Mamma Mia best\, because t
 he screening is kicking off with a costume contest! Show off your disco- a
 nd island-inspired looks for the chance to win a fabulous prize. After the
  contest\, test your Mamma Mia knowledge with a finish-that-lyric challeng
 e! Come early to take photos at the photo booth and grab a themed cocktail
  from the bar.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250712T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250712T204500
