X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Calling all d
 ancing queens and super troupers! Sing along to hit songs from the 1970s g
 roup ABBA. This smash-hit movie musical\, based on the <a href='https://ma
 mma-mia.com/' target='_blank' rel='noopener' data-saferedirecturl='https:/
 /www.google.com/url?q=https://mamma-mia.com/&source=gmail&ust=172444031910
 7000&usg=AOvVaw3jASEzGyrTIM3B7SVWMXjG'>stage show of the same name</a>\, i
 s the story of a bride-to-be trying to find her real father. Be sure to dr
 ess in your Mamma Mia best\, because the screening is kicking off with a c
 ostume contest! Show off your disco- and island-inspired looks for the cha
 nce to win a fabulous prize. After the contest\, test your <em>Mamma Mia</
 em> knowledge with a finish-that-lyric challenge! Come early to take photo
 s at the photo booth and grab a themed cocktail from the bar.</p>\n</BODY>
 </HTML>
END:VEVENT
