BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-137582@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:Sounds From the Black Hole\; soundsfromtheblackhole@gmail.com\; htt
 ps://www.facebook.com/events/10067881343248560
DESCRIPTION:Monday night punk/metal/noise/whatever at Gold Dust on Rogers+7
 th. Prankster noise punks Acid 87 are back in town\, on tour with Clevelan
 d’s Slugg. Locals Ritual Spell\, Lather and The City Underground.\n_______
 _________________\nALL-AGES /// Doors: 7pm /// Noise: 7:30\n______________
 __________\nACID 87 is BACK. The St. Louis freaks return\, hopefully with 
 their west coast cohort and the angle grinder. Both of their times in Bloo
 mington they played with fire\, Gibby Haynes’ toenails burning on the alta
 r. This time they bring SLUGG along for the ride\, heavy sound from Clevel
 and\, OH driven by beats and vocals.\nACID 87 links:\nhttps://ageofhorus.b
 andcamp.com/album/ambassadors-of-peace\nhttps://www.instagram.com/beyondac
 id87/\nAcid 87 LIVE\nSLUGG links:\nhttps://slugg1.bandcamp.com/\nSlugg LIV
 E\n________________________\nRitual Spell – https://ritualspellband.straw.
 page/ – Southern Indiana Queer Metal\n________________________\nThe City U
 nderground + Lather – solo and collaborative sets – will be completely dif
 ferent from when they played at Walkover\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@cityund
 gnd\nhttps://lather.bandcamp.com/
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250714T190000
LOCATION:Gold Dust Vintage: 216 N. Rogers St\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Sounds From the Black Hole: Acid 87 / Slugg / Ritual Spell / The Ci
 ty Underground + Lather
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/sounds-from-the-black-hole-acid-87-slugg-ritual-
 spell-the-city-underground-lather/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Monday night 
 punk/metal/noise/whatever at Gold Dust on Rogers+7th. Prankster noise punk
 s Acid 87 are back in town\, on tour with Cleveland’s Slugg. Locals Ritual
  Spell\, Lather and The City Underground.<br />\n________________________<
 br />\nALL-AGES /// Doors: 7pm /// Noise: 7:30<br />\n____________________
 ____<br />\nACID 87 is BACK. The St. Louis freaks return\, hopefully with 
 their west coast cohort and the angle grinder. Both of their times in Bloo
 mington they played with fire\, Gibby Haynes’ toenails burning on the alta
 r. This time they bring SLUGG along for the ride\, heavy sound from Clevel
 and\, OH driven by beats and vocals.<br />\nACID 87 links:<br />\nhttps://
 ageofhorus.bandcamp.com/album/ambassadors-of-peace<br />\nhttps://www.inst
 agram.com/beyondacid87/<br />\n<a href='https://youtu.be/EGDKAbMwk5o?si=pI
 gUusQrCui82a7e'>Acid 87 LIVE</a><br />\nSLUGG links:<br />\nhttps://slugg1
 .bandcamp.com/<br />\n<a href='https://youtu.be/-p13VXH0faM'>Slugg LIVE</a
 ><br />\n________________________<br />\nRitual Spell – https://ritualspel
 lband.straw.page/ – Southern Indiana Queer Metal<br />\n__________________
 ______<br />\nThe City Underground + Lather – solo and collaborative sets 
 – will be completely different from when they played at Walkover<br />\nht
 tps://www.youtube.com/@cityundgnd<br />\nhttps://lather.bandcamp.com/</p>
 \n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
