 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div dir='auto'>
 This weekend retreat invites participants to reconnect with their bodies a
 nd the natural rhythms of summer through yoga\, Ayurveda\, and nourishing 
