DESCRIPTION:Get ready to rock as the world’s #1 touring tribute to The Roll
 ing Stones hits the stage for one unforgettable night. “Satisfaction” brin
 gs you the look\, sound\, and swagger of Mick Jagger\, Keith Richards\, an
 d the band that changed rock ‘n’ roll forever. With spot-on vocals\, dazzl
 ing costumes\, and electrifying energy\, it’s more than a concert—it’s a f
 ull-throttle Stones experience. Don’t miss your chance to relive the great
 est hits\, from “Jumpin’ Jack Flash” to “Paint It Black” and everything in
  between!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250719T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250719T213000
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S. Van Buren St Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Satisfaction – The International Rolling Stones Show
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/satisfaction-the-international-rolling-stones-sh
 ow/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Get ready to 
 rock as the world’s #1 touring tribute to The Rolling Stones hits the stag
 e for one unforgettable night. “Satisfaction” brings you the look\, sound\
 , and swagger of Mick Jagger\, Keith Richards\, and the band that changed 
 rock ‘n’ roll forever. With spot-on vocals\, dazzling costumes\, and elect
 rifying energy\, it’s more than a concert—it’s a full-throttle Stones expe
 rience. Don’t miss your chance to relive the greatest hits\, from “Jumpin’
  Jack Flash” to “Paint It Black” and everything in between!</p>\n</BODY></
 HTML>
END:VEVENT
