DESCRIPTION:Please join Women Writing for (a) Change for our monthly All Ge
 nder Writing Circle.\nWe will find inspiration from poetry and painters\, 
 and spend time writing and sharing our writing with one another. This is a
  safe\, inclusive space for people of all genders and writers of all genre
 s and experience. All are welcome in this pop-up community of writers.\nRe
 serve your spot: art@juniperartgallery.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250720T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250720T173000
LOCATION:Juniper Art Gallery\, 615 West Kirkwood Ave.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:All Gender Writing Circle
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/all-gender-writing-circle-7/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Please join W
 omen Writing for (a) Change for our monthly All Gender Writing Circle.<br 
 />\nWe will find inspiration from poetry and painters\, and spend time wri
 ting and sharing our writing with one another. This is a safe\, inclusive 
 space for people of all genders and writers of all genres and experience. 
 All are welcome in this pop-up community of writers.<br />\n<strong>Reserv
 e your spot: art@juniperartgallery.com</strong></p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
