  animal plushie—choose from a jungle of cute creatures and bring one to li
 fe with a needle\, thread\, and a whole lot of heart.\nNo sewing experienc
 e? No problem!\n🦁 Pick your animal\n🧵 Sew and decorate\nWhether you’re a c
 rafting newbie or a handmade pro\, this is your chance to chill\, chat\, a
 nd make something irresistibly cute. Come solo or bring your pack—just don
 ’t miss this night of stitching and sipping fun!
