  at Gather where you’ll sew your own adorable felt animal plushie—choose f
 rom a jungle of cute creatures and bring one to life with a needle\, threa
 d\, and a whole lot of heart.</p>\n<p>No sewing experience? No problem!</p
 >\n<p>🦁 Pick your animal</p>\n<p>🧵 Sew and decorate</p>\n<p>Whether you’re
  a crafting newbie or a handmade pro\, this is your chance to chill\, chat
 \, and make something irresistibly cute. Come solo or bring your pack—just
  don’t miss this night of stitching and sipping fun!</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
