CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the first-ever Eclaras Impact Market — a one-day\, 
 open-air community market dedicated to celebrating local small businesses\
 , vintage fashion\, and giving back. Shop from a curated selection of vint
 age and handmade vendors\, enjoy live music\, explore local food trucks\, 
 and support a great cause. Entry is free\, and all proceeds from optional 
 donations benefit Beacon Inc.\, a local nonprofit serving Bloomington’s un
 housed community. Come experience the heart of Bloomington while supportin
 g small businesses and making an impact!
