 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Join us for t
 he first-ever Eclaras Impact Market — <strong>a one-day\, open-air communi
 ty market dedicated to celebrating local small businesses\, vintage fashio
 n\, and giving back.</strong> Shop from a curated selection of vintage and
  handmade vendors\, enjoy live music\, explore local food trucks\, and sup
 port a great cause. Entry is free\, and <strong>all proceeds from optional
  donations benefit Beacon Inc.\, a local nonprofit serving Bloomington’s u
 nhoused community.</strong> Come experience the heart of Bloomington while
  supporting small businesses and making an impact!</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
