BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-138399@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:EV Mae is a country music singer\, songwriter and Clarksville C
 reative Sound recording artist from southern Indiana who recently moved to
  Clarksville\, TN to pursue her dream of becoming a well-known female coun
 try artist.  She is a truck drivin’\, boot wearin’ girl who fell for class
 ic country music from her parents’ influence at a very young age. By the t
 ime EV Mae was 9 years old\, she knew she wanted a career in music.\nDrawi
 ng her musical inspiration from classics such as Johnny Cash\, Patsy Cline
  and George Jones\; and current artists like Zach Top\, Lainey Wilson and 
 Megan Moroney. EV Mae works to create her own unique sound that blends Ame
 ricana and classic country.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250726T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250726T210000
LOCATION:Mitchell Opera House\, 217 North 7th Street\, Mitchell
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:EV Mae
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/ev-mae/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>EV Mae is a c
 ountry music singer\, songwriter and Clarksville Creative Sound recording 
 artist from southern Indiana who recently moved to Clarksville\, TN to pur
 sue her dream of becoming a well-known female country artist.  She is a tr
 uck drivin’\, boot wearin’ girl who fell for classic country music from he
 r parents’ influence at a very young age. By the time EV Mae was 9 years o
 ld\, she knew she wanted a career in music.</p>\n<p>Drawing her musical in
 spiration from classics such as Johnny Cash\, Patsy Cline and George Jones
 \; and current artists like Zach Top\, Lainey Wilson and Megan Moroney. EV
  Mae works to create her own unique sound that blends Americana and classi
 c country.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
