 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>We’re
  putting a giant dirt pit on Kirkwood Avenue! Kids can play in the dirt\, 
 make mud pies\, learn about worms and the science of soil\, and take home 
 soil and seeds for gardening.</p>\n<p>Expect to get gloriously dirty! We r
 ecommend bringing a towel and even a change of clothes for kids. A shade s
 tation with water and light snacks will be provided. The soil will be gene
 rously donated by Good Earth Composting\, LLC with support from Bloomingto
 n Parks & Recreation.</strong></p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
