BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-138441@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Sophie Payten’s (aka Gordi) professional lives are split in an 
 almost perverse way\, between a healthcare professional who needs to shut 
 off the emotional valve and the songwriter whose job it is to flood the ro
 om. What better way to interrogate that contradiction than in a song?\nPay
 ten has learned the hard way of the need to be malleable\, to form and ref
 orm in response to her environment and circumstances and self. The pandemi
 c – a moment where we all lost control of our reliable structures and were
  instead completely shaped by our surroundings – prompted Payten to think 
 about “What are the moments where you really transform in your life? I thi
 nk grief is one of those things. Love is one of those things. Queerness is
  one of those things. And so is going into the next act of life.”
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250730T210000
LOCATION:The Bishop Bar\, 123 South Walnut St.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Gordi   (18+)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/gordi-18/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Sophie Payten
 ’s (aka Gordi) professional lives are split in an almost perverse way\, be
 tween a healthcare professional who needs to shut off the emotional valve 
 and the songwriter whose job it is to flood the room. What better way to i
 nterrogate that contradiction than in a song?<br />\nPayten has learned th
 e hard way of the need to be malleable\, to form and reform in response to
  her environment and circumstances and self. The pandemic – a moment where
  we all lost control of our reliable structures and were instead completel
 y shaped by our surroundings – prompted Payten to think about “What are th
 e moments where you really transform in your life? I think grief is one of
  those things. Love is one of those things. Queerness is one of those thin
 gs. And so is going into the next act of life.”</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
