BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-138651@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Participants: Come get your paws wet and play with tennis balls
 \, chew toys and compete in fun contests during both nights to win prizes!
  Various pet-related businesses and organizations will be on hand to share
  information with dog owners.\n    Dogs must be spayed or neutered.\n    A
 ll leashed\, non-aggressive\, well-behaved dogs are welcome.\n    Humans a
 re not allowed in the pool during Drool in the Pool.\n    Help us keep the
  water clean. Prior to the event engage your dog in a high-energy activity
  to avoid feces in the water.\n    Dogs are required to be at least six mo
 nths of age.\n    No retractable leads.\n    We reserve the right to dismi
 ss any dog for unruly activity and/or aggressive behavior. OWNERS MUST PRO
 VIDE WRITTEN PROOF FROM A VETERINARIAN SHOWING THEIR DOG’S CURRENT RABIES 
 VACCINATION TO ATTEND.\n    Indiana law requires that the rabies vaccinati
 on tag be worn at all times.\n        All dogs will be checked on site by 
 City of Bloomington Animal Control. Dogs without written proof of current 
 rabies vaccination will not be allowed in the event. A rabies tag alone is
  not sufficient!\n    Maximum one dog per person.  There is a charge to at
 tend.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250806T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250806T200000
LOCATION:Mills Pool\, 1100 West 14th St.\, Bloomington
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20250807T170000
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Drool in the Pool
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/drool-in-the-pool-2/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Participants:
  Come get your paws wet and play with tennis balls\, chew toys and compete
  in fun contests during both nights to win prizes! Various pet-related bus
 inesses and organizations will be on hand to share information with dog ow
 ners.</p>\n<p>    Dogs must be spayed or neutered.<br />\n    All leashed\
 , non-aggressive\, well-behaved dogs are welcome.<br />\n    Humans are no
 t allowed in the pool during Drool in the Pool.<br />\n    Help us keep th
 e water clean. Prior to the event engage your dog in a high-energy activit
 y to avoid feces in the water.<br />\n    Dogs are required to be at least
  six months of age.<br />\n    No retractable leads.<br />\n    We reserve
  the right to dismiss any dog for unruly activity and/or aggressive behavi
 or. OWNERS MUST PROVIDE WRITTEN PROOF FROM A VETERINARIAN SHOWING THEIR DO
 G’S CURRENT RABIES VACCINATION TO ATTEND.<br />\n    Indiana law requires 
 that the rabies vaccination tag be worn at all times.<br />\n        All d
 ogs will be checked on site by City of Bloomington Animal Control. Dogs wi
 thout written proof of current rabies vaccination will not be allowed in t
 he event. A rabies tag alone is not sufficient!<br />\n    Maximum one dog
  per person.  There is a charge to attend.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
