CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:All current tickets will be honored for the rescheduled date.\n
 The Bacon Brothers have spent the better part of three decades exploring t
 heir own mix of folk\, rock\, soul\, and country music. They call that div
 erse sound “forosoco\,” and it’s taken them around the world\, from headli
 ning gigs in Japan to American performances at iconic venues like Carnegie
  Hall\, the Grand Ole Opry and Gruene Hall. The Bacon Brothers will bring 
 their Freestanding Tour live to the Brown County Music Center in Nashville
 \, Ind.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250808T200000
LOCATION:Brown County Music Center\, 200 Maple Leaf Boulevard\, Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:The Bacon Brothers (re-scheduled from 6/14/25 show)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/the-bacon-brothers-re-scheduled-from-6-14-25-sho
 w/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>All current t
 ickets will be honored for the rescheduled date.<br />\nThe Bacon Brothers
  have spent the better part of three decades exploring their own mix of fo
 lk\, rock\, soul\, and country music. They call that diverse sound “foroso
 co\,” and it’s taken them around the world\, from headlining gigs in Japan
  to American performances at iconic venues like Carnegie Hall\, the Grand 
 Ole Opry and Gruene Hall. The Bacon Brothers will bring their Freestanding
  Tour live to the Brown County Music Center in Nashville\, Ind.</p>\n</BOD
 Y></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
