 04000&usg=AOvVaw1_bTK6c4MBARmV_5m2uNaS'>Kathryn J. Houghton</a></small> wi
 ll talk about her skilled use of acrylic paints which glow like oils! She’
 ll talk about her technique and give a demonstration\, as well as share st
 ories about her long and varied career in the arts.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
