UID:ai1ec-138832@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Combo Daguerre plays original French tunes with a psychedelic e
 dge and a mostly Latin crew.\nBand members are all active on New York’s ri
 ch indie Latin scene (Chicha Libre\,Tipa\, Tipo\, Banda Chuska\, Locobeach
 ) and come from Peru\, Colombia\, Puerto Rico\, Venezuela – and Cajun coun
 try.\nAs most immigrants do\, all band members share a transplant’s vision
  of the world and its culture\, giving the French language compositions a 
 deeply cosmopolitan flavor.\n 
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250809T220000
LOCATION:The Bishop Bar\, 123 South Walnut\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Combo Daguerre\, with special guest: Matixando
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/combo-daguerre/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><b>Combo Dagu
 erre </b>plays original French tunes with a psychedelic edge and a mostly 
 Latin crew.</p>\n<p>Band members are all active on New York’s rich indie L
 atin scene (Chicha Libre\,Tipa\, Tipo\, Banda Chuska\, Locobeach) and come
  from Peru\, Colombia\, Puerto Rico\, Venezuela – and Cajun country.<br />
 \nAs most immigrants do\, all band members share a transplant’s vision of 
 the world and its culture\, giving the French language compositions a deep
 ly cosmopolitan flavor.</p>\n<p> </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
