BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-136762@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:30 years ago we had to know…..”what’s in the box?!?!”\n‘Seven’ 
 tells the story of two detectives – one ready to retire (Morgan Freeman)\,
  the other at the start of his career (Brad Pitt) – and their attempts to 
 capture a sadistic serial killer (Kevin Spacey) who chooses his victims ac
 cording to the seven deadly sins.  Together they trace the killer’s every 
 step\, witnessing the aftermath of his horrific crimes one by one as the v
 ictims pile up in rapid succession\, all the while moving closer to a grue
 some fate neither of them could have ever predicted.\nGothic\, shocking\, 
 suspenseful\, disturbing and clever\, `Seven’ marked a new beginning for d
 irector David Fincher’s career.\nRated: R
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250815T190000
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater 114 E. Kirkwood Ave.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:BCT Presents Seven (1995)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/bct-presents-seven-1995/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>30 years ago 
 we had to know…..”what’s in the box?!?!”</p>\n<p>‘Seven’ tells the story o
 f two detectives – one ready to retire (Morgan Freeman)\, the other at the
  start of his career (Brad Pitt) – and their attempts to capture a sadisti
 c serial killer (Kevin Spacey) who chooses his victims according to the se
 ven deadly sins.  Together they trace the killer’s every step\, witnessing
  the aftermath of his horrific crimes one by one as the victims pile up in
  rapid succession\, all the while moving closer to a gruesome fate neither
  of them could have ever predicted.</p>\n<p>Gothic\, shocking\, suspensefu
 l\, disturbing and clever\, `Seven’ marked a new beginning for director Da
 vid Fincher’s career.</p>\n<p>Rated: R</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
