DESCRIPTION:Skaters\, it’s time to embrace the absurd. For one night only\,
  anything you put on your head counts as a hat.\nA lampshade? Hat.\nA sala
 d bowl? Hat.\nA Beanie Baby tower glued to a bike helmet? Hat.\nCome dress
 ed in your most unhinged headgear and skate like you’re on a Paris runway 
 full of unlicensed electricians.\n� Wild & wacky playlist all night\n� Pri
 ze for Best Hat That Shouldn’t Be a Hat\n�No hat? No worries\, stop by the
  DIY Hat Conversion Desk.
