 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Skaters\, it’
 s time to embrace the absurd. For one night only\, anything you put on you
 r head counts as a hat.<br />\nA lampshade? Hat.<br />\nA salad bowl? Hat.
 <br />\nA Beanie Baby tower glued to a bike helmet? Hat.<br />\nCome dress
 ed in your most unhinged headgear and skate like you’re on a Paris runway 
 full of unlicensed electricians.<br />\n� Wild & wacky playlist all night<
 br />\n� Prize for Best Hat That Shouldn’t Be a Hat<br />\n�No hat? No wor
 ries\, stop by the DIY Hat Conversion Desk.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
