BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-139073@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Doors at 6:30pm\nAs a young boy\, Bruce Wayne watched in horror
  as his parents were slain in front of him — a trauma that leads him to be
 come obsessed with revenge. But the opportunity to avenge the death of his
  parents is cruelly taken away from him by fate.\nFleeing to the East\, Wa
 yne (Christian Bale) is approached by Henri Ducard (Liam Neeson)\, who rec
 ruits him to the League of Shadows. The League believes Gotham is beyond s
 aving and intends to destroy it. After completing his training\, Bruce rej
 ects the League and returns to Gotham intent on cleaning up the city witho
 ut resorting to murder.\nWith the help of Alfred (Michael Caine)\, his loy
 al butler\, and Lucius Fox (Morgan Freeman)\, a tech expert at Wayne Enter
 prises\, Batman is born.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250816T190000
LOCATION:Buskirk Chumley Theater\, 114 E Kirkwood Ave.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Film: BATMAN BEGINS (2005)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/film-batman-begins-2005/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Doors
  at 6:30pm</strong><br />\nAs a young boy\, Bruce Wayne watched in horror 
 as his parents were slain in front of him — a trauma that leads him to bec
 ome obsessed with revenge. But the opportunity to avenge the death of his 
 parents is cruelly taken away from him by fate.</p>\n<p>Fleeing to the Eas
 t\, Wayne (Christian Bale) is approached by Henri Ducard (Liam Neeson)\, w
 ho recruits him to the League of Shadows. The League believes Gotham is be
 yond saving and intends to destroy it. After completing his training\, Bru
 ce rejects the League and returns to Gotham intent on cleaning up the city
  without resorting to murder.</p>\n<p>With the help of Alfred (Michael Cai
 ne)\, his loyal butler\, and Lucius Fox (Morgan Freeman)\, a tech expert a
 t Wayne Enterprises\, Batman is born.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
