 als and gnar shreddage\, four best friends live together\, hold down part-
 time jobs\, and lay some serious pipe in preparation for the annual Pipe M
 asters surf competition. No boys can get in the way of this totally tubula
 r girl gang. Bring your friends and catch this perfect wave of Y2K nostalg
 ia with us.\nFollowed at 11pm by DANCE PARTY WITH DUGGERNAUT
