UID:ai1ec-138992@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Pride in the most colorful way possible — with crafts
 \, cocktails\, and community! Stitch\, paint\, bead\, or glue your heart o
 ut on rainbow-themed projects that shout love is love. Make friendship pin
 s\, bold flags\, or wearable pride pieces while you sip on something brigh
 t and bubbly. Everyone’s welcome — bring your true colors and craft them i
 nto something fabulous.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250820T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250820T210000
LOCATION:Gather\, 116 N Walnut Ave\, Bloomington
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20250822T180000
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Pride Night
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/pride-night/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div>Celebrate P
 ride in the most colorful way possible — with crafts\, cocktails\, and com
 munity! Stitch\, paint\, bead\, or glue your heart out on rainbow-themed p
 rojects that shout <em>love is love</em>. Make friendship pins\, bold flag
 s\, or wearable pride pieces while you sip on something bright and bubbly.
  Everyone’s welcome — bring your true colors and craft them into something
  fabulous.</div>\n<div></div>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-138834@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Featuring:\n    KRISTIN ANDREASSEN – GUITAR\, VOCALS\, DANCE\n 
    NIC GAREISS – DANCER\n    ALLISON DE GROOT – BANJO\n    BRITTANY HAAS –
  FIDDLE\nIt’s an evening of rhythm\, movement\, and pure musical magic—fea
 turing four of the finest folk artists on the scene. With clogging\, clawh
 ammer\, and a whole lot of heart—this show will move you… body and soul.
