 in.\n\n\n\n\nA beginner lesson starts at 7:00 pm\, with dancing from 7:30 
 to 9:30 pm. Come for the lesson or drop in anytime during the night!\nExpe
 ct a high-energy crowd and an active dance floor—the room will get warm\, 
 so wear comfortable clothes you can move in. Admission is by donation. Hos
 ted by the Bloomington Old-Time Music and Dance Group. Don’t miss this one
 -of-a-kind dance party!
