BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-139256@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:​​​​A gorgeous program featuring the otherworldly sonatas of Sa
 int-Saëns\, composed in the last year of his long life. Balancing off the 
 program will be Poulenc’s Trio- one of his finest achievements- as well as
  Mozart’s Piano Quintet- a work that Mozart himself considered “the best t
 hing I have written in my life.”\nSaint-Saëns: Oboe Sonata op. 166​\nSaint
 -Saëns: Clarinet Sonata op. 167\nSaint-Saëns: Bassoon Sonata op. 168\nPoul
 enc: Trio for Oboe\, Bassoon and Piano\nMozart: Quintet for Piano and Wind
 s K. 452\n​​​​​​​​​\n​​​​​​Gianfranco Bortolato\, oboe\nJames Campbell\, c
 larinet\nJim Smelser\, horn\nGeorge Sakakeeny\, bassoon\nAndreas Ioannides
 \, piano\nFutaba Niekawa\, piano
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250821T190000
LOCATION:United Methodist Church\, 36 South Jefferson St.\, Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Chamberfest Brown County presents: Comfort Reeds\, the sonatas of S
 aint-Saëns
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/chamberfest-brown-county-presents-comfort-reeds-
 the-sonatas-of-saint-saens/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>​​​​A gorgeou
 s program featuring the otherworldly sonatas of Saint-Saëns\, composed in 
 the last year of his long life. Balancing off the program will be Poulenc’
 s Trio- one of his finest achievements- as well as Mozart’s Piano Quintet-
  a work that Mozart himself considered “the best thing I have written in m
 y life.”</p>\n<p>Saint-Saëns: Oboe Sonata op. 166​</p>\n<p>Saint-Saëns: Cl
 arinet Sonata op. 167<br />\nSaint-Saëns: Bassoon Sonata op. 168</p>\n<p>P
 oulenc: Trio for Oboe\, Bassoon and Piano<br />\nMozart: Quintet for Piano
  and Winds K. 452<br />\n​​​​​​​​​<br />\n​​​​​​Gianfranco Bortolato\, obo
 e<br />\nJames Campbell\, clarinet<br />\nJim Smelser\, horn<br />\nGeorge
  Sakakeeny\, bassoon<br />\nAndreas Ioannides\, piano</p>\n<p>Futaba Nieka
 wa\, piano</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
