LOCATION:Ransburg Scout Camp\, 7599 Waldrip Creek Rd\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Sugar Hill Dance Weekend (sponsored by the Bloomington Old Time Mus
 ic and Dance Group)
