BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-138586@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by the Founder of Graham’s Foundation\, Nicholas Hall\, 
 this will be an opportunity to learn more about Graham’s Foundation\, volu
 nteer and help assemble care packages that are shipped free to parents of 
 premature babies and buy a one of a kind piece of art with 100% of the pro
 ceeds supporting Graham’s Foundation.\nGraham’s Foundation was founded in 
 2009 in memory of Nicholas’s son\, to help educate and inform preemie pare
 nts so they feel empowered and confident while they navigate the journey o
 f prematurity.\nCome and go as your schedule allows.\nwww.grahamsfoundatio
 n.org
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250823T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250823T180000
LOCATION:200 East Southern Drive\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
