 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Hosted by the
  Founder of Graham’s Foundation\, Nicholas Hall\, this will be an opportun
 ity to learn more about Graham’s Foundation\, volunteer and help assemble 
 care packages that are shipped free to parents of premature babies and buy
  a one of a kind piece of art with 100% of the proceeds supporting Graham’
 s Foundation.</p>\n<p>Graham’s Foundation was founded in 2009 in memory of
  Nicholas’s son\, to help educate and inform preemie parents so they feel 
 empowered and confident while they navigate the journey of prematurity.</p
 >\n<p>Come and go as your schedule allows.<br />\nwww.grahamsfoundation.or
 g</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
