CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:This season’s finale begins with Brahms’ moving Clarinet Quinte
 t- a work full of introspective melancholy written as the sun was setting 
 in Brahms’ own life. Finally\, Dvořák’s radiant Sextet reminds us all that
  the sun will rise again!\n​Brahms: Clarinet Quintet\, op. 115\nDvořák: St
 ring Sextet\, op. 48\n​​​​​​​​​​\n​​​​​​James Campbell\, clarinet\nLei Hou
 \, violin\nQing Hou\, violin\nLarry Neuman\, viola\nMark Holloway\, viola
 \nBrandon Vamos\, cello\nKenneth Olsen\, cello
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250823T190000
LOCATION:New Life Community Church\, 1450 Indiana-135\, Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Chamberfest Brown County presents: ‘From Dusk to Dawn’ for  Strings
  and Clarinet
