 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>This season’s
  finale begins with Brahms’ moving Clarinet Quintet- a work full of intros
 pective melancholy written as the sun was setting in Brahms’ own life. Fin
 ally\, Dvořák’s radiant Sextet reminds us all that the sun will rise again
 !</p>\n<p>​Brahms: Clarinet Quintet\, op. 115<br />\nDvořák: String Sextet
 \, op. 48<br />\n​​​​​​​​​​<br />\n​​​​​​James Campbell\, clarinet<br />\n
 Lei Hou\, violin<br />\nQing Hou\, violin<br />\nLarry Neuman\, viola<br /
