DESCRIPTION:Bloomington’s juried fine art and craft festival\, now in its 4
 9th year\, showcases 125 local and national artists\, community booths\, L
 otus kids’ tent\, and a music and spoken word stage. Meet artists\, enjoy\
 , and purchase work in 2D\, ceramics\, glass\, jewelry\, painting\, photog
 raphy\, sculpture\, and wood. Enjoy lunch and dinner at one of the many re
 staurants serving global cuisine on 4th Street’s Restaurant Row.
