X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>In ho
 nor of the 100th birthday of the legendary Reina de la Salsa\, Celia Cruz\
 , Indiana University invites the community to a week-long celebration of h
 er life\, music\, and cultural legacy. From film and live performance to s
 cholarship and dance\, this series pays tribute to an artist whose voice a
 nd charisma shaped the soundscape of Latin music around the world.</strong
 ></p>\n</BODY></HTML>
