 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Slip into the
  swamp and let it glitter.<br />\n<strong>Western Skateland transforms int
 o a forest-floor fever dream for Frog Disco: a surreal\, high-funk skate p
 arty for creatures of the night. Expect cosmic beats\, glowing mushrooms\,
  swamp-glam vibes\, and maybe a frog in platforms.</strong><br />\n🪩 Psych
 edelic disco & weird funk all night<br />\n🌕 Glow-in-the-dark toadstools &
  forest visuals<br />\n🎭 Come as a rave frog\, glam goblin\, moss queen\, 
 or disco druid</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
