 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>In the series
 \, <em>The Geoglyphs of Our Times</em>\, Lorenzo Poli illuminates the issu
 e of resource mining in South America. The project reveals the monstrous g
 randeur of the mines\, where the land has been scooped out in almost mythi
 c proportions.</p>\n<p>Event is Open to the public. Beer\, wine and food f
 rom Maiz Colombiana for sale.</p>\n<p> </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
