  sheep\, donkeys and more. Learn about regenerative livestock farming on t
 he tour at 10am. Enjoy coffee/tea and a sweet treat as you pet\, brush\, a
 nd feed treats to goats at 11am. Take a leisurely stroll with the donkeys\
 , brush them\, feed them treats\, take lots of pictures at noon. Tickets i
 n advance at celticglen.org or at door (space permitting).
