CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Bring your thriving cuttings\, beloved but ready-to-part-with h
 ouseplants\, or rare green companions in search of a new home. All offerin
 gs should be healthy and pest-free\, with love and intention behind them.
 \nWander the space\, sip something enchanting\, and discover new foliage—a
 nd friendships—along the way.  Our Plant Swap is more than a simple trade—
 it’s an invitation to share the magic of growth\, exchange stories woven t
 hrough soil and stem\, and connect with a community of fellow plant lovers
  and caretakers.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250909T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250909T190000
