X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Bring your th
 riving cuttings\, beloved but ready-to-part-with houseplants\, or rare gre
 en companions in search of a new home. All offerings should be healthy and
  pest-free\, with love and intention behind them.<br />\nWander the space\
 , sip something enchanting\, and discover new foliage—and friendships—alon
 g the way.  Our Plant Swap is more than a simple trade—it’s an invitation 
 to share the magic of growth\, exchange stories woven through soil and ste
 m\, and connect with a community of fellow plant lovers and caretakers.</p
 >\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
