  The first theme was “Hi Neighbor” and we still hold true to those roots. 
 Our non profit organization is made up of your friends and family in the c
 ommunity that wants to make Monroe County a fun place to live. Our festiva
 l has live music on two stages\, food trucks\, craft vendors\, kids games\
 , Queen Contest\, Parade\, Circus Show.</strong></p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
