DESCRIPTION:Synopsis: In 2200\, private detective Aline Ruby and her androi
 d partner Carlos Rivera are hired by a wealthy businessman to track down a
  notorious hacker.\nOn Mars\, they descend deep into the underbelly of the
  planet’s capital city where they uncover a darker story of brain farms\, 
 corruption\, and a missing girl who holds a secret about the robots that t
 hreatens to change the face of the universe.
