X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Synopsis: In 
 2200\, private detective Aline Ruby and her android partner Carlos Rivera 
 are hired by a wealthy businessman to track down a notorious hacker.</p>\n
 <p>On Mars\, they descend deep into the underbelly of the planet’s capital
  city where they uncover a darker story of brain farms\, corruption\, and 
 a missing girl who holds a secret about the robots that threatens to chang
 e the face of the universe.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
