DESCRIPTION:TETSUO: THE IRON MAN is filmmaker Shinya Tsukamoto’s unhinged h
 ot take on humankind’s ongoing battle with technology\; literally\, as a m
 an mutates into a walking\, clanking man-machine that terrorizes himself a
 nd everyone around him. Warping elements of early Cronenberg\, Lynch\, and
  Raimi into a deliriously-paced cyberpunk cocktail\, TETSUO is a body horr
 or manifesto that’s fueled by techno-erotic adrenaline and wrought iron pe
 rversion. Unmissable.
