 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>TETSUO: THE I
 RON MAN is filmmaker Shinya Tsukamoto’s unhinged hot take on humankind’s o
 ngoing battle with technology\; literally\, as a man mutates into a walkin
 g\, clanking man-machine that terrorizes himself and everyone around him. 
 Warping elements of early Cronenberg\, Lynch\, and Raimi into a deliriousl
 y-paced cyberpunk cocktail\, TETSUO is a body horror manifesto that’s fuel
 ed by techno-erotic adrenaline and wrought iron perversion. Unmissable.</p
 >\n</BODY></HTML>
