BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-140364@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015806Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:British Glam rock star Brian Slade (Jonathan Rhys Myers) turned
  the music world on its head three times: first when he debuted his alter 
 ego Maxwell Demon\, second when he teamed up with notoriously feral Michig
 an punk Curt Wild (Ewan McGregor)\, and third when he faked his own death 
 on stage and then disappeared. Years later\, an intrepid reporter (Christi
 an Bale) tries to find out what happened to Slade\, and in the process unc
 overs the lasting personal and cultural impacts of glam rock’s transcenden
 t moment. [123 min\; musical\, drama\; English]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250918T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Q+ film series: VELVET GOLDMINE
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/q-film-series-velvet-goldmine/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>British Glam 
 rock star Brian Slade (Jonathan Rhys Myers) turned the music world on its 
 head three times: first when he debuted his alter ego Maxwell Demon\, seco
 nd when he teamed up with notoriously feral Michigan punk Curt Wild (Ewan 
 McGregor)\, and third when he faked his own death on stage and then disapp
 eared. Years later\, an intrepid reporter (Christian Bale) tries to find o
 ut what happened to Slade\, and in the process uncovers the lasting person
 al and cultural impacts of glam rock’s transcendent moment. [123 min\; mus
 ical\, drama\; English] </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
