CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Dancing Babies is offered every 3rd Saturday of the month from 
 September to December 2025.\nYou’re invited to join facilitator Celina Jaf
 fe (& baby Otis) for a joyful movement experience designed for caregivers 
 and their babies (ages 3 months to 1 year). Each 45-minute class starts wi
 th a gentle warm-up and allows for breaks at any time. We will share in a 
 welcoming space for connection\, expression\, and shared rhythm! You and y
 our baby will sway\, bounce\, and groove together to music\, fostering bot
 h your baby’s development and your skills in co-creativity.\nNo dance expe
 rience required. Come once or join us every month and let your Saturdays s
 tart with music\, motion\, and joy!\nQuestions? Email Sophia Fatouros\, sc
 hool@windfalldancers.org\; https://windfalldancers.org/workshops/
