 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Dancing Babie
 s is offered every 3rd Saturday of the month from September to December 20
 25.</p>\n<p>You’re invited to join facilitator Celina Jaffe (& baby Otis) 
 for a joyful movement experience designed for caregivers and their babies 
 (ages 3 months to 1 year). Each 45-minute class starts with a gentle warm-
 up and allows for breaks at any time. We will share in a welcoming space f
 or connection\, expression\, and shared rhythm! You and your baby will swa
 y\, bounce\, and groove together to music\, fostering both your baby’s dev
 elopment and your skills in co-creativity.</p>\n<p>No dance experience req
 uired. Come once or join us every month and let your Saturdays start with 
 music\, motion\, and joy!</p>\n<p>Questions? Email Sophia Fatouros\, <a hr
 ef='mailto:school@windfalldancers.org' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>scho
