CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:The Plant Swap is more than a simple trade—it’s an invitation t
 o share the magic of growth\, exchange stories woven through soil and stem
 \, and connect with a community of fellow plant lovers and caretakers.\nBr
 ing your thriving cuttings\, beloved but ready-to-part-with houseplants\, 
 or rare green companions in search of a new home. All offerings should be 
 healthy and pest-free\, with love and intention behind them.
