 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div>\n<p>The Pl
 ant Swap is more than a simple trade—it’s an invitation to share the magic
  of growth\, exchange stories woven through soil and stem\, and connect wi
 th a community of fellow plant lovers and caretakers.</p>\n<p>Bring your t
 hriving cuttings\, beloved but ready-to-part-with houseplants\, or rare gr
 een companions in search of a new home. All offerings should be healthy an
 d pest-free\, with love and intention behind them.</p>\n</div>\n</BODY></H
 TML>
