CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Drop in by the upstairs fireplace for a quick refresher on digi
 tal basics followed by time for questions and one-on-one help with your de
 vices. \nIn this session\, you’ll learn:\n    How to set up and troublesho
 ot your home internet\, modem\, and Wi-Fi.\n    Safe ways to connect to pu
 blic Wi-Fi.\n    Step-by-step instructions for creating and managing an em
 ail account.\n    How to create strong passwords and spot phishing or onli
 ne scams.\n    Simple tips for keeping your accounts secure with two-facto
 r authentication.
