DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250925T150000
LOCATION:Brown County Public Library\, 205 Locust Lane\, Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Tech Help Thursday — Digital Basics: Internet\, Email & Online Safe
 ty Made Simple
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/tech-help-thursday-digital-basics-internet-email
 -online-safety-made-simple/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Drop 
 in by the upstairs fireplace for a quick refresher on digital basics follo
 wed by time for questions and one-on-one help with your devices.</strong> 
 </p>\n<p>In this session\, you’ll learn:</p>\n<p>    How to set up and tro
 ubleshoot your home internet\, modem\, and Wi-Fi.<br />\n    Safe ways to 
 connect to public Wi-Fi.<br />\n    Step-by-step instructions for creating
  and managing an email account.<br />\n    How to create strong passwords 
 and spot phishing or online scams.<br />\n    Simple tips for keeping your
  accounts secure with two-factor authentication.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
