CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Synopsis: Video game designer Allegra Geller (Jennifer Jason Le
 igh) has created a virtual reality game called eXistenZ. After a crazed fa
 n attempts to kill her\, Allegra goes on the run with Ted (Jude Law)\, a y
 oung businessman who falls into the role of bodyguard. In an attempt to sa
 ve her game\, Allegra implants into Ted’s body the video game pod that car
 ries a damaged copy of eXistenZ. Allegra and Ted engage in a series of exp
 eriences that blur the lines between fantasy and reality.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250926T190000
LOCATION:Orbit Room\, 107 North College Ave.\, Suite 001 (downstairs)\, Blo
 omington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Cicada Cinema: eXistenZ (screenings at 7pm & 9pm)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/cicada-cinema-existenz/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Synopsis: Vid
 eo game designer Allegra Geller (Jennifer Jason Leigh) has created a virtu
 al reality game called eXistenZ. After a crazed fan attempts to kill her\,
  Allegra goes on the run with Ted (Jude Law)\, a young businessman who fal
 ls into the role of bodyguard. In an attempt to save her game\, Allegra im
 plants into Ted’s body the video game pod that carries a damaged copy of e
 XistenZ. Allegra and Ted engage in a series of experiences that blur the l
 ines between fantasy and reality. </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
