  Saturday\, September 27 from 11:00 AM – 3:00 PM.\nThe event offers a behi
 nd-the-scenes look at how Needmore’s specialty coffees are crafted\, movin
 g the roasting process beyond the café and into a space designed for quali
 ty and growth. Guests will have the opportunity to:\n\nTour the new roasti
 ng facility\nLearn about the specialty coffee roasting process\nSample fre
 shly roasted specialty coffees\nEnter giveaways
