CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:The October First Thursdays will be a festival of art\, ideas\,
  and community featuring 2 performance stages\, 70+ activity booths\, 20+ 
 arts vendors\, food trucks\, giveaways\, and more. Around the IU Fine Arts
  Plaza\, there will be a zine-making station\, an “ask a philosopher” boot
 h\, a/v technology and fabrication demos\, and henna tattooing among many 
 other activities. On the main stage\, we’ll have country line dancing with
  Wall to Wall Line Dance Club along with performances by the African Ameri
 can Dance Company\, NOTUS (IU Jacobs)\, IU Musical Theatre\, and IU Contem
 porary Dance. For more details\, visit  go.iu.edu/first-thursdays.\n 
