UID:ai1ec-140907@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Mutt is a poignant indie drama set over a single day in New Yor
 k City as we follow Feña\, a young trans man portrayed by Lío Mehiel\, as 
 he navigates unexpected reunions with his estranged father\, his straight 
 ex-boyfriend\, and his younger half-sister. These encounters compel Feña t
 o confront the complexities of his relationships and identity post-transit
 ion. [87 min\; drama\; English and Spanish with English subtitles]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251002T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:New Americas Cinema Series: MUTT (2023)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/new-americas-cinema-series-mutt-2023/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Mutt is a poi
 gnant indie drama set over a single day in New York City as we follow Feña
 \, a young trans man portrayed by Lío Mehiel\, as he navigates unexpected 
 reunions with his estranged father\, his straight ex-boyfriend\, and his y
 ounger half-sister. These encounters compel Feña to confront the complexit
 ies of his relationships and identity post-transition. [87 min\; drama\; E
 nglish and Spanish with English subtitles] </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-140923@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Celtic Thunder brings together past and present members for a m
 emorable night of music\, memories\, and camaraderie. Performing their mos
 t beloved hits\, this concert highlights the powerful harmonies\, soaring 
 ballads\, and electrifying energy that have made them famous. From timeles
 s Irish folk songs to modern favorites\, audiences can look forward to the
  anthems that have shaped Celtic Thunder’s incredible journey.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251002T193000
LOCATION:Brown County Music Center\, 200 Maple Leaf Boulevard\, Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:An Evening With Celtic Thunder
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/an-evening-with-celtic-thunder/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Celtic Thunde
 r brings together past and present members for a memorable night of music\
 , memories\, and camaraderie. Performing their most beloved hits\, this co
 ncert highlights the powerful harmonies\, soaring ballads\, and electrifyi
 ng energy that have made them famous. From timeless Irish folk songs to mo
 dern favorites\, audiences can look forward to the anthems that have shape
 d Celtic Thunder’s incredible journey.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
