BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-140940@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Jiaoying Summers is a comedy powerhouse on a rapid rise blendin
 g fearless\, dark humor with a deeply personal and refreshingly global per
 spective. Born in China and now based in Los Angeles\, she turns cultural 
 clashes\, immigrant identity\, and motherhood into razor-sharp comedy that
  resonates across continents.
