BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-140910@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:40th Anniversary Screening\nProduced by Dario Argento\, directe
 d by Lamberto Bava (son of Mario Bava)\, and scored by Claudio Simonetti\,
  Demons is Italian horror personified. When a a group of strangers respond
  to an invitation to a mysterious new movie\, they find themselves unwitti
 ngly trapped in a movie theater with scores of ravenous demons. Featuring 
 an iconic score mixed with artists like Billy Idol\, Mötley Crüe\, and Sax
 on\, Demons has gained a worldwide following for its maximalist approach t
 o gore\, its self-awareness\, and demented glee. [89 min\; horror\; Italia
 n with English subtitles]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251003T220000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Friday Night Frights Series: DEMONS
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/friday-night-frights-series-demons/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>40th Annivers
 ary Screening<br />\nProduced by Dario Argento\, directed by Lamberto Bava
  (son of Mario Bava)\, and scored by Claudio Simonetti\, Demons is Italian
  horror personified. When a a group of strangers respond to an invitation 
 to a mysterious new movie\, they find themselves unwittingly trapped in a 
 movie theater with scores of ravenous demons. Featuring an iconic score mi
 xed with artists like Billy Idol\, Mötley Crüe\, and Saxon\, Demons has ga
 ined a worldwide following for its maximalist approach to gore\, its self-
 awareness\, and demented glee. [89 min\; horror\; Italian with English sub
 titles] </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
