BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-140859@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Step into the world of country music with Lainey\, the ultimate
  tribute to CMA and Grammy-\nwinning sensation Lainey Wilson. Capturing th
 e heart\, soul\, and Southern charm of the\nLouisiana native herself\, Lin
 dsey Ridner delivers an unforgettable live experience that celebrates\nthe
  powerful voice\, bold style\, and heartfelt storytelling that have made L
 ainey Wilson a country\nmusic icon.\nFrom chart-topping hits like Heart Li
 ke a Truck an Things a Man Oughta Know to deep\ncuts that resonate with fa
 ns\, this tribute act brings the authentic sound and spirit of Lainey\nWil
 son to the stage with stunning vocals\, high-energy performances\, and a g
 enuine connection\nto the audience. Whether you’re a lifelong country fan 
 or discovering Lainey’s music for the first\ntime\, Lindsey Ridner will le
 ave you singing along and wanting more.\nPerfect for festivals\, country n
 ights\, fairs\, and private events\, Lainey is more than a tribute—it’s\na
  celebration of one of modern country’s brightest stars.\nhttps://events.h
 umanitix.com/lainey-tribute-to-lainey-wilson\nDoors will open at 6:15 p.m.
 \nMitchell Opera House is handicap accessible.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251004T190000
LOCATION:Mitchell Opera House\, 217 N 7th St\, Mitchell
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:LAINEY – A Tribute to Lainey Wilson
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/lainey-a-tribute-to-lainey-wilson/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Step into the
  world of country music with Lainey\, the ultimate tribute to CMA and Gram
 my-<br />\nwinning sensation Lainey Wilson. Capturing the heart\, soul\, a
 nd Southern charm of the<br />\nLouisiana native herself\, Lindsey Ridner 
 delivers an unforgettable live experience that celebrates<br />\nthe power
 ful voice\, bold style\, and heartfelt storytelling that have made Lainey 
 Wilson a country<br />\nmusic icon.</p>\n<p>From chart-topping hits like <
 em>Heart Like a Truck an Things a Man Oughta Know</em> to deep<br />\ncuts
  that resonate with fans\, this tribute act brings the authentic sound and
  spirit of Lainey<br />\nWilson to the stage with stunning vocals\, high-e
 nergy performances\, and a genuine connection<br />\nto the audience. Whet
 her you’re a lifelong country fan or discovering Lainey’s music for the fi
 rst<br />\ntime\, Lindsey Ridner will leave you singing along and wanting 
 more.<br />\nPerfect for festivals\, country nights\, fairs\, and private 
 events\, Lainey is more than a tribute—it’s<br />\na celebration of one of
  modern country’s brightest stars.</p>\n<p>https://events.humanitix.com/la
 iney-tribute-to-lainey-wilson</p>\n<p>Doors will open at 6:15 p.m.<br />\n
 Mitchell Opera House is handicap accessible.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
