DESCRIPTION:Sounds of Summer is a tribute show featuring over 30 favorite h
 its and tells the story of America’s band – The Beach Boys. These four inc
 redibly talented guys have known each other since grade school and shared 
 a love of 1960’s music and Beach Boys’ harmonies. The band has been playin
 g across the nation since 2015\, delivering audiences an authentic look an
 d sound\, taking them back to memories of the 1960s.
