 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Sounds of Sum
 mer is a tribute show featuring over 30 favorite hits and tells the story 
 of America’s band – The Beach Boys. These four incredibly talented guys ha
 ve known each other since grade school and shared a love of 1960’s music a
 nd Beach Boys’ harmonies. The band has been playing across the nation sinc
 e 2015\, delivering audiences an authentic look and sound\, taking them ba
 ck to memories of the 1960s. </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
