DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Join Little Spring Studio for a scenic and creative experience 
 in the heart of the sanctuary. This Plein Air Watercolor Workshop is the p
 erfect way to immerse yourself in the natural beauty of autumn while learn
 ing a new artistic skill. Enjoy a peaceful tour of the Sanctuary\, followe
 d by a beginner-friendly watercolor class\, and finish off the experience 
 with plant-based snacks in the fresh air.\nAges 7+ welcome with an accompa
 nying guardian.\nRegister at https://www.thegoatconspiracy.com/events/2025
