CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:You’re invited to join us at the Museum of Archaeology and Anth
 ropology on Thursday\, October 9th\, to celebrate fall festivals from arou
 nd the world. The Museum’s central hall will transform into Festival Row\,
  featuring the traditions of Dia de Los Muertos\, Diwali\, Mid-Autumn Fest
 ival\, and Halloween. Enjoy hands-on crafts for all ages\, complimentary c
 ider\, and a popcorn bar. This celebration of culture and community is ope
 n to all. Don’t forget to wear your favorite fall festival attire! More in
 formation can be found here:  https://events.iu.edu/iumaa/event/fall-festi
 vals-at-the-museum
