 lso appeared in HBO’s Our Flag Means Death\, Judd Apatow’s The Bubble\, an
 d Amazon’s series Forever. He voices characters in Big Mouth and The Mitch
 ells vs. The Machines. He is currently starring in the Broadway play All I
 n. Armisen is an 11-season veteran of Saturday Night Live. From 2014-2024\
 , Armisen was band leader of the 8G Band on Late Night With Seth Meyers.0p
