BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-141248@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:One of the most powerful crime dramas of all time\, Heat is mor
 e incendiary than ever. Al Pacino and Robert De Niro dually power the mome
 ntum and enormous scale of this groundbreaking crime epic. In the wake of 
 a precision heist of an armored truck\, an obsessive detective (Pacino) be
 gins to hunt Neil McCauley (De Niro)\, a ruthless professional thief\, and
  his crew through the streets of Los Angeles. As the stakes escalate\, the
 ir lives begin to mirror and unravel\, and McCauley’s crew initiates its m
 ost dangerous and complex job ever. Val Kilmer anchors an all-star support
 ing cast that includes Tom Sizemore\, Ashley Judd\, Amy Brenneman\, and Na
 talie Portman. [170 min\; action\, crime\, drama\; English\, Spanish with 
 English subtitles]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251009T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:The 30th anniversary screening: HEAT
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/the-30th-anniversary-screening-heat/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>One of the mo
 st powerful crime dramas of all time\, Heat is more incendiary than ever. 
 Al Pacino and Robert De Niro dually power the momentum and enormous scale 
 of this groundbreaking crime epic. In the wake of a precision heist of an 
 armored truck\, an obsessive detective (Pacino) begins to hunt Neil McCaul
 ey (De Niro)\, a ruthless professional thief\, and his crew through the st
 reets of Los Angeles. As the stakes escalate\, their lives begin to mirror
  and unravel\, and McCauley’s crew initiates its most dangerous and comple
 x job ever. Val Kilmer anchors an all-star supporting cast that includes T
 om Sizemore\, Ashley Judd\, Amy Brenneman\, and Natalie Portman. [170 min\
 ; action\, crime\, drama\; English\, Spanish with English subtitles] </p>
 \n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
