X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Join us for a
 n evening dog walk through the park—glow sticks included! We’ll walk a 1.5
 -mile paved loop together after dark.<br />\nThe first 50 dogs receive a g
 low stick for their collar. All leashed\, well-behaved dogs are welcome!<b
 r />\nMeet at the basketball courts on the north side of Switchyard Park. 
 Vehicle parking available in the Grimes Lane lot.<br />\nDogs must remain 
 leashed and attached to their humans during the walk\, and must be current
  with all vaccinations. We reserve the right to dismiss any dog for unruly
  activity and/or aggressive behavior.<br />\nSPECIAL NOTE: Presale tickets
  and registration for this event is NOT AVAILABLE. Admission is only accep
 ted at the event. If you are offered tickets to this event\, it is a SCAM!
 </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
