UID:ai1ec-141237@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Step right up and get ready to be amazed by our famous Great Gl
 ass Pumpkin Patch! Discover the perfect glass pumpkin that will bring a bu
 rst of color and joy to your home. There is nothing quite like seeing glas
 s pumpkins sparkle in the sun on a gorgeous fall day. Come and experience 
 the magic for yourself!\nAll of the pumpkins are made by the members of th
 e Bloomington Creative Glass Center. Rain or shine!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251011T100000
