 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Step right up
  and get ready to be amazed by our famous Great Glass Pumpkin Patch! Disco
 ver the perfect glass pumpkin that will bring a burst of color and joy to 
 your home. There is nothing quite like seeing glass pumpkins sparkle in th
 e sun on a gorgeous fall day. Come and experience the magic for yourself!<
 /p>\n<p>All of the pumpkins are made by the members of the Bloomington Cre
 ative Glass Center. Rain or shine! </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
