BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-141182@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:For my birthday this year\, my family suggested an intimate fam
 ily party. Wonderful idea! But the more I thought about it\, the more I re
 alized what I’d really also love is to gather some of the people whose pat
 hs have crossed with mine — those shared moments that helped shape our jou
 rneys\, filled our lives with memories\, and left impressions that last to
  this day.\nSo if that describes and includes you (and I hope it does)\, I
 ’d rather not wait for a “celebration of life” I probably wouldn’t get to 
 enjoy. Let’s celebrate now — together — with food\, drink\, music\, memori
 es\, stories\, laughter\, and good company (and yes\, you’re welcome to br
 ing a guest). To me\, that sounds far better than a posthumous celebration
  of life\, mainly because I get to be there and participate\nPlease RSVP: 
 https://www.punchbowl.com/parties/0ab85d49f3f564c433df
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251011T123000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20251011T160000
LOCATION:Beth Shalom Social Hall\, 3750 E 3rd St.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:A Premature Celebration of Life for David J. Colman\, Your Invitati
 on?
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/a-premature-celebration-of-life-for-david-j-colm
 an-your-invitation/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>For my birthd
 ay this year\, my family suggested an intimate family party. Wonderful ide
 a! But the more I thought about it\, the more I realized what I’d really a
 lso love is to gather some of the people whose paths have crossed with min
 e — those shared moments that helped shape our journeys\, filled our lives
  with memories\, and left impressions that last to this day.</p>\n<p>So if
  that describes and includes you (and I hope it does)\, I’d rather not wai
 t for a “celebration of life” I probably wouldn’t get to enjoy. Let’s cele
 brate now — together — with food\, drink\, music\, memories\, stories\, la
 ughter\, and good company (and yes\, you’re welcome to bring a guest). To 
 me\, that sounds far better than a posthumous celebration of life\, mainly
  because I get to be there and participate</p>\n<p><strong>Please RSVP: </
 strong><a href='https://TheVenueBloomington.us11.list-manage.com/track/cli
 ck?u=f1dc124bd1df761639f3a869d&id=2422308c8e&e=e0c780ebe3' target='_blank'
  rel='noopener' data-saferedirecturl='https://www.google.com/url?q=https:/
 /TheVenueBloomington.us11.list-manage.com/track/click?u%3Df1dc124bd1df7616
 39f3a869d%26id%3D2422308c8e%26e%3De0c780ebe3&source=gmail&ust=176001934199
 9000&usg=AOvVaw3g2TUnoSHA61Zq011ifGfB'>https://www.punchbowl.com/parties/0
 ab85d49f3f564c433df</a></p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
