DESCRIPTION:This series is designed to guide you on a journey from mystery 
 to mastery\, deepening both your tarot practice and your trust in yourself
 . Each session focuses on one card\, explored through a unique lens to str
 engthen intuitive reading and self-trust. Together\, we’ll learn with and 
 from one another in a supportive circle\, building confidence and insight 
 without the pressure to memorize meanings or find the “right” interpretati
 on.\nSessions include 60 minutes of engaged learning + optional 30 minutes
  for deeper conversation.
