 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>This series i
 s designed to guide you on a journey from mystery to mastery\, deepening b
 oth your tarot practice and your trust in yourself. Each session focuses o
 n one card\, explored through a unique lens to strengthen intuitive readin
 g and self-trust. Together\, we’ll learn with and from one another in a su
 pportive circle\, building confidence and insight without the pressure to 
 memorize meanings or find the “right” interpretation.</p>\n<p>Sessions inc
 lude 60 minutes of engaged learning + optional 30 minutes for deeper conve
 rsation.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
