X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p> Renowned sha
 man Lee Haw-rim and her protégé are hired by a wealthy\, enigmatic family 
 to investigate a disturbing supernatural illness that affects only the fir
 st-born children of each generation. Drawing on the help of a knowledgeabl
 e mortician and the country’s most revered geomancer\, the quartet soon tr
 ace the affliction’s origin to a long-hidden family grave located on sacre
 d ground. But as something much darker emerges\, they soon discover what b
 efalls those who dare to mess with the wrong grave. [134 min\; horror\; Ko
 rean and Japanese with English subtitles]</p>\n<p>“Exhuma is a masterpiece
  of art-horror and South Korean filmmaking\, ensured to enthrall viewers i
 nto repeated viewings and deep dives into each chapter.” — Josiah Teal\, F
 ilm Threat </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
