BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-141594@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Repression is the rule of the day in this film that skewers Gre
 ek governance of the 1960s. Z (Yves Montand)\, a leftist rabblerouser\, is
  killed in what appears to be a traffic accident. But given the political 
 climate\, the death of such a prominent activist raises troubling question
 s. Though it’s too late to save Z’s life\, a postmortem examination sugges
 ts that the ruling party was behind his death. As the facts leak out\, tho
 se who tell the truth pay the price for their honesty. [127 min\; thriller
 \, drama\; English\, French\, and Russian with English subtitles]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251018T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:McRobbie’s Choice Series: Z
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/mcrobbies-choice-series-z/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Repression is
  the rule of the day in this film that skewers Greek governance of the 196
 0s. Z (Yves Montand)\, a leftist rabblerouser\, is killed in what appears 
 to be a traffic accident. But given the political climate\, the death of s
 uch a prominent activist raises troubling questions. Though it’s too late 
 to save Z’s life\, a postmortem examination suggests that the ruling party
  was behind his death. As the facts leak out\, those who tell the truth pa
 y the price for their honesty. [127 min\; thriller\, drama\; English\, Fre
 nch\, and Russian with English subtitles] </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
