DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Bloomington Boogies features musicians who perform boogie-woogi
 e\, blues\, and related styles. For more information\, including details a
 bout free Bloomington Boogies events\, visit https://bloomingtonboogies.co
 m.\nArtists to perform in the ticketed concert include\n• C.J. Chenier – K
 ing of Zydeco accordionist/vocalist and son of Clifton Chenier\n• Silvan Z
 ingg – Boogie-woogie\, blues\, and jazz pianist and founder of the Interna
 tional Boogie Woogie Festival in Lugano\, Switzerland\n• Eden Brent – winn
 er of the 2025 Blues Music Award for Piano (Pinetop Perkins Award)\n• Henr
 i Herbert – Boogie-woogie/blues pianist originally from the UK\, performs 
 worldwide\n• Ben Toury – French pianist known for showmanship\, strength\,
  and speed\n• Craig Brenner – festival organizer and leader of Craig & The
  Crawdads\n• Rhythm Section: Gordon Bonham/guitar\, Ron Kadish/bass\, Dan 
 Hostetler/drums\, and Bill Bailey/rubboard and additional percussion\, plu
 s special guests
