BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-141686@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Jeffrey Franken\, a med school dropout with a proclivity for bi
 zarre experiments\, just lost his fiancée\, Elizabeth Shelley\, to a tragi
 c lawnmower accident. Our heartbroken protagonist comes to terms with his 
 loss in the only way that makes sense… bringing her back to life! Cobbling
  body parts together from New York’s ladies of the night\, Jeffrey reanima
 tes Elizabeth\, but she’s born again with not only a new body but a brand-
 new attitude and a chip on her shoulder!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251023T190000
LOCATION:Orbit Room\, 107 North College Ave.\, Suite 001 (downstairs)\, Blo
 omington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Cicada Cinema: FRANKENHOOKER
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/cicada-cinema-frankenhooker/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Jeffrey Frank
 en\, a med school dropout with a proclivity for bizarre experiments\, just
  lost his fiancée\, Elizabeth Shelley\, to a tragic lawnmower accident. Ou
 r heartbroken protagonist comes to terms with his loss in the only way tha
 t makes sense… bringing her back to life! Cobbling body parts together fro
 m New York’s ladies of the night\, Jeffrey reanimates Elizabeth\, but she’
 s born again with not only a new body but a brand-new attitude and a chip 
 on her shoulder!</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-141841@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Leading a phenomenal cast\, including Val Kilmer as the iconic 
 Tom “Iceman” Kazansky\, Kelly McGillis\, Anthony “Goose” Edwards\, Meg Rya
 n\, and Tom Skerritt\, Tom Cruise soars as Pete “Maverick” Mitchell\, the 
 young\, in-your-face fighter pilot with a need for speed\, a lot to prove\
 , and even more to learn. Top Gun takes a look at the danger and excitemen
 t that awaits every pilot at the Navy’s prestigious fighter weapons school
 . Cruise is superb as Maverick\, who’s out to become the best of the best.
  But you can’t be the best unless you compete amongst the best\, which is 
 exactly what Kilmer’s “Iceman” intends to show him\, thereby creating one 
 of the great cinematic rivalries of the 20th century. [109 min\; action\, 
 drama\; English]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251023T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Film: TOP GUN
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/film-top-gun/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Leading a phe
 nomenal cast\, including Val Kilmer as the iconic Tom “Iceman” Kazansky\, 
 Kelly McGillis\, Anthony “Goose” Edwards\, Meg Ryan\, and Tom Skerritt\, T
 om Cruise soars as Pete “Maverick” Mitchell\, the young\, in-your-face fig
 hter pilot with a need for speed\, a lot to prove\, and even more to learn
 . Top Gun takes a look at the danger and excitement that awaits every pilo
 t at the Navy’s prestigious fighter weapons school. Cruise is superb as Ma
 verick\, who’s out to become the best of the best. But you can’t be the be
 st unless you compete amongst the best\, which is exactly what Kilmer’s “I
 ceman” intends to show him\, thereby creating one of the great cinematic r
 ivalries of the 20th century. [109 min\; action\, drama\; English] </p>\n<
 /BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
