CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:With over a billion streams across his 8 albums\, Chad Daniels 
 is one of the most listened-to comedians of all time. He’s made 6 late-nig
 ht appearances is one of only 13 comics ever featured on The Tonight Show 
 with Conan O’Brien. Chad’s latest special\, EMPTY NESTER\, was shot in his
  hometown in Minnesota and recently premiered on Netflix. Chad co-hosts th
 e podcast PRETEND PROBLEMS with his girlfriend Kelsey Cook\, as well as Mi
 ddle of Somewhere with his buddy Cy Amundson.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251024T190000
