 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div id='event-d
 etail' class='event-detail event-detail-default buffer'>\n<div class='col-
 md-5 col-sm-9 col-xs-12 buffer-bottom'>\n<div class='event-panel-group'>\n
 <div id='descr' class='panel active' role='tabpanel'>\n<div class='truncat
 e expand-target collapsed'>\n<div class='custom-content'>\n<p>With over a 
 billion streams across his 8 albums\, Chad Daniels is one of the most list
 ened-to comedians of all time. He’s made 6 late-night appearances is one o
 f only 13 comics ever featured on <i>The Tonight Show with Conan O’Brien</
 i>. Chad’s latest special\, <i>EMPTY NESTER</i>\, was shot in his hometown
  in Minnesota and recently premiered on Netflix. Chad co-hosts the podcast
  <i>PRETEND PROBLEMS</i> with his girlfriend Kelsey Cook\, as well as <i>M
 iddle of Somewhere</i> with his buddy Cy Amundson.</p>\n<div></div>\n</div
