  a bee demo\, poetry readings\, an orchard tour\, and a raffle. We expect 
 a lively crowd of attendees enjoying baked goods\, cider\, and more. The e
 vent is free to the public\, and we’d love to discuss opportunities for yo
 ur participation this year.\nSCHEDULE\n1pm – Event Begins (cider pressing\
 , apple-tastings\, activities)\n1:30 – Orchard Tour\n2:00 – Bee Demo\n3:00
  – Haiku & Poetry Reading (+ free raffle)\n4:00 – Event Ends\, Closing Rem
 arks
