DESCRIPTION:In 1950s communist Czechoslovakia\, a government minister (Yves
  Montand)\, a war veteran who has long been a loyal party man\, leads a re
 latively comfortable life with wife Lise (Montand’s real-life spouse Simon
 e Signoret). However\, he soon finds himself under surveillance\, then und
 er arrest. He has no idea what his offense is\, but agents for the totalit
 arian regime interrogate and torture him\, aiming to use their unending po
 wer to gain a false confession for supposed crimes against the state. [139
  min\; thriller\, drama\; French and Spanish with English subtitles]
