 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>In 1950s comm
 unist Czechoslovakia\, a government minister (Yves Montand)\, a war vetera
 n who has long been a loyal party man\, leads a relatively comfortable lif
 e with wife Lise (Montand’s real-life spouse Simone Signoret). However\, h
 e soon finds himself under surveillance\, then under arrest. He has no ide
 a what his offense is\, but agents for the totalitarian regime interrogate
  and torture him\, aiming to use their unending power to gain a false conf
 ession for supposed crimes against the state. [139 min\; thriller\, drama\
 ; French and Spanish with English subtitles] </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
