  free improvisation and a weirdo singer-songwriter.<br />\nALL-AGES<br />
 \n________________________</p>\n<p>Bad History Month – honest\, intelligen
 t and humorous songwriting with a post-rock bend. Songs about daily anxiet
 ies and the little pleasures in life.<br />\nhttps://fathistorymonth.bandc
 amp.com/<br />\n________________________</p>\n<p>Let Me Hear You – masterf
 ul soundcraft using keys\, strings and samples from local sonic explorer J
 immy Brown.<br />\nhttps://letmehearyou.bandcamp.com/<br />\n_____________
 ___________</p>\n<p>Exurn – new solo project of Joseph Trahan\, progressio
 n from Spiral project.<br />\nWithout Whom – Joseph will be joined by Haze
 l Benton and Ben Myers to revive this heavy\, amorphous improvisational tr
 io.<br />\nhttps://spiral1031.bandcamp.com<br />\nhttps://www.instagram.co
 m/xwithoutwhomx/</p>\n<p>Tickets: <a class='ai1ec-ticket-url-exported' hre
 f='https://link.dice.fm/H37fca9d7fe1'>https://link.dice.fm/H37fca9d7fe1</a
 >.</p></BODY></HTML>
X-TICKETS-URL:https://link.dice.fm/H37fca9d7fe1
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
