 us celebration of being yourself. \nCo-directed by Ansley Valentine and DJ
  Gray\nBook and lyrics by Chad Beguelin\nBook by Bob Martin\nMusic by Matt
 hew Sklar\nMusical Direction by Brandon Magid\nChoreographed by DJ Gray
