 aikovsky: Serenade in C Major\, Op. 48 (1880)\n\nAbout the Conductor:\nTho
 mas Wilkins is principal conductor of the Hollywood Bowl Orchestra\, artis
 tic partner for education and external engagement and Germeshausen Family 
 and Youth Concerts Conductor Chair with the Boston Symphony Orchestra\, an
 d professor of music (conducting) at the Indiana University Jacobs School 
