UID:ai1ec-142111@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Clown in a Cornfield (Eli Craig\, USA\, 2025\, R): From the dir
 ector of the beloved Tucker and Dale vs. Evil\, Clown in a Cornfield is…ex
 actly what it sounds like. In a fading midwestern town\, beloved town masc
 ot Frendo the Clown—a symbol of bygone success—reemerges as a terrifying s
 courge. [98 min\; horror\; English]\nRed Rooms (Pascal Plante\, Canada\, 2
 024\, R): One of the most acclaimed horror films of 2024\, Red Rooms is th
 e story of Kelly-Anne\, a model who becomes obsessed with the high-profile
  trial of serial killer Ludovic Chevalier. When reality blurs with her mor
 bid fantasies\, she goes down a dark path to seek the final piece of the p
 uzzle: the missing video of a murdered 13-year-old girl. [118 min\; horror
 \; French with English subtitles]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251031T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Slice and Dice Double Feature: Clown in a Cornfield + Red Rooms
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/slice-and-dice-double-feature-clown-in-a-cornfie
 ld-red-rooms/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p> Clown in a C
 ornfield (Eli Craig\, USA\, 2025\, R): From the director of the beloved Tu
 cker and Dale vs. Evil\, Clown in a Cornfield is…exactly what it sounds li
 ke. In a fading midwestern town\, beloved town mascot Frendo the Clown—a s
 ymbol of bygone success—reemerges as a terrifying scourge. [98 min\; horro
 r\; English]</p>\n<p>Red Rooms (Pascal Plante\, Canada\, 2024\, R): One of
  the most acclaimed horror films of 2024\, Red Rooms is the story of Kelly
 -Anne\, a model who becomes obsessed with the high-profile trial of serial
  killer Ludovic Chevalier. When reality blurs with her morbid fantasies\, 
 she goes down a dark path to seek the final piece of the puzzle: the missi
 ng video of a murdered 13-year-old girl. [118 min\; horror\; French with E
 nglish subtitles] </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
