CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:On Saturday\, November 1\, Indiana University Recreational Spor
 ts will host the 25th annual Jill Behrman 5K Walk/Run (JB5K)\, a vibrant c
 elebration of life\, resilience\, and student leadership. What began as a 
 heartfelt response to tragedy has grown into one of IU’s most beloved comm
 unity events\, honoring the memory of Jill Behrman\, an IU student and Blo
 omington native who disappeared during a solo bike ride in 2000.  https://
 blogs.iu.edu/studentlife/2025/09/30/jill-behrman-5k-celebrates-25-years-of
 -remembrance-and-resilience/
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251101T110000
LOCATION:Student Recreational Sports Center\, 1601 E. Law Lane\, Bloomingto
 n
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Jill Behrman 5K Walk/Run
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/jill-behrman-5k-walk-run/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div dir='ltr'>O
 n Saturday\, November 1\, Indiana University Recreational Sports will host
  the 25th annual <a class='external' href='https://recsports.indiana.edu/s
 pecial-events/jb5k.html'>Jill Behrman 5K Walk/Run (JB5K)</a>\, a vibrant c
 elebration of life\, resilience\, and student leadership. What began as a 
 heartfelt response to tragedy has grown into one of IU’s most beloved comm
 unity events\, honoring the memory of Jill Behrman\, an IU student and Blo
 omington native who disappeared during a solo bike ride in 2000.  <a href=
 'https://blogs.iu.edu/studentlife/2025/09/30/jill-behrman-5k-celebrates-25
 -years-of-remembrance-and-resilience/' target='_blank' rel='noopener' data
 -saferedirecturl='https://www.google.com/url?q=https://blogs.iu.edu/studen
 tlife/2025/09/30/jill-behrman-5k-celebrates-25-years-of-remembrance-and-re
 silience/&source=gmail&ust=1760019341373000&usg=AOvVaw3lZPEkLnICYocHSTGSHS
 Ug'>https://blogs.iu.edu/studentlife/2025/09/30/jill-behrman-5k-celebrates
 -25-years-of-remembrance-and-resilience/</a></div>\n<div dir='ltr'></div>
 \n<div dir='ltr'></div>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
