X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><span style='
 font-family: arial\, sans-serif'>Join Charlie Brown\, Snoopy\, and the who
 le Peanuts gang in the heartwarming and hilarious musical <i>You’re a Good
  Man\, Charlie Brown</i>! This timeless classic brings the beloved comic s
 trip to life with laugh-out-loud moments\, memorable songs\, and a big dos
 e of charm. From flying kites to school crushes\, it’s a day in the life o
 f the world’s most endearing underdog and his friends. Celebrate the 75th 
 anniversary of Peanuts with this perennial favorite packed with humor\, he
 art\, and plenty of “good grief!” <em>Fun for all ages!</em></span></p>\n<
 /BODY></HTML>
