BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-142129@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Whether you’re a spooky spirit or a thrill-seeking ghoul\, we’v
 e got all kinds of eerie fun for every member of the family.\n    Dress to
  impress in your creepiest costume for a chance to win a gift card to our 
 restaurant in the costume contest.\n    If you’re in the mood for somethin
 g sweet\, cozy up by the fire to roast marshmallows and make s’mores while
  enjoying live music.\n    We’ve got a Kids Fun Zone packed with pumpkin b
 owling\, and tic-tac-toe\n    For those who prefer a more relaxed haunt\, 
 grab a blanket and settle in on the terrace for live music from Black Wate
 r Revival and the Les Masters Band.\nThis is one monster bash you won’t wa
 nt to miss! See you on the spooky side… if you dare.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251101T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20251101T210000
LOCATION:Hard Truth Distilling Company\, 418 Old State Road 46\, Nashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Sweet Mash Monster Bash\, with entertainment from Black Water Reviv
 al and the Les Masters Band
