 black-water-revival-and-the-les-masters-band/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Whether you’r
 e a spooky spirit or a thrill-seeking ghoul\, we’ve got all kinds of eerie
  fun for every member of the family.</p>\n<p>    Dress to impress in your 
 creepiest costume for a chance to win a gift card to our restaurant in the
  costume contest.<br />\n    If you’re in the mood for something sweet\, c
 ozy up by the fire to roast marshmallows and make s’mores while enjoying l
 ive music.<br />\n    We’ve got a Kids Fun Zone packed with pumpkin bowlin
 g\, and tic-tac-toe<br />\n    For those who prefer a more relaxed haunt\,
  grab a blanket and settle in on the terrace for live music from Black Wat
 er Revival and the Les Masters Band.</p>\n<p>This is one monster bash you 
 won’t want to miss! See you on the spooky side… if you dare.</p>\n</BODY><
 /HTML>
