CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:Celtic Glen Heritage Livestock\; celticglenheritagelivestock@gmail.
 com\; https://www.celticglen.org/
DESCRIPTION:Celtic Glen Heritage Livestock welcomes Winter with an immersiv
 e campfire retreat in the sacred woodlands of the historic Romona Oolitic 
 Stone Henge on the Celtic Glen family farm. Surrounded by nature’s wisdom\
 , this experience blends ancient Celtic practices with modern holistic hea
 ling.\nCeltic Nature Rituals connect to sacred traditions rooted in the Ce
 ltic wheel of the year.\nWhat to expect:\n• Gentle yoga and breathwork\n• 
 Sound bath\n• Guided meditation focused on honoring the past and the chang
 e of seasons\n• Nature-based experience and craft\n• Enjoy Dublin hand pie
  (cheddar n sweet onion)\, Barmbrack bread\, and hot cider upon your arriv
 al\n• Enjoy warming herbal tea throughout to keep you warm\n• Optional com
 plimentary camping for participants
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251101T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20251101T210000
LOCATION:Romona Stone Henge: 1806 W Romona Rd\, Spencer\, IN
SEQUENCE:0
