  Guided meditation focused on honoring the past and the change of seasons<
 br />\n</span><span class='zzOoR'>• Nature-based experience and craft<br /
 >\n</span><span class='zzOoR'>• Enjoy Dublin hand pie (cheddar n sweet oni
