 ed and award-winning poet Ross Gay. In addition\, we will lift up the voic
 es of our creative writing circles\, and welcome our founder Beth Lodge-Ri
 gal\, and poet Mary Ardery\, a former young writer with WWf(a)C.  Meet the
  authors in a reception following the program.
