DESCRIPTION:Innovation Week is Bloomington’s action week\, where ideas\, cr
 eativity\, and collaboration become action. Hosted by The Mill\, it’s four
  days of energy and impact in the Trades District.\nEach day spotlights a 
 different ecosystem strength—HealthTech\, Defense & GovTech\, AI\, and Cre
 ative Arts & Community—through keynotes\, showcases\, and gatherings desig
 ned to turn conversations into outcomes.\nFree Tickets → dimensionmill.org
 /innovation-week
