CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:You’re invited to be part of a special moment as we unveil the 
 final work of art by renowned muralist and digital artist Sıtkı Doğan — a 
 breathtaking mural that brings fresh color\, creativity\, and life to the 
 Brown County Playhouse!\nEnjoy a morning of celebration featuring special 
 guests\, representatives of our generous donors and grant funders\, and st
 ories about the Playhouse’s history and the inspiration behind this incred
 ible artwork.\nDon’t miss your chance to take a photo at our Instagram spo
 t — step up to the mic and “perform” on our stage! Be sure to share your p
 hoto on social media and tag #BrownCountyPlayhouse to join the celebration
  online.\nAbout the Artist: Based in Florida\, Sıtkı Doğan is an accomplis
 hed muralist known for his dazzling 3D illusions\, trompe l’oeil mastery\,
  and storytelling through art. His large-scale murals across the U.S. tran
 sform ordinary walls into extraordinary visual experiences that celebrate 
 community and creativity.\nCome celebrate art\, community\, and the beauty
  of Brown County!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251104T103000
LOCATION:Historic Brown County Playhouse\, 70 South South Van Buren\, Nashv
 ille\, IN
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Mural Celebration
