 r (2017)\nFrank Ticheli: Wild Nights! (2007)\n\nAbout the Conductors:\nJas
 on H. Nam is associate professor of music in bands at the Indiana Universi
 ty Jacobs School of Music\, where he conducts bands and teaches undergradu
 ate and graduate courses in instrumental conducting\, administration of sc
 hool bands\, and wind literature.\nRyan Kelly is the inaugural associate d
 ean for academic affairs and student success at the Indiana University Jac
 obs School of Music\, where he is also associate professor of music in ban
 ds.
