BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-141180@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Secretly Society\, WFHB\, & BCT Present:\nA spellbinding farewe
 ll from Porridge Radio\, Pieces Of Heaven was filmed at the Centre Pompido
 u in 2024 to mark the release of the band’s final album\, Clouds In The Sk
 y They Will Always Be There For Me.\nLed by songwriter Dana Margolin\, it 
 moves through inertia\, heartbreak and dysphoria as she distils over a dec
 ade of music into one unforgettable hour. Equal parts concert\, lullaby an
 d revelation\, Pieces Of Heaven is not only an ending\, but an unbridled c
 elebration of the void: nothing means anything\, and within that is comple
 te freedom to do and feel everything.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251105T190000
LOCATION:Buskirk Chumley Theater\, 114 E Kirkwood Ave.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Porridge Radio Presents ‘Pieces of Heaven’ live at the Centre Pompi
 dou
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/porridge-radio-presents-pieces-of-heaven-live-at
 -the-centre-pompidou/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Secretly Soci
 ety\, WFHB\, & BCT Present:</p>\n<p>A spellbinding farewell from Porridge 
 Radio\, Pieces Of Heaven was filmed at the Centre Pompidou in 2024 to mark
  the release of the band’s final album\, Clouds In The Sky They Will Alway
 s Be There For Me.</p>\n<p>Led by songwriter Dana Margolin\, it moves thro
 ugh inertia\, heartbreak and dysphoria as she distils over a decade of mus
 ic into one unforgettable hour. Equal parts concert\, lullaby and revelati
 on\, Pieces Of Heaven is not only an ending\, but an unbridled celebration
  of the void: nothing means anything\, and within that is complete freedom
  to do and feel everything.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
