BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-142394@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Join a park naturalist for a guided hike of Trail 6 around Lake
  Strahl! Hear about the history of the lake\, the surrounding Strahl Valle
 y\, and learn about the animals that make it their home\, all while enjoyi
 ng beautiful fall colors. The section of Trail 6 around Lake Strahl is con
 sidered easy to moderate. It has some short staircases\, uneven surfaces\,
  tree roots\, and possible  wet spots. The trail is less than a mile and w
 ill take about 45 minutes to complete.\nMeet at the Lake Strahl parking lo
 t.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251107T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20251107T134500
LOCATION:Brown County State Park\, Lake Strahl parking lot\, 1801 IN-46\, N
 ashville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Fall Color Hike: Lake Strahl\, Brown County State Park
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/fall-color-hike-lake-strahl-brown-county-state-p
 ark/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Join a park n
 aturalist for a guided hike of Trail 6 around Lake Strahl! Hear about the 
 history of the lake\, the surrounding Strahl Valley\, and learn about the 
 animals that make it their home\, all while enjoying beautiful fall colors
 . The section of Trail 6 around Lake Strahl is considered easy to moderate
 . It has some short staircases\, uneven surfaces\, tree roots\, and possib
 le  wet spots. The trail is less than a mile and will take about 45 minute
 s to complete.</p>\n<p>Meet at the Lake Strahl parking lot.</p>\n</BODY></
 HTML>
END:VEVENT
