CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Soul on Fire is based on the true story of John O’Leary\, who a
 t age nine suffered burns on 100% of his body. The movie chronicles his mi
 raculous survival and his journey of healing\, relying on family\, faith\,
  and community. It highlights his decision to live with purpose after the 
 accident.
