 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Soul on Fire 
 is based on the true story of John O’Leary\, who at age nine suffered burn
 s on 100% of his body. The movie chronicles his miraculous survival and hi
 s journey of healing\, relying on family\, faith\, and community. It highl
 ights his decision to live with purpose after the accident.</p>\n</BODY></
 HTML>
