CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Join Charlie Brown\, Snoopy\, and the whole Peanuts gang in the
  heartwarming and hilarious musical You’re a Good Man\, Charlie Brown! Thi
 s timeless classic brings the beloved comic strip to life with laugh-out-l
 oud moments\, memorable songs\, and a big dose of charm. From flying kites
  to school crushes\, it’s a day in the life of the world’s most endearing 
 underdog and his friends. Celebrate the 75th anniversary of Peanuts with t
 his perennial favorite packed with humor\, heart\, and plenty of “good gri
 ef!” Fun for all ages!
