 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Join Charlie 
 Brown\, Snoopy\, and the whole Peanuts gang in the heartwarming and hilari
 ous musical <i>You’re a Good Man\, Charlie Brown</i>! This timeless classi
 c brings the beloved comic strip to life with laugh-out-loud moments\, mem
 orable songs\, and a big dose of charm. From flying kites to school crushe
 s\, it’s a day in the life of the world’s most endearing underdog and his 
