 ring free seeds. Any seeds left over from the Swap will be donated to the 
 participating seed libraries so that they’re still available for the commu
 nity.\nWhen donating seeds\, please make sure your seeds are not from inva
 sive plants and note the following:\n    The type and variety of seed\n   
  The year the seeds are from\n    Whether the seeds are store-bought or se
 lf-saved\n    We ask that you please package your seeds accordingly\; we w
 ill have tools and supplies on-hand.
