 t\, and relatable humor\, Carolanne brings the everyday chaos of life to t
 he stage\, turning the ordinary into the extraordinary. From laugh-out-lou
 d stories of family antics to sidesplitting observations on modern life\, 
 Carolanne’s show promises an evening filled with joy\, laughter\, and a wh
 ole lot of heart. Don’t miss this chance to see the internet sensation and
