DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Creamy\, smooth\, with a consistent mouth-feel and a balanced e
 arthiness of vegetables and fat. We’ll tackle this soup from scratch\, wor
 king our way from raw veggies to the final steaming product\, garnished wi
 th massive broiled\, cheesy croutons. Or\, as the pros call them\, crostin
 is. This soup is indulgent without feeling heavy. Perfect for meal-prep.\n
 Active-participant style class with Ava. You’ll work in groups to complete
  the recipe start-to-finish in class.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251109T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20251109T143000
LOCATION:In the Kitchen\, 115 N College Ave\, Suite 014\, Bloomington. Use 
 the Uptown Plaza alley entrance between JL Waters and Peach Cobbler Factor
 y.
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Cooking Class: Weeknight’s Inspired: Roasted Tomato & Pepper Soup… 
 and Cheddar Crostinis
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/cooking-class-weeknights-inspired-roasted-tomato
 -pepper-soup-and-cheddar-crostinis/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Creamy\, smoo
 th\, with a consistent mouth-feel and a balanced earthiness of vegetables 
 and fat. We’ll tackle this soup from scratch\, working our way from raw ve
 ggies to the final steaming product\, garnished with massive broiled\, che
 esy croutons. Or\, as the pros call them\, crostinis. This soup is indulge
 nt without feeling heavy. Perfect for meal-prep.</p>\n<p>Active-participan
 t style class with Ava. You’ll work in groups to complete the recipe start
 -to-finish in class.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-142300@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Mobile Clinics offer a range of services\, including legally ma
 ndated rabies vaccines for pets aged 12 weeks (about 3 months) and older. 
 Additionally\, clinics provide nail trims\, anal gland expressions\, micro
 chips\, and preventive measures for flea\, tick\, and heartworm.\nSubsidiz
 ed rates are available to residents experiencing financial hardship. To qu
 alify for these rates\, residents should bring valid documentation with th
 em to the Mobile Vaccine Clinic. Safety is paramount. Cats must be in carr
 iers\, and dogs must be leashed (no retractable leashes). It’s essential f
 or pet owners to understand that pets showing signs of illness or aggressi
 on might be turned away.\n\nLearn more about Mobile Vaccine Clinics\, incl
 uding future dates and locations\, at monroehumane.org.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251109T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20251109T150000
LOCATION:Monroe County Humane Association's Animal Care Campus\, 791 S Fiel
 dstone Blvd\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Low-Cost\, Appointment-Free Vaccine Clinic for Dogs and Cats
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/low-cost-appointment-free-vaccine-clinic-for-dog
 s-and-cats-2/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Mobile Clinic
 s offer a range of services\, including legally mandated rabies vaccines f
 or pets aged 12 weeks (about 3 months) and older. Additionally\, clinics p
 rovide nail trims\, anal gland expressions\, microchips\, and preventive m
 easures for flea\, tick\, and heartworm.</p>\n<div>Subsidized rates are av
 ailable to residents experiencing financial hardship. To qualify for these
  rates\, residents should bring valid documentation with them to the Mobil
 e Vaccine Clinic. Safety is paramount. Cats must be in carriers\, and dogs
  must be leashed (no retractable leashes). It’s essential for pet owners t
 o understand that pets showing signs of illness or aggression might be tur
 ned away.</div>\n<div></div>\n<div>Learn more about Mobile Vaccine Clinics
 \, including future dates and locations\, at <b><i><a href='http://monroeh
 umane.org' target='_blank' rel='noopener' data-saferedirecturl='https://ww
 w.google.com/url?q=http://monroehumane.org&source=gmail&ust=17623681843950
 00&usg=AOvVaw0SFv34zT6ZIgu6xpxZ-tFM'>monroehumane.org</a></i></b>.</div>\n
 <div></div>\n</BODY></HTML>
