 -seekers-engish-language-show/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>This live sto
 rytelling event features a series of true stories about the experiences of
  immigrants\, refugees\, and asylum seekers. From choosing to pursue your 
 dreams in a new country\, to fleeing violence in a home you never thought 
 you’d leave\, the stories in this production showcase the diverse experien
 ces of Bloomington’s immigrant community. Join us for this celebration of 
 tenacity\, resilience\, and joy.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
