BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-141787@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Shane Mauss caught his first big breaks early in his career wit
 h appearances on Conan\, Comedy Central\, HBO\, and Showtime. He’s done co
 medy specials about animal mating behavior\, the evolution of moods\, and 
 early next year releases the most spectacular work of his career – an epic
  two-part comedy special about psychedelics.\n“Trips” part 1\n“Trips” part
  2\nDriven by a fascination with the psychology\, behavior\, decision maki
 ng\, and science’s unique lens on the human condition\, Shane began interv
 iewing scientists at universities in the towns where he performed—just as 
 a hobby. That curiosity snowballed into Here We Are\, a podcast with over 
 400 scientist interviews\, and a series of themed comedy shows that take a
 mbitious ideas and make them hilarious\, relatable\, and accessible for th
 e lifelong learner.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251111T190000
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, 123 South Walnut\, Bloomington\, the corner of 
 Walnut and 4th Street
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:A New Trip with Shane Mauss
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/a-new-trip-with-shane-mauss/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div class='col-
 md-5 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 full-panel buffer-bottom'>\n<div class='visible-l
 g-block visible-md-block event-panel-group'>\n<div id='descr' class='panel
  active' role='tabpanel'>\n<div class='truncate expand-target collapsed'>
 \n<div class='custom-content'>\n<p>Shane Mauss caught his first big breaks
  early in his career with appearances on <i>Conan</i>\, <i>Comedy Central<
 /i>\, <i>HBO</i>\, and <i>Showtime</i>. He’s done comedy specials about an
 imal mating behavior\, the evolution of moods\, and early next year releas
 es the most spectacular work of his career – an epic two-part comedy speci
 al about psychedelics.</p>\n<p>“Trips” part 1</p>\n<p>“Trips” part 2</p>\n
 <p>Driven by a fascination with the psychology\, behavior\, decision makin
 g\, and science’s unique lens on the human condition\, Shane began intervi
 ewing scientists at universities in the towns where he performed—just as a
  hobby. That curiosity snowballed into <i>Here We Are</i>\, a podcast with
  over 400 scientist interviews\, and a series of themed comedy shows that 
 take ambitious ideas and make them hilarious\, relatable\, and accessible 
 for the lifelong learner.</p>\n<div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>
 \n</div>\n<div class='col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-xs-12'>\n<div class='se-show-
 form'></div>\n</div>\n<section>\n<section id='event' class='event-detail c
 ontent-container container'>\n<div class='page-content'>\n<section class='
 pod buffer row'>\n<div></div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n</section>
 \n<footer id='footer' class='footer padding-lg container-fluid'>\n<div cla
 ss='footer-address venue-contact'>\n<div class='telephone'>\n<h2></h2>\n</
 div>\n<div class='address'></div>\n</div>\n<div class='footer-email col-md
 -5 col-sm-5'>\n<div class='form-group'></div>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</BODY><
 /HTML>
