CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:We all crave connection — a place where we can be seen\, heard\
 , and held.\nOur Find Your Circle event is a gentle invitation to come tog
 ether with others seeking the same: new friendships\, shared stories\, and
  the comfort of community.\nGather around\, sip a calming adaptogenic mock
 tail\, and let the evening unfold naturally — no pressure\, just presence.
 \nBecause sometimes\, the most magical moments happen when we simply show 
 up and find the people who get us.\n✨ Join us at Oak — where your circle i
 s waiting.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251114T180000
LOCATION:oak.Bloomington\, 116 W 6th St. Suite 101\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Find Your Circle – A Speed-Friending night at Oak
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/find-your-circle-a-speed-friending-night-at-oak/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>We all crave 
 connection — a place where we can be seen\, heard\, and held.<br />\nOur F
 ind Your Circle event is a gentle invitation to come together with others 
 seeking the same: new friendships\, shared stories\, and the comfort of co
 mmunity.<br />\nGather around\, sip a calming adaptogenic mocktail\, and l
 et the evening unfold naturally — no pressure\, just presence.<br />\nBeca
 use sometimes\, the most magical moments happen when we simply show up and
  find the people who get us.<br />\n✨ Join us at Oak — where your circle i
 s waiting.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
