 can experience from the African American Arts Institute’s three unique ens
 embles.\n\nWitness the legendary African American Dance Company as it shar
 es an eclectic array of performance works from the African diaspora.\nCele
 brate the legacy of Black choral music with the award-winning African Amer
 ican Choral Ensemble.\nAnd groove with the one and only IU Soul Revue as i
 t renders timeless R&B\, soul\, funk\, and contemporary Black popular styl
 es.\n\nGather your family and friends together for this exciting evening o
 f celebration. This is a ticketed event.
