CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a simple introduction to classic sourdough loaves? 
 We got you. From rotating instructor Madeleine Gonin\, this class will giv
 e you a run down on all the sourdough tips and tricks you’ll need to becom
 e a master baker. Her sourdough recipe is  baked in a steamy oven\, yieldi
 ng a delightfully tender crust. It’s perfect for mix-ins like chocolate or
  cheddar\, and better yet\, it’s probably one of the easiest sourdough rec
 ipes you’ll ever find. Madeleine will discuss sourdough do’s and don’ts wi
 th an emphasis on creating and nurturing starter. Consider this your sourd
 ough bootcamp. We hope to see you there!\nWe encourage you to sign up for 
 classes online. When you register online\, you’ll also pay online. While w
 e will accept walk-ins before class if capacity allows\, registering ahead
  of time secures your spot and creates a more seamless class experience.\n
 https://www.inthekitchen-bloomington.com/
