 ted by local businesses\, organizations\, groups and families. The festiva
 l is free to attend and open to the public.\nWednesday\, Nov. 19\, 4:00–8:
 00 pm.\nFood truck on site 4:00–8:00 pm.\nDaydream at 4:30 pm.\nOnline auc
 tion bidding ends at 5:00 pm.\nQuarryland Men’s Choir at 5:30 pm.\nLive au
 ction starts at 6:00 pm.
