BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-143015@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:You love it or you hate it— and we argue that mindset is so lim
 iting. Life is more exciting when you try new things\, and food is a lovel
 y avenue for  this practice. Forget grandma’s tuna salad\, we’re trying Sp
 anish\, Scandinavian and Washington based seafare\, from muscles and oyste
 rs to trout\, sardines and mackerel. What they’ve got in common is that th
 ey come in cutesy little tins\, packed in the highest quality olive oils w
 ith herbs\, peppers\, and spices. On toast or crackers\, in salad\, or tos
 sed into pasta\, tinned fish is versatile\, trending and sustainable. We e
 ncourage you to come try some with us during this open-house tasting event
 .\nTasting event hosted by Ava with recipe handouts and interspersed lectu
 res. Come dine with us anytime from 6:00-8:30.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251121T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20251121T203000
LOCATION:In the Kitchen\, 115 N College Ave\, Suite 014\, Bloomington. Use 
 the Uptown Plaza alley entrance between JL Waters and Peach Cobbler Factor
 y.
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Tinned Fish Night!
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/tinned-fish-night/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>You love it o
 r you hate it— and we argue that mindset is so limiting. Life is more exci
 ting when you try new things\, and food is a lovely avenue for  this pract
 ice. <strong>Forget grandma’s tuna salad\, we’re trying Spanish\, Scandina
 vian and Washington based seafare\, from muscles and oysters to trout\, sa
 rdines and mackerel. What they’ve got in common is that they come in cutes
 y little tins\, packed in the highest quality olive oils with herbs\, pepp
 ers\, and spices.</strong> On toast or crackers\, in salad\, or tossed int
 o pasta\, tinned fish is versatile\, trending and sustainable. We encourag
 e you to come try some with us during this open-house tasting event.</p>\n
 <p>Tasting event hosted by Ava with recipe handouts and interspersed lectu
 res. Come dine with us anytime from 6:00-8:30.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
