BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-142995@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:This sly\, slow-burning crime thriller follows a flight attenda
 nt who masterminds a dangerous double-cross to outwit both criminals and l
 aw enforcement. Quentin Tarantino’s third feature film\, following Reservo
 ir Dogs and Pulp Fiction\, adapted from Elmore Leonard’s novel Rum Punch\,
  features a standout cast including Pam Grier\, Samuel L. Jackson\, Robert
  Forster\, Robert De Niro\, Bridget Fonda\, and Michael Keaton. Forster re
 ceived a Supporting Actor Oscar nomination alongside Golden Globe nods for
  Grier and Jackson\, and a BAFTA nomination for Quentin Tarantino’s screen
 play. [154 min\; drama\, crime\; English]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251121T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:IU Cinema Staff Selects: JACKIE BROWN
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/iu-cinema-staff-selects-jackie-brown/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>This sly\, sl
 ow-burning crime thriller follows a flight attendant who masterminds a dan
 gerous double-cross to outwit both criminals and law enforcement. Quentin 
 Tarantino’s third feature film\, following Reservoir Dogs and Pulp Fiction
 \, adapted from Elmore Leonard’s novel Rum Punch\, features a standout cas
 t including Pam Grier\, Samuel L. Jackson\, Robert Forster\, Robert De Nir
 o\, Bridget Fonda\, and Michael Keaton. Forster received a Supporting Acto
 r Oscar nomination alongside Golden Globe nods for Grier and Jackson\, and
  a BAFTA nomination for Quentin Tarantino’s screenplay. [154 min\; drama\,
  crime\; English] </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
