CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:‘Music In Transit’ serves to promote local music and Public Tra
 nsit with sets of music from the locale of the bus those performers are pl
 aying on.  A Bloomington Transit Electric bus is the stage for the mixed-g
 enre acts and onlookers are welcome to watch and listen.  Each show will h
 ave its premiere on the ‘Music In Transit’ YouTube channel in two to four 
 weeks\, according to Jake Huber\, who heads the project.
