 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>‘Musi
 c In Transit’ serves to promote local music and Public Transit with sets o
 f music from the locale of the bus those performers are playing on.  A Blo
 omington Transit Electric bus is the stage for the mixed-genre acts and on
 lookers are welcome to watch and listen.  Each show will have its premiere
  on the ‘Music In Transit’ YouTube channel in two to four weeks\, accordin
 g to Jake Huber\, who heads the project.</strong></p>\n</BODY></HTML>
