UID:ai1ec-143213@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Your Wheeler Mission—Bloomington team is making plans for our T
 hanksgiving feast\, which will take place between 2 and 5 pm on Thanksgivi
 ng Day (11/27) here at our Westplex Avenue campus.\nWe would love to celeb
 rate with our guests\, alongside our community.\nWheeler Mission–Bloomingt
 on is looking for community volunteers to serve up Thanksgiving favorites 
 to our hungry guests for the following shifts:\n    2-3:30 pm\n    3:30-5 
 pm\nThank you in advance for setting aside part of your Thanksgiving holid
 ay to love Wheeler Mission–Bloomington’s guests well.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251127T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20251127T170000
LOCATION:Wheeler Mission\, 201 S. Westplex Ave.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Thanksgiving Day Meal Service
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/thanksgiving-day-meal-service/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p> Your Wheeler
  Mission—Bloomington team is making plans for our Thanksgiving feast\, whi
 ch will take place between 2 and 5 pm on Thanksgiving Day (11/27) here at 
 our Westplex Avenue campus.</p>\n<p>We would love to celebrate with our gu
 ests\, alongside our community.</p>\n<p>Wheeler Mission–Bloomington is loo
 king for community volunteers to serve up Thanksgiving favorites to our hu
 ngry guests for the following shifts:</p>\n<p>    2-3:30 pm<br />\n    3:3
 0-5 pm</p>\n<p>Thank you in advance for setting aside part of your Thanksg
 iving holiday to love Wheeler Mission–Bloomington’s guests well.</p>\n</BO
 DY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-143061@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Community Kitchen will serve a traditional Thanksgiving Dinner 
 to anyone in need\, no questions asked\, on Thanksgiving Day\, November 27
