BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-143195@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Be there when Santa flips the switch and turns downtown Bloomin
 gton into something magical. Various musical acts and activities will take
  place on the stage and around the square starting at 5:30pm. The Ceremony
  begins at approximately 6:45 pm with the lighting promptly at 7 pm.\nSche
 dule of Events\nMonroe County History Center Holiday Open House\nTime: 5:0
 0-9:00 PM\nBloomington Symphony Orchestra Presents: Celebrate the Season\n
 Location: Buskirk-Chumley Theater\nTime: 5:00 PM and 8:00 PM\nMonroe Count
 y Board of Commissioners\, in collaboration with the Hoosier Hills Food Ba
 nk\, is sponsoring a food drive at the Canopy of Lights. They will have a 
 drop-off point for non-perishable food and monetary donations at the event
  and will continue to have donation barrels inside the Courthouse Rotunda 
 through Giving Tuesday\, December 2.\nBloomington Brass Band Performance\n
 Location: Kirkwood Avenue Stage\nTime: 6:00 PM\nLighting Ceremony Events\n
 Location: Kirkwood Avenue Stage\nTime: 6:45-7:30 PM\nPhotos with Santa\nLo
 cation: Fountain Square\nTime: 7:30-9:00 PM
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251128T173000
LOCATION:Monroe County Courthouse Square\, 100 block of West Kirkwood Ave.\
 , Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Canopy of Lights (activities at 5:30pm\, ceremony at 6:45pm\, light
 ing at 7pm)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/canopy-of-lights-activities-at-530pm-ceremony-at
 -645pm-lighting-at-7pm/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Be there when
  Santa flips the switch and turns downtown Bloomington into something magi
 cal. Various musical acts and activities will take place on the stage and 
 around the square starting at 5:30pm. The Ceremony begins at approximately
  6:45 pm with the lighting promptly at 7 pm.</p>\n<p>Schedule of Events<br
  />\nMonroe County History Center Holiday Open House<br />\nTime: 5:00-9:0
 0 PM</p>\n<p>Bloomington Symphony Orchestra Presents: Celebrate the Season
 <br />\nLocation: Buskirk-Chumley Theater<br />\nTime: 5:00 PM and 8:00 PM
 </p>\n<p>Monroe County Board of Commissioners\, in collaboration with the 
 Hoosier Hills Food Bank\, is sponsoring a food drive at the Canopy of Ligh
 ts. They will have a drop-off point for non-perishable food and monetary d
 onations at the event and will continue to have donation barrels inside th
 e Courthouse Rotunda through Giving Tuesday\, December 2.</p>\n<p>Blooming
 ton Brass Band Performance<br />\nLocation: Kirkwood Avenue Stage<br />\nT
 ime: 6:00 PM</p>\n<p>Lighting Ceremony Events<br />\nLocation: Kirkwood Av
 enue Stage<br />\nTime: 6:45-7:30 PM</p>\n<p>Photos with Santa<br />\nLoca
 tion: Fountain Square<br />\nTime: 7:30-9:00 PM</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
