CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Greg Warren is a beloved stand-up comedian known for his sharp\
 , relatable humor that resonates with everyday families across the country
 . Warren recently released his latest comedy special\, The Champ\, produce
 d by Nate Bargatze\, now streaming on Nateland’s YouTube channel. The Cham
 ptakes audiences through a hilarious exploration of the dangers of poison 
 ivy\, the rise of high school fishing teams\, and his own (somewhat questi
 onable) claims to champion status.
