 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Greg Warren i
 s a beloved stand-up comedian known for his sharp\, relatable humor that r
 esonates with everyday families across the country. Warren recently releas
 ed his latest comedy special\, <em>The Champ</em>\, produced by Nate Barga
 tze\, now streaming on Nateland’s YouTube channel. <em>The Champ</em>takes
  audiences through a hilarious exploration of the dangers of poison ivy\, 
 the rise of high school fishing teams\, and his own (somewhat questionable
 ) claims to champion status.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
