 ared food vendors. Celebrate the season with holiday tunes from the Bloomi
 ngton Chamber Singers\, O2R Blues Band\, Constellation Stage & Screen\, an
 d Tango with Winnie. While you shop\, little ones can enjoy visits with St
 . Nick and Mrs. Claus\, holiday crafts\, and free hot cocoa. 
