CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Described by Jay Leno as the best joke writer in America and by
  Gary Delaney as the best joke writer in the world\, Emo Philips has perfo
 rmed over seven thousand stand-up shows in comedy clubs\, colleges\, and t
 heaters\, including a multi-week run at the Playhouse Theatre in London’s 
 West End. In 2018 and 2022-2023\, Emo toured with “Weird Al” Yankovic (ove
 r two hundred concerts across three continents)\; Emo will forever remembe
 r the standing ovation he received at Carnegie Hall.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251205T190000
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, 123 South Walnut\, corner of 4th and Walnut\,Bl
 oomington
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20251206T190000
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:An Evening With Emo Philips\, Shows at 7:00 & 9:15
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/an-evening-with-the-incomparable-emo-philips-sho
 ws-at-700-915/
