 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Described by 
 Jay Leno as the best joke writer in America and by Gary Delaney as the bes
 t joke writer in the world\, Emo Philips has performed over seven thousand
  stand-up shows in comedy clubs\, colleges\, and theaters\, including a mu
 lti-week run at the Playhouse Theatre in London’s West End. In 2018 and 20
 22-2023\, Emo toured with “Weird Al” Yankovic (over two hundred concerts a
 cross three continents)\; Emo will forever remember the standing ovation h
 e received at Carnegie Hall.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
