 e about any instrument…well maybe not your pipe organ. Dream of being in a
  band? Well…do it! Here!!\nBring your band man or woman\nOr throw one toge
 ther there!\nSign up sheet will be on the Bar Area!\nPlan for a 15 minute 
 slot and if we get through the current list you can sign up and get up aga
 in!\nYes\, you may request the very own house saxophone player Mike the OW
 NER of this amazing place.
