CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Bloomington Restorations\, Inc. (BRI) invites you to the next M
 useum Open Day at the Hinkle-\nGarton Farmstead. “Holiday Home” is the the
 me for this seasonal Open Day. Decorations\, music\, and fun will be share
 d to interpret the themes\nsurrounding A Farmstead Christmas. Mark Wiedenm
 ayer of The Bloomington Old-Time Music & Dance Group and Friday\nMusicale 
 will share Christmas and holiday sing-along music in the parlor.  The Farm
 house will\nbe handsomely decorated in a traditional style and will be ope
 n for tours.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251206T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20251206T160000
LOCATION:Hinkle-Garton Farmstead\, 2920 E. 10th Street\, Bloomington\,
SEQUENCE:0
