X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Bloomington R
 estorations\, Inc. (BRI) invites you to the next Museum Open Day at the Hi
 nkle-<br />\nGarton Farmstead. “Holiday Home” is the theme for this season
 al Open Day. Decorations\, music\, and fun will be shared to interpret the
  themes<br />\nsurrounding A Farmstead Christmas. Mark Wiedenmayer of The 
 Bloomington Old-Time Music & Dance Group and Friday<br />\nMusicale will s
 hare Christmas and holiday sing-along music in the parlor.  The Farmhouse 
 will<br />\nbe handsomely decorated in a traditional style and will be ope
 n for tours.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
