DESCRIPTION:The Muppets’ rendition of Charles Dickens’ classic tale puts a 
 unique twist on that fateful Christmas Eve\, when Scrooge (Michael Caine) 
 is visited by the Ghosts of Christmas Past\, Present\, and Future. Togethe
 r with kind\, humble Bob Cratchit (Kermit the Frog) and his family\, the S
 pirits open Scrooge’s eyes—and his heart—to the true meaning of the holida
 y season. [85 min\; holiday\, drama\, musical\; English]
