 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>The Muppets’ 
 rendition of Charles Dickens’ classic tale puts a unique twist on that fat
 eful Christmas Eve\, when Scrooge (Michael Caine) is visited by the Ghosts
  of Christmas Past\, Present\, and Future. Together with kind\, humble Bob
  Cratchit (Kermit the Frog) and his family\, the Spirits open Scrooge’s ey
 es—and his heart—to the true meaning of the holiday season. [85 min\; holi
 day\, drama\, musical\; English] </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
