BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-143171@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:We are teaming up with our neighbors\, Bloomington Farm Stop\, 
 to host our 2nd annual badknees Holiday Market Experiment + Annual Traditi
 on of the Lighting of the Monolith! It is both an indoor and outdoor marke
 t! There will be artists selling their wares in both of our spaces. There 
 will hopefully be even more artists outside in the parking lot where the l
 ive music will be. There will be beers and hot cocoa and food and propane 
 heaters and giant Jenga and holiday lights and other stuff\, too. There wi
 ll be fun for the kids. There will be fun for adults. The weather will be 
 perfect. Giant\, fat snowflakes will begin falling around 7:30 when we lig
 ht up our historic Monolith and really get into the holiday spirit. It wil
 l be just the right amount of snow and we will all agree about that after 
 it stops.\nMUSIC – MOON NEWS – STEP TWINS – KP & THE WLG’S – BUG EAT BUG\n
 ARTS VENDORS!\nMoon Bear Goods and Sundries / Whipped Cream Bobby / Mantis
  Herb Co /\nRadical Seed / Silver Linings Rescue / MissBrennaBees / Soak S
 oapworks /\nElizabeth Studio / HIDEOUT PRESS / Alison Kingsley / Jordy min
 nick glass /\nRebel Purl / Made In Naptown / Quality Art and Design / CA V
 INTAGE /\nRebekah Spivey Wellinkedbooks / Purple Shamrock Farm / LLC – Pet
  Treats /\nLarissa Danielle Designs / The Ranch Cat Rescue / DoodleGirl De
 signs
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251206T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20251206T220000
LOCATION:BadkneesTs 902 West Kirkwood Ave\, Suite B\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:badknees Holiday Market Experiment + Annual Tradition of the Lighti
 ng of the Monolith
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/badknees-holiday-market-experiment-annual-tradit
 ion-of-the-lighting-of-the-monolith/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>We are teamin
 g up with our neighbors\, Bloomington Farm Stop\, to host our 2nd annual b
 adknees Holiday Market Experiment + Annual Tradition of the Lighting of th
 e Monolith! It is both an indoor and outdoor market! There will be artists
  selling their wares in both of our spaces. There will hopefully be even m
 ore artists outside in the parking lot where the live music will be. There
  will be beers and hot cocoa and food and propane heaters and giant Jenga 
 and holiday lights and other stuff\, too. There will be fun for the kids. 
 There will be fun for adults. The weather will be perfect. Giant\, fat sno
 wflakes will begin falling around 7:30 when we light up our historic Monol
 ith and really get into the holiday spirit. It will be just the right amou
 nt of snow and we will all agree about that after it stops.</p>\n<p>MUSIC 
 – MOON NEWS – STEP TWINS – KP & THE WLG’S – BUG EAT BUG</p>\n<p>ARTS VENDO
 RS!<br />\nMoon Bear Goods and Sundries / Whipped Cream Bobby / Mantis Her
 b Co /<br />\nRadical Seed / Silver Linings Rescue / MissBrennaBees / Soak
  Soapworks /<br />\nElizabeth Studio / HIDEOUT PRESS / Alison Kingsley / J
 ordy minnick glass /<br />\nRebel Purl / Made In Naptown / Quality Art and
  Design / CA VINTAGE /<br />\nRebekah Spivey Wellinkedbooks / Purple Shamr
 ock Farm / LLC – Pet Treats /<br />\nLarissa Danielle Designs / The Ranch 
 Cat Rescue / DoodleGirl Designs</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
