CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:ROK is a non-profit community arts and education organization b
 ased in Bloomington\, Indiana. Since 2007\, ROK has commissioned and sourc
 ed a unique repertoire of opera designed for young audiences. Our goals ar
 e to introduce young audiences to opera and to give musicians the opportun
 ity to hone and share their performance skills through community engagemen
 t.\n\nOur ‘Un-Gala’ will include food\, activities\, and a live performanc
 e of our current production. This event is perfect for families and young 
 children.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251206T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20251206T193000
LOCATION:Banneker Community Center\, 930 West 7th Street\, Bloomington
