X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div>ROK is a no
 n-profit community arts and education organization based in Bloomington\, 
 Indiana. Since 2007\, ROK has commissioned and sourced a unique repertoire
  of opera designed for young audiences. Our goals are to introduce young a
 udiences to opera and to give musicians the opportunity to hone and share 
 their performance skills through community engagement.</div>\n<div></div>
 \n<div>Our ‘Un-Gala’ will include food\, activities\, and a live performan
 ce of our current production. This event is perfect for families and young
  children.</div>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
