DESCRIPTION:Andy Griggs often says his influences in music are like a pot o
 f gumbo. Growing up in Monroe\, LA\, he was raised on Jerry Lee Lewis\, Ji
 mmy Swaggert\, Waylon\, Bill Monroe\, hardcore blues\, and hardcore rock’n
  roll\, sprinkled with a touch of jazz. He often says\, “there is no defin
 ing a style of song. As long as there’s soul\, it has a place in music.”
