 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Andy Griggs o
 ften says his influences in music are like a pot of gumbo. Growing up in M
 onroe\, LA\, he was raised on Jerry Lee Lewis\, Jimmy Swaggert\, Waylon\, 
 Bill Monroe\, hardcore blues\, and hardcore rock’n roll\, sprinkled with a
  touch of jazz. He often says\, “there is no defining a style of song. As 
