 ey of favorites called “Snows of Yesteryear.” Stay for a blend of Broadway
 \, pop\, rock\, and oldies reimagined to illuminate the joys of the holida
 ys: “Morning Glow” from PIPPIN\, Jamie Cullum’s “Hang Your Lights\,” “Shin
 e” by 90s rockers Collective Soul\, and the beautiful Beatles ballad “Gold
 en Slumbers” to name just a few.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
