DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:DIY Folded Book Vase\nWith Lois Sauder\nJoin us Sunday\, Decemb
 er 7th at 1pm for a cozy afternoon of creativity and connection. Together\
 , we’ll transform books provided by our friends at local bookstore Caveat 
 Emptor into charming folded book vases—perfect for adding a touch of handm
 ade beauty to your space or gifting to someone special.\nGather is delight
 ed to host this workshop\, providing the space and all the general supplie
 s you’ll need. Lois Sauder will guide you through each step\, making it ea
 sy and fun for all skill levels.\nAll materials are included\, and refresh
 ments can be ordered to keep the good vibes flowing as you craft and conne
 ct with fellow makers.\nCome for the creativity\, stay for the community—w
 e can’t wait to fold\, sip\, and connect with you!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251207T130000
LOCATION:Gather : handmade shoppe & Co\, 116 N Walnut\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:DIY Folded Book Vase with Caveat Emptor
