 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>DIY Folded Bo
 ok Vase<br />\nWith Lois Sauder<br />\nJoin us Sunday\, December 7th at 1p
 m for a cozy afternoon of creativity and connection. Together\, we’ll tran
 sform books provided by our friends at local bookstore Caveat Emptor into 
 charming folded book vases—perfect for adding a touch of handmade beauty t
 o your space or gifting to someone special.<br />\nGather is delighted to 
 host this workshop\, providing the space and all the general supplies you’
 ll need. Lois Sauder will guide you through each step\, making it easy and
  fun for all skill levels.<br />\nAll materials are included\, and refresh
 ments can be ordered to keep the good vibes flowing as you craft and conne
 ct with fellow makers.<br />\nCome for the creativity\, stay for the commu
 nity—we can’t wait to fold\, sip\, and connect with you!</p>\n</BODY></HTM
 L>
