CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Doors at 6pm\nJoin us for an enchanting evening of holiday jazz
  and cheer at Oak\, nestled in a magical little plant shop on the downtown
  square. Pianist Monika Herzig and bassist Peter Kleinle will perform cura
 ted arrangements from Monika’s Peace on Earth CD—a musical celebration ins
 pired by the spirit of peace we so dearly need.\nIn honor of St. Nikolaus 
 Day (December 6)\, Monika will share stories about traditional German Niko
 laus celebrations\, accompanied by delicious German cookies to enjoy. The 
 evening will culminate in a joyful sing-along to spread the holiday warmth
 .
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251207T190000
LOCATION:oak.Bloomington\, 116 W 6th St. Suite 101\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Peace on Earth: A Holiday Jazz Evening with Monika Herzig & Peter K
 leinle
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/peace-on-earth-a-holiday-jazz-evening-with-monik
 a-herzig-peter-kleinle/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Doors
  at 6pm</strong><br />\nJoin us for an enchanting evening of holiday jazz 
 and cheer at Oak\, nestled in a magical little plant shop on the downtown 
 square. Pianist Monika Herzig and bassist Peter Kleinle will perform curat
 ed arrangements from Monika’s Peace on Earth CD—a musical celebration insp
 ired by the spirit of peace we so dearly need.<br />\nIn honor of St. Niko
 laus Day (December 6)\, Monika will share stories about traditional German
  Nikolaus celebrations\, accompanied by delicious German cookies to enjoy.
  The evening will culminate in a joyful sing-along to spread the holiday w
 armth.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
