DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Assistant District Attorney John Sargent (Fred MacMurray) \, kn
 owing that women are harder to convict during the holidays\, moves to have
  his case against shoplifter\, Lee Leander (Barbara Stanwyck)\, postponed 
 to January\, potentially leaving Lee alone in jail on Christmas. Feeling g
 uilty\, John posts her bail\, and the two go on a whirlwind roadtrip from 
 New York to Indiana to celebrate the holiday with their families\, only to
  fall for one another along the way. Will their budding romance get in the
  way of John’s conviction?
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251210T190000
LOCATION:Monroe County History Center\, 202 E. 6th Street\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Cicada Cinema: Remember the Night
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/cicada-cinema-remember-the-night/
