 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Assistant Dis
 trict Attorney John Sargent (Fred MacMurray) \, knowing that women are har
 der to convict during the holidays\, moves to have his case against shopli
 fter\, Lee Leander (Barbara Stanwyck)\, postponed to January\, potentially
  leaving Lee alone in jail on Christmas. Feeling guilty\, John posts her b
 ail\, and the two go on a whirlwind roadtrip from New York to Indiana to c
 elebrate the holiday with their families\, only to fall for one another al
 ong the way. Will their budding romance get in the way of John’s convictio
 n?</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
