 Le9b3eaAJnW'>debut CD</a> in July 2022\, the band released its sophomore a
 lbum <a href='https://ciarecords2.bandcamp.com/album/el-mantis-ii' target=
 '_blank' rel='noopener' data-saferedirecturl='https://www.google.com/url?q
 =https://ciarecords2.bandcamp.com/album/el-mantis-ii&source=gmail&ust=1763
 743037090000&usg=AOvVaw1BdZn5_5ZM4S0pmGpWSw9K'>El Mantis II</a>\, an LP on
  Houston-based CIA records\, in February 2024. Since then\, they have perf
 ormed extensively in Texas and Puerto Rico to promote their music (4 album
 s total).</div>\n<div>\n<p id='m_8240247446642558710m_7143263704663017274m
 _-4793803070846087955m_-731117524451977990m_4462447473671408668m_-24481200
 54720362960m_-4005476094198419028gmail-bio-text'>Festivals/venues the band
  has performed at include 1810 Ojeman in Houston\, NMASS Festival\, Sahara
  Lounge in Austin\, Rubber Gloves in Denton\, Handlebar in San Juan\, PR\,
  and C-Note Jazz Club in Luquillo Beach\, PR.</p>\n</div>\n<div><a href='h
 ttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9ZiV2nSPlw4' target='_blank' rel='noopener'
  data-saferedirecturl='https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.youtube.co
