DESCRIPTION:Night Market is a monthly event occurring on the 2nd thursday. 
 Local vendors\, free pinball\, local DJs\, and happy hour 5-7pm make for a
  fun evening at the Orbit Room. All ages always with an outdoor patio duri
 ng appropriate weather. Find that special gift that you have been looking 
 for\, get your nails painted\, or come to discover the talented people tha
 t are right here in your city.
