BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-143645@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Hayao Miyazaki’s underscreened but vital films hinges on one si
 ngle truism: better a pig than a fascist.\nFrom renowned Japanese master H
 ayao Miyazaki\, Porco Rosso follows World War I flying ace Marco Pagott as
  he mysteriously turns from a man into a pig after all his comrades die in
  battle. Now known as Porco Rosso\, the pilot continues fighting air pirat
 es while\, on the ground\, flirting with a gorgeous club singer. After an 
 attack by a brash American pilot\, Porco meets confident Fio\, who repairs
  his plane with her girl mechanics and sees him for who he really is. [94 
 min\; anime\, adventure\; Japanese with English subtitles]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251211T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Control/Revolt Film Series: Porco Rosso
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/control-revolt-film-series-porco-rosso/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Hayao
  Miyazaki’s underscreened but vital films hinges on one single truism: bet
 ter a pig than a fascist.</strong></p>\n<p>From renowned Japanese master H
 ayao Miyazaki\, Porco Rosso follows World War I flying ace Marco Pagott as
  he mysteriously turns from a man into a pig after all his comrades die in
  battle. Now known as Porco Rosso\, the pilot continues fighting air pirat
 es while\, on the ground\, flirting with a gorgeous club singer. After an 
 attack by a brash American pilot\, Porco meets confident Fio\, who repairs
  his plane with her girl mechanics and sees him for who he really is. [94 
 min\; anime\, adventure\; Japanese with English subtitles] </p>\n</BODY></
 HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
