BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-143638@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Look up “holiday music” in the dictionary\, and it’s likely tha
 t there is a photo of the a cappella group Straight No Chaser instead of a
  standard definition. For more than two decades\, the group that got its s
 tart at IU has provided the soundtrack of the season\, bringing millions o
 f fans to their feet while putting them in the holiday spirit. Year after 
 year\, fans anxiously await the moment they can officially hit play on Str
 aight No Chaser favorites. And this year is no different.\nStraight No Cha
 ser is back returning to IU Auditorium as part of its Holiday Road tour\, 
 serving up an all-you-can-eat buffet of holiday music (with none of the ca
 lories). The nine-man act of Walter Chase\, Jerome Collins\, Seggie Isho\,
  Michael Luginbill\, Steve Morgan\, Jasper Smith\, Luke Bob Robinson\, Tyl
 er Trepp\, and Freedom Young\, has served as a festive blend of harmonious
  voices for more than 25 years. Even though the group has been together fo
 r a quarter of a century\, the thrill of performing holiday songs for old 
 and new fans alike is not lost on them\, especially when they return to Bl
 oomington\, where it all began.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251211T193000
LOCATION:IU Auditorium\, 1211 East 7th St.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Straight No Chaser
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/straight-no-chaser-6/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Look up “holi
 day music” in the dictionary\, and it’s likely that there is a photo of th
 e a cappella group Straight No Chaser instead of a standard definition. Fo
 r more than two decades\, the group that got its start at IU has provided 
 the soundtrack of the season\, bringing millions of fans to their feet whi
 le putting them in the holiday spirit. Year after year\, fans anxiously aw
 ait the moment they can officially hit play on Straight No Chaser favorite
 s. And this year is no different.<br />\nStraight No Chaser is back return
 ing to IU Auditorium as part of its Holiday Road tour\, serving up an all-
 you-can-eat buffet of holiday music (with none of the calories). The nine-
 man act of Walter Chase\, Jerome Collins\, Seggie Isho\, Michael Luginbill
 \, Steve Morgan\, Jasper Smith\, Luke Bob Robinson\, Tyler Trepp\, and Fre
 edom Young\, has served as a festive blend of harmonious voices for more t
 han 25 years. Even though the group has been together for a quarter of a c
 entury\, the thrill of performing holiday songs for old and new fans alike
  is not lost on them\, especially when they return to Bloomington\, where 
 it all began.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
