DESCRIPTION:You’re invited to step into the warmth and charm of 19th-centur
 y holiday traditions at the historic Wylie House Museum\, beautifully ador
 ned with fresh garlands and greenery.\n\n\n\n\nTraditions tours begin ever
 y hour on the hour\, with the final tour starting at 3 p.m.\n\n\n\n\n\nEac
 h guided tour offers a glimpse into holiday customs of the past\, featurin
 g festive history and personal stories from the Wylie family. Before or af
 ter your tour\, be sure to visit the Education Center next door for cookie
 s and craft activities\, available throughout the day.\n\n\n\n\n\nPlease R
 SVP for a tour time at the link below. We’ll hold a few spaces for walk-in
 s.\nhttps://events.iu.edu/all/tags/Garlands%20%26%20Greenery
