UID:ai1ec-143788@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Looking to make some new friends who actually get you?\nJoin us
  at Gather for an upbeat night of speed friending — the perfect mix of con
 versation\, cocktails\, and connection.\nWe’ll set the mood with great mus
 ic\, a drink in hand\, and short\, fun rounds of get-to-know-you chats. Th
 ink of it as speed dating’s cooler\, low-pressure cousin — designed for cr
 eative\, interesting women (ages 28–60) who want to expand their circle an
 d maybe find their new brunch bestie or craft night partner.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251212T183000
