 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Looki
 ng to make some new friends who actually get you?</strong></p>\n<p>Join us
  at Gather for an upbeat night of speed friending — the perfect mix of con
 versation\, cocktails\, and connection.</p>\n<p>We’ll set the mood with gr
 eat music\, a drink in hand\, and short\, fun rounds of get-to-know-you ch
 ats. Think of it as speed dating’s cooler\, low-pressure cousin — designed
  for creative\, interesting women (ages 28–60) who want to expand their ci
 rcle and maybe find their new brunch bestie or craft night partner.</p>\n<
