 urchase adults<br />\n    Purchase a decadent Hot Chocolate\, made with re
 al cocoa powder\, and the classic fixings.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re young or
  young at heart\, this is the perfect way to kick off your holiday celebra
 tions. Don’t forget your camera — Santa’s ready to smile!</p>\n</BODY></HT
 ML>
END:VEVENT
