BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-143721@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Back 2 Mac’s 40+ song list spans all the hits of the chart-topp
 ing Buckingham / Nicks / McVie era\, solo hits\, and early classics by Pet
 er Green and Bob Welsh. Lush vocal harmonies and an easy-going playfulness
  with the audience distinguishes Back 2 Mac performances from those of oth
 er tributes\, a result of the combined years of music-making among the ban
 d members who have performed and/or recorded with Bob Weir\, The Impressio
 ns\, Days Of The New\, Josh Ritter\, Anais Mitchell\, Ian Anderson (Jethro
  Tull) and Kevin Morby.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251213T190000
LOCATION:Mitchell Opera House\, 217 North 7th Street\, Mitchell. IN
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Back 2 Mac – Tribute to Fleetwood Mac
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/back-2-mac-tribute-to-fleetwood-mac/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Back 2 Mac’s 
 40+ song list spans all the hits of the chart-topping Buckingham / Nicks /
  McVie era\, solo hits\, and early classics by Peter Green and Bob Welsh. 
 Lush vocal harmonies and an easy-going playfulness with the audience disti
 nguishes Back 2 Mac performances from those of other tributes\, a result o
 f the combined years of music-making among the band members who have perfo
 rmed and/or recorded with Bob Weir\, The Impressions\, Days Of The New\, J
 osh Ritter\, Anais Mitchell\, Ian Anderson (Jethro Tull) and Kevin Morby.<
 /p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
