BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-143435@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Nicholas Graham Hall isn’t just a singer-songwriter\, he’s a st
 oryteller. With a guitar in hand and a well-crafted lyric\, he can weave a
  vivid tale or deliver a powerful message in just a few verses. Nicholas d
 raws inspiration from his own life\, tackling relatable themes like self-d
 oubt\, love and loss\, the political climate\, and our humanness. His musi
 c is a heartfelt exploration of the human experience.\nwww.nicholasgrahamh
 all.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251213T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20251213T220000
LOCATION:Sleeper's Bar\, 2601 North Walnut St.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Songs from the Soul: Nicholas Graham Hall
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/songs-from-the-soul-nicholas-graham-hall/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Nicholas Grah
 am Hall isn’t just a singer-songwriter\, he’s a storyteller. With a guitar
  in hand and a well-crafted lyric\, he can weave a vivid tale or deliver a
  powerful message in just a few verses. Nicholas draws inspiration from hi
 s own life\, tackling relatable themes like self-doubt\, love and loss\, t
 he political climate\, and our humanness. His music is a heartfelt explora
 tion of the human experience.<br />\nwww.nicholasgrahamhall.com</p>\n</BOD
 Y></HTML>
END:VEVENT
