BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-143921@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:A holiday tradition – reinvented.\nCelebrate the season with Th
 e Nutcracker\, a ballet that brings joy\, wonder\, and imagination to life
  for audiences of all ages. This dazzling production features all-new\, ha
 nd-painted sets and over 200 exquisite costumes. Tchaikovsky’s beloved sco
 re is performed alongside iconic choreography – including “Waltz of the Sn
 owflakes”\, “Dance of the Sugar Plum Fairy”\, and “Waltz of the Flowers”. 
 With a cast of world-renowned ballet artists from 12 countries\, this Nutc
 racker is more than a performance – it’s a celebration of global talent an
 d timeless holiday magic. With more than 10 years of experience presenting
  internationally acclaimed productions\, Classical Arts Entertainment is p
 roud to share this artistic journey with communities across North America.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251217T190000
LOCATION:Buskirk Chumley Theater\, 114 E Kirkwood Ave.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:The Nutcracker by International Ballet Stars
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/the-nutcracker-by-international-ballet-stars/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>A holiday tra
 dition – reinvented.</p>\n<p>Celebrate the season with The Nutcracker\, a 
 ballet that brings joy\, wonder\, and imagination to life for audiences of
  all ages. This dazzling production features all-new\, hand-painted sets a
 nd over 200 exquisite costumes. Tchaikovsky’s beloved score is performed a
 longside iconic choreography – including “Waltz of the Snowflakes”\, “Danc
 e of the Sugar Plum Fairy”\, and “Waltz of the Flowers”. With a cast of wo
 rld-renowned ballet artists from 12 countries\, this Nutcracker is more th
 an a performance – it’s a celebration of global talent and timeless holida
 y magic. With more than 10 years of experience presenting internationally 
 acclaimed productions\, Classical Arts Entertainment is proud to share thi
 s artistic journey with communities across North America. </p>\n</BODY></H
 TML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
