CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a cozy\, creative evening celebrating the light’s r
 eturn at our Yule Makers Night. Choose from a collection of meaningful win
 ter crafts inspired by warmth\, reflection\, and renewal:\n✨ Felting Fall 
 Banner – soft textures and earthy tones to honor the turning seasons\n🔔 Ma
 ke-a-Wish Bell (Clay) – shape and glaze your own bell for luck and intenti
 on\n🪴 Pottery – choose a piece of pottery to paint on your own\, make it y
 ours\n🌞 Mosaic Sunshine – piece together light and color as we welcome lon
 ger days\n🔮 Crystal Macramé – wrap and hang a crystal to catch winter’s gl
 ow in your rear view mirror\nGather around good company\, warm refreshment
 s\, and the joy of creating with your hands.\nLet’s slow down together\, c
 raft with intention\, and celebrate the beauty of this turning season.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251219T180000
LOCATION:Gather : handmade shoppe & Co\, 116 N Walnut\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Yule Makers Night
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/yule-makers-night/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Join us for a
  cozy\, creative evening celebrating the light’s return at our Yule Makers
  Night. Choose from a collection of meaningful winter crafts inspired by w
 armth\, reflection\, and renewal:<br />\n✨ Felting Fall Banner – soft text
 ures and earthy tones to honor the turning seasons<br />\n🔔 Make-a-Wish Be
 ll (Clay) – shape and glaze your own bell for luck and intention<br />\n🪴 
 Pottery – choose a piece of pottery to paint on your own\, make it yours<b
 r />\n🌞 Mosaic Sunshine – piece together light and color as we welcome lon
 ger days<br />\n🔮 Crystal Macramé – wrap and hang a crystal to catch winte
 r’s glow in your rear view mirror<br />\nGather around good company\, warm
  refreshments\, and the joy of creating with your hands.<br />\nLet’s slow
  down together\, craft with intention\, and celebrate the beauty of this t
 urning season.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
