DESCRIPTION:Gwen Sunkel is an Indianapolis comedian\, emcee\, and character
  actor. She performs regularly at Helium Comedy Club and The White Rabbit 
 Cabaret where she is a cast member with An Evening With The Authors*. You’
 ve seen her at Cincinnati Brew Ha-Ha\, Yuckfest\, and Limestone Comedy Fes
 tival\, and on the Vice TV Series ‘Hunters.’ Gwen is also contributing wri
 ter for AWF Magazine. She is a producer with Rocketship Comedy and co-host
 s a series of benefit shows that have raised over $15\,000 for reproductiv
 e health organizations in the Midwest.
