 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Gwen Sunkel i
 s an Indianapolis comedian\, emcee\, and character actor. She performs reg
 ularly at Helium Comedy Club and The White Rabbit Cabaret where she is a c
 ast member with An Evening With The Authors*. You’ve seen her at Cincinnat
 i Brew Ha-Ha\, Yuckfest\, and Limestone Comedy Festival\, and on the Vice 
 TV Series ‘Hunters.’ Gwen is also contributing writer for AWF Magazine. Sh
 e is a producer with Rocketship Comedy and co-hosts a series of benefit sh
 ows that have raised over $15\,000 for reproductive health organizations i
 n the Midwest.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
