CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Step into a tiny traveling potion shop filled with crystals\, h
 erbs\, and good intentions. Join us as we slow down\, connect with our int
 entions\, and create a little magic together.\nOn the 20th\, from 12 to 6 
 PM\, the Traveling Apothecary brings a DIY spell jar bar where you can cra
 ft your own intention jar\; personalized with crystals\, herbs\, and your 
 unique energy.\nChoose to create your jar on the spot or pick up a pre-mad
 e DIY kit to bring the magic home. Explore crystal-infused moon waters and
  other enchanting offerings.\nCome craft\, connect\, and make magic with u
 s.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251220T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20251220T180000
