 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Step into a t
 iny traveling potion shop filled with crystals\, herbs\, and good intentio
 ns. Join us as we slow down\, connect with our intentions\, and create a l
 ittle magic together.<br />\nOn the 20th\, from 12 to 6 PM\, the Traveling
  Apothecary brings a DIY spell jar bar where you can craft your own intent
 ion jar\; personalized with crystals\, herbs\, and your unique energy.<br 
 />\nChoose to create your jar on the spot or pick up a pre-made DIY kit to
  bring the magic home. Explore crystal-infused moon waters and other encha
 nting offerings.<br />\nCome craft\, connect\, and make magic with us.</p>
 \n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
