CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Kick off the season at our festive Holiday Market featuring 20 
 talented local artisans and makers. Discover one-of-a-kind treasures inclu
 ding handcrafted jewelry\, stunning pottery\, beautiful stained glass\, cu
 stom woodwork\, small-batch coffee\, vintage clothing and textiles\, origi
 nal illustrations\, and so much more.\nWarm up with hot chocolate\, unleas
 h your creativity at our cookie decorating station\, and find the perfect 
 gifts for everyone on your list (including yourself!). Whether you’re hunt
 ing for unique presents or just soaking up the holiday vibes\, this is THE
  place to shop small and support local this season.\nWhat to expect:\n🎁 20
  curated pop-up vendors\n🎨 Handmade gifts you won’t find anywhere else\n🍪 
 Cookie decorating fun (for purchase)\n☕ Hot chocolate to keep you cozy (fo
 r purchase)\n🍻 A variety of Upland Beer selections on draft (for purchase)
 \nBring your friends\, bring your holiday spirit\, and get ready to shop l
 ocal!
