BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-144099@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Winter Solstice Serenade with Audrey Clampitt 🌙\nSaturday\, Dec
 ember 21 • 7 PM\nAt Oak & Cafe Thistle\nOn the longest night of the year\,
  join us for a soul-brightening performance in the heart of our enchanted 
 greenhouse café. Surrounded by twinkling lights and leafy magic\, we welco
 me rising star Audrey Clampitt—a 16-year-old singer-songwriter whose voice
  holds the shimmer of something just beginning and already timeless.\nCurr
 ently gracing stages like Taste of Bloomington and Food Truck Fridays\, Au
 drey brings heartfelt originals and fresh acoustic energy to both keyboard
  and guitar. With an American Idol audition on the horizon\, this is your 
 chance to experience her luminous sound in an intimate\, magical space.\nR
 SVP is required—seating is cozy and limited.\nCome celebrate the solstice 
 in song and light\, as we gather under the plants and stars to honor new b
 eginnings and the quiet power of winter.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251221T190000
LOCATION:oak.Bloomington\, 116 W 6th St. Suite 101\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Moonlit Melodies -Audrey Clampitt at oak
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/moonlit-melodies-audrey-clampitt-at-oak/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Winter Solsti
 ce Serenade with Audrey Clampitt 🌙<br />\nSaturday\, December 21 • 7 PM<br
  />\nAt Oak & Cafe Thistle<br />\nOn the longest night of the year\, join 
 us for a soul-brightening performance in the heart of our enchanted greenh
 ouse café. Surrounded by twinkling lights and leafy magic\, we welcome ris
 ing star Audrey Clampitt—a 16-year-old singer-songwriter whose voice holds
  the shimmer of something just beginning and already timeless.<br />\nCurr
 ently gracing stages like Taste of Bloomington and Food Truck Fridays\, Au
 drey brings heartfelt originals and fresh acoustic energy to both keyboard
  and guitar. With an American Idol audition on the horizon\, this is your 
 chance to experience her luminous sound in an intimate\, magical space.<br
  />\nRSVP is required—seating is cozy and limited.<br />\nCome celebrate t
 he solstice in song and light\, as we gather under the plants and stars to
  honor new beginnings and the quiet power of winter.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
