UID:ai1ec-143708@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Dive into the world of radio this winter break at the Harmony S
 chool Youth Radio Camp. Over the three days of camp\, youth will learn how
  to share their perspective with the community through music\, news\, and 
 podcasts. This camp is a partnership between Harmony School and WFHB. The 
 WFHB Youth Radio program is broadcast on 91.3 FM every Saturday Night from
  4-8pm. Space is limited. To register\, harmonySchool.org/camp rhino\nIf y
 ou have questions\, reach out to camprhino@harmonyschool.org.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251229T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20251229T160000
LOCATION:Harmony School\, 909 E 2nd St\, Bloomington
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20251230T120000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20251231T120000
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Youth Radio Camp
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/youth-radio-camp/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Dive into the
  world of radio this winter break at the Harmony School Youth Radio Camp. 
 Over the three days of camp\, youth will learn how to share their perspect
 ive with the community through music\, news\, and podcasts. This camp is a
  partnership between Harmony School and WFHB. The WFHB Youth Radio program
  is broadcast on 91.3 FM every Saturday Night from 4-8pm. Space is limited
 . To register\, <a href='https://pci.jotform.com/form/253014513623143'>har
 monySchool.org/camp rhino</a></p>\n<p>If you have questions\, reach out to
  <a href='mailto:camprhino@harmonyschool.org' target='_blank' rel='noopene
 r'>camprhino@harmonyschool.org</a>.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
