BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-144262@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Conor Delehanty is a comedian. a former construction worker\, a
 nd an organ donor from Indianapolis. Over the past decade\, Delehanty has 
 fine tuned his craft performing wherever he could across these United Stat
 es earning accolades along the way. He has performed in festivals such as 
 the Limestone Comedy Festival\, Laugh Your Asheville Off\, and San Francis
 co Sketchfest. Delehanty has been featured on Comedy Central Radio and was
  a cast member on the Facebook Watch show After After Party. He probably e
 ats too much bread and is always happy to be there\, wherever that may be.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251231T200000
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, upstairs at 123 South Walnut\, Bloomington\, th
 e corner of Walnut and 4th Street
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Ring In the New Year with Conor Delehanty  (shows at 8pm & 10:30pm)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/ring-in-the-new-year-with-conor-delehanty-shows-
 at-8pm-1030pm/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Conor Delehan
 ty is a comedian. a former construction worker\, and an organ donor from I
 ndianapolis. Over the past decade\, Delehanty has fine tuned his craft per
 forming wherever he could across these United States earning accolades alo
 ng the way. He has performed in festivals such as the Limestone Comedy Fes
 tival\, Laugh Your Asheville Off\, and San Francisco Sketchfest. Delehanty
  has been featured on Comedy Central Radio and was a cast member on the Fa
 cebook Watch show After After Party. He probably eats too much bread and i
 s always happy to be there\, wherever that may be.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
