BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-144005@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:This is your chance to engage with the Mayor in an informal set
 ting\, ask questions\, receive updates on local initiatives\, and share an
 y feedback you may have.\n\nAppointments will be scheduled in 15-minute in
 tervals to ensure everyone has an opportunity to connect.\n\nPre-registrat
 ion is required at https://bton.in/rMEV9.\n\nWhy attend? To best serve our
  community\, we need to stay connected to it. This means prioritizing list
 ening to the people of Bloomington and understanding their needs. These Tr
 aveling Office Hours provide a relaxed and personal environment for reside
 nts to interact with Mayor Thomson.\nPlease note: If you’ve already connec
 ted with Mayor Thomson during Traveling Office Hours\, please refrain from
  registering at this time to provide others with the opportunity.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260106T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260106T130000
LOCATION:Hopscotch Coffee & Kitchen\, 235 W Dodds St.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Mayor Kerry Thomson’s Traveling Office Hours
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/mayor-kerry-thomsons-traveling-office-hours/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div>This is you
 r chance to engage with the Mayor in an informal setting\, ask questions\,
  receive updates on local initiatives\, and share any feedback you may hav
 e.</div>\n<div>\nAppointments will be scheduled in 15-minute intervals to 
 ensure everyone has an opportunity to connect.</div>\n<div>\nPre-registrat
 ion is required at <a href='https://bton.in/rMEV9' target='_blank' rel='no
 opener' data-saferedirecturl='https://www.google.com/url?q=https://bton.in
 /rMEV9&source=gmail&ust=1766004047387000&usg=AOvVaw1uRkUQgOamBgubQuuPfTjn'
 >https://bton.in/rMEV9</a>.</div>\n<div></div>\n<div>Why attend? To best s
 erve our community\, we need to stay connected to it. This means prioritiz
 ing listening to the people of Bloomington and understanding their needs. 
 These Traveling Office Hours provide a relaxed and personal environment fo
 r residents to interact with Mayor Thomson.<br />\nPlease note: If you’ve 
 already connected with Mayor Thomson during Traveling Office Hours\, pleas
 e refrain from registering at this time to provide others with the opportu
 nity.</div>\n<div></div>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
