DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Join the ongoing Joshua Clover Memorial Materialism Reading Gro
 up for its next iteration on “The Eclipse and Re-Emergence of the Communis
 t Movement” by Gilles Dauvé. The short book provides a sustained reflectio
 n of the events of May 1968 in France with an analysis of the reinvigorati
 on of the proletarian movement on a new basis.\nThe reading group will mee
 t on January 8 at 7pm EST at Redbud Books and online.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260108T190000
LOCATION:Redbud Books\, 408 West Kirkwood Ave.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Meeting: Joshua Clover Memorial Materialism Reading Group\, reading
   “The Eclipse and Re-Emergence of the Communist Movement” by Gilles Dauvé
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/meeting-joshua-clover-memorial-materialism-readi
 ng-group-reading-the-eclipse-and-re-emergence-of-the-communist-movement-by
 -gilles-dauve/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Join the ongo
 ing Joshua Clover Memorial Materialism Reading Group for its next iteratio
 n on “The Eclipse and Re-Emergence of the Communist Movement” by Gilles Da
 uvé. The short book provides a sustained reflection of the events of May 1
 968 in France with an analysis of the reinvigoration of the proletarian mo
 vement on a new basis.<br />\nThe reading group will meet on January 8 at 
 7pm EST at Redbud Books and online. </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
