X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Synopsis: In 
 the early 80′\, in the Chilean desert\, eleven-year-old Lidia grows up in 
 a loving queer family pushed on the edge of an unwelcoming dusty mining to
 wn. They are blamed for a mysterious illness that’s starting to spread – s
 aid to be passed through a single gaze\, when one man falls in love with a
 nother. In this modern western\, Lidia leads a quest for vengeance\, facin
 g violence\, fear and hatred\, where family is her only refuge and love mi
 ght be the real danger.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
