CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Tis the season for a spot of tea! Join us for a fireside chat w
 hile sipping this season’s wild harvested teas. From bark to root\, the fo
 rest offers a multitude of teas to boost the immune system\, and warm your
  bones! We will begin with a brief hike while demonstrating various harves
 t techniques\, before indulging in the bounty. Bring your favorite mug and
  a thirst for knowledge. Children 14 and under must be accompanied by an a
 dult.\nSPECIAL NOTE: Registration for this event is offered ONLY through B
 loomington Parks & Recreation. “Resale” or transfer of registration is NOT
  accepted through third parties. If you are offered tickets to this event\
 , it is a SCAM.
