 rward power duo will be offering their music in the name of love\, service
  and rock & roll.</p>\n</div>\n<div>Presented by BCT + Bloomington Roots.<
 /div>\n<div>Doors at 6:30 pm.</div>\n<div>Tickets: <a href='https://app.op
 endate.io/e/may-erlewine-with-packy-lundholm-january-11-2026-630752' targe
 t='_blank' rel='noopener' data-saferedirecturl='https://www.google.com/url
