DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:We’re ready to celebrate everything that makes IU Cinema specia
 l\, especially you! Join us for a defining film of the 21st century\, the 
 reveal of our Golden Ticket winners\, special guests\, free giveaways (inc
 luding some directly from the library of cinematic great Peter Bogdanovich
  as well as from Michael Uslan\, the man who brought Batman to the world’s
  movie screens)\, some surprises\, and free popcorn. Don’t forget to come 
 in your best party clothes!\nThe movie title for this screening will be an
 nounced on site\; the film is rated R and is presented in English. This ev
 ent will end at approximately 10pm.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260113T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260113T220000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:IU Cinema 15th Anniversary Secret Screening
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/iu-cinema-15th-anniversary-secret-screening/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>We’re ready t
 o celebrate everything that makes IU Cinema special\, especially you! Join
  us for a defining film of the 21st century\, the reveal of our Golden Tic
 ket winners\, special guests\, free giveaways (including some directly fro
 m the library of cinematic great Peter Bogdanovich as well as from Michael
  Uslan\, the man who brought Batman to the world’s movie screens)\, some s
 urprises\, and free popcorn. Don’t forget to come in your best party cloth
 es!</p>\n<p>The movie title for this screening will be announced on site\;
  the film is rated R and is presented in English. This event will end at a
 pproximately 10pm.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
