UID:ai1ec-144217@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Work by more than fifty Indiana University artists\, architects
 \, and designers comes together in Continuum: Eskenazi Faculty Exhibition 
 2026 at the Grunwald Gallery of Art at the IU Eskenazi School of Art\, Arc
 hitecture + Design. Spanning disciplines from fashion\, architecture\, and
  interior design to a wide range of studio art practices—including ceramic
 s\, photography\, painting\, digital media\, and metalsmithing—Continuum i
 s the Eskenazi School’s first faculty invitational since 2021 and features
  tenure-track\, instructional\, and emeritus faculty.\n 
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260116T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260116T200000
LOCATION:Grunwald Gallery of Art\, 1201 E Seventh St\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Opening Reception for Continuum: Eskenazi Faculty Exhibition 2026
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/continuum-eskenazi-faculty-exhibition-2026/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p dir='ltr'>Wor
 k by more than fifty Indiana University artists\, architects\, and designe
 rs comes together in <i>Continuum: Eskenazi Faculty Exhibition 2026</i> at
  the Grunwald Gallery of Art at the IU Eskenazi School of Art\, Architectu
 re + Design. Spanning disciplines from fashion\, architecture\, and interi
 or design to a wide range of studio art practices—including ceramics\, pho
 tography\, painting\, digital media\, and metalsmithing—<i>Continuum</i> i
 s the Eskenazi School’s first faculty invitational since 2021 and features
  tenure-track\, instructional\, and emeritus faculty.</p>\n<p> </p>\n</BOD
 Y></HTML>
END:VEVENT
