BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-144874@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the Speakeasy at oak:\nan underground salon for the 
 soulful curious\nOur first night in the Speakeasy is Tarot Speakeasy: New 
 Year Edition\nInside\, the night unfolds gradually.\nCards are drawn. Ques
 tions are held.\nSome moments are shared\, others quiet.\nA special adapto
 gen cocktail–Fate in Motion—grounds the evening.\nMusic hums. Time feels l
 ess urgent.\nNot everything will be revealed ahead of time. Some parts of 
 the night are meant to be discovered once you arrive.\nCome curious. Come 
 open. The Speakeasy reveals itself slowly.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260117T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260117T210000
LOCATION:oak.Bloomington\, 116 W 6th St. Suite 101\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:{Tarot} Speakeasy
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/tarot-speakeasy/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Welcome to th
 e Speakeasy at oak:<br />\nan underground salon for the soulful curious<br
  />\nOur first night in the Speakeasy is Tarot Speakeasy: New Year Edition
 <br />\nInside\, the night unfolds gradually.<br />\nCards are drawn. Ques
 tions are held.<br />\nSome moments are shared\, others quiet.<br />\nA sp
 ecial adaptogen cocktail–Fate in Motion—grounds the evening.<br />\nMusic 
 hums. Time feels less urgent.<br />\nNot everything will be revealed ahead
  of time. Some parts of the night are meant to be discovered once you arri
 ve.<br />\nCome curious. Come open. The Speakeasy reveals itself slowly.</
 p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
