BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-143734@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Racial conditioning is both individual and collective\, as is h
 ealing. The BMA Faith for Racial Equity team invites you to join together 
 for an empowering conversation with Milagros Phillips\, author of “Crackin
 g the Healer’s Code: A Prescription for Healing Racism & Finding Wholeness
 .” Bring your questions regarding race-related matters\, what keeps you up
  at night\, and ideas for how we can take action to heal racism.  Given wh
 ere we are as a nation\, gathering together for healing is more important 
 than ever.\n \nEmail us at bmaf4re@gmail.com to connect with the Bloomingt
 on Multifaith Alliance Faith for Racial Equity team.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260118T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260118T170000
LOCATION:Unitarian Universalist Church of Bloomington\, 2120 N. Fee Lane\, 
 Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Healing Racism Together
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/healing-racism-together/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p dir='ltr'>Rac
 ial conditioning is both individual and collective\, as is healing. The BM
 A Faith for Racial Equity team invites you to join together for an empower
 ing conversation with Milagros Phillips\, author of “Cracking the Healer’s
  Code: A Prescription for Healing Racism & Finding Wholeness.” Bring your 
 questions regarding race-related matters\, what keeps you up at night\, an
 d ideas for how we can take action to heal racism.  Given where we are as 
 a nation\, gathering together for healing is more important than ever.</p>
 \n<p> </p>\n<p dir='ltr'>Email us at <a href='mailto:bmaf4re@gmail.com' ta
 rget='_blank' rel='noopener'>bmaf4re@gmail.com</a> to connect with the Blo
 omington Multifaith Alliance Faith for Racial Equity team.</p>\n</BODY></H
 TML>
END:VEVENT
