BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-144999@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:A film of rare emotional precision and formal grace\, this deep
 ly felt portrait of three generations of a Taipei family in quiet crisis u
 nfolds in perfect calibration and accumulated emotional power. Middle-aged
  businessman NJ is facing personal and professional upheaval: his company 
 is floundering\, and an old flame has reappeared. Around him\, his wife sp
 irals into spiritual despair\, his young daughter wrestles with guilt over
  her grandmother’s stroke\, and his curious\, observant son begins to glim
 pse the complications of adult life. Winner of the Best Director award at 
 Cannes in 2000. [173 min\; drama\; Mandarin with English subtitles]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260121T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:International Art House Film Series: Yi Yi
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/international-art-house-film-series-yi-yi/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>A film of rar
 e emotional precision and formal grace\, this deeply felt portrait of thre
 e generations of a Taipei family in quiet crisis unfolds in perfect calibr
 ation and accumulated emotional power. Middle-aged businessman NJ is facin
 g personal and professional upheaval: his company is floundering\, and an 
 old flame has reappeared. Around him\, his wife spirals into spiritual des
 pair\, his young daughter wrestles with guilt over her grandmother’s strok
 e\, and his curious\, observant son begins to glimpse the complications of
  adult life. Winner of the Best Director award at Cannes in 2000. [173 min
 \; drama\; Mandarin with English subtitles] </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
