UID:ai1ec-144872@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Presented By: Pam Hurst Designs & Studio PH.D  (317) 459-3581\n
 pamalahurst@yahoo.com Contact to ask about the cost.\nStudio PH.D is a ser
 ies of jewelry classes offered by artist Pam Hurst at The Sterling Butterf
 ly in downtown Martinsville. Some classes may have prerequisites. \nJanuar
 y will kick off Charm School – a monthly Charm Making Session! Each month 
 will feature a different type of charm\, and if you attend at least four s
 essions\, you will be able to make a charm holder pendant (this will be a 
 separate session you can attend for free!). If you attend eight sessions\,
  you can create a charm bracelet (also a separate session.) Participants i
 n each charm school session will create a specific type of charm. \nThis s
 ession has no prerequisites and no experience is necessary. All materials\
 , necessary tools and instruction is included in the class fee. Class size
  is limited. Please bring reading glasses or your preferred magnification 
 device.\nCharm School classes in January will be at 6 pm on Jan. 15 and Ja
 n. 20 and at Noon on Jan. 22\, and will last approximately 2 hours.
