BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-145095@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Leadership Bloomington-Monroe County (LBMC) builds a stronger c
 ommunity by identifying a diverse cross-section of emerging leaders and pr
 eparing them for roles in shaping our future.
