CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:An exciting series of workshops\, readings\, and creative discu
 ssions. Join us for this early look at these works in development\, so one
  day you can say “I saw that play At First Sight”.  \nThe Festival feature
 s three staged readings of new plays by our MFA Playwriting candidates dir
 ected by Dr. Jennifer Goodlander. They are:\nGroundlings by Wren Aubrey La
 tham\nFriday\, January 23 at 7:30pm and Wednesday\, January 28 at 7:30pm\n
 Isn’t This Nice by Júlia Cerqueira\nFriday\, Janaury 30 at 7:30pm\nI am bu
 sy dying by Golsa Sohrabi\nSaturday\, January 24 at 7:30pm and Thursday\, 
 January 29 at 7:30pm
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260123T193000
LOCATION:IU Studio Theatre\, within the Lee Norvelle Theatre & Drama Center
 \, 275 N Eagleson Ave\, Bloomington
