 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>An exciting s
 eries of workshops\, readings\, and creative discussions. Join us for this
  early look at these works in development\, so one day you can say “I saw 
 that play At First Sight”.  </p>\n<p>The Festival features three staged re
 adings of new plays by our MFA Playwriting candidates directed by Dr. Jenn
 ifer Goodlander. They are:</p>\n<p>Groundlings by Wren Aubrey Latham<br />
 \nFriday\, January 23 at 7:30pm and Wednesday\, January 28 at 7:30pm</p>\n
 <p>Isn’t This Nice by Júlia Cerqueira<br />\nFriday\, Janaury 30 at 7:30pm
 </p>\n<p>I am busy dying by Golsa Sohrabi<br />\nSaturday\, January 24 at 
 7:30pm and Thursday\, January 29 at 7:30pm</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
