BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-144996@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Afrique en Cirque is a show by Yamoussa Bangoura\, inspired by 
 daily life in Guinea. This performance shares the beauty\, youth\, and art
 istry of African culture. A colorful show beyond its scenery\, costumes\, 
 and staging\, it makes any theatre vibrate with energy and represents the 
 strength\, agility\, and life’s joys of young Africans. The audience will 
 see acrobats execute gravity-defying moves and human pyramids\, accompanie
 d by the contemporary sounds of live Afro-Jazz\, percussion\, and kora. We
 lcome to the universe of Kalabanté Productions and prepare for an unforget
 table journey.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260125T180000
LOCATION:IU Auditorium\, 1211 East 7th St.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Cirque Kalabanté
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/cirque-kalabante/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Afrique en Ci
 rque is a show by Yamoussa Bangoura\, inspired by daily life in Guinea. Th
 is performance shares the beauty\, youth\, and artistry of African culture
 . A colorful show beyond its scenery\, costumes\, and staging\, it makes a
 ny theatre vibrate with energy and represents the strength\, agility\, and
  life’s joys of young Africans. The audience will see acrobats execute gra
 vity-defying moves and human pyramids\, accompanied by the contemporary so
 unds of live Afro-Jazz\, percussion\, and kora. Welcome to the universe of
  Kalabanté Productions and prepare for an unforgettable journey.</p>\n</BO
 DY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
