UID:ai1ec-145415@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Megalopolis is a Roman epic fable set in an imagined modern Ame
 rica. The City of New Rome must change\, causing conflict between Cesar Ca
 tilina\, a genius artist who seeks to leap into a utopian\, idealistic fut
 ure\, and his opposition\, Mayor Franklyn Cicero\, who remains committed t
 o a regressive status quo\, perpetuating greed\, special interests\, and p
 artisan warfare. Torn between them is socialite Julia Cicero\, the mayor’s
  daughter\, whose love for Cesar has divided her loyalties\, forcing her t
 o discover what she truly believes humanity deserves. Starring Adam Driver
 \, Giancarlo Esposito\, Nathalie Emmanuel\, Aubrey Plaza\, Shia LeBeouf\, 
 Jon Voight\, Laurence Fishburne\, Talia Shire\, Jason Schwartzman\, and Du
 stin Hoffman. [138 min\; drama\, fantasy\; English]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260129T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Inspiring Conversations film series: Megalopolis/Francis Ford Coppo
 la’s Megalopolis: A Fable
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/inspiring-conversations-film-series-megalopolis-
 francis-ford-coppolas-megalopolis-a-fable/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Megalopolis i
 s a Roman epic fable set in an imagined modern America. The City of New Ro
 me must change\, causing conflict between Cesar Catilina\, a genius artist
  who seeks to leap into a utopian\, idealistic future\, and his opposition
 \, Mayor Franklyn Cicero\, who remains committed to a regressive status qu
 o\, perpetuating greed\, special interests\, and partisan warfare. Torn be
 tween them is socialite Julia Cicero\, the mayor’s daughter\, whose love f
 or Cesar has divided her loyalties\, forcing her to discover what she trul
 y believes humanity deserves. Starring Adam Driver\, Giancarlo Esposito\, 
 Nathalie Emmanuel\, Aubrey Plaza\, Shia LeBeouf\, Jon Voight\, Laurence Fi
 shburne\, Talia Shire\, Jason Schwartzman\, and Dustin Hoffman. [138 min\;
  drama\, fantasy\; English] </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
