BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-145417@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:A frustrated filmmaker\, facing creative paralysis\, turns to a
 n A.I. chatbot in order to make his latest movie a hit. The result is a se
 ries of increasingly outrageous vignettes exploring the myth of Dracula in
  all its forms. From a wild chase through the streets of modern Transylvan
 ia to eerie hauntings in the Romanian countryside\, cinematic provocateur 
 Radu Jude returns with another boundary-pushing epic featuring a union-bus
 ting Dracula breaking a strike\, an adaptation of the first Romanian vampi
 re novella\, thwarted romance\, fields of phalluses\, lots of blood\, and 
 much more. [170 min\; comedy\, horror\; Romanian with English subtitles]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260130T220000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Not Quite Midnight film series: Dracula (2025)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/not-quite-midnight-film-series-dracula-2025/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>A frustrated 
 filmmaker\, facing creative paralysis\, turns to an A.I. chatbot in order 
 to make his latest movie a hit. The result is a series of increasingly out
 rageous vignettes exploring the myth of Dracula in all its forms. From a w
 ild chase through the streets of modern Transylvania to eerie hauntings in
  the Romanian countryside\, cinematic provocateur Radu Jude returns with a
 nother boundary-pushing epic featuring a union-busting Dracula breaking a 
 strike\, an adaptation of the first Romanian vampire novella\, thwarted ro
 mance\, fields of phalluses\, lots of blood\, and much more. [170 min\; co
 medy\, horror\; Romanian with English subtitles] </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
