BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-145418@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:A passionate and concise cinematic civics lesson\, Good Night\,
  and Good Luck resonates today\, perhaps more than ever. When Senator Jose
 ph McCarthy begins his campaign to root out Communists in America\, CBS Ne
 ws impresario Edward R. Murrow (David Strathairn) dedicates himself to exp
 osing the atrocities being committed by McCarthy’s Senate investigation. M
 urrow is supported by a news team that includes longtime friend and produc
 er Fred Friendly (George Clooney) as the CBS team does its best to point o
 ut the senator’s lies and excesses\, despite pressure from CBS’ corporate 
 sponsors to desist. [93 min\; drama\; English]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260131T160000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Screening the Semiquincentennial series: Good Night\, and Good Luck
  (2005)
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/screening-the-semiquincentennial-series-good-nig
 ht-and-good-luck-2005/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>A passionate 
 and concise cinematic civics lesson\, Good Night\, and Good Luck resonates
  today\, perhaps more than ever. When Senator Joseph McCarthy begins his c
 ampaign to root out Communists in America\, CBS News impresario Edward R. 
 Murrow (David Strathairn) dedicates himself to exposing the atrocities bei
 ng committed by McCarthy’s Senate investigation. Murrow is supported by a 
 news team that includes longtime friend and producer Fred Friendly (George
  Clooney) as the CBS team does its best to point out the senator’s lies an
 d excesses\, despite pressure from CBS’ corporate sponsors to desist. [93 
 min\; drama\; English] </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
