BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-143712@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Doors at 5:30\n6:00-6:40 KP & The WLGs\n6:45-7:30 The Hammer & 
 The Hatchet\n7:35-8:25 Jeff Shew & The Late-Night Crew\n8:30-9:30 Coyote M
 otel\n9:45-11:00 The Dynamics\nAll proceeds from this benefit concert will
  go to the radio station WFHB.\nWFHB 91.3 FM is a community radio FM stati
 on in Bloomington\, Indiana\, United States. The station has three transla
 tors serving southern Indiana: 98.1 in Bloomington\, 100.7 in Nashville an
 d 106.3 in Ellettsville.\nWFHB has a small paid staff and over 150 volunte
 ers\, who perform a range of duties\, from office administration to music 
 and news programming. The station is supported financially by contribution
 s from listeners and program underwriting by local businesses.\nMission: W
 FHB exists to provide an open forum for the exchange and discussion of ide
 as and issues\, and to celebrate and increase the local cultural diversity
 .\nVision: WFHB envisions a sustainable\, diverse\, participatory multimed
 ia service that contributes to an entertained\, informed\, and empowered c
 ommunity.\nTickets: https://buskirkchumley.org/events/airwaves-for-all-a-b
 enefit-for-wfhb-january-31-2026/#buy
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260131T180000
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater\, 114 E. Kirkwood Ave\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Airwaves For All: A Benefit for WFHB featuring: KP & The WLGs\, The
  Hammer & The Hatchet\, Jeff Shew & The Late-Night Crew\, Coyote Motel\, T
 he Dynamics
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/airwaves-for-all-a-benefit-for-wfhb/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Doors
  at 5:30</strong><br />\n6:00-6:40 KP & The WLGs<br />\n6:45-7:30 The Hamm
 er & The Hatchet<br />\n7:35-8:25 Jeff Shew & The Late-Night Crew<br />\n8
 :30-9:30 Coyote Motel<br />\n9:45-11:00 The Dynamics</p>\n<p>All proceeds 
 from this benefit concert will go to the radio station WFHB.</p>\n<p>WFHB 
 91.3 FM is a community radio FM station in Bloomington\, Indiana\, United 
 States. The station has three translators serving southern Indiana: 98.1 i
 n Bloomington\, 100.7 in Nashville and 106.3 in Ellettsville.</p>\n<p>WFHB
  has a small paid staff and over 150 volunteers\, who perform a range of d
 uties\, from office administration to music and news programming. The stat
 ion is supported financially by contributions from listeners and program u
 nderwriting by local businesses.</p>\n<p><strong>Mission: WFHB exists to p
 rovide an open forum for the exchange and discussion of ideas and issues\,
  and to celebrate and increase the local cultural diversity.</strong><br /
 >\n<strong>Vision: WFHB envisions a sustainable\, diverse\, participatory 
 multimedia service that contributes to an entertained\, informed\, and emp
 owered community.</strong></p>\n<p>Tickets: https://buskirkchumley.org/eve
 nts/airwaves-for-all-a-benefit-for-wfhb-january-31-2026/#buy</p>\n</BODY><
 /HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
