 /
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>The Hidden Fo
 rtress stars the inimitable Toshiro Mifune as a general charged with guard
 ing his defeated clan’s princess (a fierce Misa Uehara) as the two smuggle
  royal treasure across hostile territory. Accompanying them are a pair of 
 bumbling\, conniving peasants who may or may not be their friends. This ri
 p-roaring ride is among the director’s most beloved films and was a primar
 y influence on George Lucas’s Star Wars. The Hidden Fortress delivers Kuro
 sawa’s trademark deft blend of wry humor\, breathtaking action\, and compa
 ssionate humanity. [139 min\; action\, adventure\, drama\; Japanese with E
 nglish subtitles]</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
