DESCRIPTION:Local folksinger Matt Lundquist brings his Deep Country Dream S
 tringband to Morgenstern Books for an afternoon of friendly vibes and tast
 eful tunes. With Michael Lindeau on fiddle\, Justin Hughey on banjo\, and 
 Devin Brown on upright bass rounding out the sound\, Lundquist pulls from 
 his catalogue of hundreds of songs. In 2022 he won the John Hartford Memor
 ial Festival Songwriter Contest and he gathers inspiration from the Lost R
 oads\, National Forests\, and good people of Southern Indiana.
