 c-event-description'>\n<p dir='ltr'>Dare to uncover the terrifying secrets
  of the Ouija board in this spine-chilling theatrical experience. As the m
 agic-filled séance begins\, you’ll find yourself surrounded by the eerie r
 emnants of the original Ouija board factory—still haunted by the untimely 
 death of its inventor in 1927. As the spirits awaken\, will you unlock the
  dark secrets of the past or become trapped in their world forever?</p>\n<
 p dir='ltr'>Starring Rob Zabrecky\, two-time Stage Magician of the Year an
 d resident séance specialist for the Magic Castle.</p>\n<p dir='ltr'>Recom
