 eleaguered women he relies upon most will risk life\, liberty\, and the pu
 rsuit of sanity to keep the Commander in Chief out of trouble. POTUS: Or\,
  Behind Every Great Dumbass Are Seven Women Trying to Keep Him Alive is a 
