BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-144508@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Road trip. Hitchhiking adventure. What could go wrong.\nIn 1972
 \, filmmaker Ron Osgood set out on a road trip through Northern California
  that quickly turned into an unexpected hitchhiking adventure. For decades
 \, he shared the story from memory\, until he rediscovered an audio casset
 te he had recorded to preserve its details. That discovery inspired him to
  retrace and investigate what truly happened. I Do Remember weaves memory 
 and evidence into a timeless question:\nWhere does the truth lie?\nAfter t
 he screening\, Ron will lead a Q/A and discussion on how to research\, col
 lect evidence\, and fact-check when developing a personal narrative.\nI Do
  Remember will broadcast on PBS stations in 2026.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260201T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260201T160000
LOCATION:Meeting Room A/B Combo\, Ellettsville Branch of the Monroe County 
 Public Library\, 600 West Temperance Street\, Ellettsville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Traveling University Presents: I Do Remember – Film Screening and S
 torytelling Discussion\, with Ron Osgood
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/i-do-remember-film-screening-and-storytelling-di
 scussion/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div class='even
 tlist-excerpt'>\n<p data-rte-preserve-empty='true'>Road trip. Hitchhiking 
 adventure. What could go wrong.</p>\n<p class='' data-rte-preserve-empty='
 true'>In 1972\, filmmaker Ron Osgood set out on a road trip through Northe
 rn California that quickly turned into an unexpected hitchhiking adventure
 . For decades\, he shared the story from memory\, until he rediscovered an
  audio cassette he had recorded to preserve its details. That discovery in
 spired him to retrace and investigate what truly happened. I Do Remember w
 eaves memory and evidence into a timeless question:</p>\n<p class='' data-
 rte-preserve-empty='true'>Where does the truth lie?</p>\n<p class='' data-
 rte-preserve-empty='true'>After the screening\, Ron will lead a Q/A and di
 scussion on how to research\, collect evidence\, and fact-check when devel
 oping a personal narrative.</p>\n<p class='' data-rte-preserve-empty='true
 '><em>I Do Remember</em> will broadcast on PBS stations in 2026.</p>\n</di
 v>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
