CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Jennifer Huston Schaeffer is the author of Mommy’s Boy: How My 
 Doggie Soulmate’s Love Rescued Me and the owner of White Dog Editorial Ser
 vices.\nShana Ritter writes poetry and prose and pieces in between.  Her c
 hapbook\, Stairs of Separation was published by Finishing Line Press. In t
 he Time of Leaving\, a novel of exile and resilience\, is set in late 15th
  century Spain.
