 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Jennifer Hust
 on Schaeffer is the author of <em>Mommy’s Boy: How My Doggie Soulmate’s Lo
 ve Rescued Me</em> and the owner of White Dog Editorial Services.</p>\n<p>
 Shana Ritter writes poetry and prose and pieces in between.  Her chapbook\
 , <em>Stairs of Separation</em> was published by Finishing Line Press. <em
 >In the Time of Leaving</em>\, a novel of exile and resilience\, is set in
  late 15th century Spain.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
