CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Dare to uncover the terrifying secrets of the Ouija board in th
 is spine-chilling theatrical experience. As the magic-filled séance begins
 \, you’ll find yourself surrounded by the eerie remnants of the original O
 uija board factory—still haunted by the untimely death of its inventor in 
 1927. As the spirits awaken\, will you unlock the dark secrets of the past
  or become trapped in their world forever?\nStarring Rob Zabrecky\, two-ti
 me Stage Magician of the Year and resident séance specialist for the Magic
  Castle.\nRecommended for ages 13+.
