 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p dir='ltr'>Dar
 e to uncover the terrifying secrets of the Ouija board in this spine-chill
 ing theatrical experience. As the magic-filled séance begins\, you’ll find
  yourself surrounded by the eerie remnants of the original Ouija board fac
 tory—still haunted by the untimely death of its inventor in 1927. As the s
 pirits awaken\, will you unlock the dark secrets of the past or become tra
 pped in their world forever?</p>\n<p dir='ltr'>Starring Rob Zabrecky\, two
 -time Stage Magician of the Year and resident séance specialist for the Ma
 gic Castle.</p>\n<p dir='ltr'>Recommended for ages 13+.</p>\n</BODY></HTML
