UID:ai1ec-145713@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Ohio musician Ethan Timm is an old soul influenced by legendary
  rock and roll bands and musicians who wrote songs worth remembering. His 
 fun yet passionate performances include soulful\, smooth vocals and clever
 \, blues-influenced guitar work. You’ll hear plenty of recognizable hits f
 rom the past\, as well as similarly styled original songs and a smattering
  of great obscure covers. Every show is different\, be there to hear what 
 happens!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260207T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260207T190000
LOCATION:Cedar Creek Winery\, Brewery and Distillery\, 3820 Leonard Road\, 
 Martinsville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Ethan Timm
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/ethan-timm/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Ohio musician
  Ethan Timm is an old soul influenced by legendary rock and roll bands and
  musicians who wrote songs worth remembering. His fun yet passionate perfo
 rmances include soulful\, smooth vocals and clever\, blues-influenced guit
 ar work. You’ll hear plenty of recognizable hits from the past\, as well a
 s similarly styled original songs and a smattering of great obscure covers
 . Every show is different\, be there to hear what happens!</p>\n</BODY></H
 TML>
END:VEVENT
