UID:ai1ec-145376@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Love is in the air\, but not just for couples! Celebrate friend
 ship\, community\, and all kinds of connections this February at Love at t
 he Museum. Bring a friend\, partner\, or relative and join the museum for 
 an early Valentine’s (or Palestine’s!) celebration that’s all about togeth
 erness.\n\nEnjoy our fully stocked chocolate bar and beverages while liste
 ning to live music. Get creative with crafts like making your own luminari
 es\, holiday cards\, and newspaper poetry\, or try your hand at painting y
 our own candles. Plus\, check out a variety of Valentine’s themed items fr
 om the museum’s collections.\nWe can’t wait to see you there!\nLink:  http
 s://events.iu.edu/event/2169206-love-at-the-museum
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260212T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260212T193000
LOCATION:IU Museum of Archaeology & Anthropology\, 416 N Indiana Ave\, Bloo
 mington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Love at the Museum
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/love-at-the-museum/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div>Love is in 
 the air\, but not just for couples! Celebrate friendship\, community\, and
  all kinds of connections this February at Love at the Museum. Bring a fri
 end\, partner\, or relative and join the museum for an early Valentine’s (
 or Palestine’s!) celebration that’s all about togetherness.</div>\n<div></
 div>\n<div>Enjoy our fully stocked chocolate bar and beverages while liste
 ning to live music. Get creative with crafts like making your own luminari
 es\, holiday cards\, and newspaper poetry\, or try your hand at painting y
 our own candles. Plus\, check out a variety of Valentine’s themed items fr
 om the museum’s collections.</div>\n<div>We can’t wait to see you there!</
 div>\n<div>Link: <a id='m_6913818007541643195OWA486f8243-29d2-abf9-445a-81
 b7500a76e4' href='https://events.iu.edu/event/2169206-love-at-the-museum' 
 target='_blank' rel='noopener' data-saferedirecturl='https://www.google.co
 m/url?q=https://events.iu.edu/event/2169206-love-at-the-museum&source=gmai
 l&ust=1769629110577000&usg=AOvVaw0XZGVV1bZhsUOPslKs2PbF'> https://events.i
 u.edu/event/<wbr />2169206-love-at-the-museum</a></div>\n<div></div>\n</BO
 DY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
