CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:You’re invited to join Janet Eger from the White River Forestry
  Committee to hone your skills in identifying trees in winter. Participant
 s are encouraged to attend both the classroom (Thursday\, 2/12) and outdoo
 r (Saturday\, 2/14) sessions of the workshop\, but those who are able to a
 ttend only one session will still get value from the class.\nIn this first
  session session\, Eger will describe ways to distinguish different specie
 s of trees without their leaves. Participants will compare the bark\, buds
 \, nuts\, and seeds of common trees to compare different species.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260212T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260212T200000
