BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-145840@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Synopsis: From the rich and textured imagination of Czech visio
 nary Juraj Herz (The Cremator) comes his own vivid reimagining of a classi
 c fairy tale in Beauty and the Beast. The film follows the innocent Julie 
 and her experiences living under the watchful eye of Netvor\, a bird-like 
 being torn between his growing affection for her and his animalistic urge 
 to kill. Gorgeously shot\, intriguingly surreal\, thrillingly sensual – Be
 auty and the Beas retells a beloved story in ways unlike any adaptation be
 fore or since.\nRestored by Národní filmový archiv\, Prague and Severin Fi
 lms\, supported by The Czech Audiovisual Fund.\nGenerously sponsored by Bl
 oomington Rentals & Realty.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260213T190000
LOCATION:Backspace Gallery\, inside Bonne Fête\, 112 West 6th Street\, on t
 he square in Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Cicada Cinema: Beauty and the Beast
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/cicada-cinema-beauty-and-the-beast/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Synopsis: Fro
 m the rich and textured imagination of Czech visionary Juraj Herz (The Cre
 mator) comes his own vivid reimagining of a classic fairy tale in Beauty a
 nd the Beast. The film follows the innocent Julie and her experiences livi
 ng under the watchful eye of Netvor\, a bird-like being torn between his g
 rowing affection for her and his animalistic urge to kill. Gorgeously shot
 \, intriguingly surreal\, thrillingly sensual – Beauty and the Beas retell
 s a beloved story in ways unlike any adaptation before or since.</p>\n<p>R
 estored by Národní filmový archiv\, Prague and Severin Films\, supported b
 y The Czech Audiovisual Fund.</p>\n<p>Generously sponsored by Bloomington 
 Rentals & Realty.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
