UID:ai1ec-146010@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Dust off your leather jackets\, pull on your bobby-socks and ge
 t ready as “bad boy” Danny and “the girl next door” Sandy fall in love all
  over again\, right here in Martinsville! Grease is a popular musical that
  tells the story of a group of high school students in the 1950s. The musi
 cal follows the lives of the students at Rydell High School as they naviga
 te their way through love\, friendship\, and the challenges of growing up\
 , all set to a memorable soundtrack.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260213T190000
LOCATION:Martinsville High School Auditorium\, 1360 East Gray Street\, Mart
 insville
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20260214T190000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20260216T190000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20260220T190000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20260221T190000
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Grease\, The Musical
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/grease-the-musical-presented-by-martinsville-hig
 h-school/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Dust off your
  leather jackets\, pull on your bobby-socks and get ready as “bad boy” Dan
 ny and “the girl next door” Sandy fall in love all over again\, right here
  in Martinsville! Grease is a popular musical that tells the story of a gr
 oup of high school students in the 1950s. The musical follows the lives of
  the students at Rydell High School as they navigate their way through lov
 e\, friendship\, and the challenges of growing up\, all set to a memorable
  soundtrack.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
