CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Cristina Mariani is a stand-up comedian who can currently be se
 en performing across the nation as well as nightly at her home club COMEDY
  MOTHERSHIP in Austin\, Texas. She made her comedy debut on episode 517 of
  the podcast KILL TONY and has completely taken off since\, garnering mill
 ions of views online with her standup videos. Cristina has toured with The
 o Von and opened for many other renowned comedians\, such as Tom Segura\, 
 Christina Pazsitzky\, Harland Williams\, Ari Shaffir\, Fahim Anwar\, Pauly
  Shore\, and even Grammy-nominated rapper Freddie Gibbs. She is currently 
 a regular on Brian Redban’s famous SECRETSHOW\, has appeared on FIRST DATE
  LIVE with Lauren Compton\, and been on FUNNY UBER RIDES with Darren Levy.
  For more on Cristina\, visit her Instagram\,  TikTok\, and YouTube pages.
