 Texas. She made her comedy debut on episode 517 of the podcast KILL TONY a
 nd has completely taken off since\, garnering millions of views online wit
 h her standup videos. Cristina has toured with Theo Von and opened for man
 y other renowned comedians\, such as Tom Segura\, Christina Pazsitzky\, Ha
 rland Williams\, Ari Shaffir\, Fahim Anwar\, Pauly Shore\, and even Grammy
 -nominated rapper Freddie Gibbs. She is currently a regular on Brian Redba
 n’s famous SECRETSHOW\, has appeared on FIRST DATE LIVE with Lauren Compto
 n\, and been on FUNNY UBER RIDES with Darren Levy. For more on Cristina\, 
 visit her Instagram\,  TikTok\, and YouTube pages.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
