CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Two conspiracy-obsessed young men (Jesse Plemons\, Aidan Delbis
 ) kidnap the high-powered CEO of a major pharmaceutical company (Emma Ston
 e)\, convinced that she is an alien intent on destroying planet Earth. Yor
 gos Lanthimos returns with an absurdist satirical comedy so maddeningly re
 flective of the current moment in its descent into hell\, you may wonder i
 f you didn’t accidentally stumble into watching a documentary. [118 min\; 
 comedy\, drama\, sci-fi\, thriller\; English]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260213T220000
