 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Two conspirac
 y-obsessed young men (Jesse Plemons\, Aidan Delbis) kidnap the high-powere
 d CEO of a major pharmaceutical company (Emma Stone)\, convinced that she 
 is an alien intent on destroying planet Earth. Yorgos Lanthimos returns wi
 th an absurdist satirical comedy so maddeningly reflective of the current 
 moment in its descent into hell\, you may wonder if you didn’t accidentall
 y stumble into watching a documentary. [118 min\; comedy\, drama\, sci-fi\
 , thriller\; English] </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
