BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-145911@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:February is a month for love and appreciation! We have a lot of
  stuff in our collection (museums call them objects and artifacts) that we
  love and appreciate – and you’ve probably seen only half of them. Come le
 arn about the history of the objects in the Wylie House collections and cr
 eate a zine with our images to tell your stories of love and appreciation.
 \nSaturday Crafternoons are for families\, students\, and friends of all a
 ges! Activities change monthly. Check the Wylie House Museum socials and w
 ebsite for updated information\, parking information\, and museum tour hou
 rs.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260214T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260214T140000
LOCATION:Wylie House Museum\, Morton C. Bradley Jr. Education Center\, 317 
 E 2nd Street\, Bloomington.
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20260221T110000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20260228T110000
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Saturday Crafternoon
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/saturday-crafternoon-at-the-wylie-house-museum-2
 /
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>February is a
  month for love and appreciation! We have a lot of stuff in our collection
  (museums call them objects and artifacts) that we love and appreciate – a
 nd you’ve probably seen only half of them. Come learn about the history of
  the objects in the Wylie House collections and create a zine with our ima
 ges to tell your stories of love and appreciation.</p>\n<p>Saturday Crafte
 rnoons are for families\, students\, and friends of all ages! Activities c
 hange monthly. Check the Wylie House Museum socials and website for update
 d information\, parking information\, and museum tour hours.</p>\n</BODY><
 /HTML>
