CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Whether you are deeply in love or simply in love with the music
  of love\, Bloomington Chamber\nSinger’s upcoming concert is perfect for y
 ou. You’re invited to join BCS as they present a program inspired by the\n
 multifaceted aspect of love.\nConducted by artistic director\, Caio Guimar
 ães\, the Chamber Singers will be joined by Brazilian\nguitarist João Vito
 r as well as four-hand piano accompaniment provided by Edoardo Lenza and\n
 Matthew Gemmill. All are cordially invited to bask in the romance of the s
 eason as BCS leads you on\na romantic journey to Spain and Mexico.\nDoors 
 at 3:15.\nMore information and admission info available at www.chambersing
 ers.info.
