X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Whether you a
 re deeply in love or simply in love with the music of love\, Bloomington C
 hamber<br />\nSinger’s upcoming concert is perfect for you. You’re invited
  to join BCS as they present a program inspired by the<br />\nmultifaceted
  aspect of love.</p>\n<p>Conducted by artistic director\, Caio Guimarães\,
  the Chamber Singers will be joined by Brazilian<br />\nguitarist João Vit
 or as well as four-hand piano accompaniment provided by Edoardo Lenza and<
 br />\nMatthew Gemmill. All are cordially invited to bask in the romance o
 f the season as BCS leads you on<br />\na romantic journey to Spain and Me
 xico.</p>\n<p>Doors at 3:15.</p>\n<p>More information and admission info a
 vailable at www.chambersingers.info.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
