BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-146155@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Synopsis: Out of the nearly 200 films directed by Euro-cult mae
 stro Jess Franco\, Vampyros Lesbos is the most essential. This artful\, dr
 eamlike retelling of Bram Stoker’s DRACULA’S GUEST stars the effervescent 
 Soledad Miranda as the Countess—a vampire who casts an erotic spell over a
  vacationer named Linda. Floating on pure vibes\, the film features dazzli
 ng scenes of arty\, softcore horror that are infused with a psycho-sexadel
 ic score.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260219T190000
LOCATION:Orbit Room\, 107 North College Ave.\, Suite 001 (downstairs)\, Blo
 omington
SEQUENCE:0
