 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Synopsis: Out
  of the nearly 200 films directed by Euro-cult maestro Jess Franco\, Vampy
 ros Lesbos is the most essential. This artful\, dreamlike retelling of Bra
 m Stoker’s DRACULA’S GUEST stars the effervescent Soledad Miranda as the C
 ountess—a vampire who casts an erotic spell over a vacationer named Linda.
  Floating on pure vibes\, the film features dazzling scenes of arty\, soft
 core horror that are infused with a psycho-sexadelic score.</p>\n</BODY></
 HTML>
