BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-146190@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Episode 18 (“On the Wings of Love”): Harry is attacked in his s
 leep. Audrey and Wheeler begin a relationship. Gordon Cole returns with a 
 report that Windom Earle worked with Major Briggs on Project Bluebook.\nEp
 isode 19 (“Variations on Relations”): Cooper and company find the mysterio
 us petroglyph. Windom Earle befriends a stranger and tells him tales of pl
 aces called the White and Black Lodge. Pete helps Catherine open the first
  puzzle box.\nEpisode 20 (“The Path to the Black Lodge”): Bobby and Shelly
  reaffirm their love. Cooper calls Shelly\, Donna\, and Audrey together to
  warn them about Earle. Briggs shows Cooper a tape of Windom Earle making 
 a report on his quest for the Black Lodge.\nEpisode 21 (“Miss Twin Peaks”)
 : Windom Earle sets his sights on the Miss Twin Peaks contest. Lucy choose
 s a father for her baby. Cooper unlocks the key to entering the Black Lodg
 e. \nEpisode 22 (“Beyond Life and Death”): Agent Cooper follows Windom Ear
 le into the depths of the Black Lodge. Big Ed and Norma get a shock when N
 adine suffers head trauma. Eckhardt’s final box is unlocked\, and Audrey s
 tages an act of civil disobedience.\n[235 min total\; drama\, mystery\; En
 glish]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260222T160000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Twin Peaks Season 2\, Episodes 18-22
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/twin-peaks-season-2-episodes-18-22/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p> Episode 18 (
 “On the Wings of Love”): Harry is attacked in his sleep. Audrey and Wheele
 r begin a relationship. Gordon Cole returns with a report that Windom Earl
 e worked with Major Briggs on Project Bluebook.</p>\n<p>Episode 19 (“Varia
 tions on Relations”): Cooper and company find the mysterious petroglyph. W
 indom Earle befriends a stranger and tells him tales of places called the 
 White and Black Lodge. Pete helps Catherine open the first puzzle box.</p>
 \n<p>Episode 20 (“The Path to the Black Lodge”): Bobby and Shelly reaffirm
  their love. Cooper calls Shelly\, Donna\, and Audrey together to warn the
 m about Earle. Briggs shows Cooper a tape of Windom Earle making a report 
 on his quest for the Black Lodge.</p>\n<p>Episode 21 (“Miss Twin Peaks”): 
 Windom Earle sets his sights on the Miss Twin Peaks contest. Lucy chooses 
 a father for her baby. Cooper unlocks the key to entering the Black Lodge.
  </p>\n<p>Episode 22 (“Beyond Life and Death”): Agent Cooper follows Windo
 m Earle into the depths of the Black Lodge. Big Ed and Norma get a shock w
 hen Nadine suffers head trauma. Eckhardt’s final box is unlocked\, and Aud
 rey stages an act of civil disobedience.</p>\n<p>[235 min total\; drama\, 
 mystery\; English] </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
