 t is a community-driven festival uniting experimental rock and contemporar
 y classical music. Dedicated to redefining the concert experience\, it ble
 nds genre fusion\, visual art\, and education to foster collaboration and 
 inclusivity. By commissioning new works for electric guitar\, drumset\, si
 nfonietta\, and multimedia ensembles—and reimagining classics like Schuber
 t’s Winterreise—the festival supports emerging artists and celebrates musi
 c as a living art form. Through workshops with MCCSC High School orchestra
