 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Prese
 nted by Green Drinks Bloomington partnering with the Sassafras Audubon Soc
 iety.</strong></p>\n<p>In March 2025\, the Southern Indiana Cerulean Warbl
 er BirdScape<br />\n(SICWB) was launched as a collaborative effort with ex
 perts from more than two<br />\ndozen organizations across The Americas to
  help protect and manage cerulean<br />\nwarbler habitats. As the BirdScap
 e Coordinator\, Oehlman will be presenting on all the<br />\nways this par
 tnership is having direct impacts to help curb the rapid decline of<br />
 \ncerulean warblers\, and how there might be ways for you\, a community me
 mber\, to get<br />\ninvolved.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
