BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-146411@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Doors at 5:30pm.   TEDxIndiana University returns to the histor
 ic Buskirk-Chumley Theater with Mosaic\, our 10th annual TEDx conference! 
 Join us on February 27th at 6 PM to hear six powerful ideas from six inspi
 ring speakers\, each bringing their unique piece of the human experience t
 o the stage.\nTEDx events are independently organized programs licensed by
  TED\, designed to bring communities together around ideas worth spreading
  – because ideas change everything. Through live talks\, storytelling\, an
 d meaningful conversations\, TEDx creates space for people to explore new 
 perspectives and engage with bold\, innovative thinking.\nOur conference\,
  Mosaic\, aims to be a celebration of the pieces that make us whole. Each 
 fragment of experience\, culture\, perspective\, and story contributes to 
 a larger image of connection and meaning. In a mosaic\, no single piece de
 fines the work\; instead\, beauty emerges through diversity\, contrast\, a
 nd cohesion.\nThrough exploring lenses like identity\, innovation\, or com
 munity\, we invite you to Mosaic to reflect on how individual elements\, w
 hen brought together\, create something far greater than the sum of their 
 parts.\nDiscover new ideas. Connect with your community. See how individua
 l fragments can create something extraordinary.\nStay updated at tedxiu.co
 m and on Instagram @tedxindianauniversity. This event is recomended to age
 s 15+.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260227T180000
LOCATION:Buskirk Chumley Theater\, 114 E Kirkwood Ave.\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Mosaic – A TEDxIndiana University Conference
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/mosaic-a-tedxindiana-university-conference/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Doors
  at 5:30pm.</strong>   TEDxIndiana University returns to the historic Busk
 irk-Chumley Theater with Mosaic\, our 10th annual TEDx conference! Join us
  on February 27th at 6 PM to hear six powerful ideas from six inspiring sp
 eakers\, each bringing their unique piece of the human experience to the s
 tage.</p>\n<p>TEDx events are independently organized programs licensed by
  TED\, designed to bring communities together around ideas worth spreading
  – because ideas change everything. Through live talks\, storytelling\, an
 d meaningful conversations\, TEDx creates space for people to explore new 
 perspectives and engage with bold\, innovative thinking.</p>\n<p>Our confe
 rence\, Mosaic\, aims to be a celebration of the pieces that make us whole
 . Each fragment of experience\, culture\, perspective\, and story contribu
 tes to a larger image of connection and meaning. In a mosaic\, no single p
 iece defines the work\; instead\, beauty emerges through diversity\, contr
 ast\, and cohesion.</p>\n<p>Through exploring lenses like identity\, innov
 ation\, or community\, we invite you to Mosaic to reflect on how individua
 l elements\, when brought together\, create something far greater than the
  sum of their parts.</p>\n<p>Discover new ideas. Connect with your communi
 ty. See how individual fragments can create something extraordinary.</p>\n
 <p>Stay updated at tedxiu.com and on Instagram @tedxindianauniversity. Thi
 s event is recomended to ages 15+.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
