 oney for Middle Way House.\nBecome a Wrapped in Love fiber artist!\nJunipe
 r Art Gallery will be a sponsor for Middle Way’s 2026 Wrapped in Love publ
 ic art display! We will adorn our gallery tree on West Kirkwood Avenue wit
 h a tree sweater\, and we are seeking one or more crocheters or knitters t
