DESCRIPTION:Romy (Nicole Kidman) is the high-powered CEO of a tech company 
 with a seemingly perfect life\, including a handsome husband (Antonio Band
 eras) and two bright kids. But she soon risks it all for an affair with a 
 new intern in her office\, Samuel (Harris Dickinson)\, who forces her to r
 eevaluate and reveal her own desire—and by doing so\, her very sense of se
 lf. [114 min\; romance\, drama\; English]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260303T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
