X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Romy (Nicole 
 Kidman) is the high-powered CEO of a tech company with a seemingly perfect
  life\, including a handsome husband (Antonio Banderas) and two bright kid
 s. But she soon risks it all for an affair with a new intern in her office
 \, Samuel (Harris Dickinson)\, who forces her to reevaluate and reveal her
  own desire—and by doing so\, her very sense of self. [114 min\; romance\,
  drama\; English] </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
