 session\, Alex Sienkiewicz\, Executive Director of Sycamore Land Trust\, w
 ill share insights from more than two decades of leadership in conservatio
 n\, wildlife habitat management\, and public lands stewardship. To learn m
 ore and RSVP\, visit www.conservationlawcenter.org/talkingconservation.
