 an attend for free!). If you attend eight sessions\, you can create a char
 m bracelet (also a separate session.) Participants in each charm school se
 ssion will create a specific type of charm. \nThis session has no prerequi
 sites and no experience is necessary. All materials\, necessary tools and 
