CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Joy is Resistance is an art opening and community gathering roo
 ted in creativity\, care\, and collective expression. The evening features
  a curated display of political art posters that speak to the moment: bold
 \, thoughtful\, and deeply human.\nLive music by local musician Robby Lake
  sets the tone\, weaving reflection and warmth throughout the night.
