 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><em>Joy is Re
 sistance</em> is an art opening and community gathering rooted in creativi
 ty\, care\, and collective expression. The evening features a curated disp
 lay of political art posters that speak to the moment: bold\, thoughtful\,
  and deeply human.</p>\n<p>Live music by local musician Robby Lake sets th
 e tone\, weaving reflection and warmth throughout the night.</p>\n</BODY><
