CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Kelly is a standup comedian\, writer\, and storyteller who bega
 n her career in Cincinnati\, Ohio\, and has since become a beloved fixture
  on the national comedy scene. She has been featured on Sirius XM\, NPR\, 
 and has a DryBar Comedy Special called I made you this. Her clips have gai
 ned millions of views on social media.
