BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-146778@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:After her father grows tired and disappears one day\, Maren\, a
  teenage cannibal\, goes on a journey of self-discovery across America to 
 find her mother and get an understanding of who she truly is. On this jour
 ney\, she meets others just like her\, good and bad. This doomed cannibali
 stic love story is displayed through the acting of Taylor Russell and Timo
 thée Chalamet as the main characters\, along with Mark Rylance\, André Hol
 land\, and Chloë Sevigny. [130 min\; drama\; English]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260306T190000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Staff Selects Series: Bones and All
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/staff-selects-series-bones-and-all/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>After her fat
 her grows tired and disappears one day\, Maren\, a teenage cannibal\, goes
  on a journey of self-discovery across America to find her mother and get 
 an understanding of who she truly is. On this journey\, she meets others j
 ust like her\, good and bad. This doomed cannibalistic love story is displ
 ayed through the acting of Taylor Russell and Timothée Chalamet as the mai
 n characters\, along with Mark Rylance\, André Holland\, and Chloë Sevigny
 . [130 min\; drama\; English] </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
