DESCRIPTION:With panel discussions\, presentations\, workshops\, and concer
 ts\, Harmony and Power will explore how cultural diplomacy shapes power an
 d global connections. Participants include renowned scholars\, practitione
 rs\, performers\, and students from a variety of disciplines.\nPresented b
 y the Hamilton Lugar School and Jacobs School of Music.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260307T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260307T200000
LOCATION:Global and International Studies Building\, 355 Eagleson Ave\, Blo
 omington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Harmony and Power: A Summit on Cultural Diplomacy
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/harmony-and-power-a-summit-on-cultural-diplomacy
 /
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><b>With panel
  discussions\, presentations\, workshops\, and concerts\, Harmony and Powe
 r will explore how cultural diplomacy shapes power and global connections.
  Participants include renowned scholars\, practitioners\, performers\, and
  students from a variety of disciplines.</b></p>\n<p>Presented by the Hami
 lton Lugar School and Jacobs School of Music.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
