UID:ai1ec-146508@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever seen a crazy quilt? We invite you to stop by the 
 Wylie House in March to see Rebecca Wylie’s 100+ year-old crazy quilt\, a 
 beautiful patchwork of fabric filled with embroidery. Then\, you’re welcom
 e to come to our education center and learn how to stitch those same desig
 ns onto your own felt ornament.\nPlease note:The museum will be closed Sat
 urdays March 14 & 21 for Spring Break.  
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260307T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260307T140000
LOCATION:Wylie House Museum\, 307 E. Second Street\, Bloomington
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20260328T110000
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Saturday Crafternoon at the Wylie House
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/saturday-crafternoon-at-the-wylie-house-7/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div>Have you ev
 er seen a crazy quilt? We invite you to stop by the Wylie House in March t
 o see Rebecca Wylie’s 100+ year-old crazy quilt\, a beautiful patchwork of
  fabric filled with embroidery. Then\, you’re welcome to come to our educa
 tion center and learn how to stitch those same designs onto your own felt 
 ornament.</div>\n<div><strong>Please note:The museum will be closed Saturd
 ays March 14 & 21 for Spring Break.  </strong></div>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
