CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Prepare yourself for a rowdy screening of the 1927 film Metropo
 lis with soundtrack from American Pirates’ new album. Hipster Hotdogs from
  Chef Chris Valencia (Outside all-ages) begin at 5pm with creative beer pa
 irings. Film starts at 7pm. Inspired by the Dark Side of the Moon/Oz pairi
 ng. Prepare for a (legal) psychedelic experience with surprise guests and 
 maybe a little Mystery Science Theater 3000-style interactive commentary. 
 #IfYouKnowYouKnow\nLive performers: Ben Myers (experimental/electronics) a
 nd surprise guests.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260307T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260307T210000
