X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Prepare yours
 elf for a rowdy screening of the 1927 film Metropolis with soundtrack from
  American Pirates’ new album. Hipster Hotdogs from Chef Chris Valencia (Ou
 tside all-ages) begin at 5pm with creative beer pairings. Film starts at 7
 pm. Inspired by the Dark Side of the Moon/Oz pairing. Prepare for a (legal
 ) psychedelic experience with surprise guests and maybe a little Mystery S
 cience Theater 3000-style interactive commentary. #IfYouKnowYouKnow<br />
 \n<strong>Live performers: Ben Myers (experimental/electronics) and surpri
 se guests.</strong></p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
