 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div>\n<div>Curi
 ous how electrification can lower your energy bills and make your home mor
 e comfortable? Join us for a hands-on open house hosted by local homeowner
 s who’ve already made the switch.</div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><b>See the Tech:
  </b>Such as heat pump appliances\, solar\, and weatherization improvement
 s.</li>\n<li><b>Get the Cash: </b>Learn about massive rebates and financia
 l incentives available now.</li>\n<li><b>Real Advice: </b>Ask neighbors ab
 out their experience and energy savings.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Hosted by: Electr
 ify Indiana\, a local volunteer-driven nonprofit\, in partnership with the
  City of Bloomington.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div><b>You can sign up</b> in ad
 vance at <a href='https://www.signupgenius.com/go/10C044FA8AD2DA7F8C52-610
