BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-147065@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Hailing from Southern Indiana\, Backwoods Bluegrass has quickly
  become one of the\ninternet’s favorite bluegrass bands\, reaching over 17
  million views on YouTube\nalone! Backwoods breaks boundaries by honoring 
 traditional bluegrass sounds and\nstyles and applying them to many fan fav
 orite classic country and 90’s country hits.\nYou can expect to hear tunes
  from the bluegrass legends like J.D. Crowe and Jimmy\nMartin\, to chart t
 opping songs from Merle Haggard\, George Jones\, and Alan\nJackson\, along
  with plenty of classic gospel tunes as well. With their unique style\,\nB
 ackwoods has captured the ears of many music fans worldwide\, young and ol
 d.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260314T190000
LOCATION:Mitchell Opera House\, 217 North 7th Street\, Mitchell. IN
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Backwoods Bluegrass Band
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/backwoods-bluegrass-band/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Hailing from 
 Southern Indiana\, Backwoods Bluegrass has quickly become one of the<br />
 \ninternet’s favorite bluegrass bands\, reaching over 17 million views on 
 YouTube<br />\nalone! Backwoods breaks boundaries by honoring traditional 
 bluegrass sounds and<br />\nstyles and applying them to many fan favorite 
 classic country and 90’s country hits.<br />\nYou can expect to hear tunes
  from the bluegrass legends like J.D. Crowe and Jimmy<br />\nMartin\, to c
 hart topping songs from Merle Haggard\, George Jones\, and Alan<br />\nJac
 kson\, along with plenty of classic gospel tunes as well. With their uniqu
 e style\,<br />\nBackwoods has captured the ears of many music fans worldw
 ide\, young and old.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
