 hey’ll be ready to chat with you about their creative process and their wo
 rks.</p>\n<p dir='ltr'>A message for local authors: In addition to this ev
 ent\, we will be having 2-3 more Local Author Book Fairs throughout the re
 st 2026! If you are a local author (which we define as being within a one-
 hour drive of our store in Bloomington\, Indiana) and would like to be con
