BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-145036@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:A Grand Night for Singing offers a collection of the greatest l
 ove songs in music theatre history given to us by the incomparable writing
  duo\, Richard Rodgers and Oscar Hammerstein II. Featuring songs from the 
 musicals Oklahoma!\, The Sound of Music\, Carousel\, The King and I\, Sout
 h Pacific\, Cinderella and many more! With a modern setting and perspectiv
 e\, MCCT’s production will reveal how relevant Oscar Hammerstein II’s word
 s still are and how Richard Rodger’s music will always make audiences’ ima
 ginations soar.\nTickets @ mcct@ludus.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260315T140000
LOCATION:Waldron Firebay\, 122 South Walnut\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:A Grand Night for Singing
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/a-grand-night-for-singing-2/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>A Grand Night
  for Singing offers a collection of the greatest love songs in music theat
 re history given to us by the incomparable writing duo\, Richard Rodgers a
 nd Oscar Hammerstein II. Featuring songs from the musicals Oklahoma!\, The
  Sound of Music\, Carousel\, The King and I\, South Pacific\, Cinderella a
 nd many more! With a modern setting and perspective\, MCCT’s production wi
 ll reveal how relevant Oscar Hammerstein II’s words still are and how Rich
 ard Rodger’s music will always make audiences’ imaginations soar.</p>\n<p>
 Tickets @ mcct@ludus.com</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
