BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-147414@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:In this 2.5-3 hour stained glass class\, you’ll focus on the ex
 citing and hands-on process of copper foiling and soldering to bring your 
 beautiful glass design to life! All the glass pieces are precut and ready 
 to go\, so you can jump right into the creative process without needing to
  worry about cutting.\nGuided by our experienced instructor\, you’ll learn
  how to apply copper foil to the edges of each glass piece\, then solder t
 hem together to create a seamless\, polished design. This class is perfect
  for beginners or those who have some experience with stained glass and wa
 nt to hone their skills in foiling and soldering.\nChoose from a selection
  of vibrant glass combinations to create your own unique piece. By the end
  of the class\, you’ll have a stunning stained glass project ready to hang
  or display\, with all the techniques you need to continue creating on you
 r own. All tools and materials are provided—just bring your creativity and
  excitement!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260319T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260319T150000
LOCATION:Glassy Studios\, 1009 16th St\, Bedford
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:“Four Leaf Clover” Stained Glass Class
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/four-leaf-clover-stained-glass-class/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>In this 2.5-3
  hour stained glass class\, you’ll focus on the exciting and hands-on proc
 ess of copper foiling and soldering to bring your beautiful glass design t
 o life! All the glass pieces are precut and ready to go\, so you can jump 
 right into the creative process without needing to worry about cutting.<br
  />\nGuided by our experienced instructor\, you’ll learn how to apply copp
 er foil to the edges of each glass piece\, then solder them together to cr
 eate a seamless\, polished design. This class is perfect for beginners or 
 those who have some experience with stained glass and want to hone their s
 kills in foiling and soldering.<br />\nChoose from a selection of vibrant 
 glass combinations to create your own unique piece. By the end of the clas
 s\, you’ll have a stunning stained glass project ready to hang or display\
 , with all the techniques you need to continue creating on your own. All t
 ools and materials are provided—just bring your creativity and excitement!
  </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-147395@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
