BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-147350@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Calling all introverts and solo travelers (and Moms who just ne
 ed an hour or two of quiet!) – you’re invited to join Fables and Fairy Tal
 es at Sara’s Goodies inside The Main Connection for another installment of
  Silent Book Club! This new twist on a book club meeting is perfect for th
 ose who don’t want to discuss a specific book – just bring whatever you’re
  reading! The meeting starts off with some casual conversation\, order a s
 nack\, drink or dessert\, then just sit and enjoy your reading! It’s a fun
  way to meet new friends who also enjoy reading. Fables and Fairy Tales wi
 ll have a selection of books available in case you need a new book to star
 t!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260319T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260319T193000
LOCATION:Sara's Goodies\, 460 S. Main Street\, Martinsville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:March Silent Book Club
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/march-silent-book-club/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Calling all i
 ntroverts and solo travelers (and Moms who just need an hour or two of qui
 et!) – you’re invited to join Fables and Fairy Tales at Sara’s Goodies ins
 ide The Main Connection for another installment of Silent Book Club! <stro
 ng>This new twist on a book club meeting is perfect for those who don’t wa
 nt to discuss a specific book – just bring whatever you’re reading!</stron
 g> The meeting starts off with some casual conversation\, order a snack\, 
 drink or dessert\, then just sit and enjoy your reading! It’s a fun way to
  meet new friends who also enjoy reading. Fables and Fairy Tales will have
  a selection of books available in case you need a new book to start! </p>
 \n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
