UID:ai1ec-147369@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Join Cedar Creek Winery on March 20\, the first day of Spring\,
  for an 80s Dance Party! We all know spring can sometimes bet a little lat
 e to arrive in Indiana\, so you pick your season between flip-flops & fros
 t\, and come ready to dance the night away to your favorite 80s music. The
  fun begins at 6:30 pm. DJ Lyle Wilson bringing all of the throwback hits 
 and neon vibes. Dress tropical or winter-ready – leg warmers\, ski jackets
 \, flip-flops\, wind breakers…the more chaotic\, the better! Bring your bi
 g hair and bold outfits\, Cedar Creek will provide the hot beats and cold 
 drinks. Winter vs summer? YOU choose!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260320T183000
LOCATION:Cedar Creek Winery\, 3820 Leonard Road\, Martinsville
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:In celebration of the first day of Spring – Flip Flops and Frost\, 
 an 80’s Dance Party
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/in-celebration-of-the-first-day-of-spring-flip-f
 lops-and-frost-an-80s-dance-party/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Join Cedar Cr
 eek Winery on March 20\, the first day of Spring\, for an 80s Dance Party!
  We all know spring can sometimes bet a little late to arrive in Indiana\,
  so you pick your season between flip-flops & frost\, and come ready to da
 nce the night away to your favorite 80s music. The fun begins at 6:30 pm. 
 DJ Lyle Wilson bringing all of the throwback hits and neon vibes. Dress tr
 opical or winter-ready – leg warmers\, ski jackets\, flip-flops\, wind bre
 akers…the more chaotic\, the better! Bring your big hair and bold outfits\
 , Cedar Creek will provide the hot beats and cold drinks. Winter vs summer
 ? YOU choose! </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
