DESCRIPTION:Create your own stunning stained glass corner flower in this ha
 nds-on\, beginner-friendly class! In just 4 hours\, you’ll complete a beau
 tiful finished piece to take home and proudly display.\nAll glass pieces a
 re precut and ground\, so you can dive right into the creative process. Yo
 u’ll learn essential stained glass techniques\, including:\n•Applying copp
 er foil\n•Soldering your project together\n•Adding zinc caming for a clean
 \, professional edge\n•Finishing with patina for a custom look\nChoose fro
 m a variety of creative options! Personalize your flower with our Color Ch
 oice Add-On—make a classic daisy or sunflower\, or go bold with rainbow co
 lors. You can also choose your preferred patina finish: copper\, black\, o
 r pewter black.\nNo experience? No problem! This class is designed for beg
 inners. All tools and materials are provided.\nDuration: 4 hours\nSkill Le
 vel: Beginner\nYou’ll leave with a fully finished\, one-of-a-kind stained 
 glass flower corner panel.
