 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Create your o
 wn stunning stained glass corner flower in this hands-on\, beginner-friend
 ly class! In just 4 hours\, you’ll complete a beautiful finished piece to 
 take home and proudly display.</p>\n<p>All glass pieces are precut and gro
 und\, so you can dive right into the creative process. You’ll learn essent
 ial stained glass techniques\, including:<br />\n•Applying copper foil<br 
 />\n•Soldering your project together<br />\n•Adding zinc caming for a clea
 n\, professional edge<br />\n•Finishing with patina for a custom look<br /
 >\nChoose from a variety of creative options! Personalize your flower with
  our Color Choice Add-On—make a classic daisy or sunflower\, or go bold wi
 th rainbow colors. You can also choose your preferred patina finish: coppe
 r\, black\, or pewter black.<br />\nNo experience? No problem! This class 
 is designed for beginners. All tools and materials are provided.<br />\nDu
 ration: 4 hours<br />\nSkill Level: Beginner<br />\nYou’ll leave with a fu
