DESCRIPTION:Curious how electrification can lower your energy bills and mak
 e your home more comfortable? Join us for a hands-on open house hosted by 
 local homeowners who’ve already made the switch.\n\n\nSee the Tech: Such a
 s heat pump appliances\, solar\, and weatherization improvements.\nGet the
  Cash: Learn about massive rebates and financial incentives available now.
 \nReal Advice: Ask neighbors about their experience and energy savings.\n
 \nHosted by: Electrify Indiana\, a local volunteer-driven nonprofit\, in p
 artnership with the City of Bloomington.\n\nYou can sign up in advance at 
 Sign Up Genius
