X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Two minor cha
 racters step out of Hamlet and into a world ruled by chance\, confusion\, 
 and fate. Rosencrantz and Guildenstern Are Dead is a witty\, absurd look a
 t what it means to exist when the script isn’t yours.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
