CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:The annual soup bowl event is a well loved Brown County traditi
 on\, the ticket price allows guests to enjoy donated soups from Brown Coun
 ty restaurants\, select a handcrafted bowl by a local potters and browse a
  lively silent auction.\nAll proceeds support Mother’s Cupboard Community 
 Kitchen and its\nmission to provide hot free meals in Brown County.\nNo qu
 estions asked.\nThis year we’re adding free shuttle service from the Brown
  County Music Center to the seasons there will be extra parking at the Mus
 ic Center . Shuttle will be going from 4:30 to 7:30.
