 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>The annual so
 up bowl event is a well loved Brown County tradition\, the ticket price al
 lows guests to enjoy donated soups from Brown County restaurants\, select 
 a handcrafted bowl by a local potters and browse a lively silent auction.<
 br />\n<strong>All proceeds support Mother’s Cupboard Community Kitchen an
 d its<br />\nmission to provide hot free meals in Brown County.</strong><b
 r />\nNo questions asked.<br />\nThis year we’re adding free shuttle servi
 ce from the Brown County Music Center to the seasons there will be extra p
 arking at the Music Center . Shuttle will be going from 4:30 to 7:30.</p>
 \n</BODY></HTML>
