 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>In this 2.5-3
  hour stained glass class\, you’ll focus on the exciting and hands-on proc
 ess of copper foiling and soldering to bring your beautiful glass design t
 o life! All the glass pieces are precut and ready to go\, so you can jump 
 right into the creative process without needing to worry about cutting.<br
  />\nGuided by our experienced instructor\, you’ll learn how to apply copp
 er foil to the edges of each glass piece\, then solder them together to cr
 eate a seamless\, polished design. This class is perfect for beginners or 
 those who have some experience with stained glass and want to hone their s
 kills in foiling and soldering.<br />\nChoose from a selection of vibrant 
 glass combinations to create your own unique piece. Our color choices are 
 first come first serve! If you’d like to request your colors in advance\, 
 it will be add-on option in the check out!<br />\nBy the end of the class\
 , you’ll have a stunning stained glass project ready to hang or display\, 
 with all the techniques you need to continue creating on your own. All too
 ls and materials are provided—just bring your creativity and excitement! <
 /p>\n</BODY></HTML>
