BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-147529@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Doors at 7pm\nA dynamic band that blends Afro-Latino rhythms an
 d rock ’n’ roll with African-derived percussion and styles like rumba\, me
 rengue\, mambo\, and cumbia. Founded by Enrique Chi—a Panamanian songwrite
 r\, musician\, filmmaker\, and cultural producer—the Latin Grammy-nominate
 d band serves as the primary platform for Chi’s creative mission. Armed wi
 th electric guitars and a mejoranera\, a folkloric guitar native to Panamá
 \, the band interweaves styles as divergent as cumbia and blues\, salsa\, 
 soul\, and rock’n’roll––all boiled down into their own original sound.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260327T200000
LOCATION:Blockhouse Bar\, located in the alley at 205 South College Avenue\
 , Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Lotus Presents: Making Movies
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/lotus-presents-making-movies/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p><strong>Doors
  at 7pm</strong><br />\nA dynamic band that blends Afro-Latino rhythms and
  rock ’n’ roll with African-derived percussion and styles like rumba\, mer
 engue\, mambo\, and cumbia. Founded by Enrique Chi—a Panamanian songwriter
 \, musician\, filmmaker\, and cultural producer—the Latin Grammy-nominated
  band serves as the primary platform for Chi’s creative mission. Armed wit
 h electric guitars and a mejoranera\, a folkloric guitar native to Panamá\
 , the band interweaves styles as divergent as cumbia and blues\, salsa\, s
 oul\, and rock’n’roll––all boiled down into their own original sound.</p>
 \n</BODY></HTML>
