UID:ai1ec-147675@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Michael Shannon and Ashley Judd give searing performances in th
 is skin-crawling exercise in fear and paranoia from director William Fried
 kin. Oklahoma waitress Aggie (Judd) lives a largely solitary life in a run
 down motel. She’s haunted by a tragic past and hounded by her ex-con ex-hu
 sband (Harry Connick\, Jr.). When she sparks a romance with an eccentric d
 rifter\, Peter Evans (Shannon)\, she starts to feel hopeful again—until Pe
 ter reveals he is a victim of government experimentation. The couple begin
 s to obsess over the nightmarish idea that they are infected by insects. S
 hannon reprises the role he originated in playwright Tracy Letts’ original
  London production of the same name. [102 min\; drama\, thriller\, horror\
 ; English]
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260327T220000
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 East Seventh St. (on the North side of the IU Aud
 itorium)\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Transfixed: Michael Shannon on Screen\, Jorgensen Guest Filmmaker S
 eries: BUG
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/transfixed-michael-shannon-on-screen-jorgensen-g
 uest-filmmaker-series-bug/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Michael Shann
 on and Ashley Judd give searing performances in this skin-crawling exercis
 e in fear and paranoia from director William Friedkin. Oklahoma waitress A
 ggie (Judd) lives a largely solitary life in a rundown motel. She’s haunte
 d by a tragic past and hounded by her ex-con ex-husband (Harry Connick\, J
 r.). When she sparks a romance with an eccentric drifter\, Peter Evans (Sh
 annon)\, she starts to feel hopeful again—until Peter reveals he is a vict
 im of government experimentation. The couple begins to obsess over the nig
 htmarish idea that they are infected by insects. Shannon reprises the role
  he originated in playwright Tracy Letts’ original London production of th
 e same name. [102 min\; drama\, thriller\, horror\; English] </p>\n</BODY>
 </HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
