UID:ai1ec-147645@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:With over a decade of experience as a tarot practitioner and Re
 iki Master\, Bridget offers readings that blend tarot\, oracle\, and energ
 etic insight. Her approach is intuitive\, grounded\, and deeply attuned to
  the person across the table.\nBridget’s sessions explore your inner lands
 cape … your emotions\, patterns\, and the subtle energies shaping your pat
 h. Drawing on both tarot and oracle guidance\, she creates space for refle
 ction\, clarity\, and deeper connection to your own inner knowing.\nBridge
 t holds space with warmth\, care\, and compassion\, creating a supportive 
 and welcoming experience for seekers at every stage of their journey. A re
 ading with Bridget invites insight\, balance\, and a gentle return to the 
 wisdom you already carry.\n15-minute readings available at Oak
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260328T130000
LOCATION:oak.Bloomington\, 116 W 6th St. Suite 101\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Tarot + Oracle with Bridget Jackson
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/tarot-oracle-with-bridget-jackson/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p> With over a 
 decade of experience as a tarot practitioner and Reiki Master\, Bridget of
 fers readings that blend tarot\, oracle\, and energetic insight. Her appro
 ach is intuitive\, grounded\, and deeply attuned to the person across the 
 table.<br />\nBridget’s sessions explore your inner landscape … your emoti
 ons\, patterns\, and the subtle energies shaping your path. Drawing on bot
 h tarot and oracle guidance\, she creates space for reflection\, clarity\,
  and deeper connection to your own inner knowing.<br />\nBridget holds spa
 ce with warmth\, care\, and compassion\, creating a supportive and welcomi
 ng experience for seekers at every stage of their journey. A reading with 
 Bridget invites insight\, balance\, and a gentle return to the wisdom you 
 already carry.<br />\n15-minute readings available at Oak</p>\n</BODY></HT
 ML>
