BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-147527@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Sirāt follows Luis (Sergi López)\, a father on a mission to fin
 d his missing daughter who was last spotted at a rave in the Moroccan dese
 rt. With his son and their dog in tow\, the group find themselves immersed
  in desert rave culture and have to contend with the brutal landscape and 
 hostile military presence in the region\, but not without some help\, caut
 ious as it may be\, from a close-knit group of raver friends. As they vent
 ure deeper into the burning wilderness\, the journey forces them to confro
 nt their own limits.\nSirāt is a powerful film\, bolstered by a powerful s
 oundtrack by Kangding Ray and led by an uncompromising directorial effort 
 by Oliver Laxe.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260328T200000
LOCATION:Upland Brewing Wood Shop\, 354 West 11th Street\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Cicada Cinema: SIRAT
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/cicada-cinema-sirat/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Sirāt follows
  Luis (Sergi López)\, a father on a mission to find his missing daughter w
 ho was last spotted at a rave in the Moroccan desert. With his son and the
 ir dog in tow\, the group find themselves immersed in desert rave culture 
 and have to contend with the brutal landscape and hostile military presenc
 e in the region\, but not without some help\, cautious as it may be\, from
  a close-knit group of raver friends. As they venture deeper into the burn
 ing wilderness\, the journey forces them to confront their own limits.</p>
 \n<p>Sirāt is a powerful film\, bolstered by a powerful soundtrack by Kang
 ding Ray and led by an uncompromising directorial effort by Oliver Laxe. <
 /p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
