BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-147051@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:This all ages afternoon show celebrates the repress of Canterbu
 ry Effect’s Album “An Exercise in Humility” on vinyl for the 25th annivers
 ary of the original release.\nCanterbury Effect originally started in Braz
 il\, Indiana in 1999 and later moved to Bloomington and continued playing 
 music till the late 2010s\nThey are being joined by Bloomington local lege
 nds “husband&wife” who haven’t played live in more than 10 years\, althoug
 h many of the members still can be seen around Bloomington playing in vari
 ous local bands such as “Mike Adams At His Honest Weight”\nSchweikhardt wi
 ll also be joining and has been playing shows in Bloomington for more than
  20 years.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260329T130000
LOCATION:The Cook Center in Maxwell Hall at IU\, 750 East Kirkwood Avenue\,
  Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Canterbury Effect and husband&wife
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/canterbury-effect-and-husbandwife/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>This all ages
  afternoon show celebrates the repress of Canterbury Effect’s Album “An Ex
 ercise in Humility” on vinyl for the 25th anniversary of the original rele
 ase.</p>\n<p>Canterbury Effect originally started in Brazil\, Indiana in 1
 999 and later moved to Bloomington and continued playing music till the la
 te 2010s</p>\n<p>They are being joined by Bloomington local legends “husba
 nd&wife” who haven’t played live in more than 10 years\, although many of 
 the members still can be seen around Bloomington playing in various local 
 bands such as “Mike Adams At His Honest Weight”</p>\n<p>Schweikhardt will 
 also be joining and has been playing shows in Bloomington for more than 20
  years.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
