UID:ai1ec-147604@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:First Thursdays showcase the diversity of arts and humanities a
 t IU Bloomington and offer a welcoming environment for students\, faculty\
 , staff\, and community members to explore new creative outlets. Each even
 t is a unique opportunity to experience the wonderful work of artists\, pe
 rformers\, and scholars from all across campus and around town.\nThe April
  First Thursdays will be a festival of art\, ideas\, and community featuri
 ng 2 performance stages\, 80+ activity booths\, 20+ arts vendors\, food tr
 ucks\, giveaways\, and more. Around the IU Fine Arts Plaza\, there will be
  a 1776 Trail\, poster printing\, 3D fabrication demos\, and henna tattooi
 ng among many other activities. On the main stage\, we’ll have performance
 s by Soul Revue\, Eleanor & Dario\, Jacobs Saxophone Ensemble\, IU Musical
  Theatre\, and InMotion Dance Company. For more details\, visit  go.iu.edu
 /first-thursdays.\n 
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260402T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260402T190000
LOCATION:IU Fine Arts Plaza\, 1201 E 7th St\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:First Thursdays Festival
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/first-thursdays-festival/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>First Thursda
 ys showcase the diversity of arts and humanities at IU Bloomington and off
 er a welcoming environment for students\, faculty\, staff\, and community 
 members to explore new creative outlets. Each event is a unique opportunit
 y to experience the wonderful work of artists\, performers\, and scholars 
 from all across campus and around town.</p>\n<p>The April First Thursdays 
 will be a festival of art\, ideas\, and community featuring 2 performance 
 stages\, 80+ activity booths\, 20+ arts vendors\, food trucks\, giveaways\
 , and more. Around the IU Fine Arts Plaza\, there will be a 1776 Trail\, p
 oster printing\, 3D fabrication demos\, and henna tattooing among many oth
 er activities. On the main stage\, we’ll have performances by Soul Revue\,
  Eleanor & Dario\, Jacobs Saxophone Ensemble\, IU Musical Theatre\, and In
 Motion Dance Company. For more details\, visit <a href='https://artsandhum
 anities.indiana.edu/council-programs/first-thursdays/index.html' data-safe
 redirecturl='https://www.google.com/url?q=https://artsandhumanities.indian
 a.edu/council-programs/first-thursdays/index.html&source=gmail&ust=1774462
 271771000&usg=AOvVaw3CHL5P1_TXctcBMvELjFR6'> go.iu.edu/first-thursdays</a>
 .</p>\n<p> </p>\n</BODY></HTML>
END:VEVENT
