 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p>Led by Artist
 ic Director Caio Lopes\, the Bloomington Chamber Singers present one of th
 e great choral masterpieces of our age: Maurice Duruflé’s transcendent <em
 >Requiem</em>. Combining Gregorian chant with lush modern harmonies\, this
  meditative and powerful work will be heard in its original chamber-orches
 tral version\, revealing its intimate and colorful soundscape.</p>\n</BODY
 ></HTML>
X-INSTANT-EVENT:1
END:VEVENT
