BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai1ec-146811@wfhb.org
DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:Website: bton.in/bemore26\nDoors at 5:30.\n\nWe invite you to j
 oin the City of Bloomington in celebrating volunteerism at the 2026 Be Mor
 e Awards. Presented by the City of Bloomington Volunteer Network\, this ye
 ar’s event will once again honor individuals and groups who have made a la
 sting\, positive impact on the Bloomington and Monroe County community thr
 ough years of dedicated volunteer service.\nAwards will be presented acros
 s eight (8) categories\, including a Lifetime Achievement Award (Be More D
 edicated)\, Volunteer of the Year (Be More Impactful)\, and a Youth Volunt
 eer Award (Be More Energized). Each recipient will be honored with an awar
 d and a $1\,000.00 grant award to the primary organization they volunteer 
 for.\nThe Bloomington Volunteer Network will also celebrate the City’s pro
 gress towards the goal of logging 100\,000 volunteer hours in 2026.\nLearn
  more at www.bloomingtonvolunteernetwork.org/bemore .
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260428T180000
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater\, 114 E. Kirkwood Ave\, Bloomington
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:2026 Be More Awards
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/2026-be-more-awards/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><div><b>Website:
 </b> <a href='http://bton.in/bemore26' target='_blank' rel='noopener' data
 -saferedirecturl='https://www.google.com/url?q=http://bton.in/bemore26&sou
 rce=gmail&ust=1772653347289000&usg=AOvVaw1eAn2rXEjGnxFVkykoNbY9'>bton.in/b
 emore26</a></div>\n<div>Doors at 5:30.</div>\n<div></div>\n<div><span styl
 e='font-family: arial\, sans-serif'>We invite you to join the City of Bloo
 mington in celebrating volunteerism at the 2026 Be More Awards. Presented 
 by the City of Bloomington Volunteer Network\, this year’s event will once
  again honor individuals and groups who have made a lasting\, positive imp
 act on the Bloomington and Monroe County community through years of dedica
 ted volunteer service.</span></div>\n<p><span style='font-family: arial\, 
 sans-serif'>Awards will be presented across eight (8) categories\, includi
 ng a Lifetime Achievement Award (Be More Dedicated)\, Volunteer of the Yea
 r (Be More Impactful)\, and a Youth Volunteer Award (Be More Energized). E
 ach recipient will be honored with an award and a $1\,000.00 grant award t
 o the primary organization they volunteer for.</span></p>\n<p><span style=
 'font-family: arial\, sans-serif'>The Bloomington Volunteer Network will a
 lso celebrate the City’s progress towards the goal of logging 100\,000 vol
 unteer hours in 2026.</span></p>\n<p><span style='font-family: arial\, san
 s-serif'>Learn more at <a href='http://www.bloomingtonvolunteernetwork.org
 /bemore' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' data-saferedirecturl='h
 ttps://www.google.com/url?q=http://www.bloomingtonvolunteernetwork.org/bem
 ore&source=gmail&ust=1772653347289000&usg=AOvVaw19Xj-4Iw5o04fkNIGc69PE'>ww
 w.<wbr />bloomingtonvolunteernetwork.<wbr />org/bemore</a> .</span></p>\n<
 /BODY></HTML>
