DTSTAMP:20260331T015807Z
CATEGORIES:
CONTACT:Constellation Stage & Screen\; info@SeeConstellation.org\; https://
 seeconstellation.org/kids/finn/
DESCRIPTION:Constellation Stage & Screen presents “Finn: A New Musical- At 
 the PB&J Cafe\,” on stage May 1-17 at the Waldron Auditorium.\nFrom the cr
 eator of Doc McStuffins and Vampirina\, Finn is a heartwarming musical adv
 enture about a young shark on the brink of growing up. As he prepares to j
 oin the fearsome Shark Guard\, Finn can’t shake the feeling that he’s diff
 erent from the other sharks. Deep inside\, he discovers a colorful fish in
 side him—a part of himself that longs to sparkle\, sing\, and dance. As Fi
 nn embarks on a journey of self-discovery\, friendship\, and adventure\, h
 e finds the courage to be himself! Fun for all ages!\nPB&J Cafe: A Dinner 
 Theater for Kids! At the PB&J Cafe\, young theatergoers will enjoy a meal 
 during the performance and leave with autographs from their favorite chara
 cters.
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260501T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260501T193000
LOCATION:Waldron Arts Center (122 S Walnut St)
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20260508T183000
RDATE;TZID=America/New_York:20260515T183000
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Finn: A New Musical- At the PB&J Cafe
URL:https://wfhb.org/event/finn-a-new-musical-at-the-pbj-cafe/
X-COST-TYPE:free
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC '-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//E
 N'>\\n<HTML>\\n<HEAD>\\n<TITLE></TITLE>\\n</HEAD>\\n<BODY><p dir='ltr'>Con
 stellation Stage & Screen presents “Finn: A New Musical- At the PB&J Cafe\
 ,” on stage May 1-17 at the Waldron Auditorium.</p>\n<p dir='ltr'>From the
  creator of Doc McStuffins and Vampirina\, Finn is a heartwarming musical 
 adventure about a young shark on the brink of growing up. As he prepares t
 o join the fearsome Shark Guard\, Finn can’t shake the feeling that he’s d
 ifferent from the other sharks. Deep inside\, he discovers a colorful fish
  inside him—a part of himself that longs to sparkle\, sing\, and dance. As
  Finn embarks on a journey of self-discovery\, friendship\, and adventure\
 , he finds the courage to be himself! Fun for all ages!</p>\n<p dir='ltr'>
 PB&J Cafe: A Dinner Theater for Kids! At the PB&J Cafe\, young theatergoer
 s will enjoy a meal during the performance and leave with autographs from 
 their favorite characters.</p>\n</BODY></HTML>
