CONTACT:
DESCRIPTION:From the creator of Doc McStuffins and Vampirina\, Finn is a he
 artwarming musical adventure about a young shark on the brink of growing u
 p. As he prepares to join the fearsome Shark Guard\, Finn can’t shake the 
 feeling that he’s different from the other sharks. Deep inside\, he discov
 ers a colorful fish inside him—a part of himself that longs to sparkle\, s
 ing\, and dance. As Finn embarks on a journey of self-discovery\, friendsh
 ip\, and adventure\, he finds the courage to be himself! Fun for all ages!
 \nPB&J Cafe: A Dinner Theater for Kids! At the PB&J Cafe\, young theatergo
 ers will enjoy a meal during the performance and leave with autographs fro
 m their favorite characters.
