 m the creator of Doc McStuffins and Vampirina\, Finn is a heartwarming mus
 ical adventure about a young shark on the brink of growing up. As he prepa
 res to join the fearsome Shark Guard\, Finn can’t shake the feeling that h
 e’s different from the other sharks. Deep inside\, he discovers a colorful
  fish inside him—a part of himself that longs to sparkle\, sing\, and danc
 e. As Finn embarks on a journey of self-discovery\, friendship\, and adven
 ture\, he finds the courage to be himself! Fun for all ages!</p>\n<p dir='
